window.AKK_HAPPY_CEO_AGREEMENT_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_HAPPY_CEO_AGREEMENT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Other Good Things","paragraphs":["\"Madam, lunch is ready. Would you like to eat now?\"","\"Mm.\"","A charming figure rose from the lounge chair, lazily stretching.","As she raised her arms, her top rode up, revealing a slim, fair waist and two cute dimples on her lower back.","The maid immediately lowered her eyes, not daring to look, her cheeks flushing red. Madam was so fair!","\"Let's go.\" Shen Tang slipped on her slippers, the taps of her footsteps echoing on the smooth marble floor.","She took the elevator down from the third floor to the dining room. Seeing the table laden with delicacies she could never have afforded in her past life, she almost teared up in excitement.","Just three days ago, Shen Tang had transmigrated into this world.","In her past life, she was an overworked extra who was served a \"death combo meal\".","When she opened her eyes again, she found herself sitting in a cafe.","The man opposite her lightly pushed up his gold-rimmed glasses. \"Miss Shen, what do you think?\"","What was going on?","Just as Shen Tang was about to reply, a flood of unfamiliar memories pushed into her mind.","Moments later, her expression turned complicated as she understood her current circumstances.","Lying on the table was a marriage agreement. She would not have to fulfill wifely duties or do anything much, just show up occasionally for family dinners and keep up the appearance of a loving couple. In return, she would receive 5 million per month, with all her living expenses charged to her husband's card.","Additionally, when the two-year agreement expired and they divorced, she would receive 200 million as settlement.","Shen Tang covered her mouth, her heart pounding and hands trembling.","What a windfall!","Thinking she was unwilling, Cen Assistant said, \"If you do not wish to...\"","\"Pfft!\"","Cen Assistant looked at her in astonishment. Shen Tang's mouth curved widely upwards as she kept emitting \"pfft\" sounds, like a boiling kettle.","Shen Tang took a deep breath, suppressing her laughter with difficulty. \"Sorry, I lost my composure...heehee...\"","Oh no, she still couldn't keep from laughing. Would he suspect she was mentally ill?","Cen Assistant opened his mouth: \"...It's fine.\"","Afraid nightmares would occur should she tarry, Shen Tang eagerly signed her name, smiling brightly. \"May I ask when the monthly payments will be made?\"","Cen Assistant: \"...Whenever you wish.\"","He felt something was off, but since Madam was the boss's choice, he must have his reasons.","The registration and move went smoothly within an afternoon.","Her cheap husband did not show up, but Shen Tang did not care.","The sprawling villa had only her as its mistress. Shen Tang lay alone on the custom-made sofa, feeling extremely lonely.","Thinking back on the plot, this novel told of the female lead Lin Mianmian's love story with four male leads.","There was not much written about her contract husband Gu Huaian, only that he was the female lead's unattainable crush.","Unfortunately, she had dropped the novel after the female supporting character with the same name died, so she did not know if Gu Huaian was truly asexual as rumored.","In the book, she was the cannon fodder who fell for Gu Huaian then actually drugged him in an attempt to force intimacy.","Of course, ultimately she obtained nothing and was directly kicked out.","Thinking of such an outcome, Shen Tang shook her head with a sigh. Foolish girl, how could she be so desperate?","Wouldn't it be better to live comfortably for two years then divorce with 320 million? With only the interest she could live idle for life.","Every day upon waking many people waited on her. She could order anything she wanted to eat, buy anything she desired.","In just three days, Shen Tang was thoroughly corrupted by capitalism.","Such days of dressing in silks and satins, with food delivered and mouths watering, were supremely blissful.","Recalling herself, Shen Tang gently coughed, \"You all can go about your tasks. I can eat by myself.\"","\"Yes, Madam.\" The servants orderly took their leave.","Seeing no one else around, Shen Tang picked up her chopsticks and ate with gusto.","Oh my god, how was it all so delicious!","After the meal, Shen Tang sprawled on the sofa to aid her digestion. Tao Sister brought over dessert and fruit. The air-flown fruit was incomparably more delicious than the discounted kind she bought in her past life.","So this was how the wealthy lived such simple unadorned lives? Marvelous, simply marvelous!","As Shen Tang ate, she booted up her game. In the past, she deliberated endlessly before spending over a hundred dollars on a skin. But she was no longer the destitute Shen Tang, she was the wealthy lady Shen Tang.","Buy buy buy!","However, her happiness did not last long—her manager Wang Brother called.","That's right, in this life she was also a Z-list celebrity.","Unlike her past life though, she was now an ever-trending queen of scandals, bearing epithets like \"loose tea bitch\", \"plastic surgery freak\", \"compensation scammer\", \"troublemaker\", and more. The online rumors never ceased.","To ride her coattails, her company PR team randomly paired her with every male celebrity she had worked with before, making her an enormous malignant tumor in the entertainment industry that everyone avoided.","But none of that mattered now as Shen Tang was prepared to quit the business.","Hilarious! She was not fated to succeed anyway, so why strive so desperately?","She had barely picked up before Wang Brother's impatient voice came through, \"Why did you take so long to answer? Come to the company right now, there's good news.\"","He hung up straight after, not even giving Shen Tang a chance to refuse.","Good news? A pimp like him, what good news could there be?","Shen Tang pondered briefly, then frowned.","In the plot, under Wang Brother's goading she joined a dating show. She attempted to seduce several male guests, unaware they were all the female lead's suitors. In the end, she was flamed by their fans and became an online target of hate.","Crossing the female lead boded no fortune; she absolutely could not participate in that dating show.","Thinking of the year plus remaining on her exploitative contract, Shen Tang felt a little annoyed. \"Uncle He, I need to go out for a bit.\"","The formally dressed butler Uncle He inclined his head slightly. \"Which car would Madam like to take today?\"","Knowing little of cars, Shen Tang said, \"Any is fine.\"","\"Very well, I will arrange it.\"","Soon, an expensive-looking car drove over. Though ignorant of cars, with one look Shen Tang could tell it was valuable.","Seated in the back, she could not discern what material the extremely comfortable seats were made of.","Shen Tang, who usually got carsick, now did not feel nausea or dizziness at all.","Could it be...she only felt sick riding cheap cars?","Just stepping out, a voice called from the side, \"Shen Tang, you found a sugar daddy?!\"","Looking over, Shen Tang saw a metrosexual with smoky makeup staring at her arrogantly.","She could make out decent features behind the outrageous look.","Heavens help me, someone's glaring at me through their nostrils!","\"You are...?\"","The metrosexual glared wide. \"What new scam are you pulling this time to grab my attention?!\"","Oh, it was that idiot ex.","They dated for just two days before he got handsy. More importantly, he owed the original owner money that he had yet to repay.","\"What's it to you?\" Shen Tang walked off, bag in hand.","Unexpectedly, the metrosexual followed, chattering nonstop. \"Hah! So hypocritical when we dated, saying marriage was necessary before intimacy. Yet now you've hopped into some old geezer's bed...\"","Shen Tang rolled her eyes. \"Such bullshit!\"","\"Ever heard this saying before?\"","The metrosexual halted. \"What?\"","\"A qualified ex should be like dead. Oh right, return the money you owe, otherwise I'll sue.\"","\"It was just tens of thousands. Worth making a fuss over?\" He looked scornful.","\"Easy to say when it wasn't your money. So pay it back.\"","Metrosexual: \"...\""]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: You are a professional CPU Master","paragraphs":["\"Cancel the contract?\"","In the break room, Wang Brother squinted at Shen Tang, his tone inquiring: \"Tang Tang, tell me the truth, have you found a new backer?\"","\"No, I'm just tired and want to retire from the industry and go home.\" Shen Tang blinked her sincere big eyes.","Wang Brother was stunned for a moment. \"Retire? Have you made enough money to retire?\"","Shen Tang felt like she had been stabbed in the chest.","\"Tang Tang, are you trying to leave because of what happened before? You should know, bad publicity is still publicity. Many people don't even get the chance to walk down this path.","In this entertainment industry, it's not scary if people slander you, it's scary if you can't even make a splash and no one knows who you are.","Didn't you say you wanted to make big money to buy a house before? And improve your siblings' living environment? Have you forgotten?\"","Shen Tang laughed coldly in her heart. Her original self had been brainwashed by Wang Brother's lectures like this over and over again.","\"To be honest, I got married. My husband doesn't really like me being in the public eye...\" As she spoke, Shen Tang even showed a shy expression.","\"Married? When did this happen?\" Wang Brother's brows furrowed, displeased. \"Why didn't you discuss such a big matter with the company first?\"","Wang Brother looked at her like he was staring at a disobedient junior, making Shen Tang feel somewhat nauseous.","Shen Tang took a deep breath, \"One of my brothers got sick recently and needs a large sum for surgery. When I asked to borrow money from you, you said you didn't have any...\"","This brother was not her real brother, but a child from the same orphanage as Shen Tang. He was only eight years old this year and had somehow contracted leukemia.","The orphanage didn't have much money to begin with. Over the years, Shen Tang had slowly poured all her savings to help. Other than the money her contractual husband had just given her, she was basically penniless.","The reason why the original Shen Tang had wanted to make it big and earn money was partly for herself, and partly for the children at the orphanage.","Only children without disabilities could be adopted. The ones left behind all had some kind of disability.","Perhaps influenced by the original Shen Tang's emotions, tears instantly welled up in Shen Tang's eyes as her heart ached.","Wang Brother looked somewhat awkward. \"I, I just bought a house recently, I don't have extra money on hand either.\"","Shen Tang rolled her eyes mentally. As if he didn't have money - he just didn't want to lend any. Over the years, he had made quite a bit from her and others like her.","Of course, borrowing money wasn't her goal anyway.","Shen Tang sniffed, \"I'm not blaming you, it's just my brother's condition is very serious. I happened to have a wealthy suitor who said as long as I married him, his money would be my money. Can you blame me for not refusing?\"","Wang Brother was flabbergasted. \"You have a suitor?\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Is that the point here?","No way, what do you mean?","Wang Brother also realized his faux pas and smiled awkwardly. \"Don't overthink, I didn't mean anything else. I just never heard you mention anyone before.\"","\"We didn't know each other long. He's a bit older and has a stiff, stern personality. I don't like him that much, so I didn't talk about him.\"","She was only 22 now. Gu Huai'an was almost 30. There's a saying that every 3 years marks a generation gap, so there was a whole two generation gap between them.","But to Wang Brother, it sounded like Shen Tang had married a rich quadragenarian or quinquagenarian for money.","He felt pained over it.","Although Shen Tang didn't have a good reputation, she was admirably beautiful - curvy figure, ample frontal and posterior assets. Several higher ups at the company were fond of her too. If Wang Brother had known she would marry someone over this, he would have lent her the money back then!","Now a good hand had slipped away just like that.","\"Keep the marriage a secret for now. You're still young. You need to know your career should be the priority. After all, you can't rely on men...\" Wang Brother's tone was meaningful.","Shen Tang nodded obediently. She looked extremely well-behaved.","Of course, that was just how she looked on the surface.","The woman standing outside who had been about to knock, covered her mouth in surprise, then revealed a smile. Shen Tang, didn't expect you to have a day like this!","She quietly turned and left without anyone noticing.","After Wang Brother left, Shen Tang instantly switched expressions, sitting on the sofa with a small pout.","As expected of the notorious old madam of the entertainment industry. Smooth talker.","She picked up the apple on the table, wiped it clean, and took a bite. Hm, not as tasty as the ones at home.","Not wanting to waste food, she still crunched up the whole thing in a few bites.","With a \"biu\", the core landed right in the trash can.","Soon, a knock sounded as a baby-faced girl poked her head in. It was Shen Tang's junior assistant, fittingly named Yuan Yuan.","\"Sis Tang Tang, Wang Brother asked me to call you to the conference room.\"","\"Oh.\" The decision must have come out.","Shen Tang felt apprehensive. Having read the novel, she understood Wang Brother's personality. He wouldn't give up squeezing every last bit of use out of someone.","In the book, her storyline was being sold to an old man. She died falling from the high floors of a hotel in her struggles.","When Shen Tang entered the conference room, Wang Brother wasn't there. Only a high-level executive was lazily reclining in the seat at the center, legs crossed.","He looked to be in his mid-thirties, wearing rimless glasses and an azure blue suit. Not bad looking, just somewhat oily.","Shen Tang politely greeted, \"Director Zhou.\"","Director Zhou brazenly looked Shen Tang up and down. His naked gaze felt almost tangible.","Shen Tang endured the goosebumps rising on her arm, as well as the urge to punch him, and asked, \"Did you ask me here for something?\"","\"I heard you got married?\" And to an old man at that.","One could clearly hear the regret in his tone.","Shen Tang pressed her lips together without answering.","Clearly the other side didn't actually want to hear her response either. He pushed over a contract and said, \"You've been with the company for a while and always obedient. Marrying so rashly this time was foolish. You should have discussed with the company first.\"","His tone then shifted as he continued, \"I heard from your agent you want to retire? Penalty for breaking your contract early would be around 8 million. Are you certain about retiring?\"","Shen Tang's eyes widened in shock. \"How much?!\"","\"8 million. Not a small sum. If you're set on retiring, you can prepare the money first. I'll help you smooth things over with the company...\"","Director Zhou sneered inwardly. Shen Tang was an orphan without any backers or resources, and even had a freeloader little brother. No way could she get that much money!","Sure enough, Shen Tang's expression darkened after hearing him.","She wouldn't just hand over 8 million to the damn company. Her contract expiration wasn't far off either, she could endure a bit longer!","She also didn't plan to participate in the dating reality show anymore.","Shen Tang gave an awkward laugh. \"Then I won't retire for now. But I did get married, so participating in a dating show wouldn't be suitable right?\"","\"Don't worry, I picked an even better show for you. I'm still optimistic about your potential. Don't let me down, Tang Tang...\"","As Director Zhou spoke, he placed his hand on Shen Tang's shoulder. Unexpectedly, his wrist was suddenly twisted and his whole body uncontrollably collapsed onto the table. Then pain shot through.","\"Ah-\"","Shen Tang quickly let go, \"Sorry, reflex...\"","\"Ow-\" Director Zhou cradled his aching wrist, inhaling sharply twice.","\"What do they feed you to make you so strong?!\"","Shen Tang became anxious. \"I often did labor work since I was little so I'm a bit stronger. Do you need me to take you to the hospital?\"","Inside, she was sneering. Touch me again, I'll break your wrist!","\"No need. Just sign the contract first.\" Director Zhou left wearing a pained grimace.","Shen Tang opened the contract and took a look. It wasn't for a dating show, but a deserted island survival reality show.","The full name of the survival show was \"13 Days on the Island\". No scripts or behind-the-scenes interference, everything would be broadcasted live. The production team would not provide any assistance.","She vaguely recalled this show seemed to blow up later on in the book.","Looking closely, there weren't any hidden unfair clauses. So she signed her name.","On her way back to the break room, Shen Tang sensitively noticed people's gazes toward her seemed a bit off.","When she looked over, they either avoided her sight or pretended not to see her.","Upon returning to her office, she learned from Yuan Yuan that someone had spread news of her being kept by an old man.","Yuan Yuan was both indignant and worried. \"No idea which blabbermouth started rumors. Sis Tang Tang, should we clarify?\"","Shen Tang thought for a moment and said indifferently, \"Forget it, just let them talk. It's pretty much the same anyway.\"","Yuan Yuan opened her mouth wide in surprise.","Shen Tang closed her jaw. \"Put away your wild imagination.\"","Yuan Yuan: \"Oh.\"","Moreover, even if there was clarification, they still wouldn't believe it.","People only choose to believe what they want to believe."]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Man and Man, Wilrigod.","paragraphs":["In the cold-toned office, Gu Huaian sat in his chair with a tight jaw and thin lips pressed into a straight line.","A few men in suits stood in the middle of the room with their heads drooping, not even daring to breathe loudly.","Gu Huaian pinched his wildly throbbing temples, somewhat unclear about the current situation.","Wasn't he dead?","Thinking back to the car accident in his previous life, Gu Huaian's eyes instantly turned cold.","\"Get out.\"","\"Yes.\"","The voice was devoid of emotion, yet to the few men it sounded like heavenly music. Overjoyed, as if granted amnesty, they hurriedly ran out.","After closing the door behind them, they finally breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Don't you think President Gu's aura has become more and more terrifying recently?\"","\"I almost suffocated to death, good thing he finally let us out.\"","\"President Gu is literally a human air conditioner factory. If you ask me, why even bother turning on the AC? Just stand next to President Gu and the company could save on electricity bills.\"","The man standing opposite saw the arriving people and quickly coughed to warn the others.","\"What's wrong? Sore throat?\"","The man: \"......\"","He desperately hinted with his eyes. The other two also realized, and turned to find themselves face to face with Assistant Cen who had arrived at some point.","The three were very embarrassed.","\"Watch your words,\" Assistant Cen glanced at them indifferently, then entered President Gu's office.","One of them wiped the cold sweat from his forehead, \"You don't think he'll tattle on us, right?\"","\"Shouldn't, I guess...\"","In the office, Gu Huaian let out a gloomy, cold chuckle. In his previous life, he had let them get away with it. Now that Heaven had allowed him to be reborn, he would not let them off easily.","Every single one of them will pay.","It's just...","Thinking of how Shen Tang clung to him like chewing gum in his previous life, shaking her off to no avail, a flash of impatience appeared in Gu Huaian's eyes.","If only he had reincarnated a few days earlier, the contract would not have been signed yet.","After thinking for a bit, he added an supplementary contract and handed it to Assistant Cen.","\"Give this to Shen Tang and have her sign it.\"","He added after thinking, \"If she's willing to sign it, give her an extra million per month.\"","Money solves problems that can be solved with money. Compared to this meager amount, what he feared more was Shen Tang's clinginess.","Assistant Cen looked at the contents of the contract in surprise.","But as an assistant, the most important thing was to do more and ask less, so he put away the contract and only then began to talk business.","*","Having accidentally offended a popular celebrity's fans under Wang Brother's guidance, Shen Tang had no other jobs recently as she was being scolded by those fans. She laid on the sofa playing games the entire afternoon.","When she got up to stretch, she realized night had already fallen.","Standing by the window, she could see the city lights flickering brightly.","On her way out she discovered many people still working overtime at the company. Shen Tang listened in gossipingly.","Apparently a male artist from the company had slept with a female fan and was now being blackmailed. What was critical was that he had a girlfriend in the industry.","Shen Tang tsked. Chastity is a man's greatest dowry. A man without virtue did not deserve to be wanted.","The driver was still waiting for her downstairs. She asked and found out he had not left at all the entire afternoon.","Shen Tang felt a little bad, \"Next time you can do your own thing, no need to wait for me here.\"","\"I'm your dedicated driver. My duty is to serve Madam 24 hours a day.\"","Shen Tang once again marveled at her cheap husband's generosity. Although theirs was a contract marriage, he had given her all the appearances that were due.","She didn't get home until after 8 pm.","At that time Assistant Cen had already been waiting for a while.","He had thought she would be home and did not expect her to be out working. This improved Assistant Cen's impression of her a little.","From neurotic to hardworking neurotic.","Hmm, maybe not that much better.","Seeing no one around, Assistant Cen took out some documents and handed them over, \"Please take a look at these clauses. If there is no problem you can sign. President Gu said an extra million will be given per month.\"","Shen Tang, who originally wanted to read them carefully, upon hearing the three words \"one million\", immediately grabbed the pen and signed at the blank space below.","Assistant Cen was shocked, \"Aren't you going to read them first?\"","\"I trust President Gu, no need to read!\"","Firstly, she knew Gu Huaian was a virtuous man. And just one million extra per month was impossible for her to refuse.","That averaged to 200,000 shocking her awake every morning. Many people didn't even make that much in a year. Why would she not get along with money?","Assistant Cen had not expected Shen Tang to trust President Gu so much. He looked complicated, \"You should still take a look.\"","Only then did Shen Tang carefully read the supplementary agreement.","1. Except out of necessity, do not approach within 3 meters of Party A.","No problem. Not just 3 meters, even 30 meters is fine.","2. Except out of necessity, all physical contact is prohibited.","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"Don't these two clauses repeat each other? Since we can't get within 3 meters, how could there be any physical contact?\"","She wasn't even 3 meters tall.","Assistant Cen lightly coughed. He actually also felt these additional clauses were very strange.","What followed elaborated that she must know her place, not deliberately get close to him. Once in breach, he had the right to terminate the agreement.","Terminate the agreement!!!","Hearing these words, Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat. If terminated, the money would be gone!","That was a full 200 million!!!","She hugged the agreement to herself and earnestly told Assistant Cen, \"Please relay to President Gu that I will definitely memorize these clauses thoroughly, reciting them every morning after I wake up, to constantly remind myself and keep to my proper place.\"","Assistant Cen: \"......\"","No need to go that far.","\"She really said that?\"","\"Noted.\"","After hanging up the phone, Gu Huaian casually picked up a towel to dry his damp hair.","Having just gotten out of the shower, his body still emitted wisps of steam, sharpening his already sharp brows and eyes.","For convenience he often lived in a studio apartment near the company building.","He had to say, Shen Tang's response did surprise him quite a bit.","Recalling what happened in his previous life, Gu Huaian felt Shen Tang should be plotting something big.","At this thought, he sent a message to the housekeeper before starting on work.","While some burned the midnight oil working, others slipped comfortably into dreamland.","Having finally obtained a second life, of course she would treasure it and nourish herself well.","So by 11 pm Shen Tang was already tucked in bed ready to sleep.","The time between 11 pm and 2 am was when the liver detoxified. Proper rest during this period was critical. Shen Tang walked the talk. The first thing she did after getting up the next day was to read through the agreement, firmly imprinting it in her mind.","This directly concerned the bliss of the later half of her life after all.","Next she washed up and applied skincare.","Coincidentally, Shen Tang's looks were identical to her previous life's. This was also why she readily adapted to her new identity. She felt the two of them must share some bond.","What followed was eating, drinking, pampering herself and beauty treatments, easy days slipping by.","Thinking of her sick little brother hospitalized, Shen Tang specially visited him at the hospital.","The poor child laid pale-faced on the bed, yet extremely well-behaved, addressing her as Sister Tang affectionately. It melted her heart.","With a sweep of her hand, she moved him to a premium suite and hired a special caretaker before leaving.","A few days flashed by swiftly and her skin became more supple and tender.","However—","Shen Tang pinched her soft tummy. Had she gained weight?","She frowned and asked, \"Uncle He, have I gotten fatter?\"","The corner of Uncle He's eye twitched. Eating and sleeping all day long, it would be strange if she didn't gain weight.","But to directly tell the young miss would surely be hard for her to accept. Also he did feel girls looked better with some meat on them.","Uncle He carefully replied, \"You were too thin before. This is just right now.\"","Shen Tang sighed. So she really had gotten fat.","Looking at the table full of delicate cuisine, she painfully swallowed and said, \"Ask Sister Tao to make me some diet meals.\"","\"Nevermind, let's start tomorrow instead.\"","She clenched her fist in her heart. She must work hard to lose weight starting tomorrow!","Uncle He smiled with a shake of his head. Ever since Madam's arrival, the coldness vanished from the household, replaced by liveliness instead."]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Damn it, Why didn't it grow","paragraphs":["The next day, Shen Tang slept until noon before waking up. Tao Sister had already prepared a sumptuous low-fat meal. However, because it was too delicious, Shen Tang couldn't control the amount she ate, and didn't achieve the desired weight loss effect.","Shen Tang lay on the yoga mat, doing scissor legs while opening Weibo. There were too many messages and it was lagging badly. She saw a few private messages which were all cursing her, so Shen Tang pouted and logged out, re-registering a small account. Big data understood her, and the homepage was full of handsome men and beautiful women.","【Ah ah ah ah! Sister, you're killing me!】","【Sister's waist, a fatal curve】","【Wuwuwu, so fair and big, let me bury my head first】","【Sister, I have to confess, I used to be a 190cm dark-skinned athletic man, but after getting sick, the after-effects made me become a 168cm well-behaved little girl. Would you mind?】","【Sisters, does anyone understand, my penis is very hard】","Shen Tang's complexion turned rosy as she read them, fully satisfied, before reluctantly putting away her phone.","There was nothing else to it, she just found the little sisters all too beautiful. Shen Tang lowered her head to glance at her own unsatisfactory lower half. Damn it, why didn't it grow there!","In the afternoon, Shen Tang fell in love with 86 men and 123 women in total. It was not until Tao Sister's voice sounded that she realized it was time to eat again.","Looking at the sumptuous dinner, Shen Tang shook her head with difficulty: \"I'm on a diet, so I won't eat.\"","Tao Sister brought out a salad, \"Madam, this is what I prepared for you.\"","Shen Tang was stunned for a moment. \"Then what about the rest...\"","\"The rest is for the master. The master is coming home tonight.\"","The butler beside them had a sincere smile on his face, with the corners of his mouth lifted higher than usual.","Shen Tang had not met this cheap husband yet. The book described him as abstinent, handsome, and perfect. She didn't know what he looked like.","She was very nervous. This was the sugar daddy. She had to serve him well. She hurriedly recited the contents of the agreement in her heart before letting out a sigh of relief.","Her room was not on the same floor as Gu Huaian's. Only then did she feel at ease to return to her room to wash up.","Gu Huaian had not stayed here for many days. Just after finishing work, as he was about to go downstairs to eat, he suddenly felt a scorching gaze coming from the side.","Glancing over, he saw Shen Tang standing in the hallway, staring at him with wide eyes.","\"What are you standing there for?\" His voice was low and magnetic, like the sound of a cello. Shen Tang only felt her ears tingle a little.","She was actually an audiophile.","In her two lifetimes added together, this was Shen Tang's first time seeing such a handsome man. His features were exquisite, with long eyebrows and temples, a tall nose and deep eyes. He was tall and well-built.","He was estimated to be about 1.9 meters tall. Even wearing loose home clothes, he still couldn't hide his broad shoulders and long legs. He was simply a ripped comic male character.","As expected of the female lead's white moonlight, he was so good looking.","Withdrawing her appreciative gaze, Shen Tang gestured at the distance between them and said, \"Three meters apart.\"","She really was a dedicated person!","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He looked her up and down carefully, feeling like Shen Tang still looked the same as before, but it seemed something had changed.","Looking closely, he realized it was her gaze that had changed. It was no longer sticky, infatuated, or uncomfortable.","Gu Huaian went downstairs first. Shen Tang strictly maintained a three meter distance between them.","Although the Gu family was luxurious, the dining table was not more than three meters long. This posed some difficulty for Shen Tang.","She picked up her salad bowl and trotted over to sit on the sofa.","Gu Huaian instantly understood her intention.","\"Come over to eat,\" he said, even though he didn't want to face her. But he wouldn't make her eat at the coffee table.","Shen Tang looked up sharply, using her eyes to ask: Was this considered a necessary moment?","Gu Huaian didn't even know why he understood her meaning, and lightly nodded.","Shen Tang excitedly ran back to the dinner table and sat down opposite Gu Huaian, chewing her vegetables with indifference.","Her eyes stared straight at Gu Huaian's chopsticks, one piece of meat, two pieces of meat...","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","His eating motions slowed.","Shen Tang quickly withdrew her gaze, though she still glanced up at him from time to time.","Gu Huaian didn't understand why. Tao Sister smiled and pushed the seafood towards her. \"Madam, these are low fat. You can eat them.\"","Shen Tang had been waiting for these words!","She picked up a piece of air-flown seafood and put it in her mouth. It was the familiar taste, so fresh it made people want to cry!","Wow, it was so delicious!","Gu Huaian was always disciplined, and kept dinner to 70% full.","Perhaps it was because Shen Tang ate the food too appetizingly. When he came to his senses, he realized he had eaten half a bowl more than usual.","Gu Huaian's face was a little ugly. He had actually been influenced by Shen Tang. He immediately left the table with a dark expression.","Shen Tang didn't care about him. After eating, she curled up on the sofa playing games.","Recently she had found a gaming partner, a female college student.","Although her skills were a bit weak, her mouth was very sweet, and she could give Shen Tang emotional feedback at all times, either praising her or praising her gameplay.","Shen Tang was happy to lead her.","Glancing at the time, her gaming partner was just about to come online.","Shen Tang's game ID was \"Lovesick Monkey Auntie\". Her partner's ID was \"Sweet Kitten\", a very cute girl.","When Tao Sister first saw this eye-catching ID, she was stunned, but by now she could keep a straight face.","\"Madam, your nourishing milk tea.\"","That's right, it had cordyceps added to the milk tea.","\"Thank you, Tao Sister, love you!\" Shen Tang blew her a flying kiss.","Tao Sister blushed.","The madam really was...too cute.","Tao Sister was considered an old hand of the Gu family, having been there over ten years. The house used to be cold and empty. Now that there was a madam, it finally became lively and felt like a home.","She was very gratified in her heart. If old Madam Gu knew about this in her grave, she would surely be happy.","At night, the entire villa sank into silence.","Shen Tang had drank too much milk tea at night. She woke up thirsty at midnight, slipped on her slippers and went downstairs. Suddenly she heard rustling sounds.","Could it be burglars?","She quietly took off her slippers, looked left and right, then grabbed a vase from the shelf and tiptoed barefoot towards the kitchen - that was where the sound came from.","The closer she got, the more obvious the sounds became. Shen Tang's heart started beating faster. She took a deep breath.","A dark shadow came out from inside. She lifted the vase and smashed it over -","\"Ouch!\""]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: That's Why you hit Me.","paragraphs":["“So this is your reason for smashing me?”","Gu Huaian sat on the sofa with a cut on his forehead that the family doctor was helping bandage. He never dreamed he'd be treated like a thief in his own home.","Gu Huaian took a deep breath. “Shen Tang, what makes you think people can just come and go here as they please?”","Shen Tang glanced at him guiltily and spoke timidly, “I’m sorry...”","Come to think of it, the people living here were either rich or noble. How could thieves possibly get in so easily?","She must have lost her mind just now!","Shen Tang quietly argued with herself in her heart. Who told you not to turn on the lights...","He could turn them on or not as he pleased. After living here for so long, he could find his way around with his eyes closed.","The veins on Gu Huaian's temple throbbed, making his wound sting too. Just what sin had he committed to end up meeting Shen Tang?","Wait, did Shen Tang not move her mouth just now?","Gu Huaian pinched his brow. He must be disoriented from the blow. How could a person speak without moving their mouth?","\"Alright, you should go rest now.\"","Hearing that he didn't want to talk to her, Shen Tang hurriedly got up and left, turning back three times, \"I'll be going then~\"","Gu Huaian didn't even spare a glance for her.","Even lying in bed, Shen Tang still hadn't figured out how things had turned out this way. Would he fire her because of this?","\"No!\"","Shen Tang suddenly sat up in bed. To avoid being fired, she had to do something!","Carefully recalling the book's description, Gu Huaian had a bad stomach from working long hours and eating irregularly.","Shen Tang tutted. Ten tycoons, nine with stomach problems.","So the next day before Gu Huaian left, Peach Sister handed her a bag.","\"What's this?\"","Peach Sister smiled mockingly, \"The mistress specifically had me make sandwiches for you. Take them to the company to eat.\"","Gu Huaian took them without saying whether he would eat them or not.","At the company, he drank a cup of black coffee as usual, and felt the habitual pain in his stomach.","Secretary Chen frowned. \"Your stomach hurts again? Let me get your medicine.\"","Gu Huaian took the medicine, then saw Secretary Chen take the sandwich out of the paper bag. \"You brought breakfast but aren't eating it?\"","Gu Huaian didn't really want to eat it. Just thinking that Shen Tang had prepared it made him feel averse.","Was she trying to curry favor with him?","The ingredients were bought with his money, and the sandwiches were made by Peach Sister. Shen Tang hadn't even shown her face.","Gu Huaian sneered. This woman really couldn't pretend properly.","\"I'm not hungry, you can eat it.\"","Secretary Chen didn't stand on ceremony either. He hadn't eaten breakfast today either.","And Gu Huaian didn't return to the villa that night. He didn't plan on giving Shen Tang a chance to get close to him.","Unknown to him, when Shen Tang found out, she happily ate three bowls of rice.","Peach Sister was a little hesitant: \"Mistress, shouldn't you call your husband?\"","It didn't seem quite normal for a newlywed couple to be living apart like this.","Other than the couple themselves, only the butler and Secretary Chen knew it was a marriage of convenience. Peach Sister was completely unaware.","Shen Tang waved her hand unconcernedly, \"Living at home wastes too much commute time. Plus, absence makes the heart grow fonder. Don't worry.\"","However, Peach Sister still felt something wasn't quite right.","\"Should I keep making the sandwiches then?\"","Shen Tang put down her phone and thought for a moment. \"Make them. Have the driver deliver them.\"","After all, he was the daddy with the gold. And she had just made a mistake, so she still had to make a good impression.","So in the mornings after that, Gu Huaian would receive a sandwich every day. Without fail they all ended up in Secretary Chen's stomach.","Gu Huaian showed no reaction. Secretary Chen, however, couldn't take it anymore. Looking at the familiar sandwich, his face was bitter, \"President Gu...\"","\"Can you tell your family's cook to make something else for breakfast?\" He was really going to vomit from eating them.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Next time she sends them, tell her not to send anymore.\" He had almost forgotten about the matter. He didn't expect Shen Tang to persist like this.","Gu Huaian scoffed softly, a touch of impatience flashing through his eyes.","Secretary Chen noticed it subtly, but didn't say anything, regretting it a little in his heart.","Although his salary was high, free breakfast was free breakfast.","Also, even though they were the same flavor every time, the ingredients used were the finest, so the taste was still good.","After receiving the driver's message, Peach Sister asked quietly, \"Still send them?\"","\"Send them! Of course send them! Whether he eats them or not is his business. Whether I send them or not is my business.\" It was just moving her lips, no big deal.","Peach Sister sighed, the mistress really loved the master dearly.","But the master was a bit oblivious, only focused on work. At this rate, who knew when they'd have a young master.","Peach Sister was a woman of few words. \"What would the mistress like for breakfast tomorrow morning?\"","\"Let's do Chinese breakfast tomorrow. I'm kind of craving baozi.\"","\"Got it.\"","The next morning, Shen Tang ate the crab roe baozi she didn't usually indulge in, tears of excitement flowing from the corners of her mouth.","Peach Sister's cooking really was incredible.","Right after finishing breakfast, she received a text from an unknown number - Shen Tang, come to Heishan tonight.","Scammers were this high level now? They even knew her name and were asking her to climb a mountain? At night?","Shen Tang gave a cold laugh and immediately blocked and deleted the number.","And so that night, pajama-clad Shen Tang came face to face with her contract husband in a tailored designer suit.","\"So that text was from you?\"","Gu Huaian didn't speak. \"You have thirty minutes to get ready. We're going to the old residence later.\"","\"Don't worry, I'll be ready in no time!\"","She complained internally: Old residence, fine, but why say Heishan? How was she supposed to know the old residence was in Heishan?","Gu Huaian suddenly looked up. Shen Tang had already clip clopped upstairs. He knit his brows and sat down.","Shen Tang was quick with her makeup, but took some time choosing an outfit.","Especially since she had really gained quite a bit of weight recently, with a layer of flab on her stomach. She finally found a dress that concealed it, and hurried downstairs just as thirty minutes were up.","Shen Tang looked at him uneasily, \"I'm ready.\"","\"Mm.\"","The two got in the car one after the other, Gu Huaian looking down handling work, his side profile very elegant.","Shen Tang sneaked a few glances at him.","[His skin is so nice. He stays up late every day, how is there not even a dark circle?]","[Is the tycoon boss that busy? He's still working in the car?]","[Hehehe~ I wonder if my discounted husband has an eight pack...]","Gu Huaian: \"Quiet!\"","Shen Tang was shocked, \"I didn't say anything...\"","The driver also looked back in surprise through the rearview mirror.","Gu Huaian pinched his brow. Did he just hallucinate?","He looked at Shen Tang.","[Oh my god, why is he looking at me? I really didn't say anything! Is this guy crazy from overwork?]","There was undisguised shock in Gu Huaian's eyes!","Shen Tang's mouth clearly hadn't moved, yet he distinctly heard her speaking. What was going on?","\"Do you still remember the contents of our agreement?\" His question seemed casual.","\"I remember, I remember! Don't worry, I'll be on my best behavior tonight!\" Shen Tang recited the agreement in her heart, then started reviewing the content of the romance novels she had read.","It was just a loving married couple. No problem!"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Shall I Carry You","paragraphs":["The remaining time, Gu Huaian had accepted the fact that he could understand what Shen Tang was thinking in her heart. It was good this way. If she deliberately caused trouble, he could also be wary. It's just that this woman's inner voice was too noisy, making it so he hadn't finished his work.","After getting off the car, Gu Huaian stretched out his arm. In that instant, countless thoughts flashed through Shen Tang's mind, and finally she held up that arm with both hands, \"Shall I support you?\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He wasn't that old yet!","With a complicated expression, he looped Shen Tang's arm, and the two walked in together, a handsome man and beautiful woman, very eye-catching.","It had to be said, the old house looked even more luxurious. As soon as they entered the hall, dozens of eyes glanced over all at once. Shen Tang's little heart thumped wildly.","【Damn, scared me to death!】","If not for her experience in her past life, she probably wouldn't have been able to stand steadily.","Thinking of this mission, she tilted her face slightly, revealing a shy smile.","A malicious gaze glared over. Shen Tang looked over to see a little girl with bloodshot eyes, lightly biting her lower lip with an expression like she was about to cry but not crying.","【Why is she looking at me like that? Is it the ex of my cheap husband? A secret admirer? Tsk! Could it be an unrequited fiancee?!】","\"Don't randomly guess, she's a cousin.\"","\"Ah? Oh!\"","【Strange, how does he know what I'm thinking?】","Gu Huaian also noticed this point, and admonished himself to be more careful going forward.","This was Shen Tang's first time seeing Gu's family members. It had to be said, Gu's family members all had outstanding looks.","But they were all smiling on the surface while feeling otherwise, and seemed hard to get along with.","There were many people in Gu's family, but strangely only a few children.","Sitting down next to Gu Huaian, the old man sitting in the head seat slammed his cane angrily.","\"You actually know to come back!\"","\"Dad, Mom.\"","Shen Tang opened her mouth, but before she could call out \"Dad\", the old man said, \"Don't call me Dad, I'm not your dad.\"","Shen Tang obediently changed her words: \"Uncle, hello.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","The elegant and graceful lady next to him gently patted his hand, then took off her wrist bracelet and put it on Shen Tang's hand, \"Good child, I don't have any nice gifts prepared for our first meeting, so I'm giving this to you. Don't look down on it.\"","Seeing this scene, the people around instantly changed expressions, especially that red-eyed little girl who seemed like she wanted to say something but was stopped by the older woman next to her.","Shen Tang didn't care about that at all. She sweetly said, \"Thank you, Mom.\"","Everyone: \"...\"","The corner of Gu Huaian's mouth twitched.","The old man's expression was also not good. Calling one Uncle and one Mom, what was going on?","But making her change again was impossible, he really didn't look favorably on this woman with no family background. She brought no benefit to Huaian.","\"Ai, she's a good child. Huaian's temperament is cold, you'll have to yield more to him. After so many years, you're the first person he's brought back. I haven't seen him this happy in a long time.\"","【Shouldn't these lines be said by the butler in the novel? Tsk tsk, being expressionless is an illness that needs treatment.】","Shen Tang glanced at Gu Huaian from the corner of her eye. And how could this coffin face tell that he was happy?","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","Another married woman cut in, \"If you ask me, Huaian is also old enough, you two should hurry and have a child.\"","Unexpectedly the wealthy family also got nagged about having kids. Shen Tang smiled slightly but didn't say anything.","Gu Huaian indifferently said, \"No need for Second Aunt to worry about this. I heard Second Uncle has been getting very close with the new secretary recently?\"","Second Aunt's expression instantly changed.","Second Uncle Gu Rong hurriedly explained, \"That child's background is quite pitiful. I'm just looking out for her more.\"","Second Aunt gave a cold humph, \"Yes, looking out for her all the way into bed!\"","Gu Rong knitted his brows, \"Speaking nonsense?\"","Second Aunt shrugged, not saying anything more. She didn't want to air dirty laundry either.","In her heart, Shen Tang also gave a big thumbs up. This guy really was ruthless, spilling everything.","Laughter sounded from across the table. Shen Tang looked over to the source and saw a handsome man smiling at her, even blinking his peach blossom eyes.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","【Tsk, flower peacock.】","The corner of Gu Huaian's mouth curved up slightly.","\"Big brother.\" The man said.","\"Second brother.\" Gu Huaian nodded slightly.","The novel didn't describe Gu Huaian's family members much, so Shen Tang didn't recognize this person. But from the first glance she felt he wasn't a good person.","Soon, the family banquet started. Everyone adhered to the rule of no talking while eating, making it a very quiet meal.","This made Shen Tang very uncomfortable.","Thinking about it, since she had to keep up the loving couple act, she personally peeled a shrimp and put it in Gu Huaian's bowl.","Then, pitching her voice, she said, \"Dear, eat the shrimp.\"","When the words left her mouth, Shen Tang realized she might have overdone it. She almost sent herself away on the spot with that voice.","\"Big brother doesn't like to eat shrimp!\" The girl who seemed to have pinkeye from her red eyes earlier loudly declared.","Shen Tang's expression instantly changed.","【Crap, I didn't remember the gold master dad's preferences. I hope he doesn't dock my pay!】","Gu Huaian looked at her with a hint of a smile, then picked up the shrimp with his chopsticks and put it in his mouth, saying softly, \"Delicious.\"","Shen Tang's face instantly turned red.","【Demon!】","If she didn't know he had no interest in her, she might have almost been seduced by him.","That girl angrily chewed her food for a bit, making Shen Tang suspect she actually wanted to bite her instead.","Everyone ate the meal distractedly, probably no one ate well except for Shen Tang.","After the meal, Shen Tang went to the garden to aid her digestion.","It was the delicious food's fault. She hadn't been able to resist and her tummy was swollen. She had to constantly suck in to maintain her image.","The garden was big and beautiful, though the mosquitoes were a bit much.","Slap! Shen Tang killed the 38th mosquito of the night that intended to attack her.","\"Pfft, have you never eaten delicious food before?\" The girl with pinkeye said disdainfully.","Shen Tang nodded sincerely, \"Yes, never.\"","This reply left the girl at a loss for words, not knowing how to respond.","After a while, she threatened, \"I'm telling you, I'll never recognize you. Big brother and Lian Jiejie are a match made in heaven!\"","\"Oh.\"","\"Don't get ideas. Lian Jiejie hasn't come back yet. When she does, big brother will definitely kick you out!\"","\"Oh.\"","\"You, you villain!\" The girl was furious and ran off in a huff.","Shen Tang sighed. Heaven and earth were her witnesses, she hadn't done anything!","Tsk, the rich family life really was dangerous and difficult.","\"Sister-in-law isn't sad?\"","Shen Tang looked up at the voice to find cheap second brother had appeared on the balcony to watch the fun at some point.","Somehow it sounded weird hearing him call her sister-in-law.","She suspected he wanted to seduce her, but had no proof.","Thinking of the 200 million yuan, Shen Tang cautiously took a step back. \"What's there to be upset about?\"","\"Doesn't sister-in-law worry that big brother will... rekindle old flames?\"","Shen Tang's eyes spun as she gave a coy smile. \"Aiya, how can your loose lips say such cold words? Huaian said I'm the only one he'll love in this life. I believe him.\"","Upstairs, Gu Jinan's expression twisted for a moment.","His aloof workaholic big brother could actually say stuff like that?","Back in the room, Shen Tang discovered she was sharing a room with her cheap husband after all.","Luckily the room was big, with a large sofa too.","The sound of water came from the bathroom. This was Shen Tang's first time sharing a room with a man, so she felt a bit uncomfortable and took out her phone to play games.","Soon the water stopped. She quickly put her phone down to look over, only to see Gu Huaian wrapped up tight in a robe.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","A flash of disappointment went through her eyes.","【As expected of a noble and abstinent president. Wrapped up tight.】","【Tsk, I wonder if he has abs.】","Gu Huaian discreetly tightened his waistband a little.","Was the previous Shen Tang like this too?","Gu Huaian fell into contemplation."]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: I heard that bullies always seven times a night.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang did not wait for him to speak, took out a thin quilt from the cabinet, and neatly lay down on the sofa.","\"You sleep on the bed, I sleep on the sofa. Don't worry, I sleep very honestly, I won't make any noise, I absolutely won't disturb you.\"","\"No need, you can sleep on the bed.\"","With that said, Gu Huaian opened his laptop and continued working.","Shen Tang didn't take his words seriously. Anyway, the sofa was big and soft, very comfortable.","However, do tycoons always work this hard?","\"Knock knock knock!\"","There was a knock at the door. Shen Tang ran over barefoot and opened the door.","\"Uncle He?\" The visitor was the steward of the old house, also surnamed He, and was the brother of Uncle He from the villa.","This Uncle He was not talkative. He handed over a bag, \"This is what the mistress ordered, young mistress keep it safe.\"","Just by looking at the package, she couldn't tell what was inside. Shen Tang guessed it might be some kind of greeting gift, and smiled as she took it.","\"I won't disturb your rest then.\"","After Uncle He left, Shen Tang sat on the sofa holding the bag, feeling great. She had just opened the package and her face dropped immediately.","[Gasp!]","[Phew! Are people from wealthy families so open about this? They actually sent over one, two, three, four, five boxes! ]","[This is practically murder, good thing this is a fake marriage.]","Shen Tang stroked her chin and glanced at Gu Huaian: [I heard that tycoons do it seven times a night, I wonder if sugar daddy can keep up.]","Gu Huaian, who was working, stiffened, and a faint blush quickly appeared on the tips of his ears.","Seeing this, Shen Tang thoughtfully lowered the air conditioner temperature.","She casually threw the bag aside, opened King of Glory on her phone, strangely, her gaming partner was not online. Who's going to shout 666 for her?","Because her gaming partner's ID was Sweet Little Kitten, Shen Tang always called her Meow Meow.","[Meow Meow, how come you're not online today?]","The other party's WeChat turned to \"Typing...\", and after a long time she finally received a long message.","[Wahhh, sister monkey, the CP I shipped got together! My brother actually brought home a woman inferior to my goddess in every way. That woman has nothing except her face. I saw clearly how much my brother liked the goddess, he even promised to marry her when she gets back. I really cannot accept this result now. Although I know he doesn't have feelings for the current woman, he's already tainted, even if my goddess comes back, he wouldn't be good enough for her anymore, wahhh... Why do men's hearts change so quickly...]","Hearing this juicy gossip, Shen Tang immediately became spirited.","The plot seemed a bit familiar? But that's not important!","Shen Tang sat up abruptly and started tapping away at her phone.","[Ah this... I feel that your brother is the real scumbag who has let down two girls! ]","The more the two chatted, the more heated the discussion became. In the end, they cursed the scumbag together.","It wasn't until the alarm rang that Shen Tang realized it was already 11pm, time to sleep.","But she was not sleepy at all, she even felt energetic enough to do a round of calisthenics.","Looking up, she saw her cheap husband was still working.","Is he a robot?","Doesn't he get tired?","Shen Tang thought for a while, slipped on her slippers and went downstairs to make a glass of milk.","Just as she was about to go upstairs, a hand took the milk away and finished it in one go, even slowly licking the milk stain from the corner of his mouth.","\"Thanks sister-in-law, how did you know I was thirsty?\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","\"Could it be this was prepared for my brother? Sister-in-law, don't you know my brother only drinks coffee not milk?\"","Shen Tang nervously curled her fingers a few times, keeping a straight face as she said: \"Who said that, this was for me to drink.\"","\"Oh~ I see...\"","Shen Tang always felt his gaze was up to no good. She made another glass of milk.","Going upstairs, she could still feel that hot gaze sticking to her, it made her break out in goosebumps.","Back in the room, she put the milk on the table, then let out a deep sigh in her heart.","\"What's wrong?\" Gu Huaian looked up and pushed up the frameless glasses on his nose bridge.","Shen Tang looked at him resentfully.","\"Nothing.\"","[Should I say your brother seems to be seducing me?]","[If I say he likes me that would definitely be impossible. There must be some grand scheme, tsk tsk, this rascal is too evil!]","[Two hundred million, two hundred million, two hundred million, two hundred million! Heh heh, no one can stop me from making money!]","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Money-grubber!","Ever since discovering that he could hear Shen Tang's inner voice, Gu Huaian had been doubting life all the time.","He even started to wonder, did he really transmigrate? Were the events in his past life real? Otherwise how could a person change so much?","He lowered his eyes, concealing the fleeting deep thoughts in them.","After only spending one night at the old Gu residence, the two left early in the morning the next day.","Since it was so early, there weren't many people around.","But Lady Gu had arranged for people to prepare piles of big and small gifts beforehand, which made Shen Tang feel a little bad.","After all, she wasn't really married.","But when she thought about giving away the things she obtained, she was somewhat reluctant.","Shen Tang clutched her chest, feeling so pained she could almost cry.","Gu Huaian glanced at her. Pathetic.","\"What's given to you is yours, just keep it.\"","Shen Tang was overjoyed, \"Really?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Hee hee, thank you sugar daddy!\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\" What kind of address is sugar daddy?","As expected of a tycoon, so generous!","Shen Tang felt great inside, and started calculating how much money these could sell for.","But her good mood didn't last long. Before they even got home, she received a call from her agent Wang Brother - there was work.","This time the job was to promote merchandise with a famous influencer.","Although she was a celebrity with high popularity, her reputation was too poor that she basically couldn't get any good jobs, and could only rely on hype.","However, the more hype, the more people disliked her, forming a vicious cycle.","Shen Tang really wanted to reject it.","She remembered there was something like this in the original book. Because she over-praised the products as arranged by the company, people received fruits of poor quality, especially durian. The prices were already high yet many were duds. She was also scolded badly because of this.","Rejecting was out of the question. The other side was offering too much, the company wouldn't let her reject it.","Also, maybe she could take this chance to warn the buyers.","\"Um... could you send me to the company?\"","\"Okay.\"","Only after Gu Huaian spoke did the driver make a U-turn.","Shen Tang opened her phone to look at the information Wang Brother sent. The theme of this livestream promotion was to help farmers, to help them sell their unsold agricultural products.","The intention was good, but the middlemen were too scammy.","Thinking of the content described in the book, Shen Tang decided to say and do less during this livestream, and try to be just a background.","However, she did not notice the expression of the person beside her gradually becoming serious.","Gu Huaian's gaze subtly fell on Shen Tang, looking calm and composed on the surface, but actually huge waves werebeing kicked up in his mind.","What did she just think?","What does she mean by described in the book?","The answer was right in front of him, just a light touch and he would know. But Gu Huaian didn't even dare to think further.","It wasn't until the driver spoke that Gu Huaian came back to his senses.","Only then did he realize Shen Tang had already gotten out of the car, and he had arrived at the company too.","He reined in his mind, pinched his brow, then strode into the company with large steps.","No matter what the truth was, work still had to be done.","That's right, even a tycoon can't do whatever he wants whenever he wants."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Escaped from what mental hospital","paragraphs":["On the other side, Shen Tang came to the company, but did not see Wang Brother. She only saw Yuan Yuan alone.","\"Where is Wang Brother?\"","Yuan Yuan explained cautiously: \"Wang Brother has been busy training new employees recently...\"","Shen Tang frowned, victim side +1.","\"Tang Tang sister...\"","\"I'm fine, just feel a little heartache for the new employee.\"","Yuan Yuan: \"...\"","Obviously, everyone was clear about what kind of person Wang Brother was.","\"Let's go, get to work.\"","\"OK!\"","Arriving at the studio 10 minutes early, she ended up waiting for more than half an hour before the male anchor finally walked in surrounded front and back.","He held his chin high, perfunctorily greeted Shen Tang, then started putting on makeup, occasionally curling his index finger ladylike and pointing at the makeup artist fussily.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","This was really a stab in the ass - she was wide awake now.","If you don't want to make money you might as well not show up.","When the live stream officially started, the fans in the live streaming room had already been waiting for a long time.","After opening the stream, the male anchor instantly transformed into a different person, nothing like his previous arrogant manner.","He knitted his brows and lightly bit his lower lip: \"Baby, I'm so sorry, something came up today that delayed me, so the stream opened late. Let's do this - I'll set up some lucky bags as compensation for everyone, okay?\"","【Husband, don't frown, it worries me】","【Not late, not late, just on time】","Shen Tang: \"...\"","After the male anchor finished his opening remarks, Shen Tang also greeted: \"Hello everyone, I'm Shen Tang.\"","With ten levels of beauty filters, the Shen Tang in the stream had a chin so sharp it could kill someone.","Looking at the bullet comments, sure enough, they were extremely unpleasant.","【Solid evidence, Shen Tang is a plastic surgery freak】","【The team keeps bragging about her peerless beauty, I'm laughing to death】","【I heard a certain scam artist came to stream? No one wants to scam her anymore?】","【Bullshit, I already guessed the next hot search topic, the brother is probably going to get scammed again】","A lot of black fans flooded into the streaming room, and popularity rose sharply.","Shen Tang maintained a constant professional smile, as if the person being scolded in the comments wasn't her.","Teehee, scold all you want, anyway after this stream she would get a lot of money from the split with the company.","The mission for this stream was to help farmers, the shopping cart was full of agricultural products, supposedly to help solve the problem of overstocked fruits in remote mountainous regions.","If she hadn't read the novel, Shen Tang would have believed it.","Under the banner of helping farmers, the male anchor's team bought fruit from farmers at extremely low prices, then sold them at high prices. In the end the farmers didn't make any money, it all went into his own pockets.","Shen Tang looked at the fruits laid out on the table, all chosen for the best appearance.","She picked up a peach, broke it open with her bare hands, took a bite - crisp, sweet, just the texture she loved most.","The male anchor jabbered on and on promoting the products, while Shen Tang sat to the side steadily eating and eating, taking delicate nibbles, her expression one of extreme enjoyment - it made everyone's mouth water just looking at her.","【Gotta say, Shen Tang is eating with gusto...】","【Bought it, if it doesn't taste good I'll scold you on Weibo】","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"If it doesn't taste good you can all go scold the anchor. \"","Male anchor: \"???\"","【Are we buying the same thing you're eating? If so I'll place an order now】","Shen Tang's mind stirred, and she said, \"How about I take everyone to go see the fruit warehouse inventory, you all know the anchor is a big anchor, I suppose he wouldn't do something shoddy like passing off inferior goods as quality ones. \"","This made the people in the streaming room take notice - a large number of them really did want to help the farmers, so being able to see for themselves was best.","Even the black fans didn't voice any opinions.","Male anchor: \"???\"","\"Wait a minute—\"","How did things seem to be going off track!","Shen Tang deliberately asked, \"What, you don't want everyone to see?\"","The male anchor feigned surprise, \"How could you think that? It's just busy in the warehouse, us going would disrupt everyone working there. And to keep the fruits fresh, the temperature is low there, if you catch a cold that wouldn't be good.\"","【Wahhh, brother is so considerate!】","【Wait, am I the only one who feels something is off?】","\"I see, so that's how it is. I thought there was something shameful in the warehouse that you didn't dare let me see.\"","The male anchor's heart thumped, looking again at Shen Tang, her gaze was innocent and guileless, seeming to just say it casually.","He breezily explained for a couple sentences, then shifted the topic along.","Some people were still suspicious, but the male anchor's fans were too numerous, their comments directly pushed everything else up.","【If you don't buy then scram, this was to help farmers in the first place, did you think you'd earn money from it?】","【Right, the brother's kind intentions, yet you still suspect this and that, really speechless】","Of course Shen Tang knew it wouldn't be possible to go see the warehouse, this was just to remind everyone a bit.","She was pondering how to expose everything.","She didn't expect a chance would come so quickly.","Next they moved on to introduce durian. The male anchor picked up a cracked open durian, splitting it to reveal large and fleshy pods inside.","He passed one section to Shen Tang, \"Does Miss Shen enjoy eating durian?\"","Shen Tang did not take it, her expression conflicted.","Seeing this, the male anchor's mouth quirked up slightly. \"Miss Shen, don't be shy, try it. Durian smells bad but tastes delicious.\"","Shen Tang was somewhat hesitant. \"It's not that I don't like durian...\"","\"I just don't want to eat the piece in your hand.\" Shen Tang asked in earnest.","The smile on the male anchor's face faded a little.","\"Let me clarify, I have nothing against you, just the durian. For durians with such a large opening, who knows if roaches or rats crawled in, I really don't dare eat it...\"","【!!!】","【Holy crap! Is that really a thing】","The male anchor quickly explained, \"Babies don't worry, the warehouse is very clean, we have strict hygiene management, no roaches or rats.\"","Shen Tang nodded in understanding and held out the durian to his mouth, eyes full of expectation, \"I see, then you eat it.\"","Male anchor: \"...\"","You're poisonous!","In the end the male anchor did not eat the durian either, but had an assistant eat it instead.","The assistant was a recent college graduate, and could only barely maintain a smile. This successfully made some people doubt whether the warehouse was really clean or not.","In short, Shen Tang's maneuvers successfully sabotaged durian sales.","After ending the stream, the male anchor's face instantly darkened.","\"Miss Shen, have I offended you somehow?\"","Shen Tang looked innocent. \"No, why would you say that?\"","\"You did that on purpose just now!\"","Shen Tang deliberately covered her mouth in an exaggerated manner. \"What did I say? Sorry, it was my first time live streaming to sell stuff, I'm not too clear on the process.\"","Seeing her put on this act, the male anchor was even more angry. Pointing at her he yelled, \"Just you wait!\"","\"Oh my, I'm so scared!\" Shen Tang didn't care about offending people or not. Anyway she was about to start a happy retired life soon.","But this was about all she could do. To put it bluntly, she didn't have as many fans as the anchor.","Trashy, so trashy...","The male anchor was so angry his lips were trembling. Just what kind of psychiatric hospital did you escape from?!"]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: Why Don't Good Horses Turn Around","paragraphs":["On her way home, Shen Tang received a phone call from her assistant Yuan Yuan.","\"Tang Tang sister, you made it to the hot search!\"","\"Ah? I haven't stirred up any controversies recently?\"","Yuan Yuan: \"...\"","\"This time it's good news, go check Weibo quickly.\"","As soon as Shen Tang logged into Weibo, her phone froze.","The messages only displayed 99+, she didn't want to look for abuse.","She opened the hot search rankings, and as expected saw herself there.","Some enthusiastic netizen recorded her performance in the livestream and posted it on Weibo.","Shen Tang thought the comments would all be cursing her, but when she looked there were some unexpected defenders, though they were attacked badly.","She was certain they were just passersby, because Shen Tang was convinced she had no fans.","The super topic managers were all her alt accounts, and the fan group only had a few people, not even enough for two mahjong tables.","【I'll prove Shen Tang is telling the truth, let me post a picture】","The photo showed a cockroach covered in oil squeezing through the cracks of a durian, it looked disgusting.","【Hahaha, Shen Tang is always contrary】","【Anonymous, I'm a warehouse worker, the warehouse is very dirty with lots of rats and cockroaches. Everyone should avoid buying fruits and fresh food with Curry's name】","Curry was the name of the male anchor.","【Rumors are easily spread, truth is hard to explain, poster above are you just slandering with no evidence? If you have the guts post a photo】","The internet exploded over this incident, most of the male anchor's fans believed and defended him, while some clung to the fact he didn't eat the durian in the end.","Shen Tang smiled, good good, this kind of scumbag was bound to have his wrongdoings exposed sooner or later.","Shen Tang was in a great mood, her heart completely at ease.","This showed the plot of the book could still be changed, which meant she really could change her tragic ending.","Hehe~","Shen Tang was extremely happy and ate three bowls of rice when she got home.","This also signaled the end of her weight loss endeavor.","However -","\"Hasn't my husband come home yet?\"","Tao Sister shook her head: \"The master hasn't returned, he must be staying near the company.\"","Shen Tang nodded in understanding, not noticing the hint of distress in Tao Sister's eyes.","Of course, what newlywed couple would be living separately already?","Tao Sister couldn't help suggesting: \"Mistress why don't you bring food to the master? I've already prepared it.\"","Shen Tang didn't want to go, but before she could refuse Tao Sister had already packed the lunchbox and held it out to her.","Shen Tang: Ah this...","\"He should have food there right...\"","A big boss how could he not have food to eat?","Tao Sister shook her head in disapproval: \"That's not how to think about it, restaurant food outside is unsanitary, how could it compare to clean tasty homemade meals? What's more, the master has a sensitive stomach and often misses meals, who knows if he's eaten dinner yet tonight!\"","Shen Tang hesitated for a moment, then took the lunchbox, \"Fine I'll go take a look.\"","She absolutely could not let the money master ruin his stomach, or who would earn money?","Maybe if she performed well, the money master would be happy and give her more money, hehe~","Because the community had strict security, and Shen Tang's information wasn't in the system, she was stopped at the entrance unable to get in.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Just then, a sports car screeched to a halt beside her and the window slowly rolled down.","\"Oh, who's this squatting outside the community gate not going in?\"","Shen Tang stood up, and upon recognizing the person rolled her eyes: \"Oh, who's this that owes money and still dares to show his face?\"","\"It's just a few ten thousand yuan, I'll pay you back right now.\"","After waiting a while, Sha Ma Te looked at Shen Tang in disbelief: \"You actually blocked me!\"","\"Sorry, I forgot.\"","Shen Tang quickly unblocked him from the blacklist, and after receiving the money, blocked him again.","\"Alright, money received, see you!\"","\"Wait!\" Sha Ma Te hurriedly got out of the car, \"Shen Tang, don't tell me you knew I lived here and came to wait for me on purpose? I'm telling you, I will never get back together with you!\"","Shen Tang took a deep breath, \"Who gave you the confidence! Do you know why good horses don't eat back their food?\"","\"Why?\"","\"Because it's covered in shit.\"","Sha Ma Te: \"...\"","\"Hahahahaha!\"","Laughter sounded from the side, Sha Ma Te's expression became very ugly, he glanced at the license plate knowing he couldn't afford to provoke the owner, so left Shen Tang with a threat: \"I'm waiting for the day you beg me to take you back.\"","\"Oh, keep waiting slowly, see you next life.\"","After Sha Ma Te left, Shen Tang finally looked at the newcomer, seeming a little familiar but not very.","The woman took off her sunglasses, revealing a jaded face.","\"What, don't recognize me after a few days?\"","Shen Tang searched her memories, the woman was her rival Qi Yue, also an unknown.","Qi Yue looked down on the vulgar sexy approach the original followed, while the original looked down on the other's complacent attitude towards not succeeding.","Shen Tang, who had the script from God, lamented that it was because the other came from a wealthy family, she was just playing around in the industry and could go back to inheriting the family business if she didn't make it big.","\"What are you doing here?\"","Qi Yue hooked her lips in a smile, \"I live here.\"","Her gaze fell upon the lunchbox in Shen Tang's hands, \"You came to deliver food?\"","Shen Tang awkwardly laughed, \"That's right, I'm bringing food for my boss.\"","Seeing Qi Yue's raised brow, Shen Tang quickly explained: \"Another boss, I took on a side job.\"","Qi Yue nodded in understanding, she knew of Shen Tang's family circumstances, it wasn't a secret at the company.","\"Get in, I'll bring you inside.\"","Shen Tang followed closely behind holding the lunchbox, looking just like a little wife.","It was at this time that Shen Tang realized, she had no idea where the money master lived at all, didn't have his number, and the driver was still outside the community.","It was all because that idiot ex had interrupted her earlier, making her forget to ask.","Shen Tang shook her head, as if hearing water sloshing around inside.","\"Um...\"","\"What?\"","Shen Tang said in a small voice: \"I forgot which unit the boss lives in.\"","\"Call and ask.\"","\"Don't have his number.\"","Qi Yue rubbed her forehead.","\"Um, have you eaten?\"","Qi Yue looked over as Shen Tang said: \"Why don't I give you the food? Don't worry, the dishes are all very clean and hygienic!\"","\"Sounds good, let's go to my place then.\"","The two didn't get along but also didn't have any major feuds.","It wasn't until they reached her door that Qi Yue realized she must have lost her mind, to actually bring this toxin of the entertainment industry back home.","Now she couldn't kick the person out either.","Moreover, she discovered Shen Tang seemed a little different than before.","\"Wow! Your place is so nice!\"","Shen Tang didn't expect the seemingly cold Qi Yue to have so many plush toys at home, the contrast was truly too great.","\"It's just alright...\" The corners of Qi Yue's mouth curved up slightly, this was the first time someone had praised her home for being nice, her family always said she was childish.","The relationship between girls could become closer through a shared interest.","Shen Tang opened the lunchbox, the food was still hot so she didn't reheat it.","\"Try it quickly, let me tell you, Tao Sister's cooking is amazing!\"","Qi Yue had eaten all kinds of delicacies, but still nodded in agreement, \"It's pretty good.\"","As a celebrity she had to watch her figure, so didn't eat much.","Normally at night she just ate salads, tonight already broke her rules.","Yet she didn't expect Shen Tang to have such an appetite.","Qi Yue watched Shen Tang's slightly bulging stomach, eyes wide.","Shen Tang finished the last spoonful of soup and sprawled on the sofa: \"Comfortable!\"","Qi Yue cautiously asked: \"Shen Tang, did something happen to you?\"","\"Huh? Nothing happened.\" Shen Tang didn't understand why Qi Yue asked this.","Qi Yue's gaze fell on the empty lunchbox, the implication was obvious. If nothing happened, why eat so much, it seemed like self-destructive behavior.","Shen Tang grinned, \"Never waste good food or money.\"","On the other side, Gu Huaian who received the butler's message but still hadn't seen anyone: \"...\"","Where was his dinner?"]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Sir, is it impossible","paragraphs":["That night, Shen Tang did not go home.","After all, good friends should sleep together!","In fact, due to her personality, Qi Yue did not have any intimate friends, and this was the first time she had lain in the same bed as a girl.","She felt a little uncomfortable, but not averse.","Qi Yue's reputation in the circle was not very good either.","Shen Tang could not help sighing to herself, indeed, one bed cannot accommodate two kinds of people.","Qi Yue was the first good friend she had made since crossing into this book world. She seemed cold and sharp-tongued, but was actually straightforward and easily offended people.","Just like now, Shen Tang touched Qi Yue's smooth and flawless skin, and could not help exclaiming, \"Your skin is so good, how do you take care of it?\"","Qi Yue: \"Injections.\"","Shen Tang: \"Oh.\"","What a simple and unadorned answer.","She touched her own face. Now that she had money, she should also take good care of herself. In the future after her divorce, she could find a few young wolves and cubs to fawn over her left and right, hee hee...","Qi Yue shifted back a little. \"Why are you laughing so lewdly?\"","\"Just fantasizing about my wonderful future life. What about you? Is there anything you want to do?\"","Qi Yue was silent.","The reason she entered the entertainment industry in the first place was to pursue her starry dreams.","However, without family support, she had struggled for two years without making a name for herself.","She didn't know if there would still be a day when she could stand at the top.","\"I don't know either...\"","The two of them lay face to face, chatting until late into the night before finally falling asleep.","The next morning, Shen Tang reached out to grab her phone, but touched a slippery texture instead. She couldn't help grabbing a handful.","When she opened her eyes, she was face to face with a horrified Qi Yue covering her chest.","Shen Tang was instantly alert: \"Hear me plead my case!\"","Qi Yue resentfully complained: \"You are so restless in your sleep!\"","\"Huh? Very restless?\" Shen Tang scratched her head innocently.","She looked at her position, which was still the same as when she fell asleep.","Qi Yue curled her lips. \"Don't look anymore. I was woken up by you hugging me once, kicking me once in the middle of the night. I don't know how you managed to flip 180 degrees, spin 360 degrees on the bed and still return to your original position.\"","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly and changed the subject. \"Anyway, are you hungry? Let me make breakfast for you!\"","When she opened the fridge, there weren't many ingredients, but it was enough to make sandwiches.","Shen Tang had always lived alone before, so her cooking skills were passable.","After eating breakfast, Qi Yue had to go for a work commitment, so she first sent Shen Tang back home.","Seeing this luxury villa area, Qi Yue's expression was very complicated: \"Shen Tang, don't do anything against your conscience, if you are short on money you can tell me...\"","Shen Tang rushed forward and hugged her. Feeling the surging waves on the other's chest, she almost shed envious tears from the corners of her mouth.","She wiped the corners of her mouth and said, \"Don't worry, this is my boss's house. I signed a two-year contract to live and eat here for now.\"","Hearing the explanation, Qi Yue was relieved.","\"Okay, as long as you know your limits, I'm going to the company now.\"","Shen Tang reluctantly let go of her hands. After Qi Yue's car drove far away, she turned and entered the house.","In the living room, Peach Sister and butler Uncle He were chatting about something.","Seeing Shen Tang's figure, Peach Sister rushed over immediately and helped her sit on the sofa.","\"Madam, you must be exhausted last night. Please sit down. I stewed nourishing soup in the pot. Let me bring it to you.\"","Shen Tang was a little confused. \"I'm not tired.\"","Peach Sister's smile stiffened a little. \"Not tired at all?\"","Could it be that the master was impotent?!","Shen Tang stood up, stretched her arms and kicked her legs. \"I'm fine, don't worry.\"","She was so moved that they were so worried about her after she was away for just one night.","In her previous life, she had always been alone, and this was the first time she had experienced a family.","Peach Sister brought out a bowl of soup. Without asking much, Shen Tang drank a sip directly.","She smacked her lips. \"Why does it taste a little strange? Peach Sister, what soup is this?\"","\"Kidney-nourishing soup.\"","\"Pfft!\" Shen Tang, who was drinking her second sip, sprayed the soup directly out, and the butler in front of her was unlucky enough to bear the brunt.","\"Sorry, sorry, Uncle He, please wipe it quickly!\"","Peach Sister was distressed. \"Oh my, I simmered it all morning, and this was the only bowl of essence...\"","\"Wait for me, I'll cook another bowl!\"","\"No!\" Shen Tang grabbed Peach Sister's hand awkwardly, \"I don't need this for now...\"","To be more precise, it was not \"for now\", but \"ever\".","\"Why don't you need it? Didn't you and the master last night-\" Peach Sister said with a wink.","Shen Tang awkwardly tugged at the corner of her mouth. \"I didn't go to him last night...\"","\"Then where did you go? Didn't you go deliver dinner to the master?\"","\"Yes, but I don't know where he lives, so I stayed overnight at my friend's house.\"","Peach Sister: \"...\"","The expression on Peach Sister's face visibly drooped. Shen Tang felt a little guilty.","Wait, what was she feeling guilty about!","Shen Tang gently patted Peach Sister's shoulder. \"There, there, he works hard, we should be more understanding.\"","Peach Sister sighed. \"I just want you to have a child soon.\"","Urging for a child, though late, had arrived.","\"I'm still young, there's no rush for this...\"","\"But the master is getting on in years, he's almost forty. In a few more years, he may not even be able to-\"","\"Cough!\" Uncle He coughed loudly.","Peach Sister shut her mouth in embarrassment, she almost let it slip, she deserved a slap.","Thinking so, she lightly patted her mouth twice.","Shen Tang almost laughed out loud.","This rounding was a bit too scary. Gu Huaian, who was not even thirty yet, was rounded up to forty.","Shen Tang suppressed her laugh. \"He's still young and has his own plans.\"","Peach Sister sighed again and stopped persuading.","No matter how good the relationship, one had to observe proper boundaries.","The regret in her eyes was so palpable it frightened Shen Tang, who quickly averted her gaze.","However, thinking of children...","Shen Tang had been alone all her two lifetimes. If she had a child, wouldn't she have a blood-related family member?","With Gu Huaian's superior genes, any child would surely be very good-looking.","This thought flashed through her mind before being discarded.","What if she returned to her original world someday?"]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Handsome, handsome, Touch your Abs.","paragraphs":["After a few days, the male streamer Curry, whom Shen Tang had previously collaborated with, made it to the top searches again. The reason was that many people complained that the fruit they received was rotten.","However, the hot search was quickly suppressed, and Shen Tang could only watch the topic disappear helplessly.","Is this the power of capital? Even public opinion can be controlled.","Shen Tang couldn't help thinking more deeply, and her whole person felt somewhat dispirited.","Tao Sister was a little worried, \"Mistress, has something happened?\"","\"I just realized that some people don't even want their conscience for the sake of making money.\" After speaking, Shen Tang didn't wait for Tao Sister to comfort her, and adjusted her mood by herself, \"Forget it, I won't think about them anymore. Tao Sister, I have an appointment later, so I won't be back for dinner tonight.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang made an appointment with Qi Yue to go to the spa together. The two first went to eat and watch a movie before going to the spa.","\"Yo, who's this? She still has the nerve to go out?\"","Shen Tang looked back. The woman speaking had fiery red lips, big curly hair, was wearing a dress that showed off her figure, and was very eye-catching.","She was quite beautiful, but she didn't seem to be very smart.","Shen Tang tried hard to remember who she was, but couldn't recall it at all.","\"You are...\"","The woman was furious, \"Don't you remember me?\"","Shen Tang was extremely embarrassed, \"Should I know you?\"","The woman took a deep breath and explained, \"I'm the new artist brought by Brother Wang. Brother Wang said you are useless, after so many years you still haven't become popular, so he has given up on you.\"","Shen Tang looked her up and down, oh, so she was that new unlucky one.","She still reminded her, \"Brother Wang is not a good person, you—\"","\"Hmph!\" The woman rolled her eyes, \"Brother Wang told me everything, you don't need to sow discord anymore.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Fine, she wouldn't be the bad guy here anymore.","The woman glanced at her watch, \"Alright, I still have things to do, I won't waste time here anymore.\"","After speaking, she left, leaving Shen Tang standing in place looking at each other with Qi Yue.","The corner of Shen Tang's mouth twitched, \"Yueyue, what do you think she came to do?\"","Qi Yue shook her head, \"She probably just doesn't like you.\"","As expected, heaven was fair. It gave her beauty, but took away her intelligence.","Shen Tang touched her face. Fortunately, she had both wisdom and beauty, hahaha!","After the spa, they also did a makeover. By the time they finished, the sky was already dark.","Shen Tang kept staring at herself in the mirror.","\"What's wrong?\"","\"I'm so beautiful.\"","Qi Yue: \"......\"","\"Let's go, I'll take you to a nice place.\"","Unexpectedly, the so-called nice place turned out to be a bar.","Only the rich and powerful could get into this bar. You had to have a membership card to enter.","This was Shen Tang's first time in a bar in both lifetimes. She followed Qi Yue closely.","There were handsome men and beautiful women inside. Huh? There was even her cheap ex-boyfriend.","Shen Tang quickly averted her eyes and hid her face.","Experience showed that it was better to stay away from fools like him.","The two came to a private room. The waiter asked softly, \"What would the two ladies like to drink?\"","Shen Tang's eyes widened.","【Holy crap! Are the waiters here all so handsome?】","【With this looks, he's even better than some traffic celebs. Great figure too, broad shoulders, narrow waist, long legs. Ah, I'm dead!】","Gu Huaian, who was in the next private room, frowned. How could he still hear that woman's voice here?","Although he hadn't tested it, he could be certain of one thing - Shen Tang must be nearby!","【I wonder if there are any male models here, hehehe......】","Upon hearing this lecherous thought, Gu Huaian couldn't sit still.","He stood up and looked around.","Fu Xici, who was sitting nearby with crossed legs, lazily lifted his eyelids to glance at him, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Looking for someone.\"","Gu Huaian quickly saw Shen Tang. He strode over with his long legs.","At that time, Shen Tang was already blushing from the alcohol.","\"Yueyue, you really are my bestie. I haven't touched abs before. I must touch some before I die...\"","Qi Yue disgustedly pushed Shen Tang away, \"Don't seek immortality.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","\"Wahhh, I don't care, I just want to touch abs, I must touch abs!\"","Qi Yue regretted it. She didn't expect Shen Tang to have such a low alcohol tolerance. After just one drink, she was already talking nonsense from being drunk.","Just then, someone walked over. When Qi Yue saw clearly who it was, she was shocked. Why was Gu Huaian here?","Since Gu Huaian was here, where was he?","Qi Yue's heart started pounding uncontrollably. This also caused her to overlook Shen Tang.","In her drunken daze, Shen Tang saw an extremely handsome boy. Her mind was full of abs at the moment, so she pounced over and started touching.","\"Handsome, let me touch your abs?\"","Gu Huaian's face instantly darkened and he hauled Shen Tang away.","Qi Yue was so frightened she immediately sobered up. In their circle, who didn't know about Gu Huaian? Offending him wouldn't end well.","\"President Gu, I'm sorry, my friend is drunk...\"","\"I'm not that drunk...\" Shen Tang struggled to cling onto Gu Huaian.","\"Shen Tang!\"","\"President Gu knows my friend?\"","\"Hahaha!\" A familiar voice sounded nearby. Qi Yue looked over, and it was indeed him.","Although Fu Xici didn't know what relationship Gu Huaian had with the woman clinging to him, one look was enough to see they had a complicated relationship.","After all, he usually didn't let women get close to him.","Fu Xici blinked his peach blossom eyes and said to Qi Yue, \"They know each other, let's not disturb them.\"","Qi Yue hesitated a little, but this was the first time Fu Xici spoke to her directly. Her cheeks instantly turned red.","Thinking of Gu Huaian's style, Qi Yue felt he probably wouldn't do anything to Shen Tang, so she obediently followed Fu Xici back to their private room.","It was near enough that they could still see clearly.","Qi Yue ordered the waiter to send over a hangover soup, before she felt at ease chatting with Fu Xici.","Gu Huaian's face was already blacker than coal at this point.","\"Shen Tang!\"","\"Look at who I am!\"","Shen Tang forced her eyes wide open. When she finally saw clearly, even the alcohol couldn't help sobering her up?","\"Sugar daddy!\"","Gu Huaian let out a cold laugh, \"Sobered up? If you've sobered up then let go.\"","Shen Tang hiccupped. Only then did she realize she was hugging Gu Huaian's waist.","Thinking of possibly losing two hundred million, she almost leapt three meters away.","\"Hear my explanation!\"","Gu Huaian loosened his tie. He was nearly choked to death just now.","\"You have three minutes.\"","Shen Tang's gaze wandered, \"You wouldn't believe me if I said this was my first time here right?\"","【Damn it, caught the first time I came here. I'm never coming again.】","【Wuwuwu, I think I touched abs just now but forgot what it felt like. If only I could touch again...】","Upon hearing Shen Tang's regretful thoughts, Gu Huaian nearly laughed from anger. Even at a time like this she was still thinking about abs!","Soon, the hangover soup was delivered. After Shen Tang drank it, she completely sobered up.","My god, what had she done earlier!","Shen Tang curled her toes in embarrassment, nearly scratching out a three bedroom apartment.","\"Um...sorry about that...I didn't know my alcohol tolerance was so bad...\"","【Sigh, no one would probably believe me if I said I could drink thousands of cups without getting drunk in my past life...】","Gu Huaian glanced at her, then lowered his eyes.","Past life? Could she also have reincarnated?","No, last time she said it was a description from a book.","Gu Huaian, who never read online novels, didn't know the term \"transmigration into a book\"."]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: Don't Blame Yourself for Anything.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang was racking her brains trying to come up with an excuse when the supervisor came over with several handsome men with distinctive features.","One of them, a cute puppy type, enthusiastically came forward, lifted up his shirt, \"Sister, feel my abs.\"","Shen Tang grinned and couldn't help reaching out her hand...","Sensing the cold stare, she instantly dropped her smile and put the puppy's shirt back down.","She lightly coughed, \"You're so young, don't always lift your shirt, your navel can easily catch a cold if exposed to the wind.\"","The puppy: \"...\"","He blinked his almond eyes, \"Sister, you're the first person to tell me to put my clothes back on instead of taking them off.\"","Shen Tang thought to herself: No, there's also your grandma.","She secretly glanced at Gu Huaian, only to see him sitting there nonchalantly without saying a word.","To be honest, that made her even more afraid.","\"Ahem, anyway, you guys can leave, I don't need anything right now.\"","The puppy still wanted to say something but noticing the icy man next to them, he left with his companions.","Shen Tang awkwardly laughed, \"Uh, so...\"","Gu Huaian looked at his watch, \"Do you have anything else to do?\"","\"Uh, no.\"","\"Then let's go.\"","\"Oh.\"","Shen Tang obediently got up, without asking where they were going.","After all, Gu Huaian's integrity was still commendable.","The two walked one in front of the other to the car. Shen Tang felt like she was forgetting something but couldn't remember what.","This time Gu Huaian didn't handle work matters. Instead he closed his eyes to rest.","Shen Tang secretly looked at him. He's so handsome! Compared to him, she was probably just a mud blob tossed aside by Nüwa.","Hmm, he has a nice straight nose too. It's said that men with big noses also have big...her gaze uncontrollably went downward.","Gu Huaian suddenly opened his eyes with a complicated expression.","He really wanted to ask Shen Tang what goes through her brain all day.","Shen Tang lightly coughed, \"Where are we going?\"","\"I thought you wouldn't ask.\"","They arrived at the entrance to an apartment complex. Shen Tang recognized this as Gu Huaian's residence near the company.","She was in a daze as they registered and recorded her fingerprint.","\"What's this for?\"","\"In case a certain someone can't find the place when delivering food and ends up eating it herself.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Guilty.jpg","\"Should we add each other on WeChat then?\"","Before Gu Huaian could refuse, Shen Tang righteously said, \"I don't have any ulterior motives, it's all for work. Otherwise I won't be able to find you if something comes up.\"","Gu Huaian didn't refuse. His intention for getting close to her was to find out what her background was anyway.","Although Shen Tang's nickname...","Gu Huaian contemplated the five words \"Crazy Monkey in Love\".","With her level of intelligence, was he overthinking things?","It was only a little after 9. Still early. The quiet room made Shen Tang, who liked lively atmospheres, a little antsy.","\"So, no work for you today?\"","Just sitting here so awkwardly...","[Waah, she wants to play games...]","\"Do whatever you want, I'm going to work first.\"","After he left, Shen Tang lightly let out a breath.","She took out her phone and saw Qi Yue had called her 5 times and sent 8 messages.","Shen Tang: \"!!!\"","She remembered what she had forgotten!","She called back but Qi Yue hung up. She sent messages but got no reply.","Just as Shen Tang was about to call the police, Qi Yue finally sent a message back:","[Yueyue: I'm having dinner with my crush, talk later!!!]","Shen Tang knew Qi Yue had a crush she entered the entertainment industry for, but didn't know who it was.","Fortunately it seemed like nothing had happened to her.","Although Qi Yue said that bar was safe, human hearts were complicated and no one could guarantee absolute safety there.","Miao Miao also sent a message asking her to play games.","Shen Tang replied and opened King of Glory, waiting a few minutes for Miao Miao to finish her last match.","After Miao Miao pulled her into the room, Shen Tang saw there was another person whose ID was \"Cool Tyrannosaurus Rex\".","Shen Tang had a bad feeling. That name, could it be an elementary schooler...","Miao Miao turned on voice chat: \"Sister Monkey, this is my brother, can you bring him for a bit?\"","[No problem]","Their match was duo queue. Their opponents were a couple with the IDs \"Heaven\" and \"Hao\".","Shen Tang didn't really like these kinds of IDs but wouldn't say anything since it was personal freedom.","Shen Tang played Marksman, Miao Miao played Little Jiao, Tyrannosaurus Rex played Li Xin, while the couple played Yao Mian and Li Bai.","Yao Mian followed Li Bai from the start. The two didn't turn on voice chat and talked through messages instead.","[Heaven: Hubby, can you give me blue buff?]","[Hao: Baby, come take it]","[Heaven: Hubby, you're so handsome]","[Hao: Love you, wifey]","Shen Tang: ...","Joy and sorrow are not shared by all.","It's said Marksman players are one level lower than others. Yao Mian Marksman players are two levels lower.","Shen Tang sat under tower alone in bot lane while the enemy ADC and support constantly poked at her. The enemy mid and jungler also ganked her several times, almost diving her under the second tower.","Aside from Miao Miao coming to help a couple times, that couple didn't come bot once.","Seeing the 0-3 score, Shen Tang felt irritated and messaged: [Crazy Monkey in Love: Jungler, can you come gank bot?]","[Hao: Can't you be more shameless? How did you die so many times?]","[Hao: With your rank, you must've spread your legs to get carried here right?]","[Sweet Kitten: Are you talking about yourself?]","These words directly lit the fuse. The couple both turned on voice chat and spewed all kinds of verbal abuse, things like \"f**k your mom\" and \"f**k your sister\" and other censored phrases.","Miao Miao was furious but her upbringing prevented her from swearing back. She could only argue back with reason.","The grade schooler arguing top lane couldn't type as fast as they could talk.","Shen Tang couldn't stand it anymore and turned on voice chat to scolded:","\"F**k, so gutsy?\"","\"Eat sh*t, even chickens play better than you.\"","\"You really think your 0-0 score is hot sh*t? Were you sleepwalking in the jungle? What, gathering magic mushrooms for your moms there?\"","\"Foul nasty mouths, how much sh*t have you eaten?\"","\"People always say you harp on what you lack the most. You two must be motherless orphans!\"","\"Tsk tsk, so pitiful. Call me mom and I'll consider giving you some maternal love.\"","Shen Tang didn't know how they reacted since she had muted them and was just relentlessly attacking.","In the end, the couple rage quit.","Of course, they lost that match too.","After leaving the room, all three of them reported the couple and successfully docked them credit score.","However, Shen Tang herself also got a chat restriction.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She pulled the couple back into the room to cuss them out more before kicking them out.","Shen Tang sighed. Yao Mian's reputation has been ruined by these kinds of people.","Miao Miao also felt very guilty: \"I'm so sorry, my words are too clumsy and I didn't help you cuss them out just now...\"","Shen Tang turned on voice chat: \"Don't overthink it. That couple was the problem. Don't blame yourself, always look to others for the cause.\"","\"Rather than blame yourself, blame others instead.\"","Cool Tyrannosaurus Rex also spoke up: \"Sister Monkey is so awesome!\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"You don't sound like a grade schooler!\" His voice was quite nice, an auditory treat.","The other laughed and said in a low voice, \"I didn't say I was a grade schooler.\"","Shen Tang was lost in thought. She was wrong to judge based on the name.","\"You're right, the name's a bit childish for a grade schooler.\"","Cool Tyrannosaurus Rex replied: \"Exactly, it's just right for a college student.\"","It was just one game. Shen Tang didn't take it to heart.","They played a few more ranked matches afterwards. Thankfully no more weirdos and they smoothly gained some stars."]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: The Clown Is Me","paragraphs":["Shen Tang didn't take this matter seriously at all. She didn't expect that her video scolding others would go viral.","That sly couple only edited the part where Shen Tang was cursing and intentionally distorted the context to guide netizens to attack her online. It was Miao Miao who reminded Shen Tang about it.","When Shen Tang logged into her game, she discovered many more friend requests, and the verification messages were all cursing her.","The comments section on Weibo was even more vicious.","[A girl with a filthier mouth than a public toilet]","[Curses so smoothly, obviously no home training]","[The one upstairs, what home training would a little slut have? Smoking, drinking, tattooing, aborting, tsk tsk, who knows how she climbed up the ranks?]","Many people are good at conjecturing the worst about others as if they had witnessed it themselves.","Shen Tang was quite speechless. Do these people live under her bed?","To be honest, her loose lips were trained when she was frequently bullied in the past.","Because if she didn't fight back, they would always take advantage of her.","Therefore, if others scolded her, she would curse back. If others hit her, she would hit back even harder.","Nobody could think of bullying her.","A nobody didn't mean she could be bullied.","Gu Huaian, who was still at work, suddenly heard a series of inner voices and paused for a moment before stepping out.","Shen Tang was about to explode with anger at this moment. Clearly, they were the ones who started scolding first!","She took out her alt account and frantically argued with the netizens online, her fingers moving so fast they were a blur and her phone screen was nearly tapped broken.","\"Need help?\"","\"Yes!\" Shen Tang didn't even lift her head. \"Come help me curse people!\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He figured out that this woman's mind worked differently from normal people!","\"The Gu Group has a professional legal department.\"","Shen Tang looked up in puzzlement.","Gu Huaian continued, \"I can lend them to you to sue those people.\"","Shen Tang hesitated. It was only verbal abuse, no big deal actually.","However, when she saw the insults that she was an orphan without parents, Shen Tang couldn't hold back anymore.","She was an orphan. According to Mother Superior at the orphanage, she was abandoned at their doorstep as a baby.","Shen Tang hated hearing those words very much.","After hearing her inner voice, Gu Huaian hesitated before reaching out his hand to stroke Shen Tang's head to comfort her.","Shen Tang was puzzled.","What? Was he treating her like a dog?","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He figured out that the mindset of this woman was different from ordinary people!","\"It's getting late, you should rest early.\"","Shen Tang looked left and right, \"Where do I sleep?\"","There was only one bedroom here. Could it be the sofa again? Although the sofa was quite comfortable.","\"You sleep in the bedroom.\"","\"Then what about you?\"","Gu Huaian wearily pinched his brow. \"I still have a few international conferences to handle tonight. Don't wait for me.\"","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly. She didn't plan on waiting for him anyway. After all, he was her sugar daddy, she still had to show some care.","Gu Huaian sighed. Being able to read minds, he didn't know if this was good or bad.","He could almost confirm now that this Shen Tang was not the same person as the Shen Tang from his previous life.","But where did she come from?","The bedroom had an en suite bathroom. Only after Shen Tang finished showering did she remember she didn't have a change of clothes or towel.","Shen Tang: \"!!!\"","She blamed those people in her heart again.","Just as she was hesitating, there was a knock on the door—","\"I've put the clothes outside the door, come out and get them yourself.\"","Shen Tang was extremely delighted. As expected of her sugar daddy, everything was prepared!","Wait, she didn't bring any clothes here. Where did these clothes come from?","Nevermind! As long as there was something to wear.","After Shen Tang put them on, she discovered they fit very well.","Lying in bed, she just couldn't fall asleep for a long time.","The bed had the same scent as Gu Huaian, probably the same incense.","Thinking that Gu Huaian had slept on this bed before made Shen Tang very uncomfortable.","Other than work, this was almost her most intimate contact with a man.","After tossing and turning for half the night, she finally fell asleep after chanting the Great Compassion Mantra for awhile.","In the next room, Gu Huaian faintly pulled up the corners of his mouth.","He admitted that after hearing this inner voice, a certain hidden delight arose from the bottom of his heart.","He attributed this to the malicious workings of petty possessiveness.","The next day, Shen Tang unusually slept in late.","Opening WeChat, she received a message from Miao Miao that the couple had deleted their Weibo post and apologized.","Shen Tang was puzzled and took a look. Indeed that was the case.","Looking further at the comments section, because they felt deceived and angry, the netizens' backlash was severe. However they had cursed her yesterday, now they were cursing the couple even more and worse.","Shen Tang was indifferent. Just a group of fickle people on the internet, endlessly cyberbullying this person or cyberbullying that person.","There was no upholding justice whatsoever, only venting their emotions.","However, for things to resolve so quickly gave her an unreal feeling.","Putting on her shoes and going out, Gu Huaian was no longer around.","She thought for a bit before taking out Gu Huaian's WeChat to send a \"Thank you\".","Feeling that was a little cold, she also sent a thankful cat emoticon.","Tapping into Gu Huaian's Moments, there was nothing inside, which nearly made her suspect she was blocked.","Shen Tang looked at her own Moments again, full of eating, drinking, playing and happy occasional selfies. The gap between them was truly so big!","Afraid she might post something inconvenient for him to see in the future, she casually blocked his access to view her Moments.","- Sugar Daddy: You're welcome","- Sugar Daddy: If anything like this happens again in the future, you can contact Cen Assistant directly","- Sugar Daddy: Thankful cat emoticon.jpg","Was this his way of saying he would be covering her?","Shen Tang was extremely excited.","In the future, could she walk sideways?","Just when she was happy, she suddenly received a message from Wang Brother and her upturned mouth corners instantly drooped.","- Old Biden: Tang Tang come to the company for a bit, something's up","- Hopeless Monkey: Oh, coming right away","When she was leaving, she just happened to bump into Cen Assistant.","\"Mistress, this is the breakfast Mr. Gu asked me to deliver to you.\"","Shen Tang took the breakfast with mixed feelings, \"Assistant Cen, your work is so busy, but you still have to be responsible for delivering meals?\"","Does the sugar daddy only have one person to order around? As expected of a merciless capitalist.","Not knowing if her brain short-circuited, Shen Tang blurted out, \"How much does he pay you per month that it requires you to be on call 24/7, responding immediately whenever summoned?\"","If she didn't see wrongly, Assistant Cen seemed to smile faintly.","\"Seven digits per month in salary, plus bonuses and stock dividends at the end of the year.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","The clown was me all along!","\"I'm sorry for the disturbance.\"","Speaking of which, do assistants earn this much?","To be honest, if she was paid that much, she would also be willing to be ordered around!","Thinking of so much salary, Shen Tang was still unresigned as she brazenly asked, \"May I rudely ask, which esteemed university did you graduate from?\"","If it was possible, she also wanted to be an assistant.","\"Yale University.\"","As expected, even the position of an assistant wasn't something ordinary people could take on, just the academic qualifications would cause her to be screened out.","Shen Tang dabbed at imaginary tears in the corner of her eyes. \"I was too presumptuous...\""]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: It's a shame you're an actor.","paragraphs":["Wang Brother said the thing was that the deserted island variety show was about to start broadcasting.","Such a small matter could be notified by WeChat, there was no need to make her come over specially.","Shen Tang intuited there was something else, sure enough —","\"Tangtang, one of the guests this time is a tycoon's child. Could you...take care of him?\"","\"How to take care?\"","\"You act a little to set him off. Don't worry, if you do well, I guarantee to tear you a good resource.\"","Shen Tang shook her head.","Wang Brother's mouth corners drooped, \"What, you don't agree?\"","\"No, I just feel that this deserted island show is quite arduous, she is more delicate and may not be able to stand it. It would be better to let her go to Love Reality Show. After all, the popularity of Love Reality Show is higher.\"","Wang Brother thought, \"Hmm, let me think about it...\"","Shen Tang secretly grimaced, she didn't want to be the stepping stone at all.","The day passed in the twinkling of an eye. Wang Brother did not message, he seemed not to come to this show, which made Shen Tang breathe a sigh of relief.","As for whether he went to Love Reality Show, she didn't know, because the two shows started one after another.","The gathering place of \"13 Days on the Island\" was at the dock.","When Shen Tang arrived, most people had already arrived.","There were a total of six guests, four men and two women, in addition to Shen Tang, the others were Huo Yingying, Zhao Zhe, Ao Ziping, He Yuan and Zhou Hao.","They were all some newcomers, with the same pure foolishness in most people's eyes.","After calculation, Shen Tang was actually the one with the highest popularity.","She greeted them, then found a corner without sunlight to rest quietly.","Because it was live broadcast all the way, many of Shen Tang's antis got wind of it and came.","It was ridiculous that many of them were fans of other artists. At this time, they actually united and targeted Shen Tang, determined not to stop until she was driven out of the business.","【Yo, the troublemaker is here again】","【Hehehe, she's useless, I bet a spicy stick that she will cry to quit within a day】","【I second that!】","The director took out the ancestral loudspeaker and said, \"Now that everyone has arrived, please hand over all your luggage and mobile phones. Each person can choose to keep three things.\"","\"What? Just three things, how to survive thirteen days?\"","\"What about the change of clothes?\"","The director coughed slightly, \"Don't worry, there are resource packages on the island, but the guests need to find them themselves.\"","After the staff took away the luggage of other guests, Shen Tang also handed over her mobile phone.","\"Swish!\"","\"Wait, what's that sound?\" The director looked at Shen Tang suspiciously.","The weather was hot today, but Shen Tang wore a long coat. Among the guests in T-shirts, shorts and dresses, she was very conspicuous.","She looked around with an extremely innocent expression, \"What sound?\"","The director looked her up and down and pointed to a female staff member, \"Xiao Liu, go check if she has smuggled anything.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","How can he be so mean?","\"No need, I'll take it out myself.\"","With that, she took out several packs of compressed biscuits from her pocket.","Seeing her move so smoothly, the director said with certainty, \"There must be more.\"","Xiao Liu stepped forward. Shen Tang sighed and took out several bags of pickled mustard greens from her hat, and said aggrievedly, \"That's really all.\"","Everyone present: \"...\"","The director's expression was extremely speechless, \"It's a pity you became an actress...\"","Shen Tang felt wronged.","It was so annoying.","【Haha, I didn't know Shen Tang was so funny!】","【It's a bit of a personal attack】","【Don't forget what disgusting things she did before! 】","【Thanks for the reminder above, sober now】","Seeing the bullet screen, the director smiled with satisfaction.","He's not afraid of scolding, he's just afraid there's no popularity.","It seemed that inviting Shen Tang was the right choice. Although she had a bad reputation, she came with popularity.","He cleared his throat, \"Alright, time's up. Pick your stuff and get on the boat. We'll come to pick you up in thirteen days.\"","Noticing that others brought lighters, Shen Tang spent a long time choosing, and finally took sunscreen, a large pot, and a dagger.","As expected, the barrage scolded again.","【She's really something, she brought sunscreen as if she was in a beauty pageant!】","【Yeah, did she think it was a love reality show?】","【666, looking forward to when Shen Tang cries】","On the boat, Shen Tang felt a little dizzy. A male guest came over, \"Sister Tangtang, can I call you that?\"","Shen Tang hmm-ed.","\"Sister Tangtang, I'm Zhao Zhe, I'm your loyal fan, I've watched all your TV series!\"","Shen Tang's eyes widened, \"Really? Then please tell me three of my roles in ten seconds.\"","Zhao Zhe hemmed and hawed and couldn't say it.","He changed the subject and said, \"By the way, Sister Tangtang, I have candy, do you want some?\"","As he said, he took out a bag of caramels from his pocket.","To his incredulous gaze, Shen Tang took away the whole bag of caramels, \"Well, thank you~\"","【Hahaha, Shen Tang did that on purpose, right?】","【Am I the only one who thinks her behavior is not good? A person only has three things, yet she took away the whole bag...】","【She deserves it. If you don't want to give, then don't. Anyone can see his intention from her expression after taking it】","After that, no one tried to get close to Shen Tang.","Seeing this, the satisfied director stroked the little hair he had left.","\"Our show is going to be a hit!\"","The producer next to him looked at him like an idiot, \"It's not even dark yet and you're dreaming already?\"","The director rolled his eyes, \"You don't understand.\"","\"Yes, yes, I don't understand, you understand the most, you are the understanding king, alright?\"","It wasn't that the producer had to pour cold water, it was just that the lineup was no good, a group of newcomers, and an eighteen-line actress full of scandals. The popularity simply couldn't be raised.","If only there was a top actor or actress, there might be some hope.","Unfortunately their budget was limited and they couldn't afford it, cough cough.","The boat soon arrived at the small island, and the staff put them down before leaving by boat.","Shen Tang panicked for a moment, \"Wait! There are no wild animals on this island, right?\"","\"Don't worry, there aren't.\"","As the boat left, the guests were a little nervous.","\"They really left...\"","With the rapid development of technology these days, the live streaming devices were cameras that could be remotely controlled to fly around the guests, which was very convenient.","Each person had a live streamer, so the live stream was divided into several, and everyone could choose which live stream to watch.","Currently Shen Tang had the most viewers in her live stream, unfortunately they were all scolding her.","The island was very big. Shen Tang thought the program team was exaggerating at first, but it turned out to be true that there was really nothing, very clean, as they said.","Literally nothing, not even eating, drinking, peeing or pooping places at all.","Oh no, there was something.","At least there was a simple toilet, and a half-finished hut that you could still enjoy the starry sky lying inside.","Guests: Listen to me, thank you."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Is it Hard to cook instant noodles","paragraphs":["The guests were restless, feeling it was time to show themselves off.","The six people happened to be divided into three groups. He Yuan and Zhao Zhe were responsible for building the shed, Huo Yingying and Ao Ziping went to find resource packages, while Shen Tang and Zhou Hao built the stove.","Building the stove was fairly simple, it would have been even better if Zhou Hao wasn't nagging on the side.","He was not good at anything, except for commanding.","The stove was built, but only a small half of the roof was fixed.","Zhou Hao walked over and shook his head sighing: \"Why isn't it done yet? Didn't you do any research before coming? If you don't know how, why didn't you say so in advance?\"","Zhao Zhe smiled awkwardly:\"Well...my hands have a mind of their own...\"","\"My eyes can see, but my hands don't follow...\" He Yuan also sighed.","Shen Tang clapped her hands and walked over saying:\"Let me try.\"","Fixing the roof requires some skills, she happened to have some experience from her past life.","The two crawled down in shame.","Just then, a mocking laugh could be heard. Shen Tang looked back and saw Zhou Hao sneering contemptuously.","Shen Tang frowned.","\"What are you laughing about?\"","Zhou Hao held his head high like a proud rooster:\"Don't get me wrong, how can you as a girl know these things? The sun is nearly down, don't delay everyone.\"","\"I don't know but you do? I didn't see you do much this afternoon, your mouth didn't stop though. So full of nonsense.\"","【Tang sister, please be my keyboard warrior! 】","【I hate people who talk too much the most, blabbering nonstop】","【Uh, I think he was right, although the words were harsh. Shen Tang is just a beautiful flower vase, fixing roofs is no simple task. She's just doing it for attention, delaying everyone for nothing】","Zhao Zhe and He Yuan looked at Shen Tang with admiration, she dared to say anything even on a livestream, how bold!","Shen Tang scoffed lightly:\"What if I fix it properly?\"","Zhou Hao blurted out:\"Then I'll do a handstand and wash my hair!\"","Shen Tang looked at the livestreaming device:\"Everyone can testify, he said it himself. Whoever goes back on their word later is a little dog.\"","\"Wait, you haven't said what your punishment would be if you don't fix it properly!\"","Shen Tang waved her hand casually:\"However you see fit.\"","After saying that, she swiftly climbed onto the roof, and started fixing it skillfully.","【Hahaha she's so shameless going to such lengths just for attention】","【I mean, what if Shen Tang really knows how to?】","【Impossible! If she can really do it I'll eat shit on the livestream!】","【Bro don't lie about eating or drinking!!!】","Zhou Hao was a little nervous too, Shen Tang can't really know how, can she?","But he soon calmed himself down again.","As everyone knows, Shen Tang is a famous flower vase in the entertainment industry, beautiful and without much skill.","As time went by, Zhou Hao's expression got uglier. He swallowed hard a few times.","Goodness, Shen Tang really knew how to fix roofs!","Zhao Zhe, He Yuan and the audience were also extremely shocked.","The moment Shen Tang finished, the livestream chat froze for a second before flooding with messages.","【Fuck fuck fuck!】","【OMG Shen Tang even knows how to build houses!】","【The bro who said he'll eat shit on stream just now, I screenshotted, when will you stream?】","Shen Tang climbed down, dusted her hands and asked Zhou Hao:\"Well?\"","Zhou Hao gritted his teeth:\"A promise is a promise!\"","He looked to He Yuan and Zhao Zhe:\"Help support me please.\"","Then he went to the seaside, and did a handstand to wash his hair with their help.","Shen Tang's impression of him improved. Although his mouth was cheap, at least he was a good sport.","After a simple rinse with seawater, Zhou Hao ruffled his wet hair, revealing his handsome features.","\"Is it ok now?\"","Shen Tang smiled and nodded:\"Not bad.\"","Zhou Hao's cheeks reddened slightly as he held his head high and humphed coldly.","\"A real man keeps his word.\"","【He looks quite hot even though his personality sucks】","【Hahaha Zhou Hao even did a handstand, where's the bro who said he'll eat shit on stream? 】","【Don't bother, he deleted his account】","Just then, Ao Ziping and Huo Yingying came back.","The two found a resource package with quite a lot of stuff - some water, compressed biscuits, instant noodles and a sleeping bag.","There was only one sleeping bag so the men gallantly let the ladies have it.","They plucked some large leaves to lay on the ground and slept on it directly.","The sunset dyed the horizon orange. Listening to the sound of waves, it felt peaceful.","\"Gulu~\"","Someone's stomach growled, breaking the brief tranquility.","\"Hungry?\"","\"Very...\"","\"Have some compressed biscuits?\"","No one agreed, compressed biscuits don't taste nice.","Shen Tang was feeling rather hungry too, and started missing home cooked meals.","She tried to do a sit up - and failed.","Shen Tang sat up:\"Let's cook some noodles and seafood, does anyone know how to catch seafood?\"","Just as Zhou Hao opened his mouth to speak, Shen Tang threw him a glare:\"Quiet! Or no food for you later!\"","Zhou Hao's body stiffened as he obediently kept silent.","【Haha Tang sister well handled!】","【Haven't watched the stream for a day, what's going on? The shameless clout chaser has fans now?】","【Don't worry, I only like her mouth】","The guests were all delicate darlings, utterly helpless and hopeless. Their expressions were rather awkward.","Shen Tang sighed:\"Go find some firewood together, the production team must have prepared some.\"","After all they can't let them chop trees on a livestream, too environmentally unfriendly.","\"Don't wander too far, just look around nearby.\"","It was getting dark, the woods were harmless but it was easy to get lost, unsafe.","There were abundant plants on the island. Shen Tang picked some familiar wild vegetables and fruits nearby, and got some small seafood by the shore.","The large pot she deliberately chose came in very handy now.","The guests returned very quickly.","Thanks to Huo Yingying's sharp eyes, she discovered a stack of firewood in a tree hollow.","After Shen Tang washed the pot, she boiled the vegetables and seafood, then added in the noodles.","Soon, an appetizing aroma filled the air.","\"Smells so good...\"","\"You're right, this seafood noodle soup is more luxurious than what I make at home.\"","Shen Tang served everyone a bowl.","Huo Yingying eagerly slurped a mouthful of noodles:\"Mm...so tasty, never had such aromatic noodles before...\"","Even the most annoying Zhou Hao didn't say anything unpleasant, just buried his head to eat.","【Making me hungry...】","【Nevermind, I'm going to cook noodles】","【Wasn't she supposed to be just a flower vase? How does she know fixing roofs and cooking too?】","【Heh, cooking instant noodles is hard?】"]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: It's not in My Nature to Laugh","paragraphs":["After the meal, the male guests voluntarily took over the task of washing the pots.","This made Shen Tang very satisfied. She hated washing dishes the most.","Since there was still plenty of time, Zhao Zhe suggested, \"Why don't we play a round of Truth or Dare?\"","Shen Tang secretly rolled her eyes. Why did every variety show have this game?","She didn't know if the author was tired of writing it, but she was certainly tired of watching it.","However, doing nothing would bore the audience.","Besides, she couldn't think of anything better to do.","\"That's a great idea!\" Huo Yingying was the first to agree enthusiastically.","The six of them sat in a circle. Zhao Zhe filled an empty mineral water bottle with seawater and placed it in the middle.","\"I assume everyone knows the rules? We'll start with me. Whoever the bottle points to gets to choose between answering a truth or taking on a dare.\"","\"Don't worry, we all know how to play.\"","\"Uh huh!\"","\"Let's start!\"","Zhao Zhe glanced at Shen Tang before spinning the bottle.","Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat when she saw the bottle pointing at her. Her eyelid twitched.","\"Sister Tang, will you pick truth or dare?\"","In the dim light of the fire, Shen Tang felt Zhao Zhe's face looked somehow malicious.","\"Truth,\" she answered.","Zhao Zhe apologized silently in his heart. The producer had instructed him to ask this question.","\"I've seen many online rumors about Sister Tang's relationships. I wonder which ones are real and which ones are fake?\"","The others' hearts beat faster. Wasn't this question too explosive?","It was widely known that Shen Tang was vilified for allegedly exploiting relationships for hype.","The person in question, however, remained expressionless. \"They're all fake,\" she stated plainly.","Zhao Zhe's eyes glimmered with gossip. \"Oh? So Sister Tang has never actually dated anyone?\"","Shen Tang shamelessly rolled her eyes again. \"That would be the next question.\"","【Haha, so the clout chaser has finally admitted it】","【Hope the world never sees another clout chaser, amen】","【There's no way Shen Tang has never dated, hilarious】","The subsequent questions were relatively simple since it was a live show that couldn't be edited. Everyone was more restrained.","When it cycled back to Shen Tang, she spun the bottle towards Zhao Zhe this time.","She slowly bared her teeth in a wicked grin. \"Hehehe!\"","Zhao Zhe shivered in fear. Scared.jpg","\"Which do you pick?\"","\"Truth!\"","\"When was your first kiss?\"","The online audience instantly grew excited.","【Now that's an adult topic worth watching!】","【We should indeed be watching Sister Tang, what lame questions were those earlier about favorite foods etc.】","【Feel free to ask racier stuff, like details about his first time!】","【Dude, I wanna know too but that's too much. It'll get the stream shut down】","Zhao Zhe mumbled softly.","Shen Tang: \"I didn't catch that, could you speak up please?\"","Zhao Zhe shut his eyes and yelled, \"I've never kissed anyone!\"","\"Pfft!\"","Someone failed to hold in their laughter first, and the room erupted into giggles.","He Yuan leaned his arm around Zhao Zhe's shoulder. \"Bro, you've really never kissed anyone?\"","\"No...\" Zhao Zhe sighed. \"My family was very strict. I didn't even get close to any girls, much less an actual kiss.\"","Just then, someone noticed Shen Tang wasn't laughing. \"Sister Tang, how come you're not laughing?\"","Shen Tang: \"It's just not in my nature to laugh much.\"","Huo Yinyin scooted over and whispered, \"Sister Tang, could it be that you haven't kissed anyone either?\"","Although she had spoken softly, everyone had microphones on that picked up sounds clearly.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","\"No. What's there to kiss about men? It'll only affect how fast I earn money!\"","Huo Yingying nodded in vague understanding. \"Oh, so that means you haven't kissed either.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Girl, why did you have to blurt it out like that?","【??? I don't believe it】","【So the alleged clout chaser is actually that innocent?】","【Pfft, now she's back to pretending to be pure again, don't let her fool you!】","Since the guests' phones had been confiscated, they were oblivious to the lively discussions online.","This question seemed to have opened the floodgates. By the end, almost everyone had gotten a turn.","Well dang, they were all virgins. Let's not laugh at one other.","As for whether they were truthful or acting, that remained to be seen.","They played until late into the night before finally feeling tired and resting.","The two girls shared the only sleeping bag while the guys slept on the other side.","Shen Tang dreamed she was being tightly coiled by a giant snake, unable to move at all.","When she opened her eyes, she discovered Huo Yingying had all four limbs wrapped tightly around her in a viselike hug.","She nudged her awake. \"Yingying, wake up.\"","Only then did Huo Yingying open her eyes. When she came to her senses, her face flushed red as she hastily let go.","\"Sorry about that, I tend to toss and turn in my sleep.\"","\"I noticed,\" Shen Tang said.","The morning air was crisp and fresh. Everyone else was still asleep as Shen Tang stood barefoot on the beach, stretching leisurely.","Sunshine filtered through the clouds, glimmering on the sea surface and bathing Shen Tang's figure in a golden glow.","The sea breeze lightly toyed with her silky hair, blowing strands right into viewers' hearts.","Those who had woken up early to watch the stream caught their breath at the sight.","【Gotta admit, the alleged clout chaser does have good looks...】","【Indeed...】","\"Morning!\" Everyone gradually woke up and encountered the biggest problem—getting cleaned up.","\"Looks like we'll have to go find one of the supply bags. At the very least we have to wash our faces and brush teeth.\"","\"Let's split into two groups.\"","With four guys and two girls, it was perfectly three to a group.","Shen Tang looked over the few male guests and said, \"Let's split into three groups— me and Yingying as one group, the rest of you pair up.\"","She headed off with Huo Yingying without waiting for them to respond.","Zhou Hao, who suggested splitting up initially, smiled awkwardly. He looked to the others only to discover Ao Ziping and He Yuan had already left, leaving only Zhao Zhe behind.","Zhou Hao: \"......\"","Zhao Zhe sighed, \"Come on, let's just go look for supplies too.\"","On the way, Zhou Hao felt very uncomfortable inside.","He huffed angrily, \"Did I offend Sister Shen Tang yesterday? Is that why she seems upset with me?\"","Zhao Zhe thought about it. \"Shouldn't be... She seems like the type to get even on the spot if someone wrongs her.\"","The scene from last night was still fresh in his mind. Zhao Zhe shivered remembering it.","He regretted listening to his agent who claimed getting embroiled in dating rumors with Shen Tang would make him popular—that any publicity was good publicity.","He had believed that.","But his agent forgot to mention how sharp Shen Tang's tongue was!","Thinking of that pack of candy and being forced to admit he had never kissed anyone last night, he felt terrible.","His reputation was ruined!!!","That woman really was malicious!"]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Dragon Well of 01982","paragraphs":["Shen Tang and Huo Yingying were walking with some difficulty through the forest. There were no paths here, only tree branches everywhere that scratched their faces.","Shen Tang stopped and said, \"This isn't working.\"","Huo Yingying was tired and out of breath, leaning against a tree, \"What should we do...\"","After walking for so long, she was hungry.","Shen Tang looked up at the tall trees, and tucked his shirt into his pants. \"Let me take a look first.\"","To Huo Yingying's shock, Shen Tang nimbly climbed up the big tree using his hands and feet.","\"Wait--\" Aren't you an actress?","Huo Yingying didn't think someone could move that quickly without having climbed trees at least 180 times.","As he climbed higher and higher, Huo Yingying started to worry. If he fell from that height by accident, he would probably die on the spot.","She couldn't keep her voice from trembling, \"Tang Tang, don't climb anymore!\"","\"It's fine!\" His voice floated down from above.","Shen Tang climbed up high and looked around. The surrounding scenery was unobstructed. The locations of the hidden resource packs weren't too difficult to spot, but they weren't completely obvious either.","He looked around and noticed a few conspicuous signs, memorizing their locations before slowly climbing back down.","With about one meter left, he jumped straight to the ground.","Huo Yingying had red eyes. \"Tang Tang, you scared me to death!\"","When Shen Tang was up in the tree earlier, Huo Yingying didn't even dare speak much, afraid of disturbing him and causing him to fall.","A warm current flowed through Shen Tang's heart. So this is what it feels like to be worried over?","It felt nice.","He reached out and ruffled Huo Yingying's hair. \"There there, see I'm fine!\"","On the other side, He Yuan and Ao Ziping had looked for half a day without even seeing the shadow of a resource pack.","He Yuan felt irritated. \"The production team sure hid them well. Do they really plan to starve us to death?\"","Ao Ziping sighed. \"Let's keep looking. There must be clues, we just haven't discovered them yet.\"","All of a sudden, they heard rustling sounds.","The two exchanged a glance and quietly walked over.","They saw an old hen pecking at bugs on the ground and eating them.","Ao Ziping was so excited he silently screamed, afraid of startling the chicken away.","He Yuan looked left and right, didn't see anything, and whispered: \"How do we catch it?\"","\"Let's just go for it directly. It's probably a domestic hen, it shouldn't be too difficult!\"","Half an hour later, He Yuan and Ao Ziping sprawled on the ground, covered in feathers.","He Yuan panted heavily. \"How - how can this chicken even fly?\"","Ao Ziping plucked the feathers out of his hair, somewhat exhausted. \"What now, try again?\"","It was almost noon already. Other than what little they ate last night, they hadn't eaten since arriving on the island for filming yesterday.","The two looked at the flapping chicken, and thoughts of various chicken dishes involuntarily flashed through their minds.","Swallowing mouthful of saliva, they said in unison: \"Catch it!\"","...","Zhao Zhe carried a resource pack in one hand, and supported the limping Zhou Hao with the other.","Returning to camp, they saw Shen Tang and Yingying lying on the beach sunbathing.","Zhou Hao raised his eyebrows arrogantly. \"Sis Tang Tang, you came back so quickly, did you not find anything?\"","Not waiting for them to reply, he went on. \"It's fine, I found a resource pack. You can share it with us. I don't mind.\"","The bullet screen in the livestream instantly became lively.","[Why did that sound so petulant?]","[Drinking early Longjing tea from 1982, wakes me right up, hahaha]","Shen Tang sat up, seeming to smile but not. \"Who said we didn't find anything?\"","She pointed at the shelter. \"There, those are the ones we found.\"","There were three resource packs, neat and tidy under the shelter.","Zhou Hao's first reaction was: \"How is that possible?!\"","\"And why is it not possible?\" Shen Tang raised her eyebrows.","Zhou Hao had thought he could win one over her, he didn't expect Shen Tang to be so capable.","He pursed his lips and went to sit by himself.","Zhao Zhe was somewhat impressed. \"Sis Tang Tang, you guys are so great. We only found one...\"","Moreover, they had discovered it accidentally after Zhou Hao got scared by a bug, twisted his ankle falling down the slope.","That was where they had found the resource pack.","Of course, Zhao Zhe left out those details about the discovery process.","\"Just got lucky.\"","Huo Yingying excitedly recounted how Shen Tang found the resource packs, gesturing wildly, her expressions vivid.","She then looked towards the woods and curiously asked: \"How come He Yuan and Ao Ziping haven't come back yet?\"","Yes, it was getting late, shouldn't those two be back by now?","Everyone grew somewhat concerned.","Although the director said there weren't many animals on this island, this was still a deserted island after all.","If those two had wandered too far, who knows what might happen.","Shen Tang looked at the sky, her brows knitted together. \"Looks like there's going to be a change in weather soon.\"","[Ah, this woman is mysteriously showing off again]","[I think she's right]","[No way. Don't tell me she's trying to hype up her image as a knowledgeable person again. Everyone knows she has low education, an empty head!]","Zhou Hao glanced up. \"But it's perfectly sunny right now?\"","Shen Tang pointed at the dark clouds in the distance. \"That cloud is drifting this way. It probably won't be long before it rains.\"","Zhou Hao neither agreed nor disagreed. Those clouds were still very far off.","But Huo Yingying grew somewhat worried. \"What should we do? Our shelter doesn't even have a door.\"","Shen Tang felt they might need to move elsewhere.","Flipping through the items, the few resource packs contained mostly the same things.","While waiting, they quickly ate something to fill their stomachs.","But He Yuan and Ao Ziping still did not return even after they finished eating.","Shen Tang stood up. \"I'll go look for them.\"","\"Let's go together.\"","\"You two stay here. Zhao Zhe come with me.\"","Shen Tang and Zhao Zhe set off in the direction He Yuan and the others had left.","Not long after they departed, the sky darkened.","Zhao Zhe felt a bit uneasy. \"It got dark so fast!\"","Shen Tang's expression was grave. \"Let's hurry there and hurry back. There might be a violent storm soon.\"","Zhao Zhe sucked in a breath. Hadn't he seen enough pig running to know better?","If it really stormed, they'd be screwed!","That shelter of theirs had problems blocking out sun or rain.","\"He Yuan!\"","\"Ao Ziping!\"","But there was no response.","The sky grew darker and darker, with the calm before a storm.","The mood of the livestream audience sank along with it.","[Oh no, is it really going to storm?]","[Ah, He Yuan ran so far, can Shen Tang still find them?]","[Wahhh, Shen Tang you must bring back my silly little brother... *prays*]","This random searching was getting them nowhere.","Shen Tang looked at the aerial camera: \"Director, can you lead us to He Yuan and Ao Ziping? If it really storms later, it'll be dangerous for those two.\"","The director behind the scenes didn't hesitate and had the staff control the aerial camera to lead the way.","Before filming started, he had checked the weather forecast and there was no storm predicted, but judging from the current circumstance, Shen Tang was likely right.","He couldn't let these people take risks here.","Forget his own career ending if something happened to these guests, their safety was paramount.","\"Quick, ready a boat to rescue them!\"","Indeed He Yuan and Ao Ziping had wandered very far. Shen Tang and Zhao Zhe walked for over half an hour.","By now the forest was frighteningly dark.","\"He Yuan!\"","\"Ao Ziping!\"","Hearing the shouts, the two dispirited people immediately perked up, yelling at the tops of their lungs:","\"Here!\"","\"We're here!\"","\"Save us!\""]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: You can lie to your brother.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang and Ao Ziping ran over and found that Ao Ziping was being carried on He Yuan's back, while the latter's legs were shaking badly.","\"What happened?\"","The two had rather awkward expressions on their faces. Should they say that they accidentally hurt their waist while trying to catch a chicken?","Ao Ziping felt so embarrassed that he buried his face in He Yuan's back.","He Yuan lightly coughed and said, \"We accidentally got injured while catching chickens.\"","Zhao Zhe looked left and right, \"Where are the chickens?\"","He Yuan turned his face away: \"......We didn't catch the chickens.\"","Zhao Zhe: \"......\"","So they failed at catching chickens and hurt themselves in the process.","Shen Tang urged: \"Let's go quickly, it's going to rain heavily soon.\"","Zhao Zhe took over Ao Ziping, and the few hurried back.","However, before they could get out of the woods, the rain had already started pouring down.","The rain was extremely heavy, as if buckets were being poured from the sky. The four were instantly drenched like drowned rats.","With the visibility impaired, it became very difficult to keep going forward.","Shen Tang wiped the rainwater off his face and spotted a small cave in the distance. He shouted loudly: \"Quick, let's take shelter from the rain over there!\"","At this time, Zhou Hao and Huo Yingying at the campsite were not having a good time either. The heavy wind and rain rendered the tent shelter useless.","Fortunately, there were sleeping bags in the survival packs. The two huddled inside the sleeping bags, only sticking their heads out.","\"Wuwuwu, the poor lady goose......\"","\"Damn program team, didn't they check the weather report!?\"","\"This is bad, looks like the rain won't stop for a while judging by how heavy it is.\"","Seeing so many bullet screen comments cursing him, the director almost burst into tears.","He wanted this show to become popular, but not this way!","However, it was only going from bad to worse.","Soon, the staff returned to report that due to the heavy storm, it was inconvenient to go out to sea.","That means they had no way to go rescue the guests who were now stranded on the island.","The director squatted on the ground, pulling at his little remaining hair in distress. \"Wuwuwuwuwu......\"","Those who heard of this grieved, and those who saw this wept.","\"What should we do now?\" the staff member asked.","\"How would I know!\"","They now could only contact the official rescue team.","After entering the cave, Shen Tang and the others were not having an easy time either.","Their wet clothes were sticking to their bodies, and shivers ran through them with every gust of cold wind.","Continuing like this, catching a cold would only be a matter of time.","Fortunately, this cave was relatively dry without traces of large animals having lived here. It was a good place to take shelter.","Shen Tang looked at the sky and said, \"You guys wait here. Zhao Zhe and I will go bring Yingying and the others over.\"","Zhao Zhe didn't say anything, but He Yuan and Ao Ziping felt a little embarrassed.","Ao Ziping felt remorseful, \"It's all because of me dragging everyone down......\"","He Yuan stood up, \"Or I can go with you?\"","Seeing his still shaking legs, Shen Tang shook his head, \"You stay here. We'll be back soon.\"","After psychologically preparing themselves, the two rushed out into the rain.","The way back was extremely difficult. With the heavy wind and rain, they might have gotten lost in the forest if not for Shen Tang's good memory.","After a while, the rain lightened up a bit, and Shen Tang let out a breath of relief.","The livestreaming cameras left behind at the campsite had all been damaged by the rain. The seawater had also risen, with waves continuously crashing into the shore, presenting a rather scary sight.","Huo Yingying hugged the sleeping bag tightly, feeling very anxious.","Seeing Shen Tang, she immediately burst into tears.","\"Wuwuwu......Sis Shen Tang, I'm so scared......\"","Shen Tang patted her head, \"Don't be afraid. We've come to take you away. We found a dry cave just now and will be taking shelter there. The crew will probably come rescue us later.\"","Huo Yingying sniffled and nodded heavily.","Not knowing how long the rain would last, everyone took everything they could carry.","Supporting the injured Zhou Hao, Zhao Zhe didn't have much strength left. Huo Yingying could barely walk straight carrying two survival packs.","Shen Tang was carrying pots on her head, two survival packs on her back, and went to take Huo Yingying's survival packs. \"Let me take them. I'm stronger.\"","Huo Yingying didn't let go, \"I can do it.\"","\"I'm really strong.\"","To prove her point, Shen Tang put an arm around Huo Yingying's waist and directly lifted her feet off the ground.","Huo Yingying's eyes widened, \"!!!\"","Zhao Zhe and Zhou Hao also opened their mouths in shock.","Could she really be that strong? After all, many male celebrities couldn't even carry female celebrities like that, let alone with one arm.","Shen Tang smiled, \"Believe me now? Let's go quickly.\"","Close to nightfall, the group finally returned to the cave after some time.","By then, there was already a campfire burning inside the cave.","Shen Tang was rather surprised. \"Impressive!\"","He Yuan scratched his head, \"The dry branches were already in the cave. Looks like people have been here before. Anyway, your clothes are still wet. Hurry up and change into something dry.\"","Fortunately, there were lots of extra clothes in the survival packs. After changing into dry clothes and sitting by the campfire to warm up, everyone finally let out a sigh of relief.","Out of the previous livestreaming devices, only the last one beside Ao Ziping was left working.","They didn't know if the signal was still good for the outside world to see what was happening.","Huo Yingying waved at the livestreaming camera, \"Hello hello, can you hear me?\"","The footage shook for a bit.","Huo Yingying was extremely excited. \"There was heavy rain here and we got stranded. We need rescue!\"","Right after she finished speaking, smoke rose from the livestreaming device before it dropped onto the ground.","Huo Yingying: \"......\"","She was stunned stiff. \"This one's also spoiled. The program team should have seen it, right......\"","Zhou Hao almost had a mental breakdown. First he hurt his leg, then they were caught in a heavy storm, and now they completely lost contact with the outside after the livestreaming device broke.","\"Wuwuwuwu......\" He directly demonstrated a macho man's tears on the spot.","Huo Yingying was startled. \"What's wrong?\"","Zhou Hao's eyes were bloodshot. \"We won't starve to death here, right......\"","Shen Tang carefully recalled the plot of the book. The book only briefly mentioned that this reality show became popular, but didn't specify why.","Her body shuddered. Could it be because of this incident that the show became a hit?","Seeing everyone's grim expressions, Shen Tang comforted: \"Everyone, don't worry. Nothing bad will happen. Our location is quite elevated so even if the water level rises, it can't flood this cave. We still have some food and water to last two to three days if we're prudent. Also, the program team won't just leave us here. They will send people to rescue us.\"","Shen Tang's reasoning was sound and successfully calmed everyone down.","What she didn't say was, since the book described this reality show becoming a hit, then nobody should have met any real danger. After all, the show wouldn't have been aired if anything really happened to them.","Huo Yingying nodded in agreement. \"Sis Shen Tang is right. What we need to do now is eat and rest well, conserve our strength.\"","Ao Ziping held his waist with one hand and weakly raised his other hand. \"Hey, would you believe me if I said my dad is the CEO of Star Brilliance Entertainment?\"","\"Pfft!\"","He Yuan patted his shoulder. \"Bro, you can fool your buddies, but don't fool yourself too......\"","After all, they didn't even share the same surname.","Shen Tang, however, looked at him rather incredulously.","That's right. She was a contracted artist under a subsidiary of Star Brilliance Entertainment.","Could the person Boss Wang mentioned back then be referring to him?","Shen Tang felt her mind muddled.","Ao Ziping scratched his head. \"I'm telling the truth. With me here, my parents will surely find a way to get someone to rescue us all.\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Who Stole My Rich Kid Life","paragraphs":["The rain was getting heavier, making it almost impossible to tell night from day.","In the cave, all that could be heard was the pitter-patter of rain hitting the leaves and the howling wind.","Huo Yingying leaned against Shen Tang's chest, her face buried in it, her voice muffled as she spoke.","\"Oh no, how unlucky...\"","She couldn't help but take a big sniff. Wow, Shen Tang smells so nice...","With Huo Yingying breaking the ice, everyone else started chiming in with complaints as well.","\"Didn't the director check the weather report?\"","\"To be honest, weather reports aren't always that accurate.\"","\"When is the rescue team coming?\"","\"Well this is just great, we're really stranded on a deserted island now.\"","Zhao Zhe still managed to crack a joke: \"What do you think, will our show become a hit?\"","Shen Tang held up her script and nodded. \"Don't worry, it definitely will.\"","He Yuan was more optimistic, already envisioning a bright future: \"To be frank, I only have 50,000 followers on Weibo right now, 49,900 of which are bots my company bought. If this show takes off, I hope to gain some real fans.\"","Huo Yingying was still clinging to Shen Tang. \"I may have over 100k followers, but most are zombie fans too, the rest are my dad's employees.\"","\"Your dad's company sure has a lot of people...\" He Yuan looked over jealously. \"Now I know why I'm struggling to make ends meet, it's because someone else is living the good life on my behalf!\"","Zhao Zhe immediately pretended to cry inconsolably: \"Who?! Who stole my destiny as a rich second generation?!\"","\"Pfft!\"","After this experience, everyone was much more familiar with each other.","With no cameras around, they could speak more freely.","Zhao Zhe thought about his past actions and apologized to Shen Tang with reddened face: \"Sis Shen Tang, I'm really sorry. Earlier my manager made me try to piggyback off your popularity on purpose, and the truth or dare question was also the director's idea.\"","Shen Tang just smiled. \"It's alright, though your manager sure is gutsy.\"","After all her reputation wasn't the best.","Huo Yingying hugged her tighter. \"Sis Shen Tang, I don't think you're that kind of person at all. Those negative rumors about you online must have been people deliberately trying to smear you.\"","Shen Tang fell silent. \"Well... not exactly. My manager does always make me stir up controversy on purpose.\"","Everyone else: \"...\"","Seeing their shock, Shen Tang went on to share some of the shady practices in the industry, as well as insider information about unspoken rules.","It was her way of holding an umbrella for them since she had already been rained on.","Of this group, only Huo Yingying came from a wealthy background. The rest were all rookie artists still naive about the industry. Learning these inside stories instantly dimmed the light in their eyes.","Shen Tang quickly stopped herself, unsure if revealing all this was good or bad.","Huo Yingying's heart ached for her. \"Sis Shen Tang, these past few years must have been so hard on you...\"","That one sentence almost made Shen Tang lose her composure.","Neither of her lives had been easy.","In her past life, refusing to compromise her principles led to being suppressed and bullied, unable to get good resources and never being able to become popular.","Although she was a D-lister in this life, her name recognition wasn't low. She made hot search topics several times a week, with horrible comments filling her Weibo posts.","She even had a dedicated anti-fan whose ID was \"Did Shen Tang Quit the Industry Today\" who persistently checked in every day waiting for her to retire.","Shen Tang held back her tears and forced a smile. \"It's been alright. I'm pragmatic about it - I entered the industry to make money. Although I haven't made big money these years, it's still much better than a normal job.\"","That's right, she had already given up and was just going with the flow now.","Hearing this made Huo Yingying feel even worse.","She told herself that after this show ended, she would get her family to help support Shen Tang.","Zhou Hao had drank too much water and needed to pee, but with the heavy rains outside and his injured leg, he held it in.","After shifting positions several times with no relief, he really couldn't hold it anymore.","He scooted over next to Zhao Zhe and softly asked: \"Could you help me get to the restroom?\"","Zhao Zhe looked outside at the lightning and thunder with some fear.","\"Or you could just go inside the cave...\"","The cave stretched deep within and they hadn't explored it.","Zhou Hao's expression tightened.","With so many people around, there was no way he could do that.","Shen Tang turned her back to him with Huo Yingying still in her arms. \"We'll cover our ears. Just go inside, it's too dangerous out there.\"","Blushing, Zhou Hao allowed Zhao Zhe to support him as they walked deep into the cave.","After about 30 feet or so Zhou Hao finally stopped.","Zhao Zhe politely turned his back. Zhou Hao hurriedly relieved himself, the dripping sound echoing slightly. He shivered in comfort.","Just after finishing and buckling his belt back up, he felt something brush against his shoulder.","Reaching back he touched something slimy.","Zhou Hao's heart lurched.","Oh my god, what is that?!","\"Hiss hiss~\"","Hearing a snake's tongue, Zhou Hao already had his last words in mind.","He wanted to call for help but extreme fear had stolen his voice.","Soon, sharp pain erupted from his neck as Zhou Hao let out a muffled grunt.","Zhao Zhe looked back sharply. \"Zhou Hao, what's wrong?\"","Zhou Hao cried out \"I got bit by a snake!\"","Zhao Zhe freaked out, \"A snake?! Where?!\"","He shined his flashlight on Zhou Hao and saw two bloody holes on his neck, but no trace of the snake itself.","\"Crap, Zhou Hao got bit by a snake!\" Zhao Zhe yelled loudly.","Shen Tang hurried over to check the wound.","Lying on the ground with teary eyes, Zhou Hao could only think one thing - thank goodness he had pulled his pants back up already, otherwise he'd never show his face again in this life.","\"If I die, please tell my mother it was because I was unfilial. The password to my bank card is...\"","Before he could finish his last words, Shen Tang spoke up. \"It's fine, not poisonous.\"","Zhou Hao: \"Really? You're not lying to me right?\"","\"It's fine, really not venomous.\"","After examining the injury, Shen Tang searched the area and found a snake's nest deeper inside, full of small snakes writhing densely.","The others noticed the scene and shivered.","Huo Yingying rubbed at the goosebumps on her arms. \"Did we wander into a snake's nest?\"","Shen Tang was also surprised to find so many snakes, but fortunately none were venomous.","\"Anyone got cigarettes?\"","The random question made everyone freeze up for a second.","Then they realized Shen Tang must be under immense stress to ask for a smoke.","\"I've got some hidden away.\" Zhou Hao pulled out a few cigarettes from his pocket.","Shen Tang had a complicated expression. \"You've got quite the nicotine addiction huh.\"","\"Takes one to know one.\"","Soon, everyone realized they had misunderstood.","Shen Tang didn't want the cigarettes to smoke, but to soak the tobacco in water and sprinkle it around them.","Although the snake's nest was quite far, better safe than sorry.","\"What's that for?\" Zhao Zhe asked the question on everyone's minds.","Shen Tang kept busy as she explained. \"Snakes don't like the irritation and smell. It can deter them from crawling over here. After all this is their home and we're the intruders. Best not to kill if we can avoid it.\"","There was one other key reason she kept unsaid - Shen Tang feared snakes and bugs too.","Just because she wasn't obvious about it didn't mean she wasn't scared.","With the circumstances as they were though, they couldn't exactly relocate. She could only try her best to improve their current environment.","Huo Yingying gazed at her adoringly. \"Sis Shen Tang, you're so amazing to know all this!\"","Shen Tang just smiled without explaining.","She'd rather not have had use for such obscure knowledge."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: My Wife is Up There","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian returned home to find an unexpected quiet.","As if casually, he asked, \"Where is Madam?\"","Tao Sister's eyes were filled with tears: \"Madam has gone to participate in a reality show and is trapped on an island. Sir, you must save her!\"","He Uncle's face didn't look good either.","After learning that Shen Tang had gone to participate in a reality show, they had been watching the live stream all day.","The content in the live stream comments was extremely vulgar. The two of them clumsily operated the cell phones and explained things to the web users. Finally they were labeled Shen Tang's stupid fans, and their ancestors eighteen generations back were also cursed.","Tao Sister didn't expect that Madam would be so miserable. Just by looking at those words she felt unbearable, let alone how Madam had endured them over the years.","Gu Huaian frowned. \"Tell me the details.\"","Then, Tao Sister embellished and exaggerated the events of the past two days.","In her words, Shen Tang was perfectly portrayed as a little pitiful person attacked by thousands of netizens. And now she was even trapped on an island, with unknown life or death.","Gu Huaian's face sank. \"Why didn't you tell me earlier when something like this happened?\"","He doesn't usually follow entertainment news so he didn't know about this.","Tao Sister had an awkward expression. She didn't want to say? She didn't dare to say.","He Uncle stepped forward: \"I have already instructed people to contact the rescue personnel. The program team should also send someone over. She was just panicking.\"","Gu Huaian's face darkened. He immediately called Cen Assistant.","The island.","The night was turbulent, the wind was howling, and bean-sized raindrops pounded heavily on the ground, splashing water everywhere.","Yingying, wrapped in clothes, sagged her eyebrows: \"The rain seems to be getting bigger.\"","Suddenly there was a roar of thunder. Yingying shrank into Shen Tang's arms in fright, \"Wow, Sister Tangtang, so scary...\"","\"Don't be afraid, don't be afraid, I'm here...\"","Shen Tang was an orphanage child in both lifetimes and had a lot of experience taking care of children. She reflexively put her arm around Yingying, stroked her hair, and patted her back.","Huo Yingying satisfiedly hooked up the corners of her mouth. Sister Tangtang is so cute.","He Yuan next to her was envious. He looked expectantly at Ao Ziping.","Ao Ziping: \"...\" He stared with frightened eyes wide open, covering his chest.","He Yuan turned to look at Zhao Zhe. Zhao Zhe coldly averted his gaze.","He Yuan looked at Zhou Hao again. Zhou Hao rolled his eyes: \"Don't look at me, I'm homophobic.\"","He Yuan: \"...\"","\"I declare in advance that I'm not gay.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes, you're not gay, you just want to get intimate with men.\"","He Yuan: \"...\"","\"I'm really not gay!\"","\"I said I believe you.\"","He Yuan felt he was going to be angered to death by Zhou Hao. He discovered that although the guy looks perfectly normal, he makes people want to beat him up as soon as he opens his mouth.","After this interlude, everyone was less nervous and much more relaxed.","He Yuan turned to look at Shen Tang: \"Sister Tangtang, how come you participated in this show?\"","Although her reputation was not very good, her popularity was still much higher than theirs as newcomers.","Shen Tang sighed, \"I was originally asked to participate in a dating show. I didn't want to go, so they arranged me here instead.\"","\"A dating show? The one called Lovelive?\"","\"Yes.\"","Ao Ziping was very excited. \"That show is so popular, and you refused!\"","Shen Tang thought to herself that it may be popular, but they have to survive to participate. She was miserable enough now. If she went, she would probably get pelted with rotten eggs when she went out.","Shen Tang smiled. \"With my reputation, I would probably end up being the one left single if I went.\"","As a girl, Huo Yingying was more attentive. Her eyes showed heartache.","\"Sister Tangtang, don't worry, I will always support you.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","What was the little girl fantasizing about again?","After arranging shifts to keep watch at night, everyone took out the sleeping bags from their resource packs and started to rest.","A sleepless night.","As day broke, the rain showed no sign of weakening at all. This put a heavy weight on everyone's hearts, making them very depressed.","Shen Tang took out some food from the resource pack and distributed it to everyone. \"Let's all eat something. The program team won't just abandon us.\"","There was a subtle tendency for leadership to gravitate towards Shen Tang from the others, firstly because she had the highest popularity, and secondly because she was the calmest one.","Overthinking was indeed useless. Shen Tang was used to going with the flow and finding the most comfortable way in predicaments.","Everyone silently ate breakfast, then got up to move around.","Shen Tang took the opportunity to check on the snakes. Wriggling, twisting, lurking.","Fortunately there was no sign they would come out, which reassured her a lot.","There was no way of knowing when the rescue personnel would arrive. They were now completely cut off from the outside world.","The pier.","The wind and waves were huge. The boats docked at the shore swayed back and forth.","The director firmly gripped his umbrella against the gale, struggling to keep his eyes open as he asked, \"Is there really no way to go over?\"","The dark-skinned man opposite heavily shook his head. \"No, it's too dangerous.\"","The director could no longer distinguish whether it was rain or tears streaming down his face. He was on the verge of sobbing.","Just then, several luxury cars pulled over.","An umbrella-holding driver in black walked over to the other side and opened the car door. Then a long leg stepped out.","Just seeing this situation, the director knew he couldn't afford to offend whoever this was.","He moved aside, not expecting the person to walk towards him.","Seeing the visitor clearly, the director was very flustered. He would recognize this face even if it was burnt to ashes.","\"I'm the director. You coming over here is...\"","\"I need the locator of your live streaming device.\"","It's worth mentioning that these live streaming devices all had locators on them, also to facilitate finding them if lost.","The director opened his mouth. Just then he heard the man continue, \"My wife is over there.\"","The director's expression instantly changed. Was his wife Huo Yingying or Shen Tang?","He subconsciously leaned more towards Huo Yingying. Although Shen Tang was good-looking, her reputation was not good.","As for whether this so-called wife was a real wife, he didn't know.","Things like this were commonplace in this circle.","However, since this man had come personally, it meant the relationship was not ordinary. He would have to be more careful in the future.","After getting a few locations, Gu Huaian and his group soon boarded a boat and set off.","Although the wind and waves were strong, the boat remained very steady.","This slightly put the director's mind at ease. Did this mean his career was safe?"]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: You're not here to save me, are you","paragraphs":["Shen Tang had never dreamed that Gu Huaian would come over.","At that time, she was wearing dirty clothes, squatting in front of a bonfire and nibbling on a compressed biscuit.","Gu Huaian appeared at the opening of the cave as if a god had descended.","Shen Tang widened her eyes in astonishment, even forgetting to chew the biscuit in her mouth.","She rubbed her eyes and the person before her was still there.","【Holy crap, how did Gu Huaian come here!】","【Is this part of the storyline in the book?】","Gu Huaian furrowed his brow, and no one in the cave even dared to breathe out loud.","Everyone recognized this face. Not to mention how wealthy Gu Huaian was, just his undefiled reputation of staying away from women was extremely attractive.","Many people fantasized about becoming an exception for him.","Seeing Shen Tang in a daze, Gu Huaian walked over to her and held out his hand, asking, \"Not leaving?\"","\"Leaving leaving!\"","Shen Tang grabbed his hand to help herself stand up.","She swallowed the biscuit and said, \"Um...how did you get here?\"","【There's no way he came specifically to save me...】","Shen Tang thought to herself skeptically.","\"Aunt Peach and Uncle He were very worried about you.\"","Shen Tang nodded in understanding. She knew Gu Huaian wouldn't possibly come specially to save her.","Upon hearing her thoughts, Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He took time off work to come personally. Doesn't that mean he came specifically to save her?","But he couldn't bring himself to explain that.","Gu Huaian took a deep breath. \"Let's go.\"","\"Let's pack up and get out of here.\" Seeing the five pairs of gossip-hungry eyes, Shen Tang said.","Huo Yingying sidled up and asked softly, \"Sister Shen Tang, what is your relationship with Mr. Gu?\"","As soon as she uttered this question, the other four male guests pricked up their ears.","Shen Tang was amused. Gossip really was human nature after all.","\"He's my bos...boss.\"","No one doubted her words. After all, Shen Tang had revealed in a game earlier that she had never dated or kissed anyone.","Besides, even though Gu Huaian was a flower on a high summit that everyone wished to pluck, he was only to be admired from afar, not to be violated.","Huo Yingying noticed that as soon as the words left Shen Tang's mouth, Gu Huaian's expression instantly turned cold.","She was so frightened that she immediately hid behind Shen Tang's back.","Good heavens! Mr. Gu really was as scary as the rumors said!","Shen Tang also noticed Gu Huaian's unpleasant expression. She was rather baffled. Was he angry about something?","She wanted to coax him but packing seemed more important at the moment, so she left him alone.","Gu Huaian also didn't know why he was upset. He just didn't feel comfortable seeing Shen Tang recoiling away from him earlier.","Was he really that unapproachable?","Before long, everyone had packed up their belongings and cleaned up the trash before following Gu Huaian's subordinates.","The wind and rain outside was still heavy.","Gu Huaian shielded Shen Tang from the storm with his tall frame.","Only then did Shen Tang notice that his clothes were wet. This fastidious man's shoes were covered in quite a bit of mud too.","Suddenly, her heart skipped a beat.","Shen Tang looked up. The man before her had a towering figure, wide shoulders, and a slender waist. Oh, and quite a perky buttock that made her hand itchy to give it a smack.","Gu Huaian's body stiffened and his gait became awkward.","His earlobes blushed red.","This woman...her head was filled with nothing but such thoughts!","Shen Tang regretfully shifted her gaze. She felt like some deviant coveting his body.","In his mind, Gu Huaian silently thought: Wasn't she exactly that?","Only when they boarded the ship did Gu Huaian's taut body relax. After giving a quick instruction, he returned to his own room.","The ship was huge. Shen Tang and her companions each got a room.","After taking a hot shower, they toweled their hair dry and went downstairs. The dining area had prepared ginger soup and steaming hot dishes.","Although Shen Tang hated ginger soup, she finished it in one go.","Not knowing how much ginger was put in, it was very spicy.","The spread was very sumptuous. To them who had been nibbling away at biscuits for days, this was a royal feast.","Everyone dug in without a word.","After a long while, Ao Ziping sighed, \"I can't believe my dad hasn't arrived yet. I'm starting to doubt if I'm really his biological son.\"","He Yuan rested his chin in his palm. \"You're really the son of the CEO of Star Entertainment?\"","\"That's right. Don't I look it?\"","\"Well, not really.\"","Zhao Zhe nodded in agreement. \"You look just like any typical college graduate. No airs at all and able to endure hardship.\"","\"That's because I'm just an ordinary person. My family is only a little wealthier than normal. We don't put on any airs.\"","He appeared very earnest. It seemed like he really thought that way.","Remembering Sister Wang's earlier instructions, Shen Tang was a little tempted to ask more but didn't want to broach the subject in front of everyone and influence him negatively. She could only hold her questions in.","Zhou Hao was puzzled. \"If your family runs a company, how come you didn't go on a popular variety show and ended up here instead?\"","To be honest, except for Shen Tang who knew the plot, no one else believed this show could take off.","The hottest variety shows on major platforms now were dating and parenting shows. Hardly anyone wanted to watch this kind of show.","Ao Ziping scratched his head and smiled. \"Actually, it's because I didn't want to rely on my family background. Coming to this show was my own idea. I really like it. Oh right...could you guys please keep my identity a secret? I don't want people saying in the future that I used my family to get ahead.\"","Shen Tang understood somewhat. Ao Ziping seemed very simple-minded. It didn't seem like he was the one who wanted to use her as a stepping stone.","She guessed that it was probably Sister Wang making decisions on her own accord, wanting to use her to get on Ao Ziping's good side.","As for why it didn't work out, Shen Tang had no idea.","Everyone ate and chatted very merrily.","Suddenly, Huo Yingying asked, \"Sister Shen Tang, Mr. Gu treats you so well.\"","Shen Tang: \"?\"","\"Huh?\"","As Huo Yingying counted off on her fingers, she said, \"You see, Ao Ziping's father hasn't even arrived but Mr. Gu came so quickly. That shows how worried he was about you.\"","Ao Ziping: \"......\"","\"Also, I noticed he kept glancing over to check your pace as your group walked.\"","\"He really is quite good to you.\"","In her mind, Shen Tang marveled that she really lives up to being the female lead. So outstanding in every aspect. Even to a contracted wife like herself, he treats her this well.","Luckily, she knew her place. The contract would be over in two years. She'd take the money and leave, definitely not stirring up trouble like in the book.","In the next room, Gu Huaian's expression was a little ugly.","On the video call, the person across from him spoke slower and slower, constantly reflecting whether he had said something wrong.","After ending the call, Gu Huaian coldly uttered two words: \"Redo it.\"","On the contrary, the other party heaved a sigh of relief and eagerly hung up.","Gu Huaian massaged his brow, not understanding what had come over him or why he felt uncomfortable.","She was only stating facts, wasn't she?","After this, Shen Tang no longer thought about matters relating to him and had a swell time playing with her friends.","Loud laughter came from the outside while Gu Huaian sat quietly alone in the room next door. He blended right into the background devoid of any vigor."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Do You Think I'm Ugly","paragraphs":["\"Knock knock knock\"","Gu Huaian pulled himself out of his thoughts, \"Come in.\"","The door was pushed open a crack, Shen Tang stuck her head in, \"Mr. Gu, are you busy right now?\"","Gu Huaian looked at her steadily, staring at Shen Tang until she became nervous.","\"Do you need something?\"","\"They want to thank you in person, I don't know if it's convenient.\"","A inexplainable feeling of disappointment surged up in Gu Huaian's heart, \"No need, I only saved them incidentally.\"","Shen Tang was stunned for a moment.","Saving them was incidental, so saving her was on purpose? Her heart suddenly became somewhat chaotic. This handsome guy was saying these ambiguous things in front of her, it was hard not to get the wrong idea.","She opened her mouth, and made a small \"oh\" sound.","Seeing her flustered appearance, Gu Huaian's mood improved somewhat.","As for those people thanking him, he really didn't think it was necessary.","The boat soon arrived at the dock, and as soon as the few people got off the boat, they saw the crying director and the paparazzi braving the wind and rain.","The flashes went off one after another, even making Shen Tang freeze for a moment.","Do they have to try so hard...","One should know, it was still pouring rain right now, and the accumulated water on the ground was already up to their calves.","The director came up crying, apologizing. The umbrella was blown inside out by the wind, the little hair left on his head was also wet and clumped together.","His face was covered in wetness, unable to distinguish the snot, tears and rainwater, looking extremely miserable.","Although the guests complained a little, they didn't say much.","After all, this was also a natural disaster, not the director's fault alone.","The guests' agents and assistants had all arrived, anxiously taking their artists away.","Before leaving, Huo Yingying pounced on Shen Tang to give her a hug, \"Sister Tangtang, I remembered your WeChat ID, remember to accept my request when you get back!\"","Hearing this, the slower Ao Ziping quickly waved his hand, \"Me too, me too!\"","Shen Tang smiled and nodded.","Looking towards her own car, there was only the driver and her assistant Yuan Yuan, as for Wang Brother, there wasn't even a shadow.","Of course, Shen Tang didn't expect anything from him anyway.","After saying a word to Yuan Yuan, she returned to Gu Huaian's car.","Shen Tang had just sat down when a towel was handed to her from the side.","The fingers were long and slender, the knuckles distinct. As someone obsessed with hands, uncontrollable indecent thoughts popped up in Shen Tang's mind.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","A blush slowly spread over his face.","But because Shen Tang felt guilty, she didn't lift her head to look, thus missing this rare sight.","After drying off the rainwater that had accidentally splashed on her, Shen Tang took out her phone that had been returned to her in advance by the staff. Opening it, she saw there was still 60% battery left.","She opened WeChat first, accepting all the friend requests, before opening Weibo.","As expected, the show had completely blown up, with 6 of the top 10 hot searches related to it.","Including no lack of posts blacking Shen Tang for bringing sunscreen, with everyone in the comments cursing at her.","The latest was a photo of everyone getting off the boat, when Shen Tang had happened to have her eyes closed and face scrunched up from the strong winds.","#ShenTang face collapsed#","Seeing this hot search tag, Shen Tang felt like collapsing on the inside.","People could criticize her poor professional capabilities, her undeserved clout chasing antics, but they couldn't insult her looks!","The thing she was most thankful for in both her lifetimes was her perfect, mother-given face.","Shen Tang pouted angrily and suddenly moved closer to Gu Huaian: \"Mr. Gu, do you think I'm ugly?\"","Gu Huaian held his breath, carefully examining Shen Tang's brows and eyes. This face was extremely exquisite, it could be said to be the furthest thing from ugly.","Was this what she looked like in her original world too?","Shen Tang was made nervous by his burning gaze, regretting her rash actions a little.","\"Um...\"","Gu Huaian lightly opened his mouth, his Adam's apple bobbing: \"Pretty.\"","Shen Tang's face instantly turned red. She made a small \"oh\" sound and averted her gaze.","【The sugar daddy seems a bit strange】","【Ahhhhhhh so awkward, my face feels so hot, did I blush】","【Stay calm, Shen Tang you're so hopeless, didn't you look at dozens of abs every day before this?】","Gu Huaian's brows knitted together. What exactly did this girl look at every day?","Neither of them spoke again, a peculiar atmosphere permeating the backseat.","On the surface Shen Tang looked calm, but inside she was extremely nervous.","She had wanted to look out the window at the scenery, but because of the dim lighting, the window reflected her and Gu Huaian's silhouettes.","And he was watching her.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","【!!! What are you looking at me for!】","Gu Huaian let out a low chuckle, the sound making one's ears tingle.","Shen Tang secretly scolded in her heart: 【Evil creature!】","Nearly destroyed her Dao heart!","Her phone dinged repeatedly with notification sounds. Opening it, she found she had been added to a group.","The group consisted of several of the guests, who were currently discussing the hot search topics.","Huo Yingying was furious. They wanted to help clarify things but didn't dare act rashly, so they frantically @'ed Shen Tang in the group, preparing to communicate.","Shen Tang felt warm inside. To tell the truth, she didn't care about these malicious hot searches at all.","As the saying goes, when lice multiply one doesn't feel the bite, when debts mount up one doesn't worry. People cursing at her wouldn't affect her ability to earn money.","The only annoying thing was them saying she had plastic surgery, and using ugly photos to prove her \"face collapse\".","Having heard her inner voice, Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Thinking for a bit, he sent a text to Assistant Cen.","On Shen Tang's side, she was still discussing things in the group, when she suddenly received a message from Yuan Yuan that the malicious hot searches about her had disappeared.","Shen Tang excitedly opened Weibo, and they really couldn't be found anymore.","She asked in the group: Wuwuwu, which cutie helped delete my hot searches? Too awesome!","Huo Yingying was furious: !!! One step too late, who was so fast?","The others all said it wasn't them.","Shen Tang was a bit confused. She had assumed it was Huo Yingying's doing, but since it wasn't her, who could it be?","Next to her, a light cough suddenly sounded out. Shen Tang carefully asked: \"Have you caught a cold?\"","Gu Huaian glanced at her. \"I had someone take down the hot searches, you don't need to worry. If there's anything else you need help with in the future, you can contact me directly.\"","【The sugar daddy is also too awesome!】","Thinking for a bit, Gu Huaian added: \"Given our current relationship, you don't need to be so restrained with me.\"","Shen Tang froze for a moment.","Their current relationship... wasn't it just the contractual marriage? He provided the money, she provided the effort, what other relationship was there?","Wasn't it him who had said earlier, for her to keep a three meter distance?","Why was he now saying not to be restrained?","Shen Tang reacted, her mind instantly clearing up, and she secretly shifted closer to the car door.","\"Um... thank you...\"","【The money for deleting those hot searches, shouldn't need to be deducted from my monthly pay right...】","Gu Huaian's face instantly darkened.","This woman really was, didn't think broadly at times she should, yet thought too broadly at times she shouldn't.","He deliberately didn't explain, watching Shen Tang's expression continuously change, her heart tangled up.","The car arrived at the house. He Uncle stood at the entrance, and seeing Shen Tang and Gu Huaian arrive one after the other, he felt very gratified in his heart.","At this rate, it wouldn't be long before he could see Young Master or Young Miss.","Tao Sister came jogging out, her fat body jiggling as she ran.","\"Oh my, Madam are you alright?\" Tao Sister said, before looking Shen Tang up and down.","Shen Tang smiled: \"I'm fine, sorry to worry you.\"","\"As long as you're fine, as long as you're fine.\" Only then did Tao Sister breathe a sigh of relief.","She pulled Shen Tang towards the house. \"Quick, drink some ginger tea as prevention.\"","Shen Tang carefully said: \"Sister Tao, I've already drunk some...\"","\"No problem, you can drink more of this stuff, I added a lot of ginger you know!\"","Shen Tang's smile instantly vanished from her face.","【Who in the world invented this ginger tea!】"]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: Don't you come over here","paragraphs":["The days that followed went back to normal.","Regarding what happened that day, Shen Tang deliberately forgot about it, and Gu Huaian didn't bring it up either. The two of them seemed to have reverted back to how they were before.","Tao Sister, on the other hand, sighed and complained every day, mumbling that why isn't the master sleeping at home again.","It's worth mentioning that Huo Yingying and others posted on Weibo to thank Shen Tang.","However, their popularity is currently too low to have any presence in the entertainment industry, so netizens don't believe it.","[Haha, these guests must have been bought off by Shen Tang!]","[It's definitely capital buying them off, tsk tsk, perhaps there's a rich backer behind the scenes]","Seeing this comment, Shen Tang couldn't help but nod her head. Indeed, it was her rich dad who made his move. This person was right.","[How can a vase like Shen Tang be that capable?]","There were also some rational passersby. Having seen Shen Tang's previous livestreams of renovating houses and cooking noodles, they felt it was most likely real.","However, anyone speaking up for Shen Tang would be labeled as a fan.","This also led to some passersby developing a rebellious mentality and actually becoming Shen Tang's fans.","Shen Tang giggled behind her hands. Is this an unexpected joy?","Although she knew these kinds of fans were not loyal and might leave at any time.","But seeing the number of fans in her fan group gradually increase, a warm feeling surged in her heart.","Shen Tang said she didn't care and wanted to retire, but deep down she still cared about the ideals she had when she first embarked on this path.","The director of the show was also very smart. He immediately edited the previous live footage and released it.","It was quite interesting and also gained high popularity. Some netizens have already started looking forward to the next episode.","After closing her phone, Shen Tang changed her clothes and went to meet Huo Yingying.","The two met at a cat cafe, chatting while petting cats, having a good time.","Huo Yingying grinned and winked, \"Sister Tang Tang, how are you and your boss now?\"","She felt more and more that there was something unusual about the magnetic field between these two. They must have something going on.","After all, Shen Tang was the only woman around Gu Huaian now.","Shen Tang was stunned. She realized she hadn't seen Gu Huaian for several days. After he sent her home last time, it seemed like he hadn't come back.","She suppressed the abnormal feeling in her heart and calmly replied, \"It's nothing much. Don't think randomly. It's impossible between us two.\"","Huo Yingying pouted in disappointment, but soon cheered up again.","\"Sister Tang Tang, do you think there will be another season of our show?\"","Shen Tang didn't know either.","Then, Huo Yingying took out a contract from her bag and pushed it over, \"Sister Tang Tang, this is an endorsement. Take a look, do you want to take it?\"","Shen Tang immediately saw the four big words of \"Shu Ya Group\". Her eyelid twitched, \"Where did this come from?\"","The Shu Ya Group was the country's largest daily chemicals company giant. Any of its products would be instantly recognizable.","Huo Yingying smiled shyly, \"My mom is called Shu Ya. This is my family's company.\"","Shen Tang knew Huo Yingying came from a rich family, but didn't expect them to be this wealthy.","Although tempted, Shen Tang still shook her head and declined politely, \"Thank you, but I can't accept this.\"","\"Why? Aren't we friends? Don't worry, my mom has agreed to this.\"","Shen Tang sighed, \"Exactly because we are friends that I can't accept it. You know my current reputation. Endorsing will only have an adverse effect. If the netizens start boycotting your company's products, it would be terrible.\"","She wasn't exaggerating matters, as events like this had happened in the entertainment industry before.","Huo Yingying sighed as well, \"I just wanted to help you...\"","\"To tell the truth, my mom said before that you might not accept it, but I adamantly claimed that I could persuade you.\"","Shen Tang smiled and rubbed Huo Yingying's head, \"I appreciate your kind intentions. Thank you, our little Yingying!\"","Huo Yingying blushed and took out another document.","\"I don't care. You rejected that one. You must agree to this one!\"","Shen Tang opened it and saw it was an audition notice.","Moreover, it was for a hugely popular large-scale IP adapted from a bestselling novel.","Even just a second female lead role was desperately sought after by actresses.","Shen Tang read the script carefully. In the story, the second female lead Tao Zhi had a miserable childhood.","During a famine year, people practiced cannibalism out of desperation.","When Tao Zhi was traded by her family to be slaughtered as livestock, she was rescued by Prince Jin and taken into his household.","Tao Zhi went through a lot of hardship. Finally, after fighting her way through a competition of a hundred people, she successfully became Prince Jin's personal guard to do some undercover work for him.","She was always loyal and concealed her feelings, only wishing to repay his life-saving kindness by doing her utmost to assist Prince Jin.","However, unexpectedly, ever since Prince Jin met the female lead Lian Yi, he seemed to have lost his mind. He frequently made exceptions for her and offended many for her sake, even abandoning the tasks assigned by the Emperor.","Tao Zhi tried to dissuade him many times but Prince Jin refused to listen. Instead, he removed her from his side. Tao Zhi could only give up.","Until Lian Yi's father embezzled most of the disaster relief funds while distributing them, causing hundreds of thousands to become displaced, yet Prince Jin helped Lian Yi destroy evidence and distort the facts.","Tao Zhi knew he was beyond saving.","Someone like this was unfit to be an emperor.","She still remembered how terrifying the famine year was during her childhood. Women, elders and children were the first to be abandoned. She could not forgive this.","Thus, she defected to Prince Rui's side and became an undercover agent.","In the end, Prince Jin was defeated and Prince Rui took the throne. Tao Zhi committed suicide in front of Prince Jin as an apology.","\"I return this life back to you.\"","After reading the script, Shen Tang had complicated feelings.","\"This role is probably highly sought after...\"","Huo Yingying winked cutely, \"You haven't been confirmed for it yet. It's just an audition opportunity! The director is my cousin. He doesn't care about anything else, only acting skills. I've seen your previous dramas. Your acting skills are great. You just lack an opportunity to take off and rise to prominence. So I believe you can definitely get this role and finally have your big break!\"","Shen Tang hugged Huo Yingying tightly, her eyes brimming red. \"Yingying, thank you...\"","This wasn't just an audition notice. It was also recognition of her acting and a stepping stone to a bright future.","Shen Tang didn't expect Huo Yingying to be so good to her. She was deeply touched.","\"Rest assured, I will definitely secure this role!\"","Over the next few days, Shen Tang devoted herself wholeheartedly to studying the script and striving to seize the role.","Right then, she received a call from Qi Yue: \"Tang Tang, you're trending on the hot searches!\"","Trending on the hot searches was a normal occurrence. Shen Tang wasn't surprised.","But a hot search that made Qi Yue call her was something that made her quite curious.","She opened Weibo and found that the first trending search was indeed her.","It was an edited video of what happened to them in the mountain cave during the livestream.","Shen Tang was somewhat astonished. Wasn't the livestreamer broken?","Upon asking, she learned that although the livestreamer broke and couldn't connect to the Internet, it was still able to record videos.","Shen Tang carefully recalled and found that she hadn't said anything, finally letting out a breath of relief.","The comments showed highly polarized opinions.","Some people scolded Shen Tang for acting pretentiously and trying to attract attention. Others felt that this was Shen Tang's true nature and personality, and the two factions fought fiercely in the comments section, brewing a blood-soaked storm.","As for Shen Tang's few loyal fans, they trembled in fear and spectated the arguments, afraid of becoming involved. Whenever someone mentioned Shen Tang's fans, they really wanted to cry out: Don't come here!"]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Do You still need investors","paragraphs":["Some people watched the commotion, while others discovered that Shen Tang's reputation was gradually improving.","The smart people in the circle had begun to change their attitude towards Shen Tang.","That day, after Shen Tang finished researching the script, she made an appointment to meet Qi Yue at a cafe.","When she arrived, Qi Yue hadn't come yet, so Shen Tang buried her head in reading the original novel.","\"Is this the variety show you want to shoot? Haha, tell me, who would want to watch farming?\"","A sharp female voice rang out, followed by a male voice, \"It's like this, variety shows are already saturated now, I think—\"","\"I don't want your opinion, I want my opinion! Luo Chen, my money didn't blow in with the wind. You said you wanted to make a variety show and let me invest, fine, but you have to let me see the prospects of the variety show, not just empty promises.\"","\"It's not empty promises...\" The male voice weakly explained.","\"How is this not empty promises? Other dating shows, kid shows, even the almost scrapped desert island survival show have conflicts, heat, and an audience. What does your variety show have?\"","\"And letting female celebrities come to farm, are you kidding me? Which female celebrity would want to do this? Even people like Shen Tang probably wouldn't be willing.\"","Shen Tang, who was suddenly cued, blankly raised her head. What's wrong with her? What kind of person is she?","After glancing at the two people sitting next to her, their faces were unfamiliar and she didn't recognize them. She lowered her head and continued reading the novel.","The suppressed scolding voice continued to ring out from the neighboring private room.","\"Luo Chen, I'll be blunt with you, your variety show has no future, I absolutely won't invest in you. Now you have two choices, either change to another variety show plan, or go find someone else to invest.\"","The one called Luo Chen didn't speak again.","\"I got this meal.\" The sound of high heels rang out as the girl gradually walked away.","Only then did Shen Tang secretly glance next door, and happened to meet Luo Chen's gaze.","Shen Tang awkwardly pulled at the corners of her lips, \"Um...\"","\"Do you also think that the farming variety show has no future?\"","Shen Tang was stunned for a moment. She didn't expect that he would ask her.","But seeing his slightly flushed eyes, Shen Tang couldn't bear to say unpleasant words.","\"You won't know if it doesn't work without trying it, right? There are only so many types of variety shows nowadays. Maybe the audience is already aesthetically fatigued and urgently needs a change to a different kind of variety show. Anyway, I think this variety show idea is quite novel.\"","Luo Chen's eyes gradually lit up, \"You're right, I can't give up!\"","\"Er...but I'm just randomly guessing without really understanding the variety show plan you’re preparing—\"","Before she could finish speaking, she saw Luo Chen walk over and push the folder in his hand towards her.","\"Take a look.\"","Shen Tang was quite confused. Is this Luo Chen a bit silly? He just showed it to her like this?","Wait, Luo Chen?","Shen Tang carefully recalled that there seemed to be a second male lead called Luo Chen in the book. Because the female lead invested in his variety show and took the initiative to become the first guest, he fell in love with the female lead.","Later on, the variety show became very popular, and he also rose with the tide. He provided a lot of help to the female lead in the later stages.","Thinking this way, Shen Tang slowly pulled her lips into a big smile.","\"Luo Chen, are you still lacking investors?\"","·","Shen Tang hummed a song on her way home, and just happened to run into Gu Huaian who had just returned.","She smiled and waved her hand, \"You're back!\"","Gu Huaian was stunned for a moment, and naturally responded, \"Yeah, you seem very happy?\"","Shen Tang giggled twice, \"How'd you know?\"","Gu Huaian pointed at her cheek, \"The corners of your mouth are almost reaching your temples.\"","Was it really that exaggerated?","Shen Tang immediately demonstrated the disappearance of her smile.","However, just thinking about the money that was about to hit her account, she couldn't help but want to laugh again.","This also caused the corners of her mouth to twitch uncontrollably, as if she had contracted some major illness.","Seeing the two walk in side by side, Tao Sister laughed to reveal her eight teeth.","\"Sir, Madam, you’re back! Dinner will be ready soon.”","Recently Shen Tang had been eating grass to lose weight for a role. Seeing the dishes placed in front of Gu Huaian, her saliva was dripping and her eyes were green with envy.","Gu Huaian pushed it over, \"Eat if you want.\"","\"No, the role I'm auditioning for is very thin.\" Shen Tang reluctantly moved her eyes away.","It’s just eating less, what’s so difficult?","【I love eating vegetables, vegetables are so delicious!】","Shen Tang kept brainwashing herself and shoveled down several mouthfuls of vegetables.","Gu Huaian was about to have Tao Sister take away the meat dishes, but Shen Tang hurriedly stopped him.","\"Don't, just watching you eat is enough for me, it’s as if I ate it myself.\"","Gu Huaian didn't understand what that logic was.","He didn't insist and continued to eat.","It had to be said that Gu Huaian ate unhurriedly, seeming to relish every bite, much more attractive to watch than those eating broadcasters.","But with a burning gaze always staring at him, even his eating motions started becoming awkward.","After the meal, Gu Huaian's back was already drenched in cold sweat.","Early the next morning, Gu Huaian got up early as usual and received the lovingly prepared breakfast sandwich from Tao Sister as usual.","Gu Huaian didn't take it. \"The company’s not busy today. I’ll eat breakfast before going in.”","Tao Sister understood. This should mean he's preparing to eat breakfast with Madam.","\"You don't need to prepare anything special, just like usual is fine.\"","After Gu Huaian exercised and took a shower, Shen Tang had just gotten up.","It had to be said, she looked very beautiful without makeup too.","Seeing Gu Huaian, Shen Tang was stunned for a moment. \"Morning. You’re not going to work today?\"","【Could it be that the workaholic is actually taking a day off?】","【Did I get up early today?】","Glancing down at her watch, nope, still the usual time.","Gu Huaian thought to himself, even workaholics need days off.","Just because he doesn’t usually rest doesn’t mean he can’t rest. It’s just that he doesn’t know what to do when he has free time.","Breakfast was very abundant with many varieties, but only a small plateful of each.","Looking at the table full of breakfast then thinking about his simple breakfast sandwich every morning, Gu Huaian felt like something wasn’t right somewhere.","\"Thank you for preparing breakfast for me every day.\" Gu Huaian said.","Shen Tang was stunned for an instant and calmly nodded her head, \"You’re welcome.\"","【Could Tao Sister still be persisting in sending him a breakfast sandwich every day?】","【Is the rich dad a bit easy to coax?】","【That stuff is just so unappetizing. Wuwuwu, but home cooked breakfast is still delicious!】","【Ahhhh, Tao Sister's cooking is just too good!】","Shen Tang thought back to her previous life when she could only eat a breakfast sandwich or two buns in the morning. She couldn't help but squeeze out a few tears for herself.","Thank the transmigration gods!","She couldn't help but wonder if she could also bring Tao Sister with her when she divorces two years later.","After all, Gu Huaian doesn't eat at home much either, it would be such a waste of Tao Sister’s great cooking skills.","Hearing all these inner thoughts, Gu Huaian: \"......\""]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: From the Beginning of Man, the Nature of Sex","paragraphs":["That night, as usual, Shen Tang brought her sister to play games. Because her operation was too fierce, she received a bunch of compliments. If Shen Tang had a tail, it would probably be held high.","Just as she was about to start another game, there was suddenly a knock at the door.","Shen Tang opened the door and saw Gu Huaian wrapped in a bath towel. There was even some unwashed shower gel in his hair. Water drops slid down his chest along his body. Unfortunately, the scenery below was tightly covered by the robe.","[So sexy, not afraid of death!]","[Why come over so late at night? Seducing me?]","[Heh, men, I'm destined to be the woman you can't get!]","Hearing the heartfelt words, Gu Huaian: \"...\"","Was Shen Tang possessed by some dirty stuff?","He explained, \"Sorry, I can't take a bath downstairs. Can I borrow your bathroom?\"","I didn't expect the plot in the novel to be staged in real life.","\"Oh, come on in,\" Shen Tang didn't think too much and let him in. After all, he had no reason to lie to her.","Besides, it wasn't the first time the two of them were in a room together.","However, she was a little puzzled. Aren't there only two bathrooms in the villa? That can't be...","The sound of trickling water came from the bathroom.","Shen Tang was inevitably a little distracted and made several mistakes in a row while playing games.","The sweet little kitten couldn't help but ask, \"Sister Monkey, are you not feeling well?\"","Shen Tang came back to her senses and scolded herself for being so lustful. Men only affect the winning rate of playing games!","She turned on the mic and replied, \"It's okay, I was just a little distracted. I'll play well next.\"","Since the two had become acquainted, Shen Tang had also started using the mic when playing games.","She didn't know why, but she always felt that the meowing voice was a little familiar, but she couldn't remember it.","Miao Miao said the same.","They attributed this to girls' voices being very similar in general.","The serious Shen Tang was invincible. She quickly turned the game around.","After returning to the team room, Miao Miao quietly asked, \"Sister Monkey, was someone taking a bath in your room just now?\"","Before Shen Tang could reply, the bathroom door opened and Gu Huaian walked out rubbing his hair.","\"Thanks, I'm done with my bath.\"","Miao Miao gasped briefly on the other end.","After seeing Gu Huaian off, Shen Tang asked, \"What's wrong with you?\"","\"Nothing, that male voice just now sounded a little familiar.\"","Miao Miao thought about it. Nice voices were mostly similar. It probably wasn't who she thought it was.","The two played a few more rounds before Shen Tang finally rested.","She dreamed all night about Gu Huaian taking a shower. His upper body was bare, revealing exquisite pectorals and abdominals. Her gaze gradually lowered, just about to see something sensational, when she suddenly woke up.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She slammed her pillow in frustration!","\"Ahhh! Damn it!\"","So close, just a little bit more and she would have seen it!","The day of the audition came very quickly.","Shen Tang arrived at the company building early. Quite a few actors had already arrived.","Seeing Shen Tang, their expressions were somewhat surprised.","Shen Tang took a number plate and sat in a corner to continue reading the script.","This audition opportunity was very important to her. She could not make mistakes.","Unfortunately, though she didn't want to cause trouble, trouble came looking for her.","\"Oh, isn't this the fraudster? Why aren't you out committing fraud? Instead you came to audition?\"","Shen Tang looked up and stared at the woman in front of her, \"Sorry, you are...?\"","The woman was about to explode with anger. \"Shen Tang, are you pretending? Your team pulled down my looks before, and caused trouble with my CP. Now you say you don't know who I am?\"","Shen Tang thought hard but still couldn't remember who she was.","She sincerely said, \"Sorry, there are too many people I've badmouthed and caused trouble with, I really can't remember who you are.\"","Sincerity was the killer move. As soon as Shen Tang said this, the surroundings suddenly became quiet.","The woman also didn't expect Shen Tang to answer like this. After half a day of silence she said, \"... \"","The people eavesdropping racked their brains to recall all the sad things in their lives, just to avoid laughing out loud.","\"Humph. Whether you remember me or not, let me tell you, you won't get this role!\" The woman was furious and left after throwing down vicious words.","Shen Tang shrugged, noncommittal.","She was still quite confident in her acting skills. Ten years of constant polish, she only lacked an opportunity.","Whispers came from the surroundings. Shen Tang ignored them and immersed herself in her own thoughts.","Soon, the audition began. Everyone entered the room one by one according to their number plates.","The expression on each person who came out did not look very good, which in turn made the remaining people either extremely confident or extremely nervous.","Shen Tang took a few deep breaths to calm herself down.","It was the turn of the woman who picked a fight earlier. In less than a few minutes she walked out arrogantly. It looked like she had succeeded.","She walked to Shen Tang, flipped her hair and said, \"I advise you not to waste your energy. You won't get this role.\"","Shen Tang closed her script. \"Oh,\" she uttered.","\"Humph! You'll be crying later!\"","After the woman left, gazes occasionally glanced over. Shen Tang remained extremely calm.","Soon it was Shen Tang's turn.","Shen Tang took a deep breath and entered the room.","\"Hello everyone, I'm Shen Tang. The role I'm auditioning for today is the second female lead Taochi.\"","As her voice fell, the room suddenly became quiet. Shen Tang was also extremely nervous in her heart.","There were five people sitting in the middle of the room. She didn't know which one was Yingying's cousin. Although Yingying said he didn't care about anything else, only acting skills mattered, she didn't know what the other four people thought.","They looked at each other, and finally the long-haired man sitting in the middle spoke up, \"Please perform the scene where Taochi finds out that Prince Jin helped her father destroy evidence.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang closed her eyes, and when she opened them again, her expression and posture instantly changed, as if she had really become Taochi.","The perfunctory expressions on the faces of the few people instantly became serious.","After a while, Shen Tang bowed, \"My performance is over, thank you everyone.\"","They looked at each other again and recorded something in their notebooks.","The man in the middle spoke again, \"Go back and wait for the notice.\"","Shen Tang bowed again and exited the room.","As soon as she opened the door, everyone looked up at her at once, carefully scrutinizing her expression.","Shen Tang calmly left. On the elevator, she suddenly received a call from Wang Brother.","She held the phone far away when she answered.","\"Shen Tang! You got an audition opportunity and didn't tell the company? You're getting more and more willful!\"","\"If others hadn't told me, I wouldn't even know!\"","\"Shen Tang, come to the company right now!\"","\"Are you still listening to what I say or not?\"","Shen Tang calmly replied, \"Oh, bad signal. What did you say Wang Brother? Hello? Hello? \"","After saying that, she immediately hung up.","Hilarious. She was definitely not going to the company. There must be nothing good going on. They might even make her give up the audition opportunity.","She had zero faith in Wang Brother's good intentions.","Luckily she had already auditioned and left her own phone number.","Otherwise, who knows how much trouble would have occurred.","Arriving at Luo Chen's place, the two began discussing the details of the variety show.","Shen Tang had a lifetime of experience and put forward many suggestions. Luo Chen adopted almost all of them.","The only thing that hadn't been decided was the guest list.","Shen Tang recommended the female lead. Luo Chen didn't know the female lead at this time. But the romance reality show she was in was very popular, which made Luo Chen very doubtful.","\"She probably won't come back...\"","There was no denying it, the female lead was the female lead. Her looks were top notch.","Shen Tang had read the novel. The female lead also had quite good character, except for being somewhat indecisive in emotional matters.","\"We can try. I think she will participate.\"","As for the other guests, if no one came, Shen Tang could only go on herself. After all, comfort was valuable, and money was even higher.","After handing over everything to Luo Chen, Shen Tang took a detour home.","When she got home, Gu Huaian was sitting on the sofa processing documents.","He wore wire-rimmed glasses, his long eyelashes were like black feathers that complemented his completely buttoned up shirt. He looked exactly like an ascetic beauty.","Seeing such a beautiful sight, Shen Tang unconsciously swallowed her saliva.","[Wow so handsome!]","[A gentle scumbag, beast in human clothing heh heh]","[Why dress so strictly every day? Who are you trying to fend off?]","Gu Huaian was annoyed by the increasingly unscrupulous and revealing inner words.","He glanced at Shen Tang. She looked innocent and pure, yet her heart and mind were impure.","Shen Tang grinned, \"Um, are you staying here tonight too?\"","\"Yeah, I'll be staying here for a while.\"","\"I see...\" Shen Tang's gaze wandered as she didn't dare to look directly at Gu Huaian.","After all, the dream she had last time was a bit disrespectful towards him.","Heavens above, she really had no ulterior motives towards her sugar daddy. She was just innocently indulging her desires.","One can hardly blame her. After all, it's human nature to be led by primal urges."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Handsome, Beautiful","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian sat on the sofa working while Shen Tang curled up on the cradle playing on her phone.","The treaty that they had previously agreed on to maintain a three meter distance had long been discarded without them realizing it.","In their recent interactions, Shen Tang discovered that Gu Huaian was not as cold and unfriendly as the rumors said. On the contrary, most of the time he was very considerate and generous.","Especially when it came to money, he was simply Shen Tang's money god, a rich daddy whose fingers leaked wealth whenever he lifted them, allowing her to get rich quick.","However, this money only passed through her hands briefly before she passed it on to Luo Chen.","Shen Tang clutched her chest, pained.","Thinking about how this money would become even more money made her feel a bit better.","The preparations for the variety show Luo Chen was going to be on were going well, and he had also contacted the female lead.","However, Shen Tang still hadn't received any news about her audition results, and she was inevitably a little nervous.","She searched online and found lots of vague information.","There was even a blogger who posted about her going for the audition, and was inevitably ridiculed in swarms.","Shen Tang didn't care about any of that. She had been cursed at enough that this no longer hurt her.","This was normal in the industry, inflating and deflating people.","Moreover, she only cared about whether the audition was successful or not.","Because she was worried, she couldn't resist contacting Huo Yingying to ask if she knew any inside information.","Huo Yingying said her old-fashioned brother had scolded her fiercely.","\"I think you have a high probability of success, don't worry.\"","If it was a director without money, they might still have to worry about whether the choice of cast and script would be controlled by capitalists. But her brother had money, so they didn't have to worry about any of that at all.","Shen Tang was also confident in her own acting skills. Hearing Huo Yingying's words, she relaxed a little.","But only a tiny bit.","With the full moon hanging high in the night sky, after eating dinner, Shen Tang finally received the text notification of her audition results.","She was extremely excited. After all, in her previous life she had never played the second female lead!","That night, Shen Tang tossed and turned, unable to sleep. Holding the densely packed character background she had written, she went over it again and again.","The group chat was also very lively. Qi Yue and friends Shen Tang had met on the desert island variety show all sent congratulations.","The drama's official Weibo account also began heating up. Without even looking she knew the comment section must be awful.","Although she had promised everyone she wouldn't check Weibo, Shen Tang still couldn't resist taking a peek.","Sure enough, in the comments section, many original novel fans were boycotting Shen Tang and requesting she be replaced.","Shen Tang felt a little sad, but she also understood.","She didn't respond. Right now anything she said would be useless.","The best method currently was to just wait until the show aired.","Thinking about it, she couldn't sleep anyway, so she might as well get up and pack her luggage to get ready to join the crew in a few days.","Because it was a closed set, she wouldn't be able to leave in the middle, so she had to bring a lot of stuff.","Shen Tang packed a full three suitcases before the sky finally began to lighten and she fell asleep.","She slept until almost noon before groggily coming downstairs, only to see a boy and a girl, two children, playing in the living room.","She looked at Gu Huaian and blurted out, \"Your kids?\"","【Hiss, they look so much alike! They must be his own blood children...】","Gu Huaian paused for a moment. \"They're my sister's children. They just got back from overseas and will be staying here for a while. Xiao Shuai, Xiao Mei, call auntie.\"","\"Auntie!\"","\"Hello auntie!\"","The two children looked very well-behaved.","Shen Tang was stimulated by this and suddenly opened her eyes wide.","\"What did you say their names are?\"","Xiao Shuai? Xiao Mei? Those names didn't seem to match the Gu family at all!","Gu Huaian pinched the bridge of his nose. \"Those are names they chose themselves. They'll probably change again after a while. Their original names are Gu Anran and Gu Wuyang.\"","Shen Tang clutched her chest, nearly scared to death.","This also reminded her of something from when she was little.","When she was small, she liked butterflies and wanted to change her name to Butterfly Princess, but luckily Matron didn't agree.","Gu Huaian suddenly laughed a little. Shen Tang was puzzled, what was he laughing about?","Wait a second! That's not right, Gu Huaian has an older sister?","Shen Tang carefully recalled the plot, but the novel didn't have detailed writing about Gu Huaian's family.","Oh well, with her as a variable, reality had already begun to change. The content of the book could no longer be completely trusted.","Moreover, these were all living, breathing people, right?","The longer she stayed here, the more muddled she felt, unable to distinguish whether this was reality or the book.","There was no plot god forcing her to complete missions, and everyone had flesh and blood and was no different from real people. Shen Tang felt that this was the real world.","The two children were both very good looking. Shen Tang was great with kids, and soon hit it off with the two.","However, because Shen Tang was so young, the two children stubbornly refused to call her auntie anymore, and instead switched to calling her big sister.","Shen Tang was quite happy about this, though Gu Huaian's expression was not too pleasant.","After playing for a while, Xiao Shuai, or rather Gu Wuyang, took out his phone. \"Big sister, do you play King of Glory?\"","\"I do!\"","\"Then let's play together!\"","\"Sure, big sister will carry you flying!\"","Shen Tang was originally worried their ranks might not match, but she was surprised to see Xiao Shuai was already in King rank.","\"Wow, you're so good!\"","Xiao Shuai straightened his back, unable to hide the pride on his face. \"Just average!\"","\"Xiao Mei, you don't want to play?\" Shen Tang asked.","Xiao Mei shook her head. \"Big brother doesn't let me play with him.\"","\"No problem, let's play together. I'll take you.\" After saying this, Shen Tang looked again at Gu Huaian and casually asked, \"Do you want to join too?\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang: \"!!!\"","She had really just asked casually!","To be honest, she couldn't imagine what the big boss looked like playing games.","But Gu Huaian was outstanding in every area, so gaming should be no exception, right...","Xiao Shuai, on the other hand, seemed hesitant to speak.","Shen Tang helped Gu Huaian download the game and briefly explained it, then pulled the few of them into a room.","She had wanted to pull in Miao Miao too, but unfortunately she wasn't online.","The four of them matched with a random player.","Soon, Shen Tang discovered that Gu Huaian's gaming talent was nearly zero.","She couldn't save him nearly as fast as he fed deaths.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Xiao Shuai sighed, \"See, I knew we shouldn't bring him.\"","Shen Tang glanced at him. Hindsight is 20/20! Why didn't you say so earlier!","But she didn't really mind. After all, the original intention of gaming was to have fun. They were playing the game, not being played by it.","Gu Huaian's fingers paused and his character died again.","Shen Tang consoled, \"It's okay, just play passively and don't leave the base.\"","\"Mm.\"","Luckily there was only one weak link on their team, and they still won in the end.","Xiao Shuai tentatively asked, \"Uncle, will you keep playing?\"","\"Yes.\"","Xiao Shuai's face instantly drooped. He wanted to refuse but didn't dare.","\"What, do you have an objection?\"","\"I don't dare.\" Xiao Shuai pouted.","\"Oh, not that you don't dare, but that you don't want to. So you do have some objections, right?\"","Xiao Shuai: \"......\"","Xiao Shuai threw himself into Shen Tang's arms. \"Auntie, look at how uncle is bullying me!\"","Shen Tang glanced at Gu Huaian, her expression slightly awkward. She wasn't his real aunt after all.","Moreover, this kid was pretty interesting. Calling her big sister when he didn't need her, then calling her auntie when he did. Tsk tsk."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Relying on the mountains to fall, relying on everyone to run","paragraphs":["\"Alright, you guys have fun, I'm going to the company,\" Gu Huaian said as he ruffled Xiao Shuai's hair.","Shen Tang hurriedly asked, \"Have you eaten yet?\"","\"Are you referring to breakfast or lunch?\"","Only then did Shen Tang realize that it was already past ten o'clock. She was surprised that the workaholic Gu Huaian was going to the company this late. His image as a workaholic seemed to be crumbling.","After Gu Huaian left, Xiao Shuai clenched his fists excitedly and cheered, \"Yes! That big ice cube uncle finally left! Sis, why did you get together with him anyway?\"","Shen Tang let out a sound, not knowing how to respond.","Should she say it was because he was rich?","That would make her seem very materialistic!","Alright, she does like money.","\"Your uncle is handsome and rich, haha, let's not talk about this. Do you guys want to keep playing games?\" Shen Tang said.","\"Yes!\"","At the company, after handling urgent work, Gu Huaian opened up the game.","He played a few rounds in a row, but because he was so bad at it, he got cursed out by his teammates and lost a lot of credit score from reports.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He called Cen Assistant in, \"Do you know how to play Wangzhe?\"","Cen Assistant thought he was hearing things.","\"You mean Wangzhe?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I know how to play, but I don't have much time for it. I only play a round occasionally,\" since work kept him too busy.","\"Find someone to teach me how to play.\"","Cen Assistant almost thought Gu Huaian had been possessed.","But since President Gu wanted to learn, he would need to find a good teacher.","And so, Cen Assistant invited a championship team's coach over.","Shen Tang knew nothing about this. She had successfully won over the two little ones with Wangzhe, gaining two new little brothers.","Due to the anti-addiction system, the two little ones had limited gaming time each day.","After playing games, the two would go to class.","This was Shen Tang's first time understanding the life of rich people's children. They actually had so many classes to take.","Even Shen Tang, a grownup, felt tired. Yet the two little ones never complained, playing wildly when it was time to play, and studying diligently when it was time to learn.","In the blink of an eye, several days passed and it was time for Shen Tang to start shooting.","Xiao Mei clung onto Shen Tang's clothes reluctantly, \"Sis, when are you coming back?\"","Xiao Shuai also looked over longingly.","\"I'm not sure for now, don't worry, I can still bring you guys ranks after I finish work everyday.\"","Xiao Shuai instantly smiled, \"Sis is so nice, not like uncle, he—\"","\"What about uncle?\"","The voice asking the question belonged to said uncle. Xiao Shuai hurriedly shut his mouth.","Gu Huaian looked to Shen Tang, \"I'll take you to set.\"","Shen Tang wanted to decline, but then realized all the cars belonged to him anyway so there was no difference.","Also, what if Papa Jin called her for something?","Once in the car, Gu Huaian didn't speak. Shen Tang glanced at him a few times, but he didn't seem to have anything to say.","\"Um, thanks...\" Shen Tang said.","\"It's on the way.\"","Shen Tang responded with a couple of \"oh's\".","The driver in front couldn't help but take a glance back. He didn't understand when two completely opposite destinations started counting as \"on the way\".","The backseat was filled with silence.","Gu Huaian pondered for a bit before speaking, \"If anyone bullies you, you can tell me.\"","He had specifically downloaded Weibo recently. He'd only known before that Shen Tang didn't have a good reputation, but only now did he discover how vulgarly those people cursed at her.","What was undeniable was that Shen Tang did use CPs for hype, but she had never actually done that herself.","Moreover, those people creating and spreading fake yellow pictures were simply too much. He already had the legal team gathering evidence to sue them.","This was the first time Shen Tang had heard such words. Life at the orphanage hadn't been easy either, with kids ganging up on each other too.","Shen Tang had known since young that those who depend on the mountains collapse when the mountain falls, and those who depend on people are abandoned when people leave. Relying on others was not as good as relying on herself.","No one had ever said something like this to her before.","Shen Tang forced out a carefree laugh, \"No one's bullying me.\"","Seeing her smile like this, Gu Huaian suddenly felt a sour feeling in his heart.","\"You're now Madam Gu of the Gu Group. While fulfilling the responsibilities of this role, you can also enjoy the conveniences it brings. So if you need any help, you can completely contact me directly, or contact Cen Assistant.\"","Shen Tang froze.","She suspected Gu Huaian had been possessed.","She didn't understand why he was being so nice to her.","He didn't actually have to care.","Shen Tang smiled, \"Thank you, I won't stand on ceremony then.\"","After that, Shen Tang didn't say anything more, but her heart was a tangled mess.","It wasn't until they reached their destination that Shen Tang showed a smile again, \"I'm here, thanks!\"","\"You've thanked me several times today.\"","Shen Tang was stunned again. Had it really been that many times?","\"Next time we meet, don't be too courteous with me.\"","After unloading the luggage, Gu Huaian's car swiftly left.","Shen Tang was calling Yuan Yuan when a voice suddenly sounded next to her, \"Do you need help?\"","Shen Tang looked up to see it was the male lead of the crew, Shen Xiuran, who was also one of the female lead's suitors.","Shen Tang waved her hand, \"Thanks, but no need.\"","She didn't want anything to do with the main leads.","\"It's no problem, I'll help carry it.\"","Shen Xiuran moved to pick up the luggage, but couldn't lift it up.","He gritted his teeth and tried again, barely getting the luggage off the ground, \"What did you put in here?\"","Shen Tang smiled embarrassedly, \"Just some daily necessities.\"","Then she picked up a box in each hand and walked in.","Shen Xiuran's mouth slowly gaped open, \"!!!\"","He was starting to doubt life a little.","After taking a few steps, Shen Tang stopped and turned back, \"Aren't you coming in?\"","\"Coming!\" Shen Xiuran said through gritted teeth.","The two walked into the hotel lobby one after the other. There were already a few people sitting around, all supporting roles, who quickly stood up to greet them when they saw the two.","Shen Tang noticed a gaze staring right at her.","She looked over to see it was an unfamiliar woman.","The other party smiled brilliantly. Shen Tang retracted her gaze, not noticing the flash of malice in the woman's eyes.","\"F*ck!\"","Hearing the exclamation, Shen Tang turned back to see Shen Xiuran trying to pick up the other two luggage boxes.","He probably thought that since she could lift two, the boxes couldn't be too heavy.","In reality, the one Shen Xiuran grabbed was the lightest. Hehehe~"]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Heard I'm being kept by an old man","paragraphs":["The crew had strict closed management.","The director clearly stipulated that no news about the crew could be leaked during filming.","Therefore, mobile phones were usually not allowed during filming, unless there were special circumstances. They had to wait until they returned to their rooms during breaks to use their phones.","As a result, Shen Tang did not know that there was news all over the internet saying that she was being kept by an old man.","Gu Huaian had suppressed the news immediately, but for some reason, the hot searches kept coming back up.","Qi Yue, Huo Yingying and others had all discovered it, but were unable to contact Shen Tang for a long time and were very worried.","Huo Yingying knew her cousin's temperament, and was unable to reach him when she called.","She rarely scolded, “shit!”","Ao Ziping looked puzzled, “???”","Did that word have that meaning?","Huo Yingying rolled her eyes, “You don’t understand. The boss has to say that.”","“...But you're not the boss!”","Huo Yingying stared angrily, “Who asked you!”","Huo Yingying: “......”","Ahhhh! She had slipped up again. Let her die!","It was said that Shen Tang was very popular among the crew members, because she had brought two suitcases and it was as if she had become a monkey in the zoo that everyone watched.","After performing it n times, Shen Tang felt that she should probably charge admission tickets. Maybe she could earn a little extra.","\"Shen Tang, may I ask what's in your suitcase?\"","Shen Xiuran had also helped carry other actresses' suitcases. Although they were heavy, it was acceptable. Compared to Shen Tang's, it was like a little sorcerer seeing a great one.","\"Just some dumbbells.\"","Shen Xiuran: \"???\"","\"Why did you bring dumbbells to film?\"","\"Of course it's to work out!\" Shen Tang felt his question was a bit strange.","If she didn't bring dumbbells to work out, was it to eat them?","The other actors couldn't help but give a thumbs up to Shen Tang, feeling admiration for her.","Damn, she was really hardworking to persist in working out when filming was so tiring.","In fact, the reason why Shen Tang worked out was also to be able to eat more. Otherwise, with her appetite, it would be weird if she didn't gain weight.","Everyone was chatting when the director suddenly walked over.","His hair was very long, covering his eyebrows and eyes, making him look somewhat gloomy, like a social recluse.","In fact, he was ruthless when scolding people regardless of gender.","Seeing him come over, everyone scattered like birds and beasts. Shen Tang, who was a bit slow, was left behind.","\"Hello, director!\" Shen Tang was very nervous, even more nervous than being caught reading novels by the class teacher during class.","\"Hmm.\"","Seeing that the director was standing in front of her and not leaving, Shen Tang carefully asked, \"Do you have anything?\"","\"I heard that you are very strong? Able to lift two oxen with one hand?\"","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly. Rumors nowadays were really terrible.","\"No no no, I'm just a little stronger than ordinary people.\"","As she spoke, Shen Tang performed lifting heavy objects with one hand for the 13th time.","The director seemed interested and even touched Shen Tang's arm. Indeed very heavy after holding it himself.","\"Not bad!\"","\"Thanks for the compliment.\"","\"I have a new script with a female lead who can lift a cauldron. Are you interested?\"","Shen Tang: \"!!!\"","There’s even benefits for being strong!","She didn't expect that the next drama would be confirmed before this one was even done filming, and she would even play the female lead!","How could she possibly not be willing?","\"Willing, willing!\"","\"Well, in that case, let's exchange contacts.\"","Until the director left, Shen Tang still hadn't recovered. To think that cakes would fall from the sky one day!","At this time, someone walked over with a complex expression. \"Sister Shen Tang, you're trending on hot search again.\"","\"Ah? What is it about again?\" Shen Tang unscrewed a bottle of mineral water to moisten her throat.","\"You are being kept by an old man.\"","\"Pfft!\"","A mouthful of water didn't make it down her throat and sprayed onto the ground.","\"Sister Shen Tang, I know you’re anxious, but don’t rush first. We all know this is false. If this matter is utilized well, it may even be a good thing.\"","Shen Tang pulled at the corner of her mouth. The key thing was that it wasn’t completely false. She also didn’t know how much the informant had leaked out, and whether her sugar daddy had been implicated.","Shen Tang hurried back to her room to take out her phone. She first added the director’s WeChat, then replied to her friends' WeChats one by one.","She noticed that she didn't receive a WeChat from Gu Huaian. He was probably busy and didn't know about this.","Shen Tang quickly shook her head. What was she thinking about, caring so much about Gu Huaian? Weren't they just a contracted couple?","When she opened Weibo, the hot search had been suppressed and couldn’t be found after searching. But one could still see the content if searching specifically for it.","In fact, the so-called news of her being kept by an old man came from one person's leak. Other than hearsay, there was nothing.","Shen Tang was surprised that so many people actually believed this news.","【Well, the falser the rumor, the more credible it is】","【I knew early on that Shen Tang was not a good person】","【I was her middle school classmate. She often went out to accompany people for money back then when she had no money... 】","【Hiss, I’m also rich. And I’m still young. Shen Tang, can you look at me? 】","【You don’t choose either. You even want a slut!】","Seeing this sentence, Shen Tang was so angry she fought back directly.","【What are you barking at? 】","【Stir your brain before talking!】","【No mirror at home? At least you can pee to see what you look like. Keys are 3 yuan each, 10 yuan for 3. Do you deserve it?】","......","Shen Tang argued with fans very excitedly until her phone screen was about to go up in smoke from pressing so much.","In the end, the other party deleted their account after being sprayed by her.","Shen Tang snorted coldly. “Hilarious. When I was an internet troll, you weren't even born yet!”","In her past life, she was employed by some big fans of idols because she was good at scolding people!","Shen Tang opened WeChat to ask Wang Brother how to handle this, before remembering that she had completely blocked him after the last audition.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","It was impossible for her to actively add him back to apologize.","After thinking twice, she contacted Cen Assistant to ask Gu’s law department for help prosecuting the matter.","Anyway it was free.","At the same time, she logged into her big Weibo account to directly respond:","Shen Tang V: I heard I was being kept by an old man? ps: Spreading rumors comes with legal liability.","【Hahaha isn’t it true??】","【You say it’s not so it’s not?】","【Do you think I believe you?】","Shen Tang didn’t bother with these comments. Those who went online without a brain just wanted to vent their emotions online like a mad dog.","Cen Assistant's speed was very fast. Shen Tang doubted life a little when she received his call.","\"That fast?\"","\"Mr. Gu had urged this before, Miss Shen please don't worry, leave this to Mr. Gu here and focus on filming.\"","Shen Tang didn’t expect Gu Huaian to have done so much for her.","She had previously thought...","\"Ok, please thank Mr. Gu for me.\"","\"You should thank him personally.\"","From this matter, it could be seen that Miss Shen was different in Mr. Gu's eyes. Otherwise, he would not have urged them personally to let Gu Group's legal team put down other things at hand and focus on serving this matter.","Shen Tang couldn't describe her current feelings.","When she opened Weibo again, the big Vs who had previously spread the news and some netizens who had particularly nasty comments had all received lawyer letters. Apologize and delete the posts or get sued.","Many people felt that Shen Tang was just putting on an act. After all, lawyer letters were nothing rare in the entertainment industry.","Some smarter people noticed that this lawyer team belonged to Gu Group. They hurried to apologize and delete posts.","It was known that Gu Group's legal team was top notch and had never lost before.","As for joking with you? Even less possible.","They were very busy with no time to deliberately scare you."]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Suspected Love Affair Exposed","paragraphs":["Shen Tang went downstairs and found that everyone was looking at her meaningfully.","She guessed they must have seen the hot search.","Shen Tang didn't know whether they believed it or not. Anyway, the innocent will prove themselves.","In this circle, there were all sorts of truths, half-truths, and rumors about everyone.","The director came over, \"We've been waiting for you, let's rehearse first.\"","\"Sorry, sorry.\"","Shen Tang was very professional and got into character quickly, and the actors acting with her also immersed themselves in their roles.","After a few scenes, everyone's impression of her also changed.","During this time, something happened - Yuan Yuan's mother was hospitalized with a sudden illness. She was an only child, so she had to leave the crew.","\"I'm sorry, Sister Tang Tang...\"","Yuan Yuan felt very guilty, but her mother's surgery had some risks, so she couldn't rest assured.","\"It’s okay, go ahead. I can handle it alone,\" said Shen Tang, who also transferred money to Yuan Yuan, \"Take good care of Auntie.\"","Yuan Yuan was deeply moved, and her eyes instantly turned red: \"Sister Tang Tang, I'll be back as soon as possible.\"","\"No rush, come back after your aunt gets better.\"","Shen Tang didn't have an assistant in her previous life either. She could also handle things alone.","In the next few days, she acted seriously and completely threw the hot search matter out of her mind.","She believed Gu Huaian would handle it properly.","The only thing that made her a little irritable was that Shen Xiuran had been a little strange recently, being nice to her in overt and covert ways.","For example, helping to bring breakfast, giving her a small fan, chatting with her when free. The meaning was very obvious.","But wasn't he the female lead’s attendant?","Why was he coming to her?","Shen Xiuran's status was much higher than Shen Tang's. He had won the Best Actor and Best Supporting Actor awards. Shen Tang didn’t understand why he had set his sights on her, a small-time celebrity.","It couldn’t be because of her looks, haha.","Because the two had a lot of scenes together, and Shen Xiuran seemed to deliberately pretend not to understand her overt and covert refusals, Shen Tang was very annoyed.","This also led to her running back to her room as soon as she was done with the scenes, not even daring to stay on set to study other people's performances.","Today after finishing shooting, Shen Tang was packing up to run when she was unexpectedly stopped by the third female lead.","The girl was a little embarrassed. \"Sister Tang Tang, sorry to bother you, could you help me rehearse?\"","\"Oh, of course.\"","Shen Tang never declined girls' reasonable requests.","The third female lead was called Li Xing. She was not a newcomer.","Because her face was not very recognizable, she was almost considered a faceless extra in the drama. This also led to the audience not recognizing who she was.","Li Xing asked Shen Tang to come to her hotel room to rehearse lines, and it was almost midnight when they finished.","Li Xing’s room was not far from Shen Tang’s room, just around the corner.","Shen Tang had just turned the corner when she saw an uninvited guest standing at her door.","Shen Xiuran had one hand in his pocket, leaning against the wall with one leg bent, head slightly lowered.","The corner of Shen Tang's mouth twitched. Did he think he looked handsome?","She suddenly remembered a line - That year I stood with one hand in my pocket, not knowing what an opponent was.","Thinking of this, Shen Tang almost laughed out loud.","Shen Xiuran looked up: \"What a coincidence.\"","Shen Tang looked at the room number expressionlessly: \"You're standing outside my room.\"","Shen Xiuran suddenly smiled and asked bluntly: \"Have you been avoiding me recently?\"","\"Yes.\"","Since no one else was around, Shen Tang didn't hide anything. \"To be honest, I don't know why you are approaching me, but your recent behavior has indeed caused me distress.\"","Shen Xiuran laughed softly.","To be fair, he looked pretty good, after all he was one of the male leads.","It was a pity that Shen Tang was used to looking at Gu Huaian. Otherwise, she might really have been charmed by his looks.","\"How heartbreaking. Haven't you noticed that I'm pursuing you?\"","\"I'm flattered, but I don't plan to date at the moment.\"","Shen Tang smiled slightly. \"Excuse me, I want to go back to my room.\"","Shen Tang took out her room card and opened the door. Just as she was about to close it after entering, Shen Xiuran reached out to stop her.","He looked a little aggrieved, \"Shen Tang, can't you give me a chance?\"","Apart from the fact that Shen Tang was already married, just the fact that Shen Xiuran was the canon male lead for the female lead was enough to make Shen Tang keep away from him.","\"I'm sorry.\"","Shen Xiuran sighed. \"Alright, I was disturbing you.\"","He let go and Shen Tang immediately closed the door swiftly.","She thought the matter had ended there, but there was still follow up.","When Shen Tang went downstairs the next day, she found everyone looking at her strangely, with mocking, gossiping, incredulous and jealous looks.","Wait, what’s with the jealous looks?!","Li Xing came over and asked quietly, \"Sister Tang Tang, are you and Shen Xiuran together?\"","\"Huh? No, why do you ask?\"","\"I saw photos online last night of you two talking...\"","\"Ah?\"","The crew couldn't have phones on set, so Shen Tang couldn't check now.","Always worrying about it in her heart led her to NG twice while filming.","Shen Tang realized this wouldn't work, so she quickly changed her state and acted seriously.","As soon as she finished her scenes, she ran back to her room.","As soon as she picked up her phone, she received a video call from Gu Huaian.","\"Mr. Gu?\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Do...you have something to discuss?\"","This was the first video call between them. Shen Tang felt a little awkward.","However, after not seeing him for a few days, she did miss Gu Huaian's good looks.","\"Have you seen the hot search?\"","\"Haven't had a chance.\"","\"Okay, take a look first then.\"","Shen Tang switched the video to the background, opened Weibo, and the third and sixth hot searches were about her and Shen Xiuran.","#Award-winning Actor Has Late Night Private Meeting With Actress#","#Shen Xiuran and Shen Tang’s Relationship Seemingly Exposed#","The photo was of her and Shen Xiuran chatting in the hallway. Shen Xiuran had his head lowered while she had hers slightly raised. The photo did indeed look quite picturesque.","If she wasn’t a party involved, she might have believed it too.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","What nonsense - nonsense to the extreme.","Wait, the angle of this photo...","Shen Tang's face sank. She couldn't believe that person had taken it.","As expected when she opened the comments section, they were all scolding her.","【Here it comes, the clout chaser is late but has arrived】","【Taking our brother without asking, can the clout chaser die further away】","【I give up, can Shen Tang die without a man?】","【No comment without full context】","【There are photos now, real proof. Shen Tang must have climbed onto Movie Star Shen’s thighs, otherwise how could she play the second female lead in Director Huo’s movie. Not just anyone can get cast. 】","【Did you guys forget about the sugar daddy incident? Shen Tang may not have been a mistress but must have connections. You guys still dare to gossip randomly, aren’t you afraid of being sued?】","Regarding the previous old man sugar daddy incident, most people deleted their Weibo posts and apologized with a pinned post. A tiny minority clung onto false hopes in the end and got reported.","It's worth mentioning some were students who cried and begged for forgiveness.","That incident had a huge impact. Some of Shen Tang's antis began to pipe down.","As for today's hot search, the public mostly remained neutral, not daring to make random comments.","Only Shen Xiuran's fans were jumping up and down, extremely angry.","What was scary was that some even shipped them as a couple.","Even scarier was the ship name called Auntie.","Shen Tang made a black guy question mark face. Was that ship name for real???","Were they sure it wasn't antis?"]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: You did It, didn't you","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian looked at Shen Tang's ever-changing expression on the screen and felt it was very vivid.","He actually knew this matter could not be true, but still wanted to call and ask.","Yet somehow he sent a video instead.","\"Did you see it?\"","Shen Tang frowned, \"How preposterous, and this photo...\"","The hotel they were staying at was booked by the crew, outsiders could not even get in.","Plus the time and angle of the photo, Shen Tang found it hard not to suspect that person.","Thinking of the call from Gu Huaian, Shen Tang was shocked, could he be suspecting her of having an affair!","\"Listen to my explanation!\"","\"Mm.\"","\"I have nothing going on with him! Really!\"","\"Mm.\"","Shen Tang then started complaining about how annoying Shen Xiuran was.","To be honest, the two of them barely had any contact outside of work.","If he said he really liked her, Shen Tang would not believe it at all.","She even somewhat suspected he wanted to be co-stars with her.","This was very common in the industry, but just because it's common does not mean it's right.","\"I really can't stand him, I suspect his brain is underdeveloped.\"","Having a crush on someone is not wrong, chasing someone is not wrong either, but when your actions bring distress to the person involved, then it's not right.","Shen Tang was truly annoyed.","Gu Huaian suddenly laughed.","\"Do you need any help?\"","Shen Tang shook her head, \"No need, I think I already know who is behind this.\"","Just lacking a confirmation, but Shen Tang felt there was a nine out of ten chance she was right.","After chatting with Gu Huaian for a while, with Shen Tang doing most of the talking and Gu Huaian quietly listening, Shen Tang finally hung up as it was getting late.","She was surprised to find herself not feeling constrained at all, instead rather comfortable.","After sitting by the bedside for a while, Shen Tang went out holding her phone.","Walking to the door of that person's room, she gently knocked.","\"Who is it?\"","\"It's me.\"","The door opened, Li Xing revealed a kindly smile, \"Sister Tang, what brings you here?\"","Shen Tang got straight to the point: \"It was you right.\"","Li Xing looked somewhat puzzled: \"Sister Tang, what are you talking about?\"","\"The photo.\"","\"What photo?\"","Shen Tang sighed, \"Li Xing, there's no point pretending anymore. That angle, and that timing, no one else could have done it except you.\"","Li Xing's smile slowly faded, \"You found out huh...\"","\"I want to know why, why did you take that kind of photo? I didn't offend you right?\"","Shen Tang did not believe she was unaware those things could only bring harm and no benefit.","\"You do as you please.\" There was no point talking further, Shen Tang turned to leave.","Returning to her room, she looked at the recording on her phone, expression somber.","She originally did not plan to pursue this matter, just let it cool off on its own.","However, she did not know what Shen Xiuran was thinking, he actually retweeted the photo posted by the gossip blogger, and said - it's shot quite beautifully.","Shen Tang was so anxious her hair was nearly falling out.","She opened WeChat, found Shen Xiuran, and asked:","【Obsessed Monkey Mother: Have you lost your mind?】","【Shen Xiuran: What's wrong?】","【Obsessed Monkey Mother: Why did you say that on Weibo? flipping-tables.jpg】","【Shen Xiuran: Pfft, Shen Tang are you still afraid of something like this?】","Seeing this sentence made Shen Tang feel somewhat uncomfortable.","The original owner often trended on Weibo because of things like this, but those were not of the original owner's own doing, they were the company's decisions, she had no choice.","【Shen Xiuran: And I didn't say much, just felt the photo was shot quite beautifully】","【Obsessed Monkey Mother: Forget it】","【Shen Xiuran: Don't worry, the hype will die down in a couple days】","【Obsessed Monkey Mother: I hope so】","After that, Shen Tang paid more attention.","But there were still many photos leaked from tricky angles.","The other party was also well prepared, mosaicking out parts that could not be exposed, leaving only Shen Tang's face clearly visible.","Not only were there photos of Shen Tang with Shen Xiuran, but also with Director Huo and other male actors from the crew.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She was speechless.","She even suspected the other party was her true love, having taken so many photos.","And in every photo, her face looked quite beautiful, 360 degrees leaving no blind spots.","I'm so good looking!","Wait, that didn't seem to be the point!","Shen Tang went to find Li Xing: \"Are you done yet?\"","Li Xing shrugged, \"Sister Tang, accusations require evidence. My phone is in my room, I didn't even bring it out.\"","Shen Tang looked at her, then walked over to Li Xing's assistant, reaching to grab her bag.","The assistant resisted forcefully, but was no match for Shen Tang's strength.","Shen Tang took a phone out of the assistant's bag, \"What's this then?\"","If she hadn't witnessed the little assistant secretly taking photos of her, she would not have recklessly come over.","\"Li Xing, I already gave you a chance.\"","Hearing this, Li Xing seemed somewhat flustered, but soon calmed herself.","\"Sister Tang, there's no law against taking photos right?\"","\"What do you think?\"","Shen Tang gave her a meaningful look, then turned to leave.","The little assistant was extremely nervous, \"Sister Xing, we won't get in trouble right?\"","She still remembered Shen Tang suing those people earlier, and was afraid.","Li Xing was also somewhat apprehensive, but still acted tough: \"What's there to be scared of? We didn't break the law.\"","However, in the subsequent filming, she kept messing up shots, or was on the verge of it.","The director cursed at her severely several times, and Li Xing glared fiercely at Shen Tang.","It was all her fault!","Shen Tang raised her brows, mouthed: \"Serves you right!\"","Li Xing felt her lungs were about to explode from anger!","Li Xing was unwilling to accept this. Why did Shen Tang with such a bad reputation still get to play the second female lead, while she tried so hard yet still failed to make it big.","Since Shen Tang liked to nitpick, she would let her nitpick to her heart's content.","Li Xing secretly looked at public opinion online, and seeing everyone scolding Shen Tang again, the stifled feeling in her heart finally dissipated somewhat.","Shen Tang, Shen Tang, isn't it good to keep lying in the mud, why must you crawl out to snatch her things?"]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Die","paragraphs":["Shen Tang figured out that she was destined to become a trending search term - no matter how trivial the incident, she would trend on social media.","Don't the netizens get tired of this?","Her Weibo comment section had already been occupied by melon-eating netizens, and even her past scandals were dug out.","What's more, Shen Tang felt that just looking at the photos, she had chemistry with every male celebrity.","Is it appropriate to say this?","Hahahaha.","Since Li Xing was unrepentant about this matter, Shen Tang would not be polite anymore.","However, this concerned the drama crew, so she could not act rashly and had to discuss it with the director first.","After hearing Shen Tang's intentions, Director Huo fell silent for a moment and said, \"I won't get involved in this. You are the victim, so do as you see fit.\"","\"Don't worry!\"","With the director's consent, Shen Tang took action.","She directly sent the previous audio recording to the legal department of the Gu Group and confronted Li Xing head-on on Weibo:","Shen Tang V: Care to explain? @Li Xing V","Li Xing did not expect Shen Tang to directly question her on Weibo.","She refreshed her Weibo feed multiple times. The comment section was already overrun, mostly by melon-eating netizens and some extremists cursing at her.","As for Shen Tang's fans, there didn't seem to be many.","Li Xing panicked a little but managed to calm herself down.","As long as she did not admit it, no one had evidence to prove it was her.","Seeing her assistant growing increasingly nervous beside her, a gleam flashed in Li Xing's eyes as she suddenly had an idea.","That night, Li Xing's assistant admitted her mistake online, claiming she had only casually taken the photos and did not know how they leaked. She conjectured that they might have accidentally leaked when she sent her phone for repair.","This excuse...how should I put it - who was she trying to fool?","Shen Tang smiled.","To be honest, she had anticipated that Li Xing would make her assistant take the fall.","That was also why she did not directly release the audio recording.","Netizens were not so easily fooled. This triggered their rebellious mentality instead.","The hype did not die down at all. Just when Li Xing began to relax, thinking Shen Tang had no follow-up moves, Shen Tang added fuel to the fire by releasing the audio recording.","Li Xing's Weibo was completely overrun.","【Still there? Come out and explain】","【Don't pretend to be dead. We know you can see this】","【Could it be that you are jealous she is prettier than you? I guess so. Your forgettable face says it all】","Regarding what happened to Li Xing, Shen Tang did not sympathize at all.","Firstly, Li Xing had brought this upon herself. Secondly, Shen Tang was no stranger to such incidents herself.","One could say this incident was not that major, yet it was rather malicious.","Li Xing's public image was completely ruined and those looking to collaborate with her would reconsider upon fear of getting backstabbed.","Shen Tang was quite satisfied with this punishment.","As for whether Li Xing was satisfied or not, Shen Tang had no idea.","Not long after showering, loud banging sounded on Shen Tang's room door.","\"Shen Tang! Open up!\"","\"I know you're in there. Don't pretend you can't hear me!\"","......","Realizing Shen Tang was not opening the door, Li Xing's tone changed from anger to desperate pleading, \"Shen Tang, I beg you, please open the door...\"","\"Let me apologize, okay?\"","\"Can you please explain things on Weibo...\"","Shen Tang inserted earplugs and put on an eye mask as she lay in bed, preparing to sleep.","Hilarious. As if she would open the door. What if something dangerous happened?","Moreover, she had given Li Xing a chance previously, it was Li Xing who failed to grasp it.","Shen Tang eventually fell asleep, though she was unaware when. She slept very soundly throughout the night.","The next day during filming, Shen Tang noticed two dark eye bags under Li Xing's eyes, clearly from lack of sleep.","Shen Tang looked away, avoiding looking at her.","Li Xing discovered everyone glancing at her occasionally, with strange looks in their eyes.","She couldn't help suspecting everyone was mocking her, badmouthing her behind her back, even saying she deserved this.","Li Xing was in poor condition today. The director scolded her many times before moving her scenes to later.","She glowered at Shen Tang who was still doing well. The hatred in her heart was almost overflowing.","Why?","Why did she get no sleep while Shen Tang slept so soundly?","Why did Shen Tang easily gain such high popularity from petty scandals while she worked so hard yet could not surpass Shen Tang?","Why, after all these years, was her status still below Shen Tang's, someone plagued by scandals?","The more Li Xing thought about it, the more discontented she felt. Upon seeing everyone chatting cheerfully with Shen Tang, her malice peaked.","Noticing the prop hook beside her, Li Xing grabbed and hid it behind her back as she slowly approached Shen Tang.","Seeing Li Xing come over, everyone stopped talking.","A flash of darkness shone in Li Xing's eyes.","\"Shen Tang, I want to apologize for my previous wrongdoings. Can you forgive me?\"","Shen Tang figured Li Xing deliberately said this in front of everyone, forcing her not to reject out of consideration for her image. Her intentions were as clear as day.","Too bad Shen Tang had no morals.","\"I can, but you have to publicly apologize to me on Weibo for three days straight.\"","Li Xing looked up. \"Sure, I'll do it n–\"","As she spoke, she swung the hook violently at Shen Tang's face!","I'll destroy this damned face of hers. She uses her looks to earn money!","The other girls screamed in horror while Shen Tang reflexively grabbed Li Xing's hand with one hand and used her other hand to shield her face.","In a split second, Shen Tang grasped Li Xing's hand tightly. \"Are you crazy!\"","Li Xing struggled violently to pull out the hook to no avail. Her wrist felt like it was about to snap.","\"Let go!\"","As if I'd let go and let her harm me again, Shen Tang thought.","\"Shen Tang, you're bleeding!\" the others exclaimed.","Only upon hearing them did Shen Tang realize her ear was aching badly. She touched it and her hand was covered in blood.","The pain hit her all at once and Shen Tang froze in shock.","Crap! Don't tell me my looks are ruined!","She still needed her face to earn money!","\"Quick, call an ambulance!\"","\"My god, has Li Xing lost her mind?\"","\"Ahhhhh!\"","Chaos ensued on set as Shen Tang was sent into an ambulance and rushed to the hospital.","Li Xing was restrained.","The rest called the police to handle the matter while sealing off the scene so news did not spread for the time being.","However, the paparazzi outside spotted the ambulance and reported it online.","Unsure who was injured, netizens began guessing wildly.","Shen Tang's friends also noticed the news.","Frankly, no one expected it to be her since she was so strong. According to the idiom, one force drops ten skills, she should have been invincible.","Someone snapped a photo of Shen Tang in the hospital with blood streaming down one side of her face and uploaded it online.","#ShenTangInjured# immediately topped the trending charts.","The injury looked severe with the blood loss but was not too critical in actuality.","The hook had cut her ear and surrounding area. The wounds were not too deep but she still needed time to recuperate.","As for potential scarring, the doctor said scar removal surgery was an option.","Shen Tang pressed her lips. She felt somewhat depressed.","Her face was the most valuable asset on her body, okay?"]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: On the Lust for Money and Lust.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang's WeChat kept ringing. She opened WeChat and found that everyone was sending messages to ask if she was okay, so she realized that the incident had made it to the hot search topics again.","Worried that her few fans might be concerned, Shen Tang specifically went to the fan group chat to explain and sent a photo showing that her wound had been bandaged.","Shen Tang V: Thank you everyone for your concern, I'm fine. Love.jpg","【How did you get hurt so badly! My god, just looking at it hurts!】","【How did Tang Bao get hurt? OMG, does her assistant not feed her...】","【Wahhh, Tang Bao, did it hurt?】","【Who is Shen Tang? How does she make it to the hot search topics every day? Did the hot search buy a house? Can her team stop buying hot search terms!】","Shen Tang responded individually to each fan, she didn't care about what other people said.","Her eyes inadvertently glanced at two long legs standing in front of her.","She raised her head, inevitably looking at a certain body part, quite big, cough cough.","Gu Huaian looked calm on the surface but was eager to sit in the chair next to him.","This woman!!!","Shen Tang tilted her head: \"What are you doing here?\"","【You got here pretty fast huh.】","【The big boss got injured too?】","Shen Tang looked him up and down.","\"I heard you got injured.\"","Gu Huaian was a little unhappy. He didn't like seeing her get hurt.","Shen Tang touched her wound and sucked in a breath from the pain.","\"I'm fine, the doctor said it wasn't serious.\"","【Ow! I almost ruined this face. What was Li Xing thinking, daring to attack in front of so many people】","【Well, I didn't do anything too outrageous】","Shen Tang doubted her life choices.","Gu Huaian's expression darkened. Li Xing huh, he made a mental note.","\"I'll take you to a private hospital for another checkup.\"","\"Ha? Um...I don't think that's necessary...\"","【It really is just a minor injury. After going to another hospital for an exam, the wound might already be scabbed over. 】","Of course, that was an exaggeration. The injury wouldn't heal that quickly.","\"Let's go. The hospitals under Gu Group are top notch. With the location of your injury, aren't you worried about scarring?\"","That happened to touch on Shen Tang's concerns.","\"Alright, thanks for the trouble then.\"","\"It's no trouble.\"","Gu Huaian extended his hand. Shen Tang used his strength to stand up.","The two of them walked out side by side.","However, quite a few people recognized Shen Tang. Someone took a photo of their backs and posted it on Weibo.","【They look so good together! A talented gentleman and beautiful lady! Shen Tang must have saved the galaxy in her past life!】","【Ooh, you can tell from the back view alone that he's very handsome!】","【You can't judge that for sure. She has quite a few exes too】","The two of them were oblivious as they hurried to the private hospital, got examined again, and had the wound re-bandaged.","Shen Tang was in so much pain that she grimaced and cried out.","【Ow! I should have known not to come for a second torment.】","【Wahhh, I wonder if this will affect my scenes going forward, will they dock my pay...】","Gu Huaian felt a little helpless. Even at this point she was still thinking about money?","\"Rest assured, I will settle this matter properly.\"","\"Thank you.\"","\"I already told you that you don't need to keep thanking me.\"","Shen Tang pulled up the corners of her lips.","【What's up with Gu Huaian? How come he keeps saying easily misunderstood things lately?】","【*sigh* Such eye candy right in front of me but I can only look, not touch, how annoying...】","【But he really does have a nice looking face. He was carefully crafted while I was just a lump of mud tossed aside...】","【Hmm wait, I'm not that bad actually】","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","When it came to greed and lust, Shen Tang was absolutely second; no one dared claim first place.","Because her face was injured, the upcoming shoots had to be postponed.","Shen Tang felt a little guilty about it.","Fortunately, everyone was quite understanding, no one blamed her. They simply moved all her scenes to a later date and would shoot others first.","As for Li Xing, she had already been fired by the crew for deliberately injuring someone and would spend time in jail.","It was too vicious of an incident. She would have to pay a huge sum and her career was over.","Shen Tang did not sympathize with her. These were all Li Xing's own choices.","After that, Shen Tang did not return to the set. Instead, Gu Huaian took her back home.","When Peach Sister and the twins saw the injury on Shen Tang's face they were scared witless.","\"Oh my god! How did this happen?!\"","\"Sis, does it hurt? Let me blow on it for you...\"","\"Sis, did someone bully you? I'll beat him up for you!\"","Shen Tang couldn't help showing a smile. Since coming to this world, it seemed her family kept growing.","\"I'm fine. The injury just looks worse than it is.\"","Peach Sister's brows furrowed into the character chuan 「川」: \"No no, come sit down, don't move around. Let me redo the meal plans. You can't just eat anything while injured.\"","She hurried off to the kitchen, muttering recipes the whole time.","The twins sat on either side of Shen Tang, leaving Gu Huaian standing awkwardly in place, about to sit down just now.","Gu Wuhen looked up in confusion. \"Uncle, why are you still here?\"","Gu Anran also glanced over. \"Uncle, don't you have work? Mom works very hard every day!\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","What a considerate pair of little cotton-padded jackets.","\"I'm heading to the company now. You two take good c—\"","Gu Huaian was cut off by Gu Wuhen. \"Oh stop nagging.\"","\"We know, we know. We'll take good care of Sis.\"","Shen Tang really wanted to weakly raise her hand and say that her injury was on her face. Her hands and feet were fine, she didn't need taking care of.","But seeing Gu Huaian getting blocked by the two little ones, leaving him unable to get a word out, she just wanted to laugh.","Gu Huaian's gaze suddenly shifted to her. Shen Tang quickly wiped the smile off her face, resulting in a somewhat twisted expression.","Gu Huaian seemed a little helpless. \"Then I'm leaving.\"","\"Bye Uncle.\"","\"Go on, go on.\"","\"See you tomorrow.\"","Gu Huaian's footsteps halted. So he was being told not to come back tonight either.","The two little ones lavished Shen Tang with care. She was able to sit back and relax, with everything brought to her. They just short of helping her to the bathroom and pulling down her pants.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","That won't be necessary!","It was worth noting that the two no longer called each other Little Handsome and Little Beauty, but had changed their names to Dragon Proud Sky and Dream Lapis Lazuli Snow.","What was scary was that they even asked her to call them by these names.","Shen Tang didn't know about the others, but her toes were curled and numb against the floor.","While eating, Shen Tang suddenly received a WeChat message from Yuan Yuan saying that Wang Brother had contacted her to ask Shen Tang to go to the company.","To be honest, Shen Tang didn't really want to go. Whenever Wang Brother contacted her, there was sure to be nonsense afoot.","But she was rather curious what harebrained scheme he was brewing this time.","Since it was already late, Peach Sister and the two little ones were reluctant for Shen Tang to go out alone.","Uncle He somehow summoned a female bodyguard from who knows where, over 1.7 meters tall with straight posture and expressionless face, giving off an imposing aura just standing there.","The girl nodded slightly. \"Madam, you can call me Xiao Yu.\"","Shen Tang enviously squeezed the girl's arm. \"Wow! Your muscles are so big!\"","Xiao Yu maintained her expressionless face, however her earlobes had quietly turned red.","Seeing this, Shen Tang covered her mouth and chuckled. Turns out she was a cute little shy thing!"]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: You Think you're really my brother","paragraphs":["\"What did you say?\"","Shen Tang cleaned out her ears, not believing what she just heard.","Wang Brother repeated, \"You go online and explain to everyone that this was an accident, then provide a letter of understanding.\"","Shen Tang was about to laugh from anger. She pointed at her own face, \"Can't you see my face is injured like this?\"","If not for her strong physique, her face would have been completely ruined, who knows if she would even be alive.","Wang Brother solemnly said: \"I'm doing this for your sake. You're already injured anyway, retaliation is meaningless. Why not take this chance to gain some benefits for paving the way for the future?\"","Shen Tang coldly laughed, \"I refuse!\"","Wang Brother was about to speak again when Shen Tang snapped, \"Moreover, I wonder if the benefits are even for me?\"","Shen Tang was just testing the waters, she didn't expect Wang Brother's eyes to actually flicker with evasion.","How dare he! She didn't even want to be the stepping stone for the female lead, let alone let others step on her to move up in the world!","\"You listen to me—\"","\"Wang Brother, I called you that because I looked up to you. Did you think you were really my brother? Let alone my actual brother would never do something like this, clinging onto me and sucking my blood dry. You wish beautifully!\" Shen Tang said.","Wang Brother's expression drastically changed, \"You ungrateful bitch!\"","\"Yes I am, lalalala!\" Shen Tang provocatively responded.","Wang Brother was furious and charged over to hit Shen Tang. Xiao Yu sent him flying with a kick, crashing into the cabinet behind them.","Shen Tang's eyes widened in amazement, extremely impressed, \"Whoa!\"","Wang Brother held his chest coughing nonstop, \"You... You...\"","Xiao Yu put her long leg down, \"He was going to hit you.\"","\"Yeah, thanks for helping just now!\" Shen Tang said.","Although she could've beaten him herself.","Shen Tang clicked her tongue, \"As expected a dog can't change its habit to eat shit. Don't bother calling me in the future if there's nothing important going on. Oh right, even if something comes up, still don't call me!\"","\"I'll boycott you! I'm boycotting you!\" Wang Brother said covering his chest, breathing heavily.","Damn, why was Shen Tang so disobedient now? He should've...","A flash of viciousness appeared in Wang Brother's eyes.","Shen Tang accurately captured it. She pretended to be scared, \"Oh my, I'm so frightened!\"","Her contract was going to end soon anyway. Boycott? Who's afraid of whom!","Besides, her cheap hubby is still around. He probably won't stand by right?","The two turned to leave. As soon as they opened the door, a woman came tumbling down.","The few sized each other up in awkward silence.","The woman embarrassedly laughed, \"Uh...lost my footing...\"","Shen Tang smirked, \"Oh, do be more careful from now on.\"","The woman got up and ran off. Only when she was back in her room did she heave a sigh of relief.","Just now, she was intentionally eavesdropping but didn't get to hear anything much before a \"pow\" happened.","It appears Shen Tang and Wang Brother still parted unhappily.","Either way, this was good news to her. Limited resources, one less competitor increased her chance of getting more.","On Shen Tang's end, as she headed downstairs, she noticed many sideway glances and stares at her.","Upon reaching the first floor lobby, she could see a sea of people gathered outside through the glass door.","As soon as they saw her, without exception, their eyes lit up in pleasant surprise.","If not for the security guards, they probably would've rushed in already.","This was the first time Shen Tang encountered such frightening scene.","She randomly grabbed a passerby and asked, \"Do you happen to know why the crowd outside is here?\"","Why did she feel like they were here for her?","\"Most likely the paparazzi and bystanders here to watch the show.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\" How did they know she was at the company?","Unless... they were invited by Wang Brother!?","Shen Tang walked toward the window, knocked on the glass, then took out her phone and typed 'Were you guys invited by Wang Brother?' for the crowd outside to see.","In response, they nodded.","Shen Tang then headed toward the door.","The moment the door opened, the crowd swarmed forth. The microphones were forcefully shoved in her face despite her facial injury.","\"Stop!\" Shen Tang raised her hand.","\"If anyone touches my wound, I won't answer any questions!\"","Everyone quieted down instantly.","After all, everyone was eagerly anticipating firsthand information on the gossip of Shen Tang and Li Xing spread all over the internet.","\"Get in line, one question per person.\" Shen Tang said.","The crowd exchanged perplexed glances with one another when a girl asked the first question, \"Was the one who visited you at the hospital your boyfriend?\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"Hang on, aren't the questions supposed to be about my injury?\"","The girl smiled awkwardly, \"The netizens are more concerned about your relationship status.\"","Shen Tang grew slightly uneasy. How should she respond? Lying wouldn't be good but full disclosure could be bad too.","\"Uhh...\"","Under everyone's scorching gaze, Shen Tang experienced the sweat-soaked hardship of Alexander when facing the Gordian knot.","Xiao Yu couldn't fully comprehend why it was such a struggle to say a simple sentence.","Shen Tang played it off with a dry laugh, \"What I can say is... I do like him quite a lot...\"","Technically, this wasn't lying since she neither confirmed nor denied any relationship.","Liking him isn't false at all either. Gu Huaian is so handsome, her biggest hope right now is to sleep with a man like him once before she dies.","Only then did the line of questioning shift to details about her assault incident.","Shen Tang provided full disclosure.","Someone from the crowd said, \"Shen Tang, don't you think you went a bit overboard? Li Xing wouldn't have tried to beat you to death if you didn't push her past her breaking point.\"","Shen Tang's expression darkened, \"Who said that?\"","No reaction from the crowd.","\"Have the guts to speak up?\"","\"Why should I reflect on myself and search my conscience? I gave her a chance but she repeatedly bullied me! So I should just put up with it? I owe her?\"","Normally in the public eye, it would be bad to say something like this. Most prefer to save face.","But Shen Tang refused to fall into the trap of hypocrisy.","\"Report however you wish. But I'll advise that truthfully reporting would be best. The legal department of the Gu Corporation doesn't show mercy!\"","She'd just go all-in on a bluff!","There was no harm in intimidating others with what they already know!","Subsequently, Shen Tang deliberately left what Wang Brother told her rather vague, giving the crowd some room for imagination.","By the time Wang Brother hobbled downstairs, baring the pain from Xiao Yu's kick, Shen Tang promptly concluded the interview.","Upon returning to her villa, Uncle He from the main house visited.","Although of the same flesh and blood, the He brothers resembled each other only in form but differed entirely in temperament. One stern, the other warm.","\"Madam.\" He Uncle greeted.","\"Uncle He.\" Shen Tang responded.","Shen Tang couldn't comprehend the purpose of Uncle He's visit, leaving her rather tense.","Seeing the pile of stuff and black card brought out by Uncle He, she came to some realization.","\"Lady ordered these sent specially after hearing of your injury. She's quite concerned.\"","Shen Tang hadn't expected news to travel as far back as the Gu's main house. Were her other scandals also made known there?","Her nerves couldn't help but be set on edge.","\"Please extend my gratitude to Mother and Uncle for me.\"","Was it her imagination or did Uncle He's mouth twitch just now?","Indeed, Shen Tang held grudges.","Moreover, why call someone 'Dad' when they don't even acknowledge her!","\"I'll convey it accordingly.\""]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Sister, what are you doing","paragraphs":["It had to be said, the Gu family was indeed wealthy and powerful, even the gifts they sent were extremely extravagant.","Shen Tang even thought about getting injured a few more times to realize financial freedom directly.","Of course, this was just a thought, she still couldn't bear to ruin this face of hers.","Besides, getting injured really hurt.","Moreover, to tell the truth, the reason why they gave her so many things was also because they were giving Gu Huaian face.","Without him, she would be nothing.","After sending off He Uncle, with nothing to do, she opened Weibo and as expected, she made the hot search again.","She didn't know if others were annoyed, but Shen Tang herself was a bit annoyed.","It was worth mentioning that those paparazzi didn't write nonsense, and she didn't know if they were intimidated by the power of the Gu Group, or if they had a change of heart.","She was more inclined to believe the former.","But what did this \"#Shen Tang brazenly professing her love#\" hot search mean?","Did she profess her love?","After carefully checking and seeing no exposure of Gu Huaian’s identity online, Shen Tang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","In addition, her deliberately vague words did take effect as expected.","Wang Brother's reputation was ruined, and many people took the opportunity to expose the bad things Wang Brother had done over the years - pimping, oppressing people, abusing power for personal gain, date rape, and so on.","It looked like he was going to jail.","After all, scumbags belonged in the place for scumbags.","Shen Tang took him off the blacklist, sent a congratulatory message over, and blocked him again.","Shen Tang was in a very happy mood. With Wang Brother in jail, he wouldn’t be able to sell her off like in the book, so she probably wouldn’t die either, right?","Although the plot had already deviated ten thousand eight hundred miles, Shen Tang still occasionally felt afraid.","\"Sister, sister?\"","Shen Tang came back to her senses, \"Wu, Dragon Proud Sky, what's up?\"","Oh my god, calling this name was really embarrassing, who understood?","\"Sister, sister, play Wangzhe?\"","\"Play!\"","\"Does Dream Pear Blossom · Light Snow not play?\"","\"Play!\"","After logging into the game, Shen Tang was surprised to find that Gu Huaian's rank had reached Diamond, although the rank was still very low, it was much better than Bronze.","Hiss, he couldn't have used a boosting service, could he!","Shen Tang didn't think much of it. Noticing that Miao Miao and her brother were also online, she directly pulled them into the room for a sweet squad battle.","Miao Miao turned on her mic at the first moment, \"Monkey sister, how come you haven't been on the game recently?\"","\"I was busy with work before, and had a little accident recently. Now I just happen to have time to play.\"","\"Ah? Is it serious? Monkey sister, if you need anything, you can tell me.\"","\"Thank you, I can handle it.\"","Shen Tang’s favorite was playing assassin jungler, squatting in the grass, flanking, and reaping, all in one go.","Miao Miao also learned to do bad things, always squatting unexpectedly to ambush people.","After the mid laner on the opposite side died several times in a row, he got extremely angry and scolded them for being despicable!","The few people had great fun playing, while a certain someone was not very happy.","Seeing Shen Tang go online to play games, he thought she would invite him, but in the blink of an eye, the room was full.","Gu Huaian pursed his lips and asked Assistant Cen, \"Why don't they take me along to play games?\"","Assistant Cen smiled awkwardly. How would he know the reason?","Was he supposed to say, it’s because you’re bad at the game?","Assistant Cen lightly coughed, \"Maybe the lady didn't notice...\"","He sighed to himself, a perfectly normal CEO, why has he been getting weirder and weirder recently?","Since there were two minors, the game didn’t last many rounds before ending.","Shen Tang exited the game directly without noticing Gu Huaian’s invitation.","It had to be said, rest days were simply blissful. Shen Tang was eating, sleeping, sleeping, and eating every day, playing a sweet squad battle before going to bed at night, and life was wonderful.","After a week, she had visibly gained a circle around her waist.","Pinched the soft flesh on her belly, Shen Tang was on the verge of tears.","\"What to do...\"","\"Madam, you are not fat,\" Tao Sister said.","Shen Tang heaved a sigh, \"I also feel that I'm not fat, I'm just afraid the director will feel I'm fat.\"","To tell the truth, she was not actually fat, it was just that gaining ten catties on camera made people look fat.","The wounds on her face recovered quickly, already scabbed over, itchy, and in order not to scar, Shen Tang barely kept her hands to herself and didn't scratch.","Now she had also gotten fatter, it was simply a double debuff.","Taking advantage of the few days of vacation left, Shen Tang prepared to strike fast – at least the belly fat had to go.","The two little ones were also very righteous, abstaining from snacks, preparing to accompany Shen Tang.","Shen Tang grabbed both little ones into her arms, \"Wuwuwu, I just know you two are the best!\"","\"But you two are still young and can't starve, so let's do this. You two supervise me, I'm afraid I can't control myself.\"","She had always been a glutton, diets were always three days of hard work and two days of slacking off, without perseverance.","Now that she was injured, she didn't really want to exercise either, so she could only make adjustments in her diet.","So in the morning she ate leafy greens, at noon she ate leafy greens, and went hungry at night.","By midnight, Shen Tang felt she could eat a whole cow.","Staggering, she walked downstairs into the dark kitchen. Just as she was about to open the fridge, she heard from behind her, \"Sister, what are you doing?\"","Shen Tang looked back and saw the two little ones standing at the kitchen door, staring at her silently.","She smiled awkwardly, \"Well, I was thirsty, and came down for some water. Why are you two still not sleeping?\"","Gu Wuyang yawned, \"Afraid you'll sneak some food at night.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She craned her neck insistently, \"How can that be? Am I that kind of person?\"","Gu Anran nodded in agreement, \"Of course sister is not that kind of person. It's late now, drink your water and go back to sleep.\"","Under the supervision of four eyes, Shen Tang drank half a glass of water, then dragged herself upstairs back to her room.","After waiting for a while, she snuck out again quietly. Seeing no one there, she tiptoed downstairs, hunched over.","\"Sister, what are you going to do again?\"","It was only then that Shen Tang realized the two little ones were sitting on the sofa in the living room.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She couldn't help but start reflecting - what kind of impression had she left them that she was so untrustworthy?","Although... it did seem rather untrustworthy ha.","Shen Tang sighed, “I’ll start working out tomorrow, dieting alone doesn’t seem to work.”","“We’ll accompany you!”","“Sister, keep it up!”","This time, after Shen Tang returned to her room, she didn't sneak out again.","She just couldn't fall asleep hungry, lying in bed counting sheep.","\"One sheep, two sheep, three sheep... stewed mutton, roast lamb leg, lamb skewers...\"","She didn't know when she finally fell asleep. Anyway, her dream was a full lamb feast, but she just couldn't seem to eat any of it no matter what.","Under the conscientious supervision of the two little ones the next few days, Shen Tang finally thinned down.","By now, her wounds had also healed just about.","This meant the end of her blissful days and time to return to the crew.","Gu Anran was a little reluctant, \"Sister, can I come along with you?\"","\"Sister is going to work, it will be tough, but my scenes are almost done filming. I’ll come back to accompany you when I’m done okay?\"","\"Okay then.\"","Although Gu Anran was somewhat disappointed, she still nodded obediently.","Gu Wuyang's eyes turned. He leaned over to Gu Anran's ear and said something. Her eyes instantly lit up.","Shen Tang was curious, \"What are you two whispering about?\"","The two little ones looked at each other, \"Nothing!\""]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: She won't like Shen Xiuran","paragraphs":["Shen Tang returned to the crew and received care and concern from everyone, including the staff, who sent her many small gifts.","In fact, when she first arrived, many people objected to her joining the cast due to her previous reputation.","Fortunately, after working together for a while, everyone's opinion of her changed after getting to know her.","Director Huo looked closely at Shen Tang's face and saw that the wound was very faint and could be covered with makeup, which made him feel relieved.","Shen Tang was a little nervous. \"Don't worry, Director, the wound is no problem.\"","\"Okay, get ready. We start shooting tonight.\"","\"Got it!\"","Shen Xiuran walked over. \"Congratulations.\"","Shen Tang smiled. \"Thank you.\"","Shen Tang noticed the third female lead was replaced by another girl. She was very cute with a little pear vortex on her cheek.","When the girl saw Shen Tang, her eyes shone brightly. \"Sister Tangtang, can I call you that?\"","\"Sure.\"","Hearing Shen Tang agree, the girl's mouth turned up in a huge smile.","\"Sister Tangtang, I'm your fan. My name is Xu Jiaojiao. Can you...sign an autograph for me?\"","As she spoke, the girl took out a notebook.","Shen Tang took the pen but noticed the notebook only had blank pages so she didn't sign it right away.","She raised an eyebrow. \"Don't you have any other paper?\"","\"No. What's wrong with this paper?\"","Shen Tang looked at her steadily. Her eyes were clear and innocent as if she really didn't understand.","As a public figure, could she really not know?","Still, it was best to be cautious.","Shen Tang explained it to her and the girl's face immediately turned red.","She stuck out her tongue. \"Sorry, Sister Tangtang. I don't really understand this stuff.\"","\"It's alright. So what do you like about me anyway?\"","Xu Jiaojiao whispered in a tiny voice, \"Your face. I'm a fan of your looks.\"","Saying so, she glanced at Shen Tang's face again before lowering her reddened face.","Shen Tang thought her face was good-looking but not to the extent of charming everyone.","Still, it wasn't strange for some people to like her looks, since she also liked watching pretty young ladies.","The two quickly became familiar with each other. Jiaojiao followed Shen Tang everywhere like a stalker.","Even the crew joked that Shen Tang had gained a little fangirl.","Shen Tang neither confirmed nor denied it, while Jiaojiao would blush.","One night they were shooting a night scene and got caught in a downpour before they finished.","Shen Tang returned to her room drenched and had just finished bathing when someone knocked on her door.","Shen Tang opened it to find Jiaojiao holding a pillow.","\"It's so late. What's the matter?\"","Jiaojiao hesitated. \"Sister Tangtang, can I sleep with you tonight?\"","Seeing Shen Tang didn't react, Jiaojiao's eyes reddened slightly. \"I've been scared of thunder since I was little. Here, besides you, I don't know anyone else. Never mind if it's inconvenient.\"","Shen Tang stepped aside. \"It's no trouble. Come on in.\"","Seeing Jiaojiao enter, Shen Tang closed the door, her gaze slightly meaningful.","Shen Tang had wanted to see what she was up to but Jiaojiao simply went to sleep.","At some point, Shen Tang fell asleep too.","She had sweet dreams all night.","The next morning when Shen Tang woke up, Jiaojiao was no longer in the room.","There was a sticky note on the table that said, \"Thanks Sister Tangtang for putting me up. I didn't know what you like to eat so I just bought some random stuff.\"","Shen Tang looked at the breakfast - it was quite abundant and most were foods she enjoyed.","It looked like the girl had done her homework.","Shen Tang didn't know what Jiaojiao's motives were, whether good or bad, so for now she decided to be vigilant.","When Shen Tang got to the set, Jiaojiao was in the middle of shooting a scene.","Her skills were much better than the previous third female lead, Li Xing's.","Looking at Jiaojiao's innocent face, Shen Tang couldn't help but wonder if she was overthinking things.","Soon Jiaojiao finished and came trotting over.","\"Sister Tangtang, how did I do?\" She held her head high like a little peacock waiting to be praised.","\"Very good.\"","What Shen Tang said was the truth.","Jiaojiao smiled from ear to ear.","After that, Shen Tang worked overtime shooting scenes and didn't have time to think about irrelevant things.","Jiaojiao didn't do anything out of the ordinary which also caused Shen Tang to gradually lower her guard.","It was just that every time it rained, Jiaojiao would come over to sleep and hug Shen Tang tightly at night.","Shen Tang suspected the girl wanted to strangle her.","One day as Shen Tang went downstairs, she suddenly heard noisy voices.","Following the sound, she discovered a man criticizing a girl.","\"Can you do your job or not? If not, get lost!\"","\"Do you know these clothes have to be used every day? You ruined them and still have the nerve to cry?\"","\"I can't believe you! All you know is cry. Can't you open your mouth and say a word?\"","The girl cried piteously, her eyes red: \"Sorry, sorry...\"","\"It really wasn't me. It was already damaged when I got here...\"","Shen Tang took a look at the clothes and surprisingly it was her costume, torn with a big hole.","Judging by the edges, it looked like it was cut by something sharp.","Shen Tang couldn't help speculating - was this targeted at the girl or herself?","\"Is there no surveillance nearby?\"","The man sighed. \"Only the hallway has cameras, not inside the rooms.\"","Shen Tang nodded.","She looked at the girl who was sobbing uncontrollably, pitiful as can be.","\"Stop crying. It's no big deal. It can be patched up.\"","The girl choked out, \"How to patch?\"","\"Let me do it. Got any needle and thread?\"","\"Yes!\" The girl hurried to grab some.","The tear wasn't too big so with some simple stitching it should be alright.","Shen Tang's needlework skills weren't bad. She patched up the costume in no time.","\"It should be passable now.\"","It was difficult to notice anything amiss on the black garment without scrutiny.","The girl looked timidly at the man. \"Brother Chen, is this okay?\"","Brother Chen waved his hand. \"Should be fine. As long as filming isn't delayed.\"","Delaying the production schedule by one day would cost the production team a lot more money.","\"Be more careful from now on. One more mistake and you can pack up and go home.\"","\"Got it!\"","After Brother Chen left, the girl breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Thank you so much, Sister Tangtang. If not for you, I would've been fired.\"","\"Just be careful from now on.\" Shen Tang didn't bother finding out who exactly damaged the clothes. After all, the tear wasn't big and it wasn't that serious an issue.","If she made a big fuss out of a small matter, it would only make her seem petty.","The girl nodded vigorously. She didn't dare make any more mistakes again. This job didn't come easy and she couldn't lose it.","Still, in the days that followed, Shen Tang paid more attention to things going on around her.","And she discovered something amusing.","Whenever she had scenes with Shen Xiuran, the look in Jiaojiao's eyes would be somewhat complicated.","Shen Tang wondered if it was possible she had a crush on Shen Xiuran!"]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Don't listen, don't listen, son of a bitch.","paragraphs":["After her guess, Shen Tang set about verifying it. As a result, she had been walking rather close to Shen Xiuran these days.","Xu JiaoJiao would always find ways to chime in once or twice, which could be passed off as coincidental. But when it happened many times, it was obviously suspicious.","That day, after their scenes ended, Shen Tang ran over to Shen Xiuran's side again.","Shen Xiuran licked his back molars and raised an eyebrow: \"What's the matter? Regret rejecting me?\"","To be honest, his sleazy manner disgusted Shen Tang.","She quickly said: \"Regret is out of the question. It will never happen in this lifetime.\"","Shen Xiuran's expression was somewhat ugly. \"Then why are you coming over?\"","\"Well... I heard that Teacher Shen, you are very skilled in acting. I wanted to learn from you.\" Shen Tang smiled awkwardly. She could hardly tell him she was here to conduct an experiment!","Shen Xiuran let out an arrogant \"hmph\". \"You have a lot left to learn.\"","\"Sister Tang Tang, Master Shen, what are you guys talking about?\"","Xu JiaoJiao came bouncing over.","Shen Tang gave a knowing smile.","Shen Xiuran looked deeply at Shen Tang, and said: \"We were discussing what to eat for dinner tonight.\"","\"Ah, I know a hot pot restaurant nearby that is delicious. Why don't I treat you guys!\"","For a moment, Shen Tang was shocked, because she loved eating hot pot very much.","\"Sure, it's a deal then.\"","\"Wait, when did I agree to this?\" Did she say yes?","Xu JiaoJiao let out a disappointed \"ah\". \"Sister Tang Tang, come on, don't you love eating hot pot?\"","\"I don't.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Tang clearly saw a fleeting astonishment flash across Xu JiaoJiao's face.","Just who was she!","\"You can try it. Hot pot is really delicious.\"","Shen Tang stared straight at Xu JiaoJiao, staring at her until she became nervous, before finally loosening her mouth: \"Fine, let's eat then!\"","That night, after the three of them suited up, they drove to the hot pot restaurant.","At this time, the hot pot restaurant was quite crowded. Fortunately, they had booked a private room beforehand.","At first, Shen Tang was rather listless.","On the contrary, Xu JiaoJiao was very enthusiastic, helping to pick food for Shen Tang.","Shen Tang kept feeling something was off.","But the hot pot was too delicious. Her appetite instantly soared, and by the end, her stomach was round from all the eating.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Who would believe now if she said she didn't like eating hot pot?","Shen Xiuran looked over mockingly. Swordmaster Liang, you said you didn't know any martial arts!","Ah no, Shen Tang, you said you don't like eating hot pot!","Xu JiaoJiao was also extremely delighted, her expression clearly showing: I knew you'd love to eat it!","Shen Tang covered her face in embarrassment. Damn, her awful self-control!","After the meal, Shen Xiuran left first. Shen Tang and Xu JiaoJiao wandered around the mall for a bit longer.","Suddenly, Shen Tang caught sight of a somewhat familiar figure.","On reflex, she grabbed Xu JiaoJiao and hid to the side, tilting her head down to peek.","Xu JiaoJiao was somewhat confused: \"Sister Tang Tang, what's wrong?\"","\"Sh!\"","Glancing furtively, Shen Tang managed to see his profile. It was indeed Gu Huaian.","Even if his face turned to ashes, she would still recognize him!","Beside him stood an extremely beautiful woman with scarlet red lips and a perfect figure.","The two of them were walking down a flight of stairs, chatting and laughing together, seemingly quite close.","Shen Tang found it strange. The book didn't write about Gu Huaian finding true love so quickly.","Also, the book hardly described anything about him, focusing most of the writing on the female lead and male leads' love-hate entanglements instead.","And moreover, the plot had already changed so much since she transmigrated into the book. It wouldn't be surprising for Gu Huaian's love storylines to change either.","Shen Tang hid far behind them to peek like a despicable little thief.","\"Sister Tang Tang, do you know that person?\"","\"Mm, he's my boss.\"","Xu JiaoJiao took another glance. From her manner, she clearly didn't look like she was watching her boss.","But she politely didn't inquire further.","After Gu Huaian's group walked far away, Shen Tang turned to Xu JiaoJiao. \"Sorry, something came up suddenly. I can't accompany you shopping anymore. Let's make plans another time.\"","After saying this, without waiting for Xu JiaoJiao's response, Shen Tang hurried away while using her bag to hide her face, secretly following them.","Xu JiaoJiao watched the disappearing figure, then looked at Shen Tang, pressing her lips together displeasedly.","Shen Tang rushed downstairs, and the figures quickly disappeared from sight.","She looked left and right but couldn't find anyone. Annoyed, she angrily stamped her foot, accidentally twisting her ankle in her shoe.","\"Ow!\"","She sucked in a breath of cold air from the pain, hobbling over to a chair to sit down and rest.","Damn, how unlucky.","She recalled the scene from earlier again. The man and woman did look quite well-matched.","She didn't mind Gu Huaian finding true love, but her contract period wasn't up yet!","If Gu Huaian broke the contract, would she still get her money?","The more Shen Tang thought about it, the more upset she felt. It was such a huge sum of money. Surely she wouldn't lose it just like this...","\"Why are you crying?\"","How strange, she was even hallucinating Gu Huaian's voice now...","Wait, she was crying?","Shen Tang touched her face. Only then did she realize her face felt damp—she really was crying tears.","Shoot! Her eye makeup must be smudged!","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","\"Stop crying. Look up.\"","Shen Tang raised her head. Gu Huaian and the beauty were standing right in front of her.","【Hiss—Did they come to confront me!】","Shen Tang bolted to run away.","As long as she didn't hear it, the money would still be hers!","But she had only taken two steps before getting picked up by the waist. \"You're injured yet still being so unruly.\"","Shen Tang hurriedly covered her ears. I can't hear, I can't hear, chanting scriptures to a tortoise.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Beside them, the great beauty watched the two with amusement. \"Huaian, won't you introduce us?\"","\"Shen Tang, this is my sister.\"","\"I don't care what she is to yo—sister?\"","......","A while later, the three of them were sitting inside a cafe.","Shen Tang smiled extremely awkwardly, not even daring to lift her head, truly embarrassing herself to death.","She had actually thought this beauty was Gu Huaian's true love, never expecting her to be his sister!","\"Wuyang and Anran told me you've been very good to them.\"","Thinking about how the two little ones had wholeheartedly served her, Shen Tang felt even more guilty.","\"It was nothing much...\"","\"You don't have to be modest. I know what those two are usually like.\"","Gu Qingan took out a jewelry box from her bag and slid it over. \"Sorry our first meeting was so rushed. This is for you, see if you like it.\"","Just looking at the packaging, Shen Tang could tell it was expensive. She hurriedly declined, \"This is too valuable, I can't accept it.\"","\"Don't worry, I designed this myself, it's not worth much money. I feel it suits you very well, try it on.\"","Upon hearing it was a self-designed piece, admiration flashed through Shen Tang's eyes. She was so incredible!","Opening the jewelry box, the bracelet was extremely beautiful—simple yet cute. She couldn't help but love it.","\"Thank you, sister. I really like it.\"","\"As long as you like it.\"","Gu Qingan didn't stay too long. After taking a call, she apologetically took her leave.","Only then did Shen Tang look towards Gu Huaian. \"How did you know I was there?\"","Recalling the noisy mental voices he had heard from quite a distance away, Gu Huaian sighed.","\"Coincidence.\"","\"Also, why do Wuyang and Anran take on your sister's surname?\"","Generally speaking, prestigious families had more rules, like how people of the same surname couldn't marry and other weird taboos.","Shen Tang had only casually asked out of curiosity. She didn't expect Gu Huaian's expression to instantly turn gloomy.","She quickly changed her words: \"Sorry, I overstepped. If you don't wish to talk about it, nevermind.\"","\"It's not like it's particularly private either...\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: She's not gonna like you","paragraphs":["Gu Qing'an was very strong-willed since she was five years old. From a young age to adulthood, she had always been rather overbearing, so many people did not like her personality.","The Gu family business was huge, so they did not need political marriages. Therefore, the girls only needed to find someone they liked to marry.","Although Gu Qing'an was strong-willed, she was also naive.","When she was out with friends one time, she was drugged and taken advantage of by so-called friends. She escaped and was saved by a frugal and hard-working student with high grades.","The two got to know each other and gradually developed feelings after more interactions.","Upon hearing this, Shen Tang suspected that this was a story of a rich lady falling in love with a self-made man.","Just as she thought this, she noticed that Gu Huaian seemed to glance at her.","\"Within his ability, he treated my sister very well. However, at that time, many people opposed their relationship, including me. I felt that he was approaching my sister with ulterior motives, until that incident happened...\"","When Gu Qing'an and her boyfriend were graduating from college in their fourth year, they had promised to go back to their hometown together after graduation.","The man's home was in a mountain village. He was raised by his grandmother and was the only college student from that village.","However, when they returned, they discovered that his grandmother was paralyzed in bed with bedsores all over her body and starving with skin and bones.","The man was furious. He then found out that the money he sent back every month had been embezzled by their neighbor.","The couple decided to take the grandmother with them and provide care.","The grandmother refused as she felt she would be a burden, but her objections were ineffective.","On their way leaving, the neighbor's son was angry that his source of money was gone. He drove his van to hit them.","The man protected Gu Qing'an tightly in his arms at the cost of his own life and his grandmother's. They died at the scene.","Shen Tang was shocked that it turned out to be a tragedy.","She regretted her damned curiosity for prying into another person's old wound.","\"I'm sorry...\"","\"It's okay. It's all in the past, and that family has been punished. Just don't mention it in front of my sister. She puts on an unconcerned attitude but is actually very sensitive.\"","Otherwise, she would not have buried herself in work after giving birth.","All these years, she had been overseas and never came back until recently when she heard he was getting married. Only then did she transfer her work back to China.","Shen Tang nodded in understanding.","She could not understand how there could be such bad people.","\"So Anran and Wuyu...\"","\"They are his unborn children. You can also tell from their names that my sister's greatest wish is for the two of them to be safe and sound.\"","Shen Tang's tears kept flowing. The most painful thing in the world is for loving people to be eternally separated.","This also affirmed Shen Tang's heart that did not understand love. What if she transmigrated back one day? Wouldn't she also be separated from her lover by two worlds?","Shen Tang sniffed and nodded heavily. From now on, she would only sleep with people, not fall in love.","Gu Huaian: \"???\"","\"It's not necessary to give up eating due to choking.\"","\"You don't have to tell me, I understand!\" Shen Tang's eyes grew even firmer.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He suddenly regretted what was going on?","The two chatted for a long time before heading back to the hotel late at night.","Just as they arrived at the hotel lobby, Shen Tang discovered that Xu JiaoJiao was still there.","Hearing the sound, Xu JiaoJiao looked up and excitedly ran over to hug Shen Tang's arm tightly.","\"You're back!\"","\"Why are you here?\"","\"Waiting for you.\" Having said that, Xu JiaoJiao revealed a shy, bashful smile.","Shen Tang felt something was not right. She extricated her arm from Xu JiaoJiao's embrace, \"Um, it's late, let's go upstairs first.\"","While riding the elevator up, Shen Tang noticed that Xu JiaoJiao kept giving her inadvertent glances.","The hair on Shen Tang's skin were standing up.","After a quick goodbye, she hurried back into her room and locked the door tightly. She couldn't wait to take out her phone and ask her friend what was going on.","With conspiracy theories filling her brain, Qi Yue went on elaborating more and more horribly frightening speculations.","On the contrary, Huo Yingying had seen a lot more of the world with deeper experience. She gave Shen Tang an unexpected speculation —","\"Could she have fallen for you?!\"","She's fallen for me?!","Fallen for me?!","Fallen for you?!","Shen Tang's brain went blank directly with the CPU nearly burnt out.","\"That can't be...\"","\"Then tell me, isn't she always sticking to you? Doesn't she always squeeze herself in whenever she sees you with someone else?\"","\"Yes...\"","\"Then that's it. She likes you!\"","Shen Tang's jaws dropped without a word for quite a while. \"I'm a bit dumbfounded...\"","On the other end, Huo Yingying already started her fanfiction on their relationship.","\"I would never have expected a lesbian right by my side!\"","\"She must have been absolutely infatuated with you!\"","\"Ahhh it feels so sweet, so sweet!\"","\"Sigh... Tangtang, you really attract everyone, men and women alike...\"","But Shen Tang still felt something was not right. She did not think Xu JiaoJiao looked at her with feelings of affection. On the contrary, her gaze seemed almost fanatic.","\"No no no, it must be a misunderstanding.\"","Shen Tang felt unsettled. It would not do keep speculating wildly like this. She decided to ask directly.","Arriving at Xu JiaoJiao's door, Shen Tang took a deep breath and gently knocked on the door. Sounds of footsteps rang out before the door opened.","\"Tangtang, why are you here?\"","\"I... have something I'd like to ask you, do you mind if I come in?\"","\"Of course not!\"","Stepping into the room, Shen Tang discovered everything looked normal without anything out of the ordinary.","\"May I ask directly, do you have feelings for me?\"","\"Yes, I like you a lot.\"","\"In what way?\"","Xu JiaoJiao paused briefly in surprise before bursting out in loud laughter with tears flowing out.","\"Pffft Tangtang, could you have misunderstood something?\"","Shen Tang felt rather embarrassed. \"So there's nothing going on?\"","Xu JiaoJiao rolled her eyes with an impish grin, \"There is!\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Haha, just kidding! You're so adorable...\"","\"Then why do you keep...\" Although very embarrassed, Shen Tang still wanted to understand what was going on.","Xu JiaoJiao sighed. \"I don't know if you'd believe me if I told you...\"","\"Ah?\"","\"Actually, I have reincarnated.\"","She didn't actually know whether it was reincarnation or a fleeting dream.","If it were a dream, it would have felt too real.","Seeing Shen Tang's lack of response, Xu JiaoJiao shrugged. \"See, I told you that you wouldn't believe me.\"","\"I believe you. Can you tell me what happened in your previous life?\"","Why wouldn't she believe it? With Shen Tang crossing into a book herself, having someone else reincarnate was nothing strange.","Shen Tang was unaware whether Xu JiaoJiao reincarnated in the first cycle without her crossing in or the second cycle after she crossed. If it was the second cycle, then she might be able to learn something about the future from this.","\"My previous life...\"","Xu JiaoJiao gazed ahead as her thoughts slowly drifted away.","In her previous life, she was a minor celebrity without resources or connections. After acting in this drama, she managed to ride the wave of popularity.","However, good times did not last. Some investor eyed her, so the company started bringing her out to drink and entertain clients.","Although she upheld her principles, she still could not avoid being taken advantage of by roving hands.","At another dinner banquet, a fat-headed man with big ears put his hand on her thigh to grope about while trying to pour alcohol down her throat.","By then she had already drunk until she felt like vomiting with stomach cramps and a dizzy head. She declined again and again.","The man was about to force the drink on her.","It was Shen Tang who saved her like an angel sent from heaven.","In her muddled state, she witnessed Shen Tang give that man a good beating before bringing her to the hospital to pump her stomach.","While it might have been a small matter to Shen Tang, it was a life-changing event for her.","If not for Shen Tang, terrible things could have happened to her - things she did not dare imagine.","Shen Tang scratched her head. \"So you came to like me because of that?\"","Xu JiaoJiao smiled and nodded. \"Yes, we later became best friends. I knew all your preferences and you helped clear the way forward for me...\"","As she spoke, tears flowed from Xu JiaoJiao's eyes.","How could she have been so uncontented in her previous life?","Fortunately, fortunately..."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Congratulations on the Killing","paragraphs":["Shen Tang always felt that Xu JiaoJiao's state was a bit off, but she didn't seem to be lying. If she encountered this kind of thing, she would definitely stand up for justice.","She couldn't help but want to ask if she had a boyfriend in her previous life, but then thought, if she knew in advance, it wouldn't be as fun, so she'd just let nature take its course.","Seeing Xu JiaoJiao cry, she panicked to comfort her, \"Why are you crying?\"","\"I'm just a little relieved,\" said Xu JiaoJiao.","Xu JiaoJiao threw her arms around Shen Tang, and continued in her heart: I'm relieved that nothing has happened yet, I'm relieved that I still have a chance to start over.","In my previous life, I was blinded and plotted with the enemy to harm Shen Tang.","She would never forget that day when Shen Tang gripped the wine glass tightly and asked her sincerely, \"Do you really want me to drink it?\"","Seeing her nod, a tear flowed from the corner of Shen Tang's eye, but she drank it all in one gulp anyway.","At that moment, she already regretted it, but it was too late.","Although nothing happened to Shen Tang, she could not forgive herself, and the two of them broke up.","Xu JiaoJiao held Shen Tang tightly. In this life, she would redeem herself properly.","After getting to the bottom of her doubts, Shen Tang slept well that night.","They were nearing the end of filming, and would soon wrap up shooting.","During this period, a few minor incidents occurred, like accessories or makeup items being tampered with. Fortunately there were no major incidents.","To be cautious, Shen Tang stopped using the tampered makeup items, and even specially installed a small camera in her makeup room. Unexpectedly, it did come in handy.","That morning, as usual, Shen Tang first checked everything before starting on makeup and costumes.","Unexpectedly, she discovered a problem as soon as she looked.","A man wearing a duck bill cap had pried the lock and sneaked in. First he added something to the makeup, then took apart some threads in the costume.","Shen Tang found the costume. The unraveling wasn't obvious, but the costume could no longer be worn. With just a little force, it might rip.","If not for her recent cautiousness, she surely would have fallen into the trap.","Shen Tang wearily pinched her brow. She wasn't the female lead, so how did she run into so much trouble just shooting a drama?","Although unwilling to disturb the director, there was no choice. She had to let her know about this.","And who knows what was added to the makeup.","Shen Tang had someone take it for testing.","Director Huo also didn't expect so many incidents with the crew.","But Shen Tang was the victim here, it wasn't her fault.","\"Investigate it,\" said Director Huo.","Although there was video footage, the person was dressed all in black with a duck bill cap, and you could only see half his chin, so he was difficult to identify.","There were a lot of blind spots in the set’s surveillance system.","“It looks now like the person was likely an outsider,” Director Huo frowned.","This incident was frightening. Fortunately so far it was only tampering with items without harming anyone. Otherwise the consequences would be unimaginable.","Shen Tang couldn’t resist secretly asking Xu JiaoJiao if this had happened in their previous life.","Xu JiaoJiao shook her head, her complexion pale. “I don’t know...”","She was now starting to doubt whether this rebirth was real or fake.","Before joining the crew, she had suddenly gained some memories. She had firmly believed it was rebirth. But now she discovered reality was somewhat different from her dreams.","What was going on here?","Could it be she hadn’t rebirthed?","\"Don't worry, don't worry. Whether it's rebirth or whatever, who cares. Living well in the present is most important,\" Shen Tang consoled.","Xu JiaoJiao murmured, \"You're right...\"","Shen Tang called the police.","The police took the remaining makeup for testing. The results would take a few days.","As for that person, it wasn’t certain if he could be found either, since he seemed quite familiar with the local surveillance situation.","When Gu Huaian learned of this incident, he immediately sent over his bodyguard Xiao Yu.","Shen Tang had originally thought the set would be safe this time. Unexpectedly there were still problems.","Xiao Yu arrived quickly. Shen Tang told others she was her new assistant.","After all, Tao Sister’s mother’s surgery was successful, but she hadn’t fully recovered yet.","Having Xiao Yu around was very reassuring.","But this girl could really eat. Shen Tang seriously suspected Gu Huaian had sent her over to save on food expenses.","A few days later, Shen Tang wrapped up shooting and received a big red envelope from Director Huo.","\"Congratulations on wrapping up filming!\"","\"Thank you!\"","\"Sister Tang, let's keep in touch!\"","\"Sure!\"","\"Let's play games when we're free.\"","\"Don't worry, sister will raise your rank!\"","......","Shen Tang couldn't have dreamed she'd have such a harmonious relationship with the crew. On her way out, she was loaded down with all kinds of stuff they gave her.","On the ride home, Shen Tang received the message that the test results were out.","The things added to the makeup were glue and jy.","The jy was added to the lotion. If you didn't look closely, you really couldn't tell.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She nearly vomited.","How disgusting!","What a psycho to add this stuff!","Shen Tang didn't even want to tell others about it, but Gu Huaian still found out.","Over the phone, his voice was low and tense. \"Don't worry, I'll find out who this person is working for.\"","\"Thanks. I also want to know what this pervert was trying to do.\"","After hanging up, Shen Tang took a few deep breaths to calm herself.","There was no need to be depressed over some perverted psycho.","Returning to the villa, Shen Tang discovered no one was home.","\"Sister Tao?\"","\"Uncle He?\"","\"Wuyang?\"","\"Anran?\"","Not a soul around. How strange.","Shen Tang went upstairs to her room. Just as she pushed the door open, there was a loud \"pop\" by her ear, followed by everyone shouting \"Surprise!\" Then shards of firework debris lightly pattered down on her head.","\"Congratulations on wrapping up filming!\"","\"When, when, when, when!\"","Shen Tang felt somewhat embarrassed, although she knew their intentions were good.","\"Thank you.\"","\"Here's your wrap gift red envelope.\"","Each of the four people gave her one.","Just as Shen Tang was about to put them away, Gu Anran piped up, \"Sister, quick, open them and take a look!\"","\"Should I really open them now?\"","\"Open them, open them!\"","Shen Tang opened the red envelopes to discover that combined, Sister Tao's, Uncle He's and Wuyang's envelopes held several tens of millions.","—Be happy for tens of millions reasons, be fortunate for tens of millions blessings, be safe for tens of millions days.","Anran's envelope contained a hand-drawn voucher.","\"What's this...\"","\"This is Uncle's one-day complimentary experience voucher. You can use this voucher to have Uncle accompany you for a whole day, he has to do whatever you want.\"","Shen Tang's imagination inevitably wandered to inappropriate places. She hastily gave a little cough to rein her thoughts back in.","\"Does...does your uncle know about this?\"","Gu Anran's gaze drifted left and right. \"He'll definitely agree to it!\"","Shen Tang neither agreed nor disagreed, just smilingly put all the red envelopes away. \"Thank you all, I really like your gifts.\"","How fortunate to know this lovely group of people.","\"Alright, the welcome ceremony is over now, next up is––\"","\"Cleaning up the trash,\" Uncle He killed the mood."]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Rob people in the street, so arrogant","paragraphs":["When she returned to the villa that evening, Gu Qingan came.","The two little ones were visibly excited, calling \"Mom\" repeatedly around her mother.","Aunt Peach watched her grow up and was also very happy. She cooked a big meal.","After dinner, Gu Qingan said, \"I want to invite you to be my brand ambassador.\"","Shen Tang exclaimed \"Ah,\" and when she reacted, she repeatedly declined, \"No, no way, my reputation...\"","Shen Tang looked to Gu Huai'an for help, but he nodded in agreement.","Shen Tang suspected he didn't know about her reputation, otherwise how could he ask her to agree to marry him.","Gu Qingan laughed and explained, \"Since I dared to look for you, of course I would do my research beforehand. To be honest, I think those negative things about you are too far-fetched...\"","Shen Tang laughed awkwardly and secretly glanced at Gu Huai'an: \"Actually, a lot of it is true...\"","Gu Qingan paused for a moment, then continued, \"I think your image is very suitable, you can consider it again.\"","Seeing the topic not continuing, Shen Tang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","It wasn't that she didn't want to make money, but she knew her current state too well. Endorsing might even have the opposite effect, so it's better not to pit others.","Gu Qingan laughed and shook her head. She really wanted to help out. If her sister and brother-in-law really didn't want to, then forget it.","She didn't care about those things. Her brand succeeded because of solid products.","The next day, Gu Qingan left early to go to work, and Gu Huai'an was not around either.","It had to be said, the sister and brother were both workaholics.","When Anran woke up and didn't see her mother, she looked very disappointed. Shen Tang suggested, \"How about I take you out to play?\"","\"Where are we going to play?\" Gu Wuyang asked listlessly.","\"Amusement park?\"","The two little ones got excited.","To be honest, they hadn't really been there much.","Usually they had a lot of classes, and when they were free they just played at home.","Today they actually had horse riding and piano lessons, but Shen Tang directly asked for time off.","The two little ones were excited, but also a little afraid, \"Is this really ok?\"","\"Don't worry, no problem!\"","Shen Tang first bought tickets online, then took the two little ones to go shopping at the mall.","When a family goes out, they have to have a family look. How can they not wear matching outfits?","The two little cuties had top looks, they were beautiful in every outfit they tried, so Shen Tang bought them all.","After changing into matching Donald Duck outfits, the other clothes were sent to the Gu villa.","Downstairs, there was someone selling cotton candy. Seeing the two little ones looking longingly, Shen Tang held one in each hand, \"Let's buy it!\"","While paying, Anran was gone.","Shen Tang looked around, there was no one. She panicked a little.","\"Where's Anran?\"","The cotton candy in Gu Wuyang's hand instantly lost its appeal, \"I, I didn't notice...\"","He had just been distracted looking at the cotton candy.","Shen Tang first called the police to report it, then asked passersby and shop owners nearby. She also entrusted the security guard to check the surveillance footage before going to look for Anran.","Fortunately, their outfits were quite eye-catching. Someone noticed Anran was led away by an old lady.","Shen Tang ran in that direction. Sure enough, she saw an old lady leading Anran forward. There was a van there.","The distance wasn't too far. Afraid she wouldn't make it in time, Shen Tang looked left and right. She grabbed a shared bike on the roadside and hurled it over -","\"Bang!\"","The shared bike heavily smashed into the van and the windows shattered instantly.","The surroundings instantly quieted.","Ignoring the looks from passersby, Shen Tang rushed over in three steps and grabbed Anran's hand.","At this time, Anran was still a little confused, \"Sis?\"","The old lady pulled hard and looked towards the van, \"What are you dazing for? Do it!\"","Several muscular men with tattoos rushed over to grab the girl.","The surrounding passersby were afraid of getting involved in trouble and retreated several steps.","Kindhearted people helped call the police.","Shen Tang pried open the old lady's hand, shielding Anran behind her amidst the old lady's screams.","\"Openly snatching people in broad daylight, how arrogant?\"","The few people probably knew well that villains die from talking too much. They didn't speak and just rushed forward to fight.","Shen Tang wasn't skilled at fighting, but she was very strong.","Just now she had almost thought she lost the child, and now her heart was filled with rage she couldn't vent, these people came at just the right time.","She shielded Anran behind her and punched with all her might, taking them on one by one, two on one.","The onlooking passersby had originally thought they would see Shen Tang being one-sidedly abused. They didn't expect those burly men to be all bark and no bite, that even a woman could beat them.","The originally fearful passersby weren't afraid anymore. Since even one woman could beat them, they could too!","In the end, Shen Tang pressed down the ringleader and rained heavy blows on him. The thug cried and begged for mercy, \"Stop hitting... stop hitting...\"","\"I was wrong... spare me...\"","Damn, this woman is too fierce!","Punching hurts so much, are her fists made of iron hammers?","The other few people didn't fare well either, beaten black and blue by the passersby.","Seeing the situation was bad, the old lady wanted to run but was firmly blocked by righteous passersby.","She screamed, \"Let go of me!\"","\"Damn you, you human trafficker, don't think about running!\"","When the police arrived, the few bad guys seemed to see hope. They cried loudly, \"Help! Uncle police, help!\"","\"Save me! Save me!\"","\"I'm a human trafficker! Hurry catch me!\"","This scene was truly laughable and pitiful. The police were a little stunned, almost unable to distinguish who the real human trafficker was.","Only then did Shen Tang let go. She recounted what happened in an orderly manner.","Gu Wuyang ran over with the security guard at this time. Seeing Anran, he rushed over and hugged her, crying.","\"You scared me to death...\" Luckily nothing bad happened.","Gu Anran then realized she had made a mistake. She explained softly:","\"Sorry for worrying you. Just now that granny said she hadn't eaten in a long time and wanted me to treat her to a meal...\"","She also realized now something was wrong. If just giving money was fine, why insist on pulling her along...","And adults don't seek help from children, but insist on asking her, a child...","Gu Anran was usually protected too well. She didn't have experience with these kinds of things, so she didn't understand and was easily duped.","\"I'm sorry...\"","Shen Tang stroked her head, \"There's no fault in your kindness, but bad people have too many tricks. We can't let our goodwill become capital for bad people to harm us.\"","Gu Anran nodded seemingly comprehending.","In the end, the three didn't make it to the amusement park. Instead they listened to anti-fraud lectures at the police station for half a day.","Although somewhat disappointing, they still learned a lot. At least the two little ones won't be easily fooled in the future.","This incident was also recorded into a short video by a passerby and posted on Weibo.","Shen Tang's fans didn't notice, but one of the major anti-fans recognized her first. He reposted the video on Weibo and said:","Human traffickers deserve to be beaten to death. Well done! I won't scold you today @Shen Tang.","Unexpectedly, Shen Tang actually replied: Thanks?"]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Dunhuang There are so many murals.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang beating up the human traffickers became a trending topic.","The comments were mixed.","Some felt the human traffickers deserved to be beaten, even beaten to death.","Others felt that human traffickers have human rights too and shouldn't be beaten like that.","The two sides argued and eventually the side approving the beating prevailed.","Some also suspected this was all staged by Shen Tang to clear her name, since it seemed too coincidental.","How could she take on several big men alone? It was a bit implausible.","Fortunately many netizens had seen her strength on the deserted island reality show, so they knew Shen Tang was very strong.","Many celebrities who knew Shen Tang also vouched for her.","Instead, this gave Shen Tang the image of a powerful woman.","As for staging it, that was even more impossible. The officials even criticized her actions as reckless and dangerous.","Shen Tang was completely unaware of all this online.","The three people were taken back by Gu Huaian.","In the car, the three hung their heads low, not daring to make a sound.","As the ringleader who had almost lost the child, Shen Tang didn't even dare to breathe loudly.","Gu Huaian moved slightly, and all three jumped in fright.","\"We're sorry...\"","\"Uncle, I'm sorry, I shouldn't have believed them so readily.\"","\"It's my fault for not watching my sister properly.\"","Seeing the three cowering like quails, Gu Huaian couldn't stay angry anymore.","\"Remember this lesson. Bring your bodyguards when going out next time.\"","The three nodded eagerly.","Shen Tang sneakily glanced at Gu Huaian and seeing his normal expression, finally relaxed.","[The novels all say the CEOs are like human air conditioners, getting colder when angry. How come he didn't get colder just now?]","Gu Huaian was speechless for the countless time: \"...\"","Noticing Shen Tang was still thinking random irrelevant thoughts instead of reflecting seriously, he did get a little angry.","\"And you, daring to take on several big men alone, do you really think you're invincible?\"","\"What if they had a knife, could you beat that?\"","Shen Tang instantly lowered her head.","[I can't beat that but I can run! I was the school sprint champion!]","[Ow, it really did get colder! The novel didn't lie to me!]","Gu Huaian wearily massaged his brow.","Soon, they arrived home. To avoid worrying Gu Qingan, the four agreed to keep it from her.","At dinner, it was unusually quiet, though they ate like normal.","Gu Qingan put down her chopsticks. \"Confess, what are you hiding from me?\"","Shen Tang, Gu Anran, and Gu Wuyang looked towards Gu Huaian in unison, as if he had orchestrated it.","Gu Qingan looked over too, brows raised slightly. \"Hm?\"","\"It's nothing, just a small mistake.\"","Gu Qingan didn't seem to believe it but didn't keep questioning either, to the relief of Shen Tang and the others.","Nothing could be done, Gu Qingan's aura was too powerful after all.","After dinner, as usual Shen Tang chatted and fooled around with her friends for a while.","That night, the two little ones ran to Shen Tang's room to sleep, hugging their pillows.","The bed was big and the three had plenty of space even lying together.","\"Sis...\"","\"But Mom said to call you auntie!\" Gu Anran said.","That's right, the two little ones had finally been ordered by Gu Qingan to stop that inappropriate form of address for Shen Tang.","Shen Tang didn't really mind, she had only wanted to annoy Gu Huaian before.","Gu Wuyang sighed, \"Uncle really is robbing the cradle...\"","\"Who isn't saying that!\"","\"When no one's around, call me whatever you want. Call me auntie when there are people.\"","Even if they did call her that, it would only be for another two years.","Thinking they wouldn't see the little ones again after that, Shen Tang suddenly felt a little sour.","Could she find a nice sack to steal the two little family members away!","Upstairs, Gu Huaian and Gu Qingan sat together on the recliners, chatting quietly.","\"Have you made up your mind about her?\"","Gu Huaian didn't answer.","\"That's good,\" Gu Qingan went on. \"She's pretty cute.\"","She hadn't seen such a lively, special person in a long time. It made her feel younger too.","\"And quite annoying.\"","Gu Qingan looked over teasingly, \"Oh? Do tell?\"","Gu Huaian swirled the red wine in his glass and downed it in one go. \"It's late, Sis you should rest early too.\"","Seeing Gu Huaian leave, Gu Qingan clicked her tongue.","She looked up at the night sky, dotted with stars, the bright moon high overhead, but the person to appreciate it with her was gone.","...","The next morning, Shen Tang received a call from the company about changing her agent.","Wang Brother was gone, so all his artists had to be reassigned.","Because of Wang Brother's scandal, the company had taken a hit too, so no one wanted the hot potato that was Shen Tang, despite her recent redemption arc.","After all, none of the agents had completely clean hands, and resources weren't that easy to obtain.","Shen Tang happened to be free and bored, so went to the company in a T-shirt, sweatpants, and slippers.","In the elevator she encountered the female artist who had threatened her last time. Though Shen Tang didn't remember her name, she remembered her haughty lifted chin like a victorious rooster.","Now the woman looked down on Shen Tang disdainfully, stepping in arrogantly. \"Shen Tang, what have you been reduced to?\"","Shen Tang was puzzled. \"???\"","What was up with her?","\"You're too sloppy, where's your image as a female artist?\"","\"No wonder all the company's agents don't want you. You really are useless mud that can't be molded. You'll stay like this from now on while I stand at the peak looking down on you.\"","Fine fine, look down from your peak, you're looking down now, could you clean your nostrils?","Shen Tang turned her face away. The female artist thought she was too upset to handle it and went on.","\"But don't be jealous of me. If you beg me nicely, I might bring you along.\"","Shen Tang's expression was nearly cracking. She hadn't even responded yet this woman was going on a self-righteous monologue endlessly.","And without even starting anything, she was already imagining the distant future. Something was wrong with this woman's brain, she should be writing novels not acting.","\"Yes, yes, you're right.\"","\"Humph, Shen Tang are you admitting defeat? Kneel down now and kowtow to me, and I'll give you the livestream resource with the number one internet celebrity brother.\"","\"Are you ok?\" Shen Tang suspected this woman's brain had gone bad.","The woman did regret it after saying that. She had worked hard for that resource herself and wouldn't easily give it away.","\"Forget it, someone like you would probably bankrupt the brand if you tried to sell anything. I have to be responsible to the merchants.\"","Shen Tang was speechless.","\"Come from Dunhuang? So many murals.\"","\"Just you can run your mouth? Blabbing on endlessly, my ears are calloused.\"","\"Even if you're outspoken, you can't just spout crap!\"","The female artist's mouth twisted in anger. \"You, you...\"","\"What you me you!\"","\"I, I...\" The woman was speechless from anger for a long time.","\"What I, I. Excuse me, your big 37-inch face is blocking the way.\"","Shen Tang pushed her aside and walked out without looking back.","How annoying!"]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: I'll tell you when I say something nice.","paragraphs":["Pushing open the door, the office was already filled with many people, all looking over with smiles hinting at watching a good show.","Shen Tang found an empty seat unconcernedly and sat down.","Seeing everyone staring at her, she said, \"What are you looking at me for? Do I have something on my face?\"","Many people's faces showed shock. Shen Tang did seem to have a somewhat reckless attitude.","\"Now that Shen Tang is here too, who wants to manage her?\"","President Zhou sat in the middle. Seeing Shen Tang, the spot he got injured last time started hurting again.","Several agents remained silent, showing no intention of managing Shen Tang.","The room became very quiet all of a sudden.","Everyone's gazes inadvertently looked over.","Shen Tang was unconcerned, as if no one wanting her was not about her.","\"Ahem, no one wants to manage her?\" Even President Zhou was starting to feel embarrassed.","In fact, although Shen Tang had a lot of scandals, she also had high popularity, often trending on social media for free. This was a good thing.","In this industry, it wasn't scary if you had many scandals, it was scary if you had no popularity.","However, Shen Tang's recent behavior had become more and more unrestrained.","Especially what happened with Brother Wang last time. Everyone was very afraid of following in Brother Wang's footsteps.","Shen Tang put down her phone. \"Hmm, then just forget it if no one wants to manage me.\"","\"How could that work?\"","\"Then who do you see managing me?\"","President Zhou was rendered speechless. No matter who he looked at, they avoided his gaze.","Finally, a girl wearing black-framed glasses weakly raised her hand, timidly saying, \"Can I...can I manage her?\"","Everyone looked over. The girl normally had a very low sense of existence in the company. Many didn't even know who she was.","The man beside the girl glared at her fiercely. \"This person is a new intern agent.\"","President Zhou's eyes lit up. He immediately clapped the table saying, \"Okay, it'll be you. Shen Tang is now yours. No more interning, you're officially hired.\"","His eagerness to toss this hot potato made people want to laugh.","People gradually left, until only Shen Tang and the new agent were remaining.","The girl walked over, boldly reaching out her hand, completely different from her shrinking violet manner earlier.","\"Nice to meet you, Sister Shen Tang. I'm Pei Kesong. From now on I'm your agent. Please guide me well.\"","Shen Tang raised her brows with interest. She'd thought it was a little white bunny, but it turned out to be a big bad wolf.","She reached out and shook Pei Kesong's hand. \"Hello, just call me Shen Tang.\"","\"You seem a bit different from just now...\"","Pei Kesong smiled. \"You also seem a bit different from before.\"","The two looked at each other and laughed out loud together.","\"Let's work happily together.\"","\"Let's work happily together.\"","Shen Tang had thought that since Pei Kesong had just been hired, she probably didn't have many resources. But unexpectedly that night Pei Kesong sent her a WeChat message:","I found a variety show for you, get ready","Shen Tang hurriedly called her.","\"What variety show?\"","\"That farming variety show. You'll guest on it for one episode.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","Could it be that farming variety show she had invested in?!","After confirming with Pei Kesong, it really was!","Shen Tang's expression was complex. Was this considered finding work for herself?","Moreover, wouldn't a portion of her pay still get taken by the damn company as a middleman fee?","Ah! So annoying!","Shen Tang didn't know how Pei Kesong obtained the resources, and she didn't ask. Instead, she contacted Luo Chen to inquire about the variety show situation, as she had been too busy lately and hadn't paid attention to it.","Thinking of how she had been indulging in pleasure recently without checking on the show, she felt a bit guilty.","Although it was just a tiny bit of guilt.","After searching online, in the original book the female lead's reputation rose sharply because of these two shows, attracting many fans.","One suitor had stubbornly chased her from the romance show to the farming show. Many netizens were shipping their CP.","Shen Tang watched some fan edits and also got a bit obsessed.","As expected of the female lead, her looks were just too good.","Thinking of meeting the female lead soon, Shen Tang felt a bit nervous. She even secretly ate a serving of spicy crawfish in the middle of the night, and kept running to the bathroom afterwards.","In the morning, Shen Tang came down the stairs with a ghastly pale complexion, giving Taoye a fright.","\"Tsst, Madam what's the matter with you!\"","Shen Tang felt a bit guilty. How could she say she secretly ordered takeout in the middle of the night and got diarrhea?","\"Didn't sleep well...\"","Taoye supported her. Shen Tang had just sat down on the sofa when a burst of intense pain came from a certain unspeakable place. She painfully sucked in a breath.","\"What's wrong?\"","Shen Tang said with a twisted expression, \"My hemorrhoids are acting up.\"","Taoye awkwardly smiled. \"Do you need to go to the hospital?\"","\"No need, no need...\"","Shen Tang secretly changed to a more comfortable sitting position before finally relaxing.","The next two days she had to eat plain food. Her mouth was completely bland.","Soon it was the day for the show's filming.","Shen Tang brought two heavy suitcases and headed to the location.","To prevent netizens from saying the guests were fake, the production team had also adopted a fully live broadcast model.","That meant the livestream started as soon as she got in the car.","\"Shen Tang, here is your mission card.\"","Shen Tang took the card, eyebrows slightly raised. \"This mission... You guys are really a**holes.\"","She seriously suspected the production team had added this mission temporarily just to prank her.","Too f**king sly.","Her attitude made the netizens watching the livestream anxious.","[What's the mission? Say it, say it!]","[It better not be fake hype...]","Shen Tang looked at the camera and waved the card in her hand. \"Want to know? I won't tell you.\"","[...]","[So aggressive. My fists are clenched.]","[Can the production team change people? Shen Tang is spoiled rotten, what can she do?]","\"Alright, I'll tell you if you compliment me once.\"","[Emmm...nevermind, I don't want to know anymore.]","[Shen Tang you're the prettiest!]","[Where's your integrity, person above?]","[Can integrity be eaten? Don't you want to know what's on the card? Also, I'm not lying. Shen Tang's face is truly flawless.]","With this, the bullet screen comments all turned into praising Shen Tang. Outsiders coming in thought they had entered some cult gathering.","Praising Shen Tang? Are they crazy!","Shen Tang grinned from ear to ear, looking very punchable.","\"Since you have sincerely asked, I will benevolently tell you—the mission is—\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: What's for Dinner Today","paragraphs":["\"The task is - let the guests make a luxurious dinner for themselves, ps: ingredients self-provided.\"","It's hard to say whether this task is difficult or simple.","The key is that this is a rural variety show, and everyone is already exhausted from working in the fields, and when they get back they barely manage to get a meal in them to fill their stomachs, let alone have the energy to make a fancy dinner.","Not to mention they have to provide their own ingredients too.","【???】","【Damn it! We've been tricked!】","【Shen Tang, don't you feel guilty at all?】","It turns out Shen Tang not only doesn't feel guilty, but is laughing happily.","Upon arriving at the destination, there aren't many people in the small courtyard.","Shen Tang says admiringly: \"You guys went to the fields this early huh.\"","Carrying a suitcase in each hand, she walks through the door, examining the small courtyard - it has to be said, it looks pretty nice, with a rustic farm stay kind of feeling.","After putting her luggage inside the house, Shen Tang looks towards the camera, \"What should I do now?\"","\"Hmm, breakfast was a bit late, and lunch is a bit early.\"","\"Oh right, where's my room?\"","Shen Tang goes upstairs, and just after turning the corner bumps right into a man, nearly falling down.","\"Oof!\" Her nose!","Luckily it's the original!","\"Tsk!\"","The man rubs his eyes, \"Sis Shen Tang? You're a guest this season?\"","Shen Tang looks up, the man is none other than Ao Ziping, still in his \"blackened\" form after being tanned dark from the sun multiple times.","\"What are you doing here?\"","\"I'm a regular guest!\"","\"No, what I mean is why are you still here?\"","Ao Ziping makes an \"ah\" sound, carefully asking, \"Then...should I leave?\"","\"Che, what I mean is why aren't you guys in the fields? You're still at home at this hour.\"","Ao Ziping's face instantly falls, \"Don't mention it, yesterday the director made us work overtime to do tasks and earn ingredients. But we didn't get any ingredients and we're dead tired, we nearly didn't get up this morning.\"","\"Oh right, sis Shen Tang, your room is here.\"","Ao Ziping moves to help carry her luggage, but Shen Tang blocks his hand, \"I'll get it myself thanks.\"","\"It's no problem, you're a guest, I'll help.\"","\"I'm afraid you can't lift it.\"","A man can't admit he's not up to it, so Ao Ziping subtly flexes the muscles in his arms, \"Don't worry, I'm Ao Ziping now.\"","Ao Ziping confidently takes the suitcase, but his arms instantly drop down heavily, \"Damn!\"","\"Should I take it instead?\"","\"I've got this!\"","Ao Ziping's expression doesn't change much, but the veins in his arms bulge out.","【Those arms, I love them, hehe】","【Sisters commenting above, go put your panties back on!】","Carrying it upstairs, Ao Ziping breathes a sigh of relief, and pushes the case to a room doorway, \"Sis Shen Tang, this is your room.\"","Shen Tang opens the door to take a look - the room isn't big, but it's clean and tidy with its own bathroom.","\"Thanks, oh right, are the other guests still sleeping?\"","\"They're also dead tired, they'll probably get up soon.\"","Hearing this, after Shen Tang finishes unpacking her things she heads downstairs to wait, since they still have to do the task after all, best to make a good first impression.","Hmm, maybe I should make breakfast!","Arriving in the kitchen however, she finds it completely empty inside.","\"How is it empty?\"","Shen Tang seriously suspects she's got the wrong place.","\"We ate it all, that's why the director made us do tasks yesterday to win supplies.\" Ao Ziping says, scratching his head.","\"Then where are the supplies?\"","Shen Tang and Ao Ziping stare at each other speechlessly in the kitchen.","\"So what do we eat today?\"","Ao Ziping looks at the camera lens, \"Director, what are we eating today?\"","After a little while, a staff member comes running in, handing over a card with today's tasks written on it.","\"Trade 100jin of corn to get 1jin of rice, sell 100jin of watermelon to get one whole watermelon, clean the pigsty properly to get 1jin of pork.\"","Shen Tang looks up in disbelief, \"Are you serious about this ratio? It's more exploitative than capitalists.\"","\"Cough cough!\" Ao Ziping hurriedly coughs to try to gloss over her words.","【Hahaha laughed to death, Shen Tang sure dares to speak】","【Look she scared the poor guy, his face has gone pale】","【What Shen Tang said isn't wrong, this director really is quite exploitative】","\"But it's not bad, the tasks aren't too difficult.\" After all she participated in designing them too, *cough*.","\"Wait, sis Shen Tang, we have to do all these tasks after finishing up in the fields.\"","\"I know, so here's the plan - I'll go make breakfast first, you go wash up, then go wake them.\"","\"What are we eating?\" Ao Ziping scratches his head again, he really is starving.","\"It's a secret.\"","After Ao Ziping returns to his room, Shen Tang also heads out for a bit, and comes back carrying some rice, vegetables and eggs.","The bullet screen comments are all asking the same question - where did she get that from?!","Shen Tang makes egg fried rice and stir fried greens.","She had wanted to make porridge at first, but figured fried rice is more filling since they'll be doing physical labor.","Soon the guests start coming down one by one, this is Shen Tang's first time meeting the female lead in person.","The female lead looks just like a typical female lead - hasn't tanned one bit despite the sun, standing out amongst the other pale guests.","\"Hello everyone, I'm Shen Tang, breakfast is ready, come eat!\"","\"Wow wow wow!\"","The guests instantly rush over and sit on the chairs, staring yearningly at the food, mouths watering nonstop.","\"Did you make this Shen Tang?\"","\"Where did you get this stuff from?\"","Not just the guests want to know the answer to this, the audience is also very curious.","Shen Tang just smiles, \"I said I'll go help trade 100jin of corn later.\"","\"Huh? Since when did the director become so generous?\"","Shen Tang shakes her head, \"It's not the director, it's granny from next door.\"","\"I knew it.\"","\"But those 100jin of corn...won't it interfere with our own farming progress...\"","\"Don't worry, I can handle it myself.\"","The male guest who just spoke waves his hands nervously, \"I, I didn't mean it that way...don't overthink it...\"","Shen Tang indeed didn't overthink it. She meant exactly what she said.","But judging from their reactions, even if she explained they still wouldn't believe her. So Shen Tang doesn't continue explaining.","They'll understand soon anyway after they see.","After waiting a bit, the rice is finally cooked. The guests wolf the food down voraciously, not even bothering to pretend for the camera.","Ao Ziping even sheds a tear from the corner of his eye.","Shen Tang is rather shocked: \"Is it that serious?\"","\"Mm mm!\" Ao Ziping nods heavily, he can't even spare a moment to speak, or it'd mean one less bite to eat.","Because of this one meal, the guests' goodwill towards Shen Tang rises exponentially, including the female lead.","【Waa waa waa, thank you Shen Tang, my daughter finally got a meal!】","【I don't know if I should say this, but Shen Tang coming does seem to be useful】","【Wait, did you guys forget that this is technically Shen Tang borrowing in advance? Anyone could go borrow it, later they all have to go pay it back together right?】","【...I nearly forgot about that, as expected of a famous green tea b*tch, Shen Tang sure knows how to handle people, 666】","After the meal, the male guest voluntarily washes the dishes.","They grow late rice in the south, so it'll be ready for harvest in a few months.","Right now they're harvesting spring corn, after harvesting they'll plant autumn corn.","After the meal, the guests voluntarily bring up going to help granny next door together.","Shen Tang says there's no need, but everyone disagrees.","Granny next door is already over 80, but moves very nimbly, seeming healthier than some young people even at her age.","\"Granny, we're here! Let's go harvest corn now!\"","\"Oh my, so many good kids...\" Granny was originally just giving the ingredients, but Shen Tang refused to take advantage, and insisted on helping out.","\"No need, no need, we just drank water, let's head to the field now!\"","After rejecting her offer several times, granny brings the guests out to the field.","On the way there, the female lead voluntarily teaches Shen Tang some corn harvesting techniques, while Shen Tang smiles and nods without mentioning that she already knows how.","After all it's just the female lead's good intentions."]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: How did you do it so fast","paragraphs":["\"Huh? Where's Shen Tang?\"","\"She should be at the front...\"","A few guests looked towards the front where some rustling sounds were coming from, all somewhat shocked.","\"Shen Tang?\"","\"Yo!\" A voice answered from far away.","\"How did you finish so quickly!\"","\"Speedy girl!\"","Shen Tang's hands kept moving. She had a lot of experience in her previous life. Shucking corn and sprinkling water was nothing to her.","Before long, the corn that was owed from breakfast was all shucked, and it could be said that the vast majority was done by Shen Tang.","The few guests were so shocked their jaws nearly dropped.","\"Are you even human?\"","\"Of course I am. I just have some experience. Practice makes perfect. Let's go plant the fields!\"","Ao Ziping swallowed his spit. \"Sister Tang Tang, aren't you tired?\"","\"How could I be? Anyway, the sooner we finish, the sooner we can end.\"","\"I guess...\"","After being praised by Granny, the few set off with armfuls of stuff Granny gave them and changed direction to go plant the fields.","The fields were currently at the seedling transplantation stage.","Because of the uneven terrain of staggered paddies in odd shapes, large transplantation machines could not be used. They could only transplant by hand, and progress was very slow and tiring.","But although the guests were tired, they never complained or slacked off. Despite the slow speed, they kept seriously working.","This was also one of the reasons the show was so popular.","With Shen Tang added, many anti-fans flocked to the livestream, not optimistic at all.","[I bet this wannabe can keep up her act for how long]","[Why do I see Shen Tang wherever I go, so annoying]","[My family is rural, let me say this. Shen Tang's corn shucking actions were pretty standard]","[How much do you water army get paid per post? Make some money and bring your sisters in]","Shen Tang didn't know about the barrage of attacks on the screen.","If she knew, she'd probably applaud and cheer, since the more people scolded her, the more people were watching, the hotter the show, and the more money she earned.","After all, getting scolded doesn't make you lose any meat.","Shen Tang looked at the ground and heaved a long sigh. Having great strength didn't mean she couldn't get tired.","In her past life, she had transplanted rice too, but only during her school breaks when she did part-time work. She could earn a good 200 yuan a day. Working a few days a month was enough for her monthly living expenses.","Now looking at the rice seedlings, she strangely felt a sense of intimacy.","Shen Tang opened her arms wide and took a deep breath. \"Little seedlings, here I come!\"","The other guests: \"......\"","They quietly distanced themselves a bit from Shen Tang.","[Haha dying, every guest's face clearly says \"we're not close\"]","[Shen Tang's acting is too much, when will her acting be as little as your brain]","[Can we have less screen time of this attention seeker, so annoying to watch]","Whether it was on purpose or not, it seemed Shen Tang's screen time increased.","Transplanting seedlings also relied on practice. Shen Tang worked nonstop at lightning speed, quickly moving to the front.","Ao Ziping stood up straight and massaged his waist. He discovered Shen Tang was getting faster and faster.","\"F*ck!\"","The other guests hurriedly asked, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Quick look!\" Ao Ziping pointed ahead.","Then they saw Shen Tang's speed getting quicker and quicker, almost like a robot.","\"No way...did she secretly get trained somewhere?\"","\"Sister Tang Tang, doesn't your waist hurt?\"","\"You guys chat slowly. I'm going to catch up!\"","The guests raced one another to keep up, even the female lead.","Many old fans started wondering if this was still the same show they watched.","The ones who previously sighed and groaned, why were they suddenly so energetic today like chicken blood was pumped into them?","In the end, less than half a day's tasks were finished in a day.","Ao Ziping clapped his muddy hands. \"As expected, human potential is unlimited. If you don't push yourself, you'll never know what you can achieve.\"","Shen Tang glanced at him. \"I want to eat a big meal.\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Do you want to push yourself more and earn more ingredients?\"","That's right, today's ingredients were still up in the air. Not to mention whether they could have a big meal, having enough to eat was an issue.","Ao Ziping immediately slapped his chest, \"Sure! Sister Tang Tang, wait for me. Today's big meal is my treat!\"","The female lead came over too, \"Anyway, the tasks are finished. Why don't we all work together, to be honest, it's been so long since we had a good meal ourselves.\"","Shen Tang didn't decline, however——","She lowered her voice and said, \"The production team is too nasty. We can help the villagers like this morning and get ingredients in exchange.\"","The others didn't immediately decide. Apparently they knew what their own work output was like, and in the end it was still Shen Tang who did the most.","Shen Tang grabbed the female lead's hand. \"Come on, the earlier we finish the earlier we can eat!\"","She couldn't help but squeeze. Tsk, the female lead's hands were so soft.","It was a busy farming season, and there were still quite a few families that needed help. Moreover, they only wanted ingredients instead of money, which was advantageous for both sides.","After a simple lunch, the few found a family that needed help. They agreed that after finishing work, they would get a big goose.","Big geese were precious goods. Braised goose especially was superb.","The guests hadn't enjoyed a good meal for a long time, just thinking about it made their mouths water.","\"Work work work!\"","\"Sister Tang Tang, you're good at cooking, you make dinner tonight?\"","\"Sure!\"","Shen Tang didn't mind cooking. Her junior was quite lazy usually, but could buckle down when needed.","Moreover, these others weren't very good at cooking either.","She had speed-watched the livestream replay overnight. She could only say it was pretty impressive they hadn't poisoned themselves with their cooking yet.","Flavor was not even a priority anymore. As long as the food was cooked it was good enough.","That afternoon, everyone worked hard, with no intention of cutting corners whatsoever.","By night when they finished, not only did the other family give them a big goose, but also a lot of side dishes.","It was just that the goose was alive, and Shen Tang didn't dare kill it.","She held the knife to the goose's neck, aiming here and there, but ultimately didn't dare put it down.","\"I don't think I can do it. Anyone else want to try?\"","The few guests all shook their heads and backed away.","\"I don't dare either...\"","\"I've never killed anything before...\"","In the end they all stared blankly at each other.","Ao Ziping scratched his head, \"So what now?\"","He was really hungry, and also craving meat.","Alright, not craving, extremely craving.","Shen Tang tentatively asked, \"Why don't we...not eat it?\"","She really couldn't do it. You have to know, when she cooked in the past, she used pre-slaughtered meat bought at the market.","If she had known earlier, she would've asked the owner to kill and clean the goose first before taking it back.","But she also felt a little bad about asking that. Slaughtering geese was probably troublesome too, and the busy villagers should properly rest at home after work, without extra tasks.","Ao Ziping painfully swallowed his saliva. \"Okay, then what about the goose?\"","\"Let's keep it...\"","And so, the first small animal joined their small courtyard——the big white goose.","If you ignored its constant honking while craning its neck, it was still pretty cute.","At least it wasn't casually biting people like in online jokes."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: Give the baby something good.","paragraphs":["After a day's work, everyone was extremely tired, but deep down they really wanted to eat something nice. However, no one objected to killing the goose.","Shen Tang pondered for a while. Since the goose couldn't be killed, they'd have to find some other food. She suddenly remembered that when they came, there seemed to be a small river at the foot of the back mountain, where there should be fish.","After getting permission, Shen Tang took some crude equipment and went to the riverside. One of the male guests was a little skeptical: \"Can you really catch fish like this?\"","Without waiting for Shen Tang to answer, Ao Ziping directly said, \"Don't worry, as soon as Sister Tang Tang makes her move, we'll know if there are any or not. These fish, we're definitely eating them tonight.\"","The female lead nodded along, \"I've also seen that show, Sister Tang Tang can definitely do it.\"","Actually, Shen Tang didn't even know if she could do it herself.","\"You guys should be careful. If your hopes get too high now, the disappointment will be even greater later. This is my first time trying this too.\" She had only heard some fishing tips from other people before, she hadn't tried them herself either.","Now she was clutching at straws. What if she did manage to catch some?","\"Sister Tang Tang, I believe in you!\" Hearing Ao Ziping's words, Shen Tang made an \"ok\" gesture.","The sun had already set. It would be dark soon. Whether she succeeded or not, she had to hurry.","When Shen Tang got to the riverside, she found a good spot, cast the fishing hook, and everyone watched with bated breath, already thinking of eighteen ways to cook the fish in their minds.","After a while, it seemed like a fish had taken the bait. Shen Tang sharply tugged on the line and pulled up a broken shoe.","\"Don't worry, try again,\" everyone comforted.","Shen Tang silently cast her line again to keep fishing. She already had a bad feeling.","After a while, the hook shook again. Shen Tang thought, this time I must have caught one...","She sharply flicked the fishing pole, and a torn pair of pants flew up.","Everyone: \"...\"","\"I heard that fishing enthusiasts can catch anything except fish. Seeing it today, it is indeed true.\"","\"Pfft!\"","【Hahaha I'm laughing to death, is Shen Tang going to suffer a crushing defeat? 】","【Get ready to screenshot this!】","Unwilling to admit defeat, Shen Tang tried a few more times, and successively fished up a safety helmet, trash bag, and finally a sanitary pad.","That's right, a sanitary pad.","【Oh gross...why would there be something like that in the river...】","【How disgusting...】","【To be fair, I've caught those things while fishing too, it really is nasty...】","【Ugh don't remind me, last year when my dad went fishing he pulled out a corpse, he was scared half to death and still hasn't recovered to this day, he doesn't dare to go fishing anymore】","【!!!!!! Damn】","Looking at the \"catch\" before her, Shen Tang suddenly lost her appetite.","\"Um...I don't really feel like eating fish anymore...\"","\"Me neither...\"","\"Yeah, let's uh, head back...\"","The group returned empty-handed, with everyone looking rather dejected.","Well, not exactly empty-handed, they were carrying a lot more bags now.","The anti-fans in the livestream chatrooms were extremely delighted though, especially Shen Tang's haters, they were as happy as if it were New Year's.","Before they even got home, they saw a figure wandering at the entrance to their little courtyard from afar.","When the few of them walked over, they realized it was the granny who had helped them this morning.","Seeing them return, Granny smiled and handed over the ceramic basin in her hands.","\"My family cooked too much for dinner, so I brought some for you. Don't turn your noses up at it!\"","How could they understand that feeling of being cared for by someone? It was indescribable, extremely comforting.","\"We would never, thank you Granny!\"","\"Why would we turn our noses up, thanks Granny!\"","After sending the old woman off, Shen Tang lifted the lid. To her surprise, it was a whole pot of stewed chicken.","\"This is...\"","No one expected that Granny had brought them such a huge pot of chicken meat.","In the countryside, chickens were not usually casually slaughtered except for festivals or important family occasions.","What's more, Granny's family conditions were not good, and she lived alone.","\"Maybe we should...send the food back...\"","Shen Tang shook her head in explanation. \"Granny must have specifically made this for us. Sending it back would be inappropriate. Let's go help her more over the next few days, to repay her kindness in other ways.\"","Everyone agreed this made sense and consented to do so.","Shen Tang stir-fried some vegetables to go with the chicken. With full bellies, the meal tasted delicious.","Ao Ziping ate mouthfuls of chicken and rice, tears of excitement streaming down his cheeks.","\"It's so tasty!\"","\"Mm...the vegetables Sister Tang Tang stir-fried do taste good...\" said the female lead.","Shen Tang sighed. What technique was needed to stir-fry vegetables? Didn't they all taste the same?","\"People only say everything tastes great when they're hungry.\"","\"No no, it's really different, the dishes you make taste exceptionally flavorful,\" the female lead insisted, puffing out her cheeks.","Shen Tang badly wanted to reach out and poke them to see how cute she looked.","【Does Shen Tang's cooking actually taste that good?】","【It's all pretense and grandstanding, if you take it seriously then you've already lost】","【Give the kids some decent stuff to eat, even stir-fried veggies get called tasty】","【Maybe she actually is a good cook...】","The bullet screen comments defending Shen Tang were instantly drowned out by a sea of mocking messages.","Night falls swiftly in the countryside.","After the meal, everyone lay back on recliners in the yard, blowing in the breeze and gazing at the night sky, extremely comfortable.","The female lead took a deep breath, \"The country air really is fresh...\"","\"To be honest, I used to be a night owl. Since coming here, my biological clock has practically adjusted itself.\"","\"I'm different, my agent said I lacked exercise in daily life and sent me here to train.\"","\"Oh, I get it, you're just too lazy,\" remarked Shen Tang.","Male Guest: \"......\"","\"Fine, you can say it is what it is.\"","\"By the way, why did you guys come here anyway?\"","Frankly, this was a variety show about doing farm labor. Generally people didn't like watching it, especially actresses who didn't want to get tanned skin that would be hard to whitewash later.","The female lead gave a charming smile. \"I feel it's quite meaningful, it's my first time seeing a show like this.\"","Shen Tang secretly nodded, as expected of the female lead, she had broad perspectives.","\"What about you, Sister Tang Tang?\"","\"Me? I came for the money.\"","To be precise, it was for two sources of money - the income from appearing on the show, and investment returns. Teehee...","\"Sister Tang Tang, you really are...pure and unpretentious!\"","Shen Tang burst into laughter. The flattery here was just too pleasant-sounding, she could almost float to heaven from all the praise.","They didn't chat for long before everyone returned to their rooms to rest.","After washing up, Shen Tang took out her phone and started replying to messages, most of which were from the twins.","Glancing at the time, she knew they were already asleep, but Shen Tang still conscientiously replied to each one without cutting corners.","She was quite surprised to see a WeChat message from Gu Huai'an.","Because all he had simply asked was if she had adapted yet or not.","Shen Tang really wanted to say, what difference would it make whether she adapted or not?","But he did mean well. Replying like that would sound sarcastic.","【Passionate Monkey Mom: Still okay, just a little tiring】","Unexpectedly, the status instantly changed to \"Gu Huai'an is typing...\" Shen Tang was very puzzled. Was this guy staring at his phone the whole time?"]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Shouldn't it be the Husband","paragraphs":["Shen Tang waited for Gu Huaian to reply, but he just edited his message over and over again and finally only said \"Go to sleep early\".","Shen Tang said she had something to say but didn't know if she should say it or not.","She angrily threw her phone aside and prepared to sleep.","After lying with her eyes closed for a while, she laughed, she simply couldn't fall asleep.","Shen Tang felt it was necessary to take revenge, there is a saying \"an eye for an eye\".","So Shen Tang opened WeChat and said to Gu Huaian: \"Actually—\"","Then she turned off her phone and went to sleep.","On the other end, Gu Huaian did wait for a while as Shen Tang expected, but did not get the rest of the sentence. His heart felt hooked, extremely uncomfortable.","However, he soon reacted and laughed softly.","Perhaps even he himself didn't realize there was affection in his voice.","The next morning when Shen Tang woke up, she only felt back pain, probably because she was usually too lazy, and suddenly did too much work yesterday, her muscles couldn't take it.","\"Ow!\"","She simply stretched and then washed up and went out.","The others were still not awake.","When Shen Tang came back, everyone had already prepared breakfast.","【Where did Shen Tang go so early?】","【Where else could she go, slacking off, not wanting to cook right】","【Is Shen Tang bare-faced? She looks pretty good】","【The above person, don't think too much. That's a pseudo no make up look. I've seen Shen Tang, she looks so ugly in real life and has bad skin too】","More and more people also gradually entered the live stream room. Even passersby couldn't help but exclaim, Shen Tang's antis are so hardworking!","\"Sister Shen Tang, where did you go? I thought you hadn't gotten up yet.\" Ao Ziping said.","The female lead handed her a bowl of porridge, \"Sister Shen Tang, try my porridge and see how it tastes.\"","Shen Tang touched her nose, \"I've eaten.\"","\"Huh?\"","【It's clear now, Shen Tang woke up so early to go out and eat by herself!】","【Isn't that going a bit overboard? Everyone else waited for her to eat, but she went out and ate alone】","【How selfish!】","Before Shen Tang could explain, the big white goose in the yard stretched its neck and honked.","A few people looked over and saw Granny standing at the door.","\"Can this big white goose also guard the house?\"","\"Granny, why did you come?\"","\"Shen Tang, you forgot to bring the candy I gave you.\"","Granny opened her handkerchief, inside were some loose sugar cubes, some were even stuck together.","You could tell they had been kept for a long time.","\"Granny, you should keep them for yourself to eat.\"","【I bet 1 mao (a Chinese currency) spicy stick, Shen Tang is looking down on them】","【Hehe, the beggar definitely won't eat them】","\"Granny doesn't eat them. Shen Tang, you should take them.\"","Shen Tang was a little helpless. She finally walked over and put a piece of candy in her mouth.","\"Is it sweet?\"","\"Sweet.\"","Shen Tang couldn't help but think of her previous life. The orphanage she was in could barely survive.","The director would hide candy and only give them one candy each during new year.","I wonder if Director is still doing well...","Shen Tang looked away, wiping away the tears at the corner of her eyes.","She took a candy and fed it to Granny's mouth, \"Try it yourself and see if its sweet or not.\"","Granny didn't have many teeth left. Her face was wrinkled. But at this moment, a sweet smile blossomed.","\"So this is what candy tastes like...\"","Hearing that, everyone felt a little sad.","The older generation were frugal, \"Diligent and thrifty\" was almost ingrained in their bones.","The female lead thought about it and walked over to hold Granny's hand, \"Granny, have you eaten? We just finished making lunch, why don't you come in and eat too.\"","\"I've eaten. Shen Tang came and helped me with chores and made breakfast earlier. You all eat. I'm going back first.\"","For a moment, the bullet screen quieted down.","【Hehe, where are the people scolding just now? Why aren't you coming out to apologize?】","【So what if she did it on purpose to gain attention? 】","【Regardless of motivation, did she do it or not?】","The guests also didn't expect Shen Tang to get up early and do chores. They felt a little guilty.","\"It's all my fault for getting up too late...\"","\"No no, don't overthink it. I just couldn't sleep so I got up and went for a walk. I happened to see Granny busy so I went to help.\"","To tell the truth, Shen Tang had planned to not do anything and drag people down when she first came.","She didn't know why things turned out this way, now she had become the most hardworking one instead.","If it was someone petty, they probably would have been angry already. Fortunately these guests were very nice.","Today everyone finished chores faster than yesterday. Then they started the program team's task - shuck corn and sell watermelon.","However, Shen Tang had other plans. She didn't plan to follow the show's routine.","She whispered to the female lead. The female lead looked shocked, \"Is that really ok?\"","\"The program team didn't say you can't. So that means you can.\"","\"You have a point.\"","So when the guests went to sell watermelons, they used some watermelons to barter for ingredients instead of selling them.","Afraid of a repeat of yesterday's fiasco, they specially bartered for ingredients that were already prepped so they didn't need to slaughter animals.","Although they didn't complete the task and earn a reward, they got ingredients.","【Damn! You can do that!】","【Isn't that exploiting loopholes in the rules? And they took other people's things in exchange for ingredients, isn't that not good...】","【Come on, how can people still sympathize with capitalists!】","Shen Tang was responsible for shucking corn. The shucked corn was given to the program team directly. They didn't want rewards for completing tasks, it was used to pay off the money for the watermelons.","Although the program team was unwilling, they couldn't do anything about it since the previous rules didn't say you couldn't do that.","However, the director immediately modified the rules overnight to close loopholes. Future guests won't get to exploit loopholes anymore.","That night, everyone made a big meal. This counted as Shen Tang completing the task she came to do.","Shen Tang was in charge of cooking while the female lead helped out. The others were responsible for cleaning up after the meal.","After returning to the room, Shen Tang replied to the twins' WeChat messages one by one, and discovered these two rascals hadn't slept yet.","\"Sister Shen Tang, play some King of Glory with me!\"","\"Ok, log in!\"","Shen Tang hadn't played games for a number of days either. After logging in she discovered Gu Huaian was online, and he had already reached the King rank, though she didn't know if he got there himself or if he got someone else to boost his account.","Without even creating a room, she was pulled into Gu Huaian's room.","\"Together?\"","\"Wait, let me pull some people in first.\"","After waiting a while, Gu Huaian saw Shen Tang pull in the twins who should have been sleeping.","\"You slept?\" As soon as Gu Huaian's voice sounded, the twins who were chattering away instantly quieted down and silently played dead.","Fortunately Gu Huaian didn't pursue the matter further. He only said \"Play two rounds then sleep\".","\"Ok ok! We'll sleep after!\"","\"Uncle you're the best! Muah!\"","After waiting a while longer, Shen Tang pulled another person in.","\"Huh? Who's the second slot? The avatar looks kind of familiar.\" Miao Miao said, slightly surprised.","\"Ah, he's my...friend.\"","Shen Tang glanced at Gu Huaian's avatar. Nothing special, just a moon - probably a random picture off the Internet.","\"Huh?\" Gu Anran sounded puzzled, \"Shouldn't it be 'husband'?\"","Miao Miao was very surprised, \"Sister Monkey, you got married?!\"","She was even planning to play matchmaker for Sister Monkey and her brother!"]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: It's the same name","paragraphs":["Shen Tang hadn't expected this matter to be exposed by Anran, but she didn't intend to hide it in the first place.","The only reason she hadn't talked about it was that she didn't really like exposing her private affairs.","\"Ah yes, I got married,\" Shen Tang didn't want to discuss this matter much. She changed the topic and said, \"I'm starting the game!\"","At first, Shen Tang was still a bit worried about Gu Huaian's gaming skills, after all, he had been a complete novice last time they played together.","Unexpectedly, this time she was completely carried by him.","She couldn't help suspecting that there was a professional eSports player on the other end of the phone instead of Gu Huaian.","\"Gu Huaian, did you hire someone to boost your account?\"","\"What?!\" Meow Meow's voice unintentionally went higher in pitch.","She couldn't help wondering if she had misheard. Otherwise, how could she hear her cousin's name?","Shen Tang was also a bit nervous. Gu Huaian was quite famous, could Meow Meow know him? ...","She weakly asked, \"You know him?\"","Meow Meow stammeringly explained: \"No, no, I don't know him. It's just that this name sounds so familiar. Could he be that tycoon Gu Huaian...\"","On the other side of the phone screen, Gu Huaian's mouth curved into a smile.","He still remembered that when he first visited the family mansion, Shen Tang and her cousin didn't get along well.","He had just wondered how the two were now close enough to play games together. Now it seemed like they still didn't know each other's real identities.","He suddenly felt a bit curious to know what their reactions would be once they found out the truth.","Logically, any smart person would have figured out his identity already. But her cousin did seem to have some mental issues.","Also, the twins had spent most of their years abroad, and even when they returned to China, they didn't interact with the rest of Gu's family.","So up until the end of the game, they still didn't know they actually knew each other.","After the game ended, Shen Tang still couldn't resist asking that question:","\"Gu Huaian, how did your gaming skills improve so quickly?\"","\"I hired a professional coach. If I'm going to play, I must strive to be the best.\"","No matter what he did, Gu Huaian had to be the best at it.","He used to think gaming was a waste of time and not a proper career, but now he suddenly appreciated the charm of eSports.","What Gu Huaian didn't say was that he was also planning to invest in a gaming club to surprise Shen Tang.","The two chatted for a while longer before Shen Tang unknowingly fell asleep.","In the next few days, Shen Tang's performance on the variety show gradually changed many people's views of her. After all, one can only pretend for so long, it's impossible to fake it forever.","This kind of variety show where they did nothing but livestream except for sleeping was almost like an exposé of the entertainment industry, there would always be people who couldn't persevere.","Shen Tang was gaining more and more fans, and her fan club was also growing rapidly. There were now people in the livestream comments speaking up for her.","As for the antis, they only chose to believe what they wanted to believe.","A few days passed swiftly, and it was time for Shen Tang to leave.","The female lead hugged Shen Tang's waist and cried, her face full of reluctance, \"Sis Tang, I really don't want you to leave.\"","\"Are you going to miss me or my cooking then?\"","The female lead was silent for a moment. \"Why can't I miss both?\"","【Hahaha, I'm starting to believe Shen Tang's cooking must be delicious!】","【I'm suddenly quite curious, just how tasty is Shen Tang's cooking?】","【Am I the only one envious of Shen Tang's monstrous strength? One punch and she could send someone flying】","【The clout-chaser is finally gone, seeing her everyday was such an eyesore】","The other guest stars were also very reluctant to part, but she had to leave eventually.","When Shen Tang left, the big white goose ran over, craning its neck and honking twice, seemingly very reluctant to see her go as well.","Shen Tang stroked the big white goose's head, \"Big White, I'm leaving now. Be good and watch the house, or I'll stew you in an iron pot.\"","Big White's honking stopped abruptly.","【Hahaha, even Big White gets bullied by Shen Tang】","As she walked out, the granny from next door came over. She handed Shen Tang a basket full of vegetables.","\"They're all vegetables from my own garden, don't look down on them.\"","\"How could I, I don't even have time to thank you yet.\"","Shen Tang happily accepted the basket, and in return, stuffed the granny a tightly-tied bag, its contents unseen.","\"Granny, this is a gift for you. Remember to open it when you get home.\"","\"What a good child, thank you...\"","Shen Tang quickly got in the car and left. The guest stars felt somewhat lost.","\"Is the next guest star coming tomorrow already?\"","\"Yeah, wonder if they can cook well too.\"","\"Are they very strong as well?\"","【Why do I feel like the next guest is going to be Alexander the Great? It'd be disastrous if they don't perform as well as Shen Tang】","【Shen Tang performed well? What joke is that?】","The livestream comments quickly descended into chaos again.","Not long after Shen Tang returned home, she received a message from her agent. It was a Word document, recording both the good and bad parts of her performance on the show.","Shen Tang was surprised that Pei Kesong had reviewed it so seriously. It was just a variety show, yet she had prepared such detailed analyses.","She suddenly felt a tinge of regret - someone like her probably didn't deserve an agent as diligent as Pei Kesong. With Pei Kesong's attitude, she could have easily brought an Oscar-winning actor or actress under her wing instead.","She suddenly wanted to meet up with Pei Kesong to talk things through.","Just then, she received a WeChat message from Meow Meow.","【Sis Monkey, are you free to meet up?】","She immediately gave her a call, which got picked up almost instantly.","\"What's the matter? Did something happen?\"","\"I...\"","Meow Meow sounded a bit hesitant over the phone.","\"Just tell me straight out if you have anything to say.\" The two had known each other for quite some time already. Shen Tang considered herself quite familiar with Meow Meow's personality - she was an adorable girl. But Shen Tang herself was a public figure who knew many people, so she didn't dare take any risks with her identity.","\"Nevermind, it's nothing much. Just that my cousin has the same name as your husband.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"Your cousin?\"","\"Yeah. My cousin is also called Gu Huaian. He always wears a long face every day, with nothing but work on his mind. And he recently married some Z-list celebrity hated by everyone. I was so pissed.\"","Now Shen Tang was finding this more and more familiar. She suddenly recalled that she and Meow Meow had mocked her cousin's on-screen romance before. To think that she would become the gossip target herself, what an ironic joke.","Wait... Gu Huaian has more than one cousin? Could Meow Meow be that girl at the family mansion who seemed to have some major illness...","Shen Tang sucked in a breath of cold air.","\"Sis Monkey, what's wrong?\"","Shen Tang awkwardly laughed. Her mind was filled with just one thought - she must not expose her identity.","\"Nothing much. You're probably overthinking it. My husband is just an average office worker - he has a huge beer belly, acne all over his face, and even a bald head. He's completely different from that Gu Huaian, it's like heaven and earth.\"","As Shen Tang turned around, she met Gu Huanian's eyes directly.","Her heart thumped. When did this guy get here?!","Ahhhhh, I'm so dead!"]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: I don't Know Him","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian's appearance gave Shen Tang a fright, and she hurried to hang up the phone.","\"Big belly?\"","\"Pimples all over his face?\"","\"And bald?\"","As Gu Huaian got closer, his three quick questions made Shen Tang feel very guilty. She weakly raised her hand and said, \"Um, I can explain.\"","\"Oh?\"","Shen Tang stammered an explanation, \"I didn't mean to say that. I just heard you have a White Moonlight and wanted to get some information from her...\"","After speaking, seeing Gu Huaian's expression seem a bit strange, Shen Tang thought he didn't believe what she said, so she supplemented,","\"Don't worry, I don't have any other ideas. It's just that the official has returned, and I as an imitation product should give way...\"","If White Moonlight really came back, this contractual marriage might end prematurely. Preparing in advance would prevent her from rushing around when moving out.","Also, ending early should mean more compensation, hee hee...","Gu Huaian's face instantly darkened. He squeezed out a few words from between his teeth, \"This is your explanation?\"","Shen Tang awkwardly realized that Gu Huaian seemed even angrier.","\"Um... if you need it, I can also help take care of the postpartum care...\"","With so much money every month, forget postpartum care, even if he wanted her to help wash his feet or wipe his butt, she would do it.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Stop talking.\"","Shen Tang still wanted to speak but Gu Huaian covered her mouth. \"Anyway, I don't want to hear anything else you say.\"","Shen Tang looked at him innocently with wide eyes.","Gu Huaian took a deep breath and told himself not to haggle with Shen Tang, or he would be the one to get angry to death.","He pinched his brow and said, \"There is no one.\"","Shen Tang made a few \"hmm\" sounds.","Gu Huaian removed his hand. Shen Tang asked, \"No what?\"","\"No White Moonlight.\"","\"Huh?\"","Shen Tang was a little confused. Could what her cousin said be false?","That couldn't be. She seemed very sincere, not like she was lying.","Wait, why was Gu Huaian explaining this to her?","But it could not be denied that there was a trace of secret delight in her heart.","Shen Tang lightly coughed and said in a low voice, \"I don't have one either.\"","If she had to say there was one, it would be money.","Suddenly, her head was rubbed. Shen Tang looked up to see Gu Huaian's mouth hooked up in a shallow arc.","\"Don't randomly speculate in the future.\"","\"Oh.\"","...","Even after sleeping and waking up again, Shen Tang still didn't react to how things had developed this way.","Thinking about it now was still a bit embarrassing.","She looked at the time. It was after 10 o'clock already. Gu Huaian should have left...","Shen Tang went downstairs. Besides Tao Sister, there was no one else.","\"Madam, you're awake. Do you want to eat now?\"","\"Sure, where is everyone else?\"","\"The Mister went to work. The young misses and young master went to school.\"","Shen Tang suddenly felt a little guilty. Somehow, it seemed like she was the only one in this family with nothing to do.","No, she had just gotten off work.","Thinking this, Shen Tang's back straightened again.","After Tao Sister brought up plates of food, she looked at Shen Tang with distress. \"Aiyo, eat more, just watching that show looks exhausting.\"","\"It's fine.\"","\"Look, your skin seems to have darkened two shades. Tsk, your hands are even injured. Let me put some medicine on them!\"","Before she could recover from the concern, Shen Tang heard the bad news.","Shen Tang touched her face. \"Did I really tan that much?\"","\"One day in the sun, how could you not tan. It will be better after nourishing for a couple days.\" Tao Sister grabbed Shen Tang's hand. \"This medicine is very effective. Thickly applying it for a day will heal the wounds...\"","Tao Sister's chatter was endless as she talked and worked at the same time, quickly smearing medicine on Shen Tang's few injured fingers.","To be honest, these wounds were very small, just scratches that broke the skin without bleeding.","In Shen Tang's eyes, if she didn't apply medicine, these wounds would have automatically healed.","But she had to admit, this feeling of being cared for felt very warm.","\"Done. Remember not to get them wet.\"","\"Thank you, Sister Tao.\"","Shen Tang first drank some soup, then took out her phone to meet up with her friends for some skin care.","When Shen Tang arrived at the mall, the others hadn't yet arrived, so she lined up at a milk tea shop.","Suddenly, there was a commotion not far away.","\"Let me go! I don't know you!\"","\"Wife, stop messing around. There are so many people here. Let's go home and talk, okay?\"","Shen Tang looked over. She saw a beautiful girl with an angry expression on her face. Beside her was a helpless looking man, his eyes full of indulgence.","\"What nonsense are you talking about! I don't know you at all!\"","The woman struggled violently but was held tightly by the man. \"Alright, alright, I was wrong. In the future I'll give you all the money and won't spend it on games...\"","\"Help! I don't know him!\"","\"Wife... you can hit or scold me, just please don't say such hurtful things...\"","The two looked just like a bickering couple, the girl being unreasonable and the boy very tolerant.","Others just shook their heads with a smile and walked by. But the more Shen Tang watched, the more she felt something was off.","The man's clothes looked tidy at first glance but were actually quite sloppy, and there was mud on his shoes as if he had stepped somewhere dirty.","The woman had exquisite makeup, and the jewelry on her neck and wrists started at six digits. No matter how you looked at it, the two did not match.","\"Hello, would you like to order something?\"","Hearing the clerk's voice, Shen Tang quickly waved her hands to refuse. \"Sorry, something came up. I'll order later.\"","Shen Tang rushed over to the man and woman.","With the great difference in strength between men and women, despite the woman's constant struggling, she was still controlled by the man and pulled forward.","The crying woman pleaded for help, but the kind-looking man deceived the passersby who wanted to help.","\"Sorry, my girlfriend is throwing a tantrum with me...\"","The two walked further and further away, eventually turning onto an empty side road.","The man's face changed and he slapped her hard. \"F*ck, shut up!\"","The woman crashed into the wall at once. As she got up to run, several brawny men suddenly rushed out and tied her up in no time.","Shen Tang suddenly felt she had been rather rash.","But as soon as she took a step back, something poked her waist. \"Don't move!\"","Shen Tang hurriedly raised her hands and trembled, \"I won't move, don't hit me!\"","\"Heh! Quite sensible.\" Warm breath brushed past her ear and Shen Tang felt afraid and disgusted.","In front were five or six people, and behind were unknown numbers. As the saying goes, those who know the times are outstanding. She was no match for them, and resisting may lead to injury.","Furthermore, Shen Tang couldn't just ignore someone in mortal danger.","She very cooperatively allowed her hands to be tied.","\"Um, Boss, could you tie a bit gentler... I won't run.\"","\"Heh. Quite delicate.\"","Whether it was excessive arrogance or Shen Tang's show of weakness was effective, in any case, only her hands were tied, and not too tightly.","Just then, a scarface walked over. His rough big hands gripped Shen Tang's chin, looking left and right. \"Not bad goods.\"","Someone said, \"She looks like some female celebrity...\"","\"I don't care if she's some female celeb. In my hands, she has to listen to my words.\"","\"Yes, Boss.\" Shen Tang tactfully responded.","Scarface: \"...\"","That was a bit too tactful."]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: This Is a Female Star","paragraphs":["Shen Tang's overly compliant attitude initially made Knife Scar Face Man hesitate, even suspecting that there might be some conspiracy at play.","In the end, the desire for money prevailed.","After all, finding someone as attractive as Shen Tang was like searching for a needle in a haystack.","Shen Tang and the other girls had their eyes blindfolded.","They had no idea how long the car ride lasted, but it finally came to a stop.","The two of them were pushed out of the car and locked inside an abandoned warehouse.","Apart from the two of them, there were over ten other beautiful girls, but they all had a vacant look in their eyes and appeared extremely exhausted.","Fortunately, most of them didn't seem to be injured, except for one girl who seemed to be in a serious condition.","She was in a disheveled state, with torn clothes and a ripped mouth, clearly having gone through something terrible.","If it weren't for the slight movement of her chest, one might believe she was dead.","Shen Tang whispered, \"How long have you all been here?\"","No one answered.","Shen Tang asked again, \"Do you know who these people are?\"","Still, no one answered.","Suddenly, a girl looked up and said, \"Don't bother. There's no way to escape. That's our fate.\"","She glanced at the girl who was barely alive, her expression filled with despair.","\"Well, that's not necessarily true,\" Shen Tang muttered under her breath.","Their phones had been confiscated, cutting off their contact with the outside world.","But Shen Tang wasn't too panicked. She touched her ring, a high-tech device newly developed by the Gu Corporation, which had a built-in tracker.","Shen Tang didn't understand its workings, but she believed in Gu Huaian.","Ironically, he had given it to her last night, and today it was already proving its worth.","She just wondered when he would realize she was missing.","The warehouse was large, with only a small window that had been boarded up.","Sunlight seeped through the cracks, casting beams of light where countless specks of dust danced.","Outside the door, there was a clamor of voices, indicating that those people were drinking and chatting.","As the sky grew darker, Shen Tang's confidence started to waver. Could it be that Gu Huaian hadn't noticed her disappearance?","If that were the case, it would be disastrous!","But there's always something worse than the worst.","Soon, the door was opened from the outside, and Knife Scar Face Man walked straight towards Shen Tang.","Shen Tang nervously stepped back. \"Brother, what brings you here so late?\"","Knife Scar Face Man let out a drunken belch. \"You... you're a celebrity. Come and perform a... a show.\"","Shen Tang breathed a sigh of relief, barely noticeable. \"Sure, what would you like to see? I can sing and dance.\"","\"Start with a... a song.\"","Shen Tang was dragged outside, only to realize that there were over a dozen men, all looking menacing and possibly involved in criminal activities.","Shen Tang felt a shiver down her spine. \"Hello, everyone. What song would you like to hear?\"","\"Anything.\"","\"Hey, isn't that that famous star? I heard she's had dozens of boyfriends.\"","As soon as these words were spoken, Shen Tang noticed that many people's gazes shifted towards her.","She felt a cold sweat trickling down her back and hurriedly explained, \"No, not at all. It's all just the company's publicity. They don't allow us to date.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Of course, it's true,\" Shen Tang sighed. \"To be honest, I've never even touched a guy's hand in all my life.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, someone reached out and touched her hand, their rough touch feeling like sandpaper.","\"Now you've been touched,\" the person said.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Do I even have to thank you?!","But as soon as she said that, the gazes of those people became less intense.","Shen Tang felt a little scared. If it weren't for her quick thinking earlier, her fate might not have been any better than that other girl's.","Shen Tang took a deep breath and began to sing a performance.","After a while, the men covered their ears in agony.","Shen Tang immersed herself in her singing, oblivious to the outside world, until a bottle was smashed, snapping her back to reality.","\"Shut the hell up!\"","\"So damn awful, my ears are ruined!\"","\"This is a female celebrity? Damn, so terrible.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Was my singing really that bad?\"","\"Yes! Shut the hell up!\"","Shen Tang pouted, feeling a bit aggrieved.","\"Maybe it's because there's no accompanying music. Otherwise, I can dance for you guys.\"","In her previous life, she was a square dance leader and even participated in square dance competitions with the aunties, winning championships.","This was something she could boast about.","\"Which one of you guys can play some music?\"","She cleverly didn't ask to borrow a phone.","Although she wouldn't be able to borrow one, it showed her obedient and cooperative attitude.","An older bald-headed man played a song called \"Drunken Butterfly,\" and Shen Tang danced to the music, starting her square dance performance.","Except for that bald-headed man, the expressions of the others were difficult to describe.","\"Stop, stop, stop!\"","Shen Tang was a bit confused. \"What's wrong?\"","\"Don't you know those girl group dances?\"","Shen Tang awkwardly smiled. \"Sorry, I haven't learned them.\"","\"What about street dance or Chinese dance?\"","Shen Tang shook her head in embarrassment. \"I can't do those either. Those who know me should know that I was an orphan before, and I didn't know anything. My debut relied solely on my looks.\"","The youngest man in the crowd nodded, \"That's right, just a vase with a pretty face.\"","The others were also shocked. It was their first time being in such close contact with a celebrity, and they didn't expect her to be different from their imaginations. How could she not know anything?","Shen Tang felt a little nervous, silently praying that these people hadn't seen her variety shows and didn't know about her strength.","But since they hadn't found out until now, they probably hadn't seen them.","Knife Scar Face Man impatiently rubbed his face, \"What the hell are you good at then?\"","\"Can I cook?\" Shen Tang noticed that all these people were eating takeout skewers and beer, and there were many empty instant noodle cups in the corner. It seemed like no one knew how to cook.","Sure enough, as soon as she said it, everyone looked at each other, speechless for a moment.","\"Let's talk about that later.\"","And then Shen Tang was locked up again.","Two girls looked over with disdain and contempt in their eyes, clearly looking down on her for what she had just done.","But when you're under someone else's roof, you have to lower your head. Now, confronting them head-on would be the most foolish thing to do.","Shen Tang didn't explain.","The night grew darker, and the sounds outside gradually faded, replaced by the intermittent sound of snoring.","The door was opened once again, and a disheveled figure with a strong smell of alcohol sneaked in quietly.","Shen Tang felt that this was her chance."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Chastity is Never beneath a woman's skirt.","paragraphs":["Yellow Hair Man groped towards Shen Tang, suddenly belched alcohol, the stench making Shen Tang almost throw up last night's dinner, hurriedly holding her breath.","\"Hehe...a f*male celebrity huh, let me try what it feels like to f*ck a celebrity... *burp*...\"","After Yellow Hair Man spoke, he started groping Shen Tang's clothes.","Shen Tang frowned, clenched her fist about to punch him, only to hear a banging sound, the man was smashed in the head, instantly fainting to the ground.","In the moonlight, Shen Tang discovered the person who hit him was the girl who earlier disdained her obsequiousness.","Seeing Shen Tang look over, the girl disdainfully twisted her lips, \"What are you looking at, I despise you, but I won't stand by watching you get humiliated.\"","Shen Tang revealed a sincere smile, \"Thank you.\"","\"Hmph.\"","The girl let out a cold humph then returned to her previous spot lying down.","It's worth mentioning that, possibly because there were many people, or perhaps they were overly self-confident, hence everyone wasn't tied up.","Shen Tang turned around and tied up Yellow Hair Man, using a smelly sock to gag his mouth.","She walked to the door, gently opened a crack.","Most people outside were already asleep, only two night guards remained, watching short videos.","Shen Tang softly closed the room door, walked to the window across, in the moonlight, she could see the surroundings were all dense woods.","In this kind of place, if they hid well, it would be very difficult to find them.","Shen Tang shook the sleeping girls awake one by one.","\"Do you want to escape?\"","The girls didn't react.","\"It's better to live as a coward than die a hero, follow me and you'll still have a ray of hope, do you think there'll be any good ending staying here?! This is clearly a transit station, next you'll either be sold to brothels or become trafficked brides.\"","A few girls raised their heads to look over, hesitation surfacing on their faces.","This was a good thing.","\"Alright, watch my demonstration first.\"","Shen Tang walked to the window, grasped the wooden boards with both hands, then slowly started using force.","Afraid of making noises, Shen Tang's movements were extremely careful.","Soon, a wooden board was successfully dismantled, the sounds made were negligible, perfectly masked by the night guards' video watching sounds.","Shen Tang looked back triumphantly, \"What do you think? Do you believe me now?\"","Other than the fainted girl, the rest were extremely shocked, lowering their voices to softly ask: \"You're so awesome!\"","\"You're so strong!\"","\"Does this mean...we can really escape?!\" Hope suddenly blossomed in a girl's eyes.","\"Of course you can, but you all have to listen to me.\" Shen Tang said.","\"Listen listen!\"","\"We'll all listen to you!\"","The previously despairing girls were now extremely excited, all cleverly controlling themselves to not make any sounds.","Just as Shen Tang continued dismantling the boards, someone asked, \"What about her?!\"","That most miserable girl was skinny, but probably still weighed 80-90 pounds.","If they were well-fed, perhaps they could carry her along.","But after being locked here for two days without food or water, even running was difficult for them.","That one sentence successfully quieted everyone down.","Abandoning someone here, they couldn't do that, but they also couldn't carry her...","The girl lying on the ground suddenly spoke, her voice extremely hoarse: \"Don't mind me...\"","\"You're awake?!\"","\"How can we not care?!\"","\"Yeah, why don't two of us carry her in shifts?!\"","\"You don't need to mind me...\" the girl repeated.","She opened her eyes staring at the ceiling, revealing despair.","She was already like this, even if she went back what use would it be, her entire life was ruined.","She couldn't even walk, bringing her would only become a burden...!","With several creaking sounds, Shen Tang had completely dismantled the boards, it was fortunate they were nailed from the inside, otherwise it might not have been possible to open them.","Gently pushing, the window opened, moonlight spilled in, shining on Shen Tang seemingly like a moon fairy, ready to ride the wind and depart at any time.","She looked back, rosy lips parting: \"We won't leave anyone behind, I'm strong, I'll carry her.\"","Upon closer inspection, the girl's injuries were more severe.","Shen Tang found a hemp rope, preparing to tie the girl onto herself.","\"Your leg is injured, it might hurt more, endure it.\"","\"You don't need to bring me, I'm already dirty...\"","Shen Tang looked into her eyes, speaking earnestly: \"You're not dirty, consider it just a dog bite. Humans only have endless possibilities when alive, don't you want revenge? Don't you want to see them punished?\"","The girl froze.","With everyone's help, Shen Tang tied the girl onto her back, testing the weight, she felt featherlight.","\"You're too skinny, you need to eat more in the future.\"","A drop of warmth suddenly landed on her neck, the girl choked out: \"My boyfriend used to say I was fat too...\"","\"That was nonsense, what boyfriend, your ex-boyfriend, scum.\"","\"Yeah, can't keep boyfriends like that.\"","The girl moved to Shen Tang's ear, softly saying: \"If you get tired, just abandon me, I won't blame you...\"","\"Don't worry, that situation won't happen.\"","Unknown what time it was now, also unknown if those people would come in again at night, Shen Tang urged everyone to hurry, she took up the rear.","As everyone crawled out the window, Shen Tang kept worrying if there would be \"bad teammates\" like in novels.","Fortunately until the end no one made mistakes, the entire process completely soundless.","What awaited them outside were dense woods, no signs of humans having passed through here, also unknown if there were wild beasts about.","Pitch dark, everyone could only randomly walk in a direction.","Unknown how long they walked, no one complained of tiredness, no one yelled in fear, only increasingly heavy breathing sounds.","\"Can we really escape?!\"","\"Definitely!\" Shen Tang firmly said.","Encouraged by her, everyone gradually opened up, starting to talk about how they were captured.","As it turns out, the reasons were quite similar, those people either posed as boyfriend/girlfriends, fathers/daughters, mothers/daughters and openly brought them here.","\"When I get back I'll expose this matter, don't let anyone get tricked again, this is too frightening...\"","\"You, are you Shen Tang?!\"","Someone suddenly said, quieting everyone down.","\"I am.\"","\"You really are Shen Tang...umm, I used to be your anti-fan, sorry...\"","A girl awkwardly blushed, fortunately it was dark now, unseen.","\"Me too...but don't worry, from now on I'll be your loyal fan!\"","Shen Tang lightly laughed, not minding this at all.","Strictly speaking, \"she\" didn't do well before either, having antis was too normal.","\"Alright, then let me thank you in advance!\"","Everyone's mood became increasingly relaxed, when suddenly noisy sounds and bright lights came from afar behind them.","\"Crap! They discovered us!\"","\"Run!\"","Everyone sped up running, but it was very troublesome sprinting in pitch darkness.","\"Thud\" a sound, someone tripped and fell, not minding the pain, hurriedly climbing up again.","Shen Tang knitted her brows, her expression extremely solemn.","\"This won't do.\"","\"What do we do?!\"","Shen Tang looked back, clearly seeing traces on the path they ran past, continuing like this they would inevitably get caught up to.","She decisively put the girl on her back down, \"You guys hide, I'll run ahead.\"","\"We can't do that!\"","\"Don't argue, listen to me, I'm strong with self-defense capability, you guys differ. Also, the police should have been contacted, you only need to find a spot and wait till daybreak.\" Shen Tang spoke, revealing an easy smile.","Shen Tang brought the girls downhill, letting them hide under bushes, using branches to cover them.","As long as no one came down, they would absolutely not be discovered.","Shen Tang held up a finger: \"Shh! From now on, don't make any sounds no matter what, see you tomorrow!\"","She carefully erased all traces around the area before continuing ahead.","The path forward was obscured, actually she wasn't as nonchalant and relaxed as she appeared.","But this was already the best plan she could think of.","Girls, hang in there!"]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: So good, It's Morning.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang continued to stumble forward, with many cuts on her face, arms, and very sore feet.","But she dared not stop.","She didn't know how much time had passed, but the lights and noise behind her were getting closer and closer. Did this mean they hadn't been discovered?","A smile appeared on Shen Tang's taut face.","The sky was gradually getting brighter, which was not good for hiding.","Shen Tang looked left and right, and all around were just trees.","Suddenly, she heard a snoring sound.","Anyone snoring here must not be human!","Shen Tang followed the sound and discovered a large boar with fierce fangs, currently sleeping soundly.","In no time at all, she thought of a good idea.","She quickly climbed up into the trees with several large rocks she found nearby and waited.","The trees here were tall with thick branches. Shen Tang's position was very high that no one would notice her if they didn't look up deliberately.","She didn't have to wait long before those people caught up.","Shen Tang was extremely nervous, her heart pounding as if it would jump out of her throat at any moment.","She hugged the rocks tightly, staring intently at the group, and swallowed.","\"Damn it, when we catch those sluts back, break their legs!\"","\"Pah! You bunch of useless fools to let a group of women escape!\" Knife Scar was furious that the ducks about to enter his mouth had flown away. What would they deliver tomorrow?","\"I don't know how they managed to pry open the window...\" Yellow Hair said.","Knife Scar was provoked seeing Yellow Hair and viciously kicked him. \"Damn it!\"","Yellow Hair stumbled to the ground, not daring to make a sound.","Shen Tang sat high up in the tree and watched them get closer and closer.","\"What's that sound?\"","\"Who the hell is snoring?\" Just as he finished speaking, the group realized something was wrong. Who would snore at this time?","At that moment, Shen Tang heavily smashed the large rocks towards the boar.","Bullseye!","The boar suddenly awakened and the first thing it saw upon opening its eyes was the group holding lamps.","The anger from being hit caused the boar to snort twice. After scraping its hooves twice, it charged towards them.","\"F**k!\"","\"A boar!\"","\"Run!\"","The group scattered in terror. Shen Tang breathed a sigh of relief on the tree. Her plan had worked!","A boar's power was fiercer than a tiger's. Soon afterwards, wailing sounds could be heard.","Shen Tang watched with wide eyes as some had their stomachs ripped open and intestines pulled out, covered in blood.","She closed her eyes in horror, extremely relieved that she had discovered this early.","But she did not regret it. These people had probably ruined countless girls. Their deaths were too light a punishment!","The sky was getting brighter. She wondered if the police had come and if Gu Huaian had discovered she was missing.","Shen Tang pinched the ring on her hand, lost in thought.","The sun slowly rose. Shen Tang's position was very high. Through cracks in the branches she could vaguely see the sunrise. The magnificent sight cleansed the gloom in her heart.","How nice, it's daylight.","She really lived to see the next day's sun. She wondered how the other girls were.","On the other side, Gu Huaian's people and the police had found the warehouse from last night but no one was there.","Gu Huaian had an extremely ugly expression. He deeply regretted working overtime last night and not noticing Shen Tang's disappearance sooner.","Yet he also felt relieved. Fortunately, he had given her the ring, otherwise who knows where they'd have to look. Maybe...","Thinking of a certain possible outcome, Gu Huaian's expression became darker.","\"Evidence shows the victims seem to have run out by themselves.\"","\"Definitely Shen Tang's doing.\" Gu Huaian firmly believed.","It must have been her. She was so smart and strong, she definitely would not have an accident.","Shen Tang, wait for me!","The team continued to search based on the ring's positioning.","Meanwhile, the girls had lain flat on the ground the entire night, unmoving even when crawled over by insects.","They relieved themselves on the spot. Now was not the time to care about dignity compared to their lives.","Until daylight, all their limbs had become stiff and cramped.","The most severely injured girl mumbled softly, \"Shen Tang will be alright...\"","\"She will definitely be fine, she's so capable...\" Another girl clenched her fists tightly, not knowing if she was trying to convince others or herself.","\"Wah...\" Someone started crying loudly first, and the rest immediately followed suit.","Suddenly, they heard footsteps approaching and the crying immediately ceased while they held their breaths.","Could it be them who found us...","\"Over here!\"","Hearing the voice, their hearts sank, it's over!","\"Don't panic, we're the police!\" The female officer slowly slid down and parted the branches.","Indeed this place was extremely hidden.","Now that it was bright out, plus her professional skills, otherwise they really wouldn't have found them.","When they saw the police uniforms, the girls instantly broke down again, unable to control the turmoil of emotions pent up the entire night.","\"There are injured here!\"","Gu Huaian had searched around and grabbed a girl asking urgently, \"Where's Shen Tang?\"","The girl he grabbed didn't care about crying anymore and quickly recounted everything from last night.","Gu Huaian felt a bit angry yet also proud. This was his Shen Tang!","The girl he loved.","The positioning from the ring was still further ahead and hadn't moved for a long time. He didn't know if Shen Tang was hiding there or if the ring had dropped.","This was an undeveloped deep mountain forest. Anything could happen. The longer it took to find her, the more danger she would be in.","The team split into two batches. One escorted the girls back and the other continued searching for people and to catch the criminals.","As the team moved forward, they discovered several dismembered corpses in succession. Gu Huaian could no longer stay calm.","Huge fear filled his heart as his limbs turned cold and his mind went blank.","Impossible. Shen Tang would definitely not have an accident!"]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: It's Too Hard","paragraphs":["After crashing into several people, the wild boar wandered around before returning to its original location. Shen Tang guessed this was likely its main base.","She sat in the tree shivering uncontrollably, constantly praying in her heart for it not to find her, for it not to find her...","However, this time, luck was not on her side. After staggering around twice, the wild boar still discovered her.","The wild boar snorted and backed up a few steps before violently charging at the tree!","Shen Tang hugged the tree tightly, but still swayed from the impact.","Not long after, the tree shook a second time.","This would not do. Although this tree was thick, it could not withstand the wild boar's brute force.","Shen Tang steeled her heart - it was now or never!","...","Upon arriving at the location, the group only saw blood stains on the ground, with no sign of Shen Tang.","Because of the wild boar, most of the human traffickers were either dead or seriously injured.","Gu Huaian pursed his lips in a straight line.","He took off his suit and calmly unbuttoned his cuffs, rolling up his sleeves. He threw a punch at Scarface.","\"Where is Shen Tang?\"","One had to admit, even his moves for punching people had a sense of beauty.","Scarface was baffled. He had no idea who Shen Tang was.","\"I don't know...\"","With a bang, another punch. \"Are you going to talk or not?\"","Scarface nearly spit out blood from the blows. \"I really don't know...\"","Seeing Gu Huaian about to hit him again, Scarface hurriedly closed his eyes to dodge, shouting loudly: \"I don't even know who Shen Tang is, beating me to death won't help!\"","Gu Huaian's movements paused briefly before he still swung his fist over.","\"She's the one you guys were chasing.\"","\"We didn't catch her!\"","Scarface spit out a tooth, on the verge of tears. He looked to the people around him, \"Are you all just going to watch him hit me? Are you even human?\"","Before he even finished speaking, everyone turned their backs.","Scarface: \"...\"","What's this about, he has no human rights?","\"Look over there!\"","Everyone rushed over, only to see a wild boar lying on the ground with its stomach still weakly rising and falling - it wasn't dead yet!","Then where was Shen Tang?","\"Shen Tang!\"","\"Are you there?\"","A faint voice sounded out, \"I'm here...\"","But no one heard it.","Shen Tang lay in the ditch, anxious to the point of tears.","【Help...!】","【Can no one hear me? Ahhhhhhhhhh!】","【Screaming! Twisted! Creeping in darkness!!!】","Hearing Shen Tang's inner voice, Gu Huaian hurriedly looked around.","Finally he discovered the barely conscious Shen Tang in a ditch nearby.","Shen Tang was moved to tears: \"Wuwuwu you finally found me...\"","Seeing her covered head-to-toe in blood and grime, Gu Huaian was at a loss.","\"You...how are you?\"","\"Are you okay?\"","Shen Tang sighed. \"Do I look okay to you?\"","【Damn, this wild boar is so strong. I suspect my hand is fractured.】","【How can this dumbass still not carry me out? Is he too disgusted by how dirty I am?】","As soon as this thought surfaced, Gu Huaian carefully picked her up into his arms.","With the help of others, Shen Tang was lifted out of the ditch.","\"Where's the doctor? Hurry and check on her condition!\"","Soon, two people came over with medical kits. The results showed Shen Tang was not well.","\"Multiple bone fractures and contusions over her body, hand bones shattered - emergency surgery is required.\"","\"Can her hands fully recover?\"","\"There's a 90% chance.\"","Shen Tang was not too worried. This probability was quite large, so there likely wouldn't be issues.","\"Right, did you guys find those girls?\"","\"Don't worry, they've all been sent home.\"","Shen Tang finally relaxed.","But she was still somewhat worried for the girl who suffered at the hands of evil men, fearing she might react poorly.","Last night when comforting that girl, Shen Tang spoke lightly, but she was heavy-hearted too.","If the knife doesn't cut your own skin, you won't know the pain. But in Shen Tang's eyes, just being alive was most important.","\"Oh right, one girl's mental condition doesn't seem good. If possible, I hope a psychologist can be arranged for her.\"","\"You should be more concerned about yourself.\" Gu Huaian ruffled Shen Tang's hair.","\"Hey! Don't mess up my hair!\"","Gu Huaian chuckled. \"Don't worry, you had no sense of style to begin with.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Gu Huaian stopped joking. First he contacted a helicopter for pickup, then called the hospital under Gu Enterprise, preparing for Shen Tang's impending surgery at a moment's notice.","After everything was arranged properly, only then did someone belatedly ask: \"So what's with this wild boar?\"","\"I beat it.\"","\"Huh?\"","\"What? You beat it?\" All the people present were shocked.","But looking at the wild boar's body, it only had internal injuries without much external damage.","Shen Tang waved her hand. \"Otherwise how would my own hands turn out like this?\"","Gu Huaian hastily grabbed her wrist. \"You're already injured, stop fidgeting.\"","Shen Tang lightly coughed. \"Umm, I killed the wild boar, so remember to take it with you. I wonder if wild boar meat tastes good...\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He truly felt it was difficult to make this woman become more reliable!","While waiting for the helicopter, Shen Tang kept bragging about her merits and prowess - how she utilized the wild boar to chase away those people, how she beat the wild boar bare-handed.","The legend goes that Wushuang beat tigers. Now there was Shen Tang beating wild boars. Teehee~","Gu Huaian endured again and again before finally unable to resist handing her a bottle of water.","Shen Tang was puzzled. \"Thank you, but I'm not thirsty.\"","\"No, you are thirsty.\"","Soon Shen Tang understood - this was because she was being too chatty.","She obediently drank some water.","\"Oh right, how did you end up in that ditch?\"","Shen Tang nearly did a spit take. This guy really knew how to poke where it hurts.","Should she tell him she accidentally fell while walking? That would be too embarrassing.","Gu Huaian sighed.","The helicopter arrived, but there was no open area nearby to land, so they could only climb up the ladder.","Gu Huaian wanted to piggyback Shen Tang up, but was firmly rejected.","\"Thanks, but I'm too heavy. You must be tired too after everything, so it's better to leave this small task to the professionals.\"","【Haha, I barely survived, can't lose my life over something minor after going through all that. If I fall from that height, I'd be smashed into pieces!】","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Perhaps knowing her inner voice was not as good as he thought after all.","It was truly too crushing."]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: One Hundred Days of Broken Bones","paragraphs":["In the end, Shen Tang still had to be carried by professionals.","Before getting on the plane, she looked back and asked, \"By the way, have those bad guys been caught?\"","\"They've been caught, don't worry,\" came the reply.","As long as they were caught, Shen Tang felt reassured about leaving.","Not long after, the helicopter landed on the roof of the hospital.","The delay en route wasn't long. Shen Tang's surgery went very well.","However, she was still forced by Gu Huaian to stay in the hospital for treatment.","What was even more annoying was that he didn't even let her play with her phone.","With no one to chat with in the private room, she could only watch TV. Shen Tang was bored to death.","Coincidentally, she saw on the news a report about the incident, with a censored photo of herself.","It could be said that the mosaic was so thick that even her own mother wouldn't recognize her.","Oh, she almost forgot, she didn't have a mother.","Because of the heavy mosaic, one could only see a human-shaped blur, surrounded by mottled blood stains, which looked terrifying.","Next, Shen Tang heard the news praising her for single-handedly rescuing all the victims. She cocked her chin arrogantly.","Look, she had made it onto the national news now.","If those anti-fans knew about this, their jaws would definitely drop!","Unfortunately, to protect their privacy, they all used pseudonyms without revealing any real information.","She couldn't even brag about it.","Just as she was bored, there was a knock at the door.","\"Come in!\"","\"How are you feeling today?\"","\"Why are you here again?\"","Shen Tang was quite surprised. \"You come three times a day. Don't you have work?\"","If his company went bankrupt, who would give her money?","Gu Huaian's footsteps paused for a moment before he walked in as usual and put down the food box.","Sometimes, the things that came out of Shen Tang's mouth really could infuriate someone.","And yet he couldn't bring himself to say it out, feeling rather frustrated.","\"I came to see how you're doing. Are you bored?\"","Shen Tang nodded her head slightly like a chicken pecking at rice. \"Um...my phone...\"","\"Your hand hasn't healed yet. You can't play with it for now.\"","\"Oh...\" The light in Shen Tang's eyes instantly died out. \"Then why did you ask?\"","\"If you're really bored, I can let your friends come keep you company. And those girls want to come see you too. Do you want to see them?\"","Shen Tang perked up again. \"Yes, yes! Let them come!\"","Shen Tang also wanted to know how they were doing now.","And what about those few anti-fans? They'd promised to become her fans. She wondered if they'd followed through.","Gu Huaian brought out the nutritious meals specially prepared by Aunt Peach and arranged them neatly on the table: \"Eat first, we'll talk after the meal.\"","\"Oh...\"","With Shen Tang's injured hand, Gu Huaian could only feed her mouthful by mouthful.","Although it wasn't the first time, Shen Tang still felt awkward about it.","Why did she feel like her and the Sugar Daddy's positions were somehow reversed?","Tsk, if others knew Gu Huaian would personally feed someone, they'd definitely be shocked.","Maybe she could brag about this for a whole year...","\"Eat properly, stop daydreaming,\" Gu Huaian rapped Shen Tang lightly on the head with his chopsticks.","Shen Tang shrank her neck obediently and answered softly.","Somehow she felt like Gu Huaian was like a tapeworm that knew everything she was thinking.","Since he insisted on not saying, she'd let it go.","After eating her fill, Shen Tang suddenly felt the urge to relieve herself.","She looked at Gu Huaian. \"Aren't you leaving yet? You'll be late for work in the afternoon.\"","\"It's fine.\"","[It's not fine for me!]","Shen Tang was extremely anxious inside.","Who knew Gu Huaian simply refused to leave. Shen Tang even suspected his bottom was glued to the seat.","In the end, Shen Tang really couldn't hold it in anymore and asked, \"Can you call the nurse for me?\"","\"Sure, what's the matter?\"","\"Nothing, just call her.\"","Gu Huaian finally called the nurse back.","He just didn't like Shen Tang's caginess. He wasn't actually trying to make her wet herself.","Since she insisted on not saying, he'd let it go.","After Gu Huaian left, with the nurse's support, Shen Tang happily used the bathroom.","Next, she looked forward to her friends' arrival.","She wondered if she'd get to play with her phone later.","For an internet addict like her, going without a phone for days was as agonizing as going through withdrawal.","The first person to visit Shen Tang after Gu Huaian was Qi Yue. She happened to be free and, upon learning that Shen Tang was hospitalized, rushed over immediately.","Qi Yue clip-clopped in wearing high heels. Seeing Shen Tang wrapped up like a zongzi, she couldn't help bursting into laughter.","\"Tangtang, how did you get injured like this?\"","Shen Tang's tone was aggrieved. \"I know, I'm injured like this and yet you're laughing...\"","Qi Yue held back her smile and put on a grave expression. \"Tangtang, what on earth happened?\"","Next, Shen Tang began to recount her thrilling ordeal this time.","Qi Yue reacted very cooperatively, constantly providing emotional feedback, which Shen Tang enjoyed very much.","\"Wow~ You're too amazing... But will your hand really be okay?\"","\"Don't worry, it's nothing serious. I just need to rest well for a while.\"","\"Can't be helped, for every broken bone it takes 100 days to heal.\"","As the two chatted, there was another knock at the door. The visitor was Shen Tang’s agent Pei Kesong.","She was holding a large fruit basket with just the right amount of concern on her face.","Shen Tang spoke first. \"What are you doing here too?\"","\"You got injured and had surgery, and didn't even tell me. I heard it from someone else.\"","Shen Tang asked who she had heard it from, but Pei Kesong didn't say.","She sighed. \"I got you a role, but now it looks like it'll have to be turned down.\"","Shen Tang was a little puzzled. \"What role?\"","\"The third female lead in Director Zhou's movie. Not much screen time, but a particularly eye-catching part. So many people fought desperately to get it.\"","\"You actually got it?!\" Shen Tang was genuinely shocked.","She started wondering who her agent really was. After all, getting into Director Zhou's movies wasn't just about having money.","Pei Kesong rolled her eyes. \"Yes I got it, but now that you're injured, you can't do it.\"","\"What a pity, I guess it just wasn't meant to be.\" Shen Tang also felt it was a shame.","Her injury this time would probably delay many things. She'd be forced to rest for a while.","But if it happened again, she would still make the same choice.","Qi Yue, who had been playing the background wall the whole time, suddenly spoke up. \"Are you from the Pei family?\"","Pei Kesong nodded. \"Ms. Qi, pleased to meet you. I'm a big fan.\"","\"I really didn't expect you to become an agent.\"","Pei Kesong shrugged. \"Just like how I didn't expect you to become a celebrity.\"","\"I won't be for much longer.\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Tang nearly bounced off the bed. \"What do you mean by that?\"","Qi Yue grimaced, seemingly reluctant. \"I made an agreement with my family earlier. We'd see if I could make it big in this industry without relying on them. Clearly I failed, so now I have to withdraw from the entertainment circle and return home as agreed.\"","Shen Tang wiped the drool from the corner of her mouth. \"I also want to go home and inherit the family business. Wuwuwu...\"","Where on earth were her mysterious rich parents? When would they finally come to take her home?!"]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: It Is to Cherish the Moment","paragraphs":["Qi Yue didn't stay long before leaving, saying he had to prepare for the dissolution of his contract and inheritance of the family business.","Shen Tang was so envious that tears nearly spilled from the corners of her eyes.","She gossiped and asked, \"Which Pei family was Qi Yue talking about earlier?\"","Pei Kesong rubbed Shen Tang's hair, \"Be good, don't ask about things you shouldn't.\"","Shen Tang pouted, \"Nevermind if you won't say.\"","She'd ask Gu Huaian later.","Pei Kesong smiled gently, \"You focus on recovering from your injury, and I'll tear up resources for you once you've healed.\"","\"Actually, there's no need to work that hard...\" Shen Tang didn't know whether or not to tell him about her plans to retire from the industry and live peacefully.","Clearly they were partners, yet she strangely felt as if she'd betrayed him. She didn't dare say a word.","\"Don't worry, I will definitely make you a first-tier actress.\" Pei Kesong said earnestly.","Shen Tang opened her mouth: \"Oh...\"","Pei Kesong didn't stay long either. He still had a lot to deal with.","Although Shen Tang didn't know what he was busy with, after all, she was still his only artist.","The room emptied out again, and Shen Tang again felt bored.","Soon, faint footsteps sounded outside, followed by a soft knock on the door. \"Shen Tang, are you there?\"","Shen Tang jerked her head towards the door. That voice...","\"I'm here, come in!\"","A group of girls swarmed in, pushing each other. No one spoke first.","It had to be said, these girls were all very good-looking, a sight for sore eyes.","Shen Tang spoke first: \"How are you all?\"","\"Very good!\"","\"We're fine, but you, how did you get injured so severely...\"","\"If not for us, you wouldn't have gotten hurt...\" The girls began crying as they spoke.","Shen Tang hurried to comfort them, \"Don't think too much, this was just an accident...\"","She looked closely at the group and didn't see the bullied girl. Her heart lurched. \"Is someone missing?\"","\"She's also hospitalized. Haven't you seen her?\" The girls looked at her with large, confused eyes.","\"Should I have seen her?\" Shen Tang looked down at her thoroughly wrapped limbs. It was difficult just getting out of bed.","\"She's also being treated at this hospital.\"","Shen Tang was angry. That damn Gu Huaian must have deliberately not told her!","She'd asked several times!","\"Sit down, there's fruit here. Help yourselves, I can't get up to serve you all.\"","She had previously felt bored without a neighbor. Now she suddenly felt a suite to herself was quite nice, at least there was a long sofa and chairs. Otherwise with so many people, there wouldn't be enough seats.","\"Oh right, I remember a few of you used to be my little antis...\"","The girls' faces instantly turned red as they softly explained, \"We're not antis anymore...\"","\"We've already joined the fan group. From now on we'll help promote you every day and scold others for you.\"","\"Ah...there's no need for that. I have too many antis, you can't argue with them. Just pay more attention to my work.\"","Although it seemed she didn't have much work.","Looking at the cute, obedient faces before her, Shen Tang deeply felt that they'd probably cry after being scolded a few times.","The girls looked at each other and smiled without explaining further.","The girls also didn't stay long, afraid to disturb Shen Tang's rest.","Just as they were leaving, they happened to run into Ao Ziping and her group.","Both sides paused in surprise.","One girl timidly asked, \"Are...are you Ao Ziping? Can I get an autograph?\"","\"Sure!\"","But they realized there was no pen or paper for her to sign.","Ao Ziping said, \"Go back and private message me your address on Weibo. I'll mail the autograph to you.\"","\"Great, great! Thank you, you're so nice. Keep it up, you'll definitely shine brightly!\"","Ao Ziping blushed happily, \"Thank you!\"","Upon seeing Shen Tang after entering the room, Huo Yingying's eyes instantly turned red.","\"How did you get hurt so badly?\"","Ao Ziping's focus was rather unique. \"Did you really beat a wild boar to death with your bare hands?\"","Shen Tang shook her head. \"Didn't beat it to death, but it was nearly dead.\"","\"Wow!\"","Ao Ziping sucked in a breath and gave a thumbs up. \"Awesome!\"","Huo Yingying's brows furrowed as she looked at Shen Tang's injured hand, her face full of disapproval.","\"What were you thinking, daring to fight a wild boar? If not for your strength, would I have ever seen you again?\"","Huo Yingying was both angry and afraid, tears flowing freely down her face.","Shen Tang hurried to comfort her and raised her arm, only to find her hand wrapped like a zongzi.","\"Don't...don't cry anymore. Ao Ziping, can you pass me the tissues from the table?\"","\"Oh...\"","Huo Yingying wiped her tears. \"Focus on recovering. Don't move around recklessly. Oh right, do you know, you made it on the hot search!\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Tang carefully thought about what could have put her on the hot search.","\"Could it be because news broke that I'm hospitalized?\"","\"Yeah...more or less...\" Huo Yingying had an expression like she was watching a good show. \"Someone secretly took photos of you and said you were beaten and crippled by a legal wife after being discovered as the mistress.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She said in disbelief: \"No way people actually believed such an idiot rumor...\"","\"Ahem, congratulations on guessing right. Quite a lot of people online believed it.\"","Shen Tang frowned. \"How come no one told me?\"","\"They were probably afraid to worry you. But don't worry, the perpetrator has been found out. It was a young nurse who got fired.\"","Shen Tang had a bizarre feeling of being forcibly involved.","\"What was she after? Could she have been my anti?\"","Huo Yingying shook her head. \"I don't know. I just heard from others. I heard President Gu was very angry about it and is suing the big Vs who spread rumors online.\"","When you’re not on the rivers and lakes, the rivers and lakes still have legends about you.","Listening to Huo Yingying's words made Shen Tang's heart itch. She very much wanted to see what the situation online was like now.","To be honest, what she actually wanted more was to wildly boast about fighting off that wild boar with her bare hands. It was such an awesome feat she could brag about her whole life.","Thinking this, Shen Tang suddenly wondered what had happened to that wild boar. She still hadn't eaten wild boar meat!","She decided to ask Gu Huaian about it when he came by that evening.","As it neared dusk, Xu JiaoJiao also came.","Seeing so many people in the room, she didn't say much, just greeted them and sat to the side.","It wasn't until the others had left that she finally voiced her doubts: \"I remember nothing like this happened in our last life.\"","\"There are no absolutes in the world's affairs. Every choice will impact the road ahead. Don't cling to the past. You should cherish the present instead.\"","Shen Tang sighed, as if she had crossed into a book, she didn't always adhere to the plot either, but lived her own life instead.","Xu JiaoJiao was stunned for a moment, then revealed a bitter smile. \"You're right. I was confused.\"","She could also clearly feel that the Shen Tang of this life was somewhat different from that of the previous life, with an indistinct feeling of estrangement.","\"You...rest well, I'll come see you again tomorrow.\"","\"No need.\"","Xu JiaoJiao's expression changed. \"Tangtang, I...\"","\"You just started filming, right? Coming back and forth is too troublesome. And I'm doing fine here, don't worry.\"","Xu JiaoJiao smiled. \"It's no trouble at all, I'm not tired.\"","\"But you really should rest more these days. So I won't come tomorrow.\"","Shen Tang murmured in agreement.","After Xu JiaoJiao left, her expression collapsed.","She really has changed..."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: She just made the same mistake every woman makes.","paragraphs":["Over the next few days, Shen Tang lay in the hospital room like a complete invalid, needing people to help with everything from eating and drinking to using the bathroom.","If it were someone else, they might have felt ashamed or uncomfortable, but Shen Tang adapted to this lifestyle quickly. Other than boredom, there were no downsides.","Gu Huaian still had not returned Shen Tang's phone, so to pass the time she could only watch TV or chat with visiting friends. She had to admit, it felt a bit like she was already retired.","Gu Huaian came every day to bring meals and feed her. Scarily, Shen Tang was getting used to it.","On this day, it was not Gu Huaian who came with the meal, but Tao Sister.","Shen Tang was taken aback for a moment and picked at her food absentmindedly. Even Tao Sister noticed.","She jokingly asked, \"Is Madam missing her husband?\"","Shen Tang loudly denied, \"Why would I miss him?\"","Little did she know, her reaction seemed like she had been found out and was now flustered.","\"Yes yes, you're not missing your husband, I was the one missing him,\" Tao Sister said.","After hesitating for a bit, under Tao Sister's teasing gaze, Shen Tang still asked: \"Why...didn't he come today?\"","Tao Sister's face broke into a grin. \"The young master is--\"","Shen Tang perked up her ears.","\"He's working overtime.\"","\"Oh,\" Shen Tang responded. \"Overtime?\"","That's it?","Tao Sister unrestrainedly laughed out loud. \"What else could it be? The young master works around the clock between home, office and hospital.\"","Shen Tang awkwardly laughed, rather embarrassed that she had underestimated him. She had thought he was tired of this. Turns out she was judging an honorable man by her own mean measure.","After Tao Sister cleaned up the food containers, she took out a phone and placed it on the table.","\"This is...\" Shen Tang could barely hide her excitement.","\"The young master will be very busy these next few days. He specially told me to bring this phone over for you. However he said, with your hand still healing, you're only allowed an hour of use every day outside of necessary moments.\"","An hour would do! Shen Tang was starving. Days without internet or a phone were not fit for human living. She was becoming devoid of worldly desires.","\"Hurry, help me turn it on!\"","Under Tao Sister's helpless gaze, Shen Tang clumsily operated the phone with her left hand.","In truth her left hand injury wasn't too bad, she just couldn't lift heavy objects. Her right hand was more troublesome.","Upon turning on the phone, her WeChat was bursting with messages.","She replied to the important ones and opened up Weibo. Her fan group was also very lively with an influx of new people.","However, her mood instantly sank when she swiped upon Miao Miao's moments - Welcome back Lian Sister, love love.","She clicked open the attached photos of a banquet scene where a girl with innocent and outstanding looks stood smiling sweetly among the crowd.","So this was Gu Huaian's so-called white moonlight that he used to pine for? She really was quite beautiful.","Although Gu Huaian had said he didn't have a white moonlight figure, Shen Tang believed that where there's smoke, there's fire. *cough cough* Why else would Miao Miao be so deeply mistaken?","Perhaps out of some indescribable feeling, Shen Tang zoomed into the photo and suddenly noticed a hand wearing the same watch as the one Gu Huaian had recently worn, in the bottom left corner.","Her heart instantly sank.","Shen Tang inspected it over and over to confirm it was that same watch. She told herself perhaps it was just a similar model by coincidence. Besides, just a hand, watch and wrist didn't definitively prove anything.","It didn't necessarily have to be Gu Huaian.","However she still couldn't help the assumptions running wild in her mind, leaving her heart feeling sour.","She opened up Gu Huaian's WeChat. Their last conversation was from many days ago already.","She typed and deleted potential messages over and over again, but ultimately sent nothing.","It seemed she didn't have the right to ask anything.","Shen Tang clutched her chest. What was happening to her?","Could she have developed some feelings for Gu Huaian?","It must have been because he had been treating her too well recently, easily giving her the treasured feeling of being cared for. And in both her lifetimes she had been an orphan, longing desperately for that.","Shen Tang repeatedly reminded herself that theirs was a contractual marriage, a contractual marriage, a contractual marriage.","These strange emotions must be from having seen too few men.","And so, Shen Tang opened Weibo and started swiping photos of handsome men and beauties.","In no time at all her eyes were dazzled by the fresh meat and enticing bodies.","I'd love to slide down those abs!","The weather is dry, kissmenow","The waters and mountains of Bashu are desolate. Beautiful women, please marry me.","Do you smell something burning? That's my heart burning for you.","...","Just as Shen Tang was throwing herself into pleasure viewing, she suddenly received a call from her agent Pei Kesong.","\"Hello?\"","\"Shen Tang! Stop what you're doing this instant!\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Don't tell me you were browsing on your main account!\"","Shen Tang was about to deny it but upon checking Weibo discovered she had indeed forgotten to switch accounts.","She awkwardly responded \"If I told you this was all just an accident, would you believe me?\"","Pei Kesong took a deep breath to restrain himself from the urge to beat someone up.","\"It doesn't matter if I believe you or not, it matters if your netizen fans believe you or not! Don't use that account anymore, I'll talk to the company to figure things out.\"","\"Oh...\"","The call quickly ended. Shen Tang's good mood from earlier vanished instantly.","\"At least my private account didn't get exposed...\" Carefully recalling her earlier comments, luckily there hadn't been anything too vulgar said.","Shen Tang felt confused that she got discovered so quickly even though she hadn't even browsed for long. Upon checking the small account, she realized it turned out that hottie she had commented on was actually one of her antis. He had coincidentally just posted fresh new photos which she happened to scroll upon and comment under in her carelessness.","Shen Tang decided to retract her earlier words. This man was not handsome at all! To suffer from such eye disease at his young age, and even have the gall to mock her, an ugly toad wanting to eat the swan's meat!","Pfth! If anyone's the toad here, it's him!","Opening the comments section on her main Weibo, other than some familiar vicious antis, most passersby reactions were surprisingly not too extreme, largely just playful mocking.","Haha looks like Shen Tang forgot to switch accounts!","Who would've thought I, a normal netizen, would share the same taste in girls as a female celebrity. It's like we're peers!","Wahhh I went and bumped into someone's girlfriend, and quite a few at that!","Worth mentioning were several powerful fans who leapt valiantly to her defense, just about cussing out the antis into shutting up.","In the end Shen Tang still couldn't resist and ended up switching through eighteen small accounts to clap back against those vulgar, nasty commenters.","People are born with innate desires. What was wrong with her looking at some videos and pictures and messing around a bit?","She had just made a common mistake many women have made. Did people have to criticize her to this extent?"]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: White Moonlight","paragraphs":["Shen Tang received a notification from her agent saying that the company was preparing to whitewash her image.","Unlike those who had cursed people and accidentally liked posts, her recent behavior was somewhat silly, so it would be easy to clear up.","The company's water army and marketing accounts went into action. The comments were almost one-sided, all feeling that Shen Tang was funny.","Even the old photos that anti-fans had previously enlarged with a microscope of her making eye contact with a male artist were now changed from her liking him to her simply being a face fanatic.","It had to be said, the entertainment industry had so much real and fake, it was impossible for outsiders to distinguish. You only saw what people wanted you to see.","To be honest, Shen Tang was a little surprised. She had thought the company was going to completely ignore her. It seemed she still had utilitarian value.","It would be good to make use of the company’s resources for free. Although she wanted to retire from the industry, if her image could be restored, that would be great.","Pei Kesong repeatedly urged, \"Don't randomly log into Weibo these days.\"","\"Don't worry, next time I surf the Internet, I’ll definitely use my alt account,\" Shen Tang said, also a little scared. Fortunately, she hadn't posted anything she shouldn't have posted this time. Cough cough.","Just as she was talking, Shen Tang thought of those fans who had bravely confronted anti-fans to defend her. She couldn't let them work for nothing.","So she stealthily logged into her main Weibo account and sent several big red packets to fan groups.","[It's the real Tangtang!]","[Ahhh such big red packets!]","[Tangtang darling, I love you, mwah.]","Shen Tang simply replied to them a few times before hurriedly logging off Weibo again. She didn't want to cause trouble out of nothing.","Perhaps from playing on her phone for too long, her hand was starting to hurt a little. Shen Tang quickly put her phone away.","Soon after, Gu Huaian pushed the door open and entered.","Shen Tang's face turned red from tension. That was a close call, she almost got caught.","Gu Huaian raised an eyebrow. Caught doing what?","\"You're not sleeping yet? Why is your face so red?\" He casually leaned in and put his hand on Shen Tang's forehead. \"No fever.\"","Shen Tang blushed even more from him touching her head.","Damn, how could anyone have such a nice voice! Her ears were going soft.","However, Shen Tang remembered the main issue and glanced at his wrist from the side of her eye. It seemed he wasn't wearing a watch?","\"Where's your watch?\"","\"Hmm? I forgot to put it on after showering. What's the matter?\"","\"Nothing. I just asked randomly.\"","Shen Tang sighed to herself. When did she become so anxious and doubtful?","This wasn't good.","Men were just an adjuvant in life, they couldn't become the center. Loving someone required loving oneself first.","As Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian’s perfectly sculpted face, she suddenly felt at peace. With a face crafted so meticulously by the Creator, who couldn't love it...","Gu Huaian's lips curved up slightly. This girl was still as lustful as always, even when injured.","Shen Tang voiced her doubt, \"Oh right, why did you come over so late?\"","\"I finished up work and came to see you. Where's your phone?\"","Since he said he had finished up work, then that was that.","It wasn't that Shen Tang blindly believed Gu Huaian, but he had no need to lie.","Suddenly she felt happy. \"It's under my pillow.\"","Gu Huaian took out the phone and touched it. It was still hot. He said in a mocking tone, \"Looks like you were on it quite a bit.\"","Shen Tang's eyes shifted around evasively. \"No I wasn't. Just played for a bit...\"","She felt a little nervous inside. Surely her phone hadn't heated up so quickly that it would be confiscated now!","Gu Huaian didn't say anything else, only, \"Don't play so long tomorrow. It’s not good for your wound recovery.\"","\"Got it...\"","The cold CEO suddenly becoming like a teaching director felt a bit unfamiliar.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He really wanted to let her experience what a real teaching director was like.","Shen Tang mulled it over and suddenly felt that blindly guessing was useless compared to directly asking the person involved.","\"Um... I saw on Miao Miao’s timeline that your white moonlight is back. Didn't you go pick her up?\"","Shen Tang looked calm on the surface but was extremely anxious inside. The sugar daddy wouldn’t think she was prying too much right...","\"Who?\"","\"White moonlight.\"","\"Who is white moonlight?\" Gu Huaian pressed between his eyebrows. \"I remember telling you last time that I don't have a white moonlight.\"","Shen Tang lightly coughed. \"That girl called Lotus or something. She looks very beautiful with good temperament.\"","Very suitable for you.","However, Shen Tang didn't voice out the second half of her thoughts, not knowing what she was thinking.","Gu Huaian ruffled Shen Tang's hair. \"Have you been secretly reading romance novels?\"","\"Huh?\"","\"How else could you imagine such things?\"","Gu Huaian explained, \"Our families are business partners, so we inevitably have contact, but I haven't had any private interactions with her. I just showed my face at the banquet today before returning to work.\"","Shen Tang desperately held back the corners of her mouth that desperately wanted to rise up. \"I see...\"","Gu Huaian flicked his finger at the tip of Shen Tang's nose. \"Go ahead and laugh if you want.\"","This action caused both people to freeze up momentarily. It was a little too intimate.","\"Um...\"","\"I...\"","They both started talking at the same time, and an awkward atmosphere permeated the surroundings.","\"What did you want to say?\" Shen Tang asked, averting her gaze.","\"I'll be very busy the next few days. Aunt Tao will come to take care of you.\"","\"Oh...\"","She felt a little disappointed but still understood. After all, he still had a huge company to manage.","Gu Huaian ruffled Shen Tang's hair again. \"Don't overthink!\"","\"Ow, you're messing up my hair!\"","Shen Tang felt a little annoyed. Her hair was almost a bird's nest now.","The corners of Gu Huaian's lips curved up slightly again. \"Alright, I'm going. Rest early.\"","After Gu Huaian left, with the nurse's help, Shen Tang simply washed up and got into bed counting sheep. She didn't know when she fell asleep.","In a daze, she returned to the real world and saw her unmoving body lying in the hospital room with various tubes inserted into it. She had lost some weight.","Shen Tang tried entering her body but couldn't integrate in.","She tried a few more times but still failed.","During this time, the nurse came in a few times, and her friends had come once too. Their expressions couldn't hide their grief.","A pain suddenly pierced Shen Tang's heart—if she never woke up again, her friends would definitely be really upset...","For a moment, she really wanted to return to this body.","A voice sounded in her ear: \"Are you sure you want to go back?\"","Shen Tang woke up in shock, her body drenched in cold sweat. \"It was just a dream...\"","She still remembered what the voice had said after—If she returned to the real world, she could never come back here again.","Shen Tang didn't rashly agree; she didn't feel this was an ordinary dream. She was afraid that if she agreed, she really wouldn't be able to come back.","To be honest, she felt conflicted now.","Logically, she should go back, but she had more money here!","Money she couldn't earn in an entire lifetime in the real world.","Plus the plot was different from before now. As long as she properly stayed for two years, she could leave with money.","It was just a pity that such a perfect man like Gu Huaian could only be seen and not touched.","Shen Tang clicked her tongue. The more she thought about it, the more regretful she felt.","Out of habit, she reached for her phone to relieve her anxiety by looking at some fresh bodies. She suddenly remembered what happened yesterday and embarrassing pulled her hand back.","Forget it, she should abstain recently."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: May all good luck be in sight.","paragraphs":["Shen Tang was ready to be discharged from the hospital.","Having recovered well, she could now return home to rest, especially since they had a family doctor there.","Tao Sister packed their belongings while Shen Tang sat in a wheelchair, being pushed by the two excited little ones.","\"Sister, is your leg seriously injured?\"","\"It's not too bad.\"","\"Then can you get up and let me sit for a while?\"","Shen Tang turned her head to look at Gu Wuyang and asked, \"Are you serious?\"","\"Yeah, I've never been on a wheelchair before!\"","Shen Tang glanced at her own leg, then back at Gu Wuyang. \"Didn't you see that my leg is injured? I can't get up.\"","Gu Wuyang scratched her head. \"But you just said it's not too bad.\"","Shen Tang sighed, \"That was just a polite remark. You shouldn't take it seriously.\"","Gu Wuyang pouted. \"Grown-ups can be so hypocritical.\"","Shen Tang nodded, feeling the same way.","Children are better. They say what they mean, like what they like, and dislike what they dislike.","While chatting, Tao Sister finished packing everything.","When they arrived, Shen Tang was alone, but now there were several suitcases, and she had no idea where all these things came from.","\"Madam, shall we go back now?\"","\"Wait, I want to see someone.\"","Shen Tang went to the door of the room where the girl who had been bullied was staying. She looked through the window on the door and saw her chatting with her family. Although her face was pale, she couldn't hide her smile.","She seemed to be in good spirits.","Shen Tang didn't want to disturb her abruptly, so she asked a nurse for a piece of paper and wrote a sentence, instructing the nurse to pass it to her.","\"Madam, aren't you going in?\"","\"If she's fine, then I can rest assured. Let's go.\"","Having witnessed her vulnerable side, Shen Tang was afraid that her presence would remind her of unpleasant memories.","As Shen Tang left, the girl seemed to sense something and looked towards the door.","\"What's wrong?\"","The girl smiled and shook her head. \"Nothing, I just feel like someone is watching me.\"","\"Maybe it's a doctor.\"","The girl nodded. \"Perhaps.\"","After a while, a nurse knocked on the door and handed her a piece of paper. It said, \"May good fortune follow wherever your gaze falls.\"","The girl held it tightly. \"Hello, may I ask who sent this?\"","\"It's from Shen Tang, Miss Shen.\"","The girl revealed a bright smile. \"It's her...\"","A middle-aged woman beside her seemed lost in thought and made a note of the name.","The tail end of summer passed by in a blink, and autumn arrived unnoticed.","Shen Tang wore a sweatshirt and a short skirt, with a cap on her head, holding a cup of milk tea, squatting by the roadside and sipping it.","Qi Yue drove by, searching for her and eventually resorted to making a phone call.","\"Where are you?\"","Shen Tang stood up, threw the empty milk tea cup into the trash bin, and then waved her hand. \"I'm here!\"","Qi Yue took off her sunglasses, looked her up and down, and couldn't help showing a look of disdain. \"You're wearing that?\"","Shen Tang lowered her head and looked at herself, feeling puzzled.","\"What's wrong with what I'm wearing?\"","She thought it looked pretty good. Just look at those slender and fair legs.","Then she looked at Qi Yue, well, dressed in a formal gown and high heels. There seemed to be quite a gap between the two of them.","Qi Yue sighed, \"Never mind, we're running out of time, let's go like this.\"","Shen Tang had no idea what they were going to do until she sat in the car.","The night before, Qi Yue had messaged her saying that she wanted to show her the world, and Shen Tang eagerly agreed.","\"So, where are we going?\" Shen Tang asked.","Qi Yue gave her a disdainful look. \"You're only asking now? I thought you weren't curious.\"","\"Hehe, I trust you,\" Shen Tang replied.","\"I'm taking you to a banquet to expand your network,\" Qi Yue said.","Shen Tang had never attended a banquet before. In her mind, it was filled with successful individuals discussing high-end business deals while holding glasses of red wine.","Upon hearing Shen Tang's thoughts, Qi Yue burst into laughter. \"Haha, don't think too highly of them. They're just a bunch of posers. You'll see when you meet them tonight.\"","Before long, the car stopped, and Qi Yue pulled Shen Tang out of the car and up the stairs, finally pushing her towards a man who didn't seem quite straightforward.","\"Tony, please give her a full makeover,\" Qi Yue said.","Upon hearing the name, Shen Tang couldn't help but think sarcastically, \"Do all stylists have the same name?\"","Tony raised his delicate fingers and flirtatiously glanced at Qi Yue. \"Miss, any specific requests?\"","\"Just make her look good,\" Qi Yue replied.","Shen Tang paused for a moment, realizing how simple and unassuming the request was.","First, she had a full-body spa treatment, followed by the selection of a dress.","Qi Yue pulled out a dress and tossed it to her. \"Let me try this one.\"","It was a seemingly simple dress with hidden intricacies, revealing an exquisite back and collarbone.","Whether it could captivate men, Qi Yue wasn't sure, but it would certainly mesmerize women.","Qi Yue thought Shen Tang would look stunning in it.","Tony was also amazed. \"Wow, this dress suits you perfectly. Miss Shen, come, sit here, and I'll do your makeup.\"","\"Wow, your skin is flawless, not a single blemish,\" Tony exclaimed.","\"Oh my, your eyelashes are so long, I'm envious,\" he continued.","\"Oh my goodness, you...\" Shen Tang wanted to ask if everyone here spoke like him, but she held back.","She smiled faintly and said, \"Thank you for the compliments. You look beautiful too.\"","Tony blushed shyly. \"Oh, you have a good eye. By the way, do you have a boyfriend?\"","Before Shen Tang could answer, Tony said, \"I have a boyfriend, and he's in the same circle as you.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Ah... I wish you both a lifetime of happiness,\" Tony said.","\"Thank you for the kind words,\" Shen Tang responded.","Tony seemed to have thought of something and giggled mischievously, making Shen Tang worry that he might mess up the eyeliner due to his shaky hands.","It must be said that Tony, as a stylist for celebrities, had his skills.","Shen Tang opened her eyes again and looked at her familiar yet unfamiliar self in the mirror. She was momentarily stunned.","Was she always this beautiful? Hahaha.","Shen Tang smiled, revealing all sixteen teeth. Qi Yue frowned and told her to tone it down.","Shen Tang chuckled and took out her phone to start taking pictures.","After all, she wouldn't look this beautiful every day, so she had to capture the moment in photos.","She picked the most attractive photo and sent it to Gu Huaian, only to quickly retract it.","Qi Yue witnessed the entire exchange and asked, \"Why did you retract it?\"","Teasingly, she added, \"Boyfriend? When are you going to introduce me?\"","Blushing, Shen Tang shook her head and said, \"No, it's my boss.\"","\"Oh,\" Qi Yue drawled, clearly unconvinced.","Just then, a notification sound from WeChat chimed.","[Wealthy Dad: Why did you retract it? I didn't see what you sent.]","Qi Yue raised an eyebrow. She didn't think Shen Tang would be someone's sugar baby; it must be a matter of amusement.","Tsk, she really knows how to play."]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: He doesn't think he's handsome, does he","paragraphs":["Shen Tang sent the photo again, shyly asking: How is it?","[Sugar Daddy: Very beautiful]","Just two simple words made Shen Tang's heart flutter happily like a little deer bouncing around.","Qi Yue pinched her cheek: \"Well done.\"","Shen Tang's little face flushed red. She did seem to be a bit shameless.","But that was Gu Huaian! Even the female protagonist of the original story couldn't get that man!","[Sugar Daddy: Do you have plans tonight?]","Only then did Shen Tang remember that he had said earlier he had something to do tonight and told her to wait at home.","[Silly Monkey in Love: My friend asked me to go out. Did you have something for me to do when you said to wait for you earlier?]","[Sugar Daddy: No]","Shen Tang strangely felt that he didn't seem very happy.","Maybe it was just her illusion. After all, it was only two words without even seeing the person.","After getting ready, the two got in the car and headed for the banquet.","After arriving, Shen Tang was very nervous. Qi Yue held her hand all along, which did give her some strength.","It was just that she felt many people's gazes falling on her back, making her very uncomfortable.","Qi Yue brought Shen Tang to the dessert area and explained, \"Wait for me here. I'll go pay my respects to the elders.\"","\"Go on.\"","Looking at the various high-end desserts, Shen Tang's mouth was already watering. She now only had one thought—eat them!","It had to be said, the desserts here were really delicious, and they were all in small pieces, which made it convenient for her to try them.","\"Shen Tang? What are you doing here?\"","Shen Tang looked back, somewhat puzzled, \"Sorry, you are...?\"","The man revealed an incredulous expression. \"Shen Tang, are you really forgetting or just pretending? You didn't say you had such a bad memory when we were dating before.\"","Shen Tang suddenly realized, \"Oh, so you're my ex-boyfriend. You look decent now, I didn't recognize you. What are you doing here?\"","\"I'm here with— No, wait, I asked first. What are you doing here?\"","Although the man now looked normal, his IQ didn't seem too high.","\"Stop!\" Shen Tang made a \"stop\" gesture.","\"Didn't I say it before? A qualified ex should be treated as dead. Why did you come to find me?\"","\"Do you really think I care to talk to you? If it wasn't for—\"","\"If it wasn't for what?\"","\"I have a friend who's recently investing in a TV drama. He just thought you look a lot like the third female lead and wondered if you'd be interested in meeting him?\"","Shen Tang directly refused: \"Not interested.\"","\"Well, since you're not interested, I'll be going then.\" With that, the man reached out to grab Shen Tang's arm.","Shen Tang frowned and forcefully slapped his hand away. \"I said I'm not interested. Can't you understand people?\"","Seeing his reddened hand, the man's face also sank. \"Shen Tang, don't be ungrateful. That's the third female lead role. With your usually limited resources, you should seize the opportunity when you get it. Or do you expect to get the first female lead? Heh, you really aim high but your abilities are lacking.\"","Here we go again. She thought he had recovered his senses, but clearly there was still something wrong with his brain.","Just then, a tall figure suddenly appeared next to them. \"What's going on here?\"","Shen Tang looked up to see it was Gu Jinan.","At this time, his almond eyes seemed to be smiling as they swept over her. Shen Tang suddenly felt goosebumps on her arm.","Although not as rich as Gu Huaian, Gu Jinan was also not to be trifled with. Seeing him, the ex-boyfriend became very nervous.","Gu Jinan stepped closer, and his tall stature put pressure on Shen Tang.","\"Sister-in-law, what are you doing here alone?\"","\"I came with a friend. I have something to do, so I won't disturb you.\"","Shen Tang turned to leave, but Gu Jinan suddenly grabbed her wrist, and his thumb even gently caressed it.","\"Why is sister-in-law leaving?\" he asked deeply while looking at her, his almond eyes clearly reflecting her image.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Help, he doesn't think he's handsome, does he?","With her other hand, she forcefully pried his wandering fingers off one by one.","\"If you don't want your hand anymore, I can help you with that.\"","Gu Jinan suddenly laughed out loud. \"Sister-in-law, you really are amusing.\"","\"Are you trying to say, 'Woman, you've successfully caught my attention'? Tsk, how greasy. Let me make a suggestion, go degrease yourself.\"","Gu Jinan's smile remained, but it turned fake.","Shen Tang couldn't be bothered to respond to him and just left.","She was completely unaware that Gu Jinan stood in place watching her back for a long time before someone came to greet him and he resumed his previous demeanor.","Shen Tang sent Qi Yue a message and then went to the lounge area in the corner to rest.","She had thought she could relax for a while, but didn't expect more shameless people to come over.","Shen Tang suddenly understood what Qi Yue had said before—most of the people here were rogues. Normal people were too few.","At the moment, a potbellied, Mediterranean-looking man in a suit walked over holding two glasses of wine and casually sat down next to Shen Tang, overly familiar.","\"Here alone?\"","Not waiting for Shen Tang to reply, he went on, \"I'm also alone. Since we met by chance, why not have a drink together?\"","Shen Tang frowned. What does he mean met by chance? Wasn't it clearly that he deliberately came over?","\"Sorry, I'm allergic to alcohol.\"","The Mediterranean man was taken aback for a moment. \"No problem, the alcohol content in this drink is very low, it's mostly juice.\"","Shen Tang smiled. \"Sorry, I'm also allergic to fruit juices.\"","The Mediterranean man realized Shen Tang was deliberately brushing him off and his face turned unpleasant.","He forced a smile. \"Let's be honest. I'm currently investing in a TV drama. I think you look a lot like the third female lead role. Would you be interested in meeting about it?\"","\"Thank you, but I don't plan on taking any roles right now.\"","The smile completely slipped from the Mediterranean man's face.","\"Shen Tang, who do you think you're fooling? Do you think I don't know about your measly situation? I'm giving you a chance here.\"","\"Oh, so you know me. That saves me the introduction. Since you have such a great opportunity, just keep it for yourself. I'm not worthy. That's it, you take care now.\"","This time, Shen Tang didn't leave again. She realized she might have a trash magnet aura—wherever she went, someone would come over. So she might as well just relax here comfortably.","Anyway, why should she take the fall for others?","The Mediterranean man was furious but couldn't do much with so many people around.","He just coldly snorted, \"There will come a time when you'll be begging me.\"","Shen Tang dug out her ear, indifferent. \"I'll wait and see then.\"","As someone ready to retire from the industry, she feared nothing. He could use whatever means he wanted.","After waiting a while longer, Qi Yue finally returned, along with a man in a suit and leather shoes.","Shen Tang stood up.","\"Shen Tang, this is my brother, Qi Jue. Brother, this is Shen Tang.\"","\"Hello.\"","The two shook hands briefly.","Qi Jue bid them farewell and left. Only then did Qi Yue quietly explain to Shen Tang, \"My brother is preparing to enter the entertainment industry recently. Would you want to join my brother's company?\"","\"Huh?\"","Shen Tang was a bit confused. \"Then why didn't you join when you were in the entertainment industry before?\"","Qi Yue rolled his eyes. \"He recently met a girl he likes. He feels like it's quite tough for her to struggle in the entertainment industry, so he wants to protect her.\"","\"Sigh, I really am an adopted sister.\"","Only then did Shen Tang react late. \"What did you say your brother is called?\"","\"Qi Jue. What's wrong?\"","Shen Tang gasped. Wasn't this one of the male leads who pined for the female protagonist in the original book?","The entertainment company he set up focused on promoting the female protagonist alone. Its full name was \"Protecting the Female Lead\". He won the female protagonist many resources.","The female protagonist became the youngest Grand Slam Best Actress in history.","\"Tang Tang, think about it.\"","Shen Tang absentmindedly nodded.","She did need to consider this carefully."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: Isn't He too nice","paragraphs":["Shen Tang did not immediately agree to Qi Yue's suggestion.","To be honest, although the female protagonist of the original book was very kind, she still did not want to get involved with her.","In case the plot god awakened one day, things would turn bad.","However, it had to be said that Qi Jue's company treated its artists very well. If she wanted to continue working in the entertainment industry, this would be a very good place to go.","Qi Yue did not mind. Next, he took Shen Tang to meet several people, all well-known figures in the entertainment industry, and most importantly, they had good character.","It was not until after 10 pm that the two finally left.","In the car, they both took off their high heels and sprawled inelegantly on the back seat.","\"This job really isn't meant for humans.\" Shen Tang rubbed her cheeks. Her face was almost cramped from smiling, and she had drunk quite a lot too.","She rubbed her eyebrows. Even though the alcohol had low proof, it still got to her head a little, making her dizzy.","Qi Yue sighed. \"Ever since I was little I have attended many banquets like this, and couldn't refuse even if I wanted to.\"","It was even worse when she was little. The adults would compete with each other, and she had to take all kinds of classes since young and excel in them.","Sometimes for the family business, she would also have to chat amiably with people she did not like.","The rich do not have it easy either. They enjoy what they should enjoy, and have to bear what they should bear.","Even her future marriage would become a bargaining chip.","Qi Yue did not say any of these out loud.","After lying down for a while, Shen Tang fell asleep unknowingly.","When she woke up, she gave a start.","She realized that she was actually lying in her bed at home, and her clothes had been changed into pajamas. Her makeup seemed to be removed too, her face felt clean.","How did she get home?","Shen Tang tried hard to recall, but could not remember anything.","Her throat felt parched. As Shen Tang got up, she noticed a thermal flask placed by the bed. The water inside was still warm.","Aw aw aw, Tao Sister is too thoughtful!","Shen Tang was deeply moved. She was awake now but still could not fall asleep. Looking at the time, it was past 3 am, still early before dawn.","Having nothing to do, she opened her game. Just as the \"timi\" sound rang, there was a knock on her door.","Conditionally, Shen Tang turned off her phone and hid it under her pillow.","But she soon realized that she had recovered now, and no longer needed to sneak around. So she took out her phone again.","\"Who is it?\"","\"It's me.\"","Gu Huaian?","Shen Tang hurriedly ran over to open the door. \"Why aren't you asleep yet?\"","Gu Huaian lowered his eyes and noticed Shen Tang's bare feet. His brows furrowed. \"Why aren't you wearing any shoes?\"","Shen Tang wiggled her plump toes. \"It's not cold either, I was in a hurry to open the door.\"","Shen Tang sat on the sofa. \"Why aren't you asleep yet?\"","\"I came to see if you were sober from the wine.\"","Shen Tang scratched her head. \"Was I drunk? Oh right, how did I get home?\"","Gu Huaian was silent for a moment. \"You called me to come pick you up.\"","Shen Tang was startled. She had absolutely no memory of it.","After checking her phone, she realized she did not only make a call, but also said some nonsense.","[Lovesick Monkey: Unaware of dawn during spring sleep, but aware of beloved]","[Lovesick Monkey: Do you know how to say wall, eye and knee in English? It’s wall, eye, knee. I love you!]","[Lovesick Monkey: I’m going to buy stewed meat stuffed in bread. I asked the owner to add more chili. I had just taken a bite and it fell onto the muddy ground. I cried. Turns out this is what’s called “spicy films like mud”.]","[Lovesick Monkey: Dear, what water did I drink just now? I can’t fall asleep without you.]","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Looking at these cheesy pick-up lines, she felt embarrassed, even her toes curled in response.","\"So... I didn't do anything indecent right...\"","She was somewhat skeptical of herself now.","Gu Huaian glanced at her. \"Nothing much. You just hugged me and refused to let go, insisting on touching my abs.\"","Shen Tang's eyes shook: \"!!!\"","Oh my god!","This is absolutely disastrous.","But did she manage to touch them in the end...? If she did and now had no memory of it, wasn't that a huge loss?","Hearing her inner voice, Gu Huaian helplessly curved his lips.","Seeing how Shen Tang's complexion fluctuated between pale and red, Gu Huaian chuckled. \"I'm kidding.\"","Shen Tang heaved a sigh of relief. \"I knew I'm not that kind of person.\"","\"You only hugged me and said you wanted to give birth to little monkeys for me, that’s all.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Is there a big difference between the two?","Speaking of which, she never dared to get drunk because of someone from the past. She really did not know how she behaved when drunk.","Turns out she behaved so uninhibitedly. The impression Gu Huaian had of her must be pretty terrible now.","He wouldn't see her as some cheap woman now, would he?","As God is her witness, she had not even kissed a man at her age!","Thinking of this, Shen Tang involuntarily glanced at Gu Huaian's lips.","His lips were very attractive, pinkish in color, as if applied with lipstick. His lips were thin. It was said that people with such lips were most fickle. She wondered if this was true.","Gu Huaian rested his chin on his fist, uncomfortable with the gaze as he softly cleared his throat. \"Since you can't sleep, drink this sober-up soup.\"","Only then did Shen Tang notice Gu Huaian was carrying a bowl of soup.","Ah ah ah! Were her eyes blind just now?!","\"Thanks a lot. It's so late yet you still made a trip here to deliver this to me. Hasn't Tao Sister slept?\"","Tao Sister was just too nice. She helped her change her clothes and remove her makeup, prepared water for her, and even made hangover soup. She’s so thoughtful!","\"Tao Sister's asleep long ago.\"","\"Huh? In that case, did you... cook this?\"","Gu Huaian gave a light nod. \"Drink the soup and go to bed. I should turn in too.\"","Shen Tang blankly saw him to the door. Until she finished the soup, she still could not react to the fact that the sober-up soup was cooked by Gu Huaian himself. He's also too nice!","Shen Tang's heart started pounding uncontrollably.","It really was difficult not to fall for him. She was so afraid that after spending more time together, she would not be willing to leave him. Just like what happened in the book.","Shen Tang hurriedly shook her head to throw this idea aside.","No way. She was not the Shen Tang in the book. She had moral values. She would certainly not do despicable things like giving drugs!","Not until she was about to fall asleep did Shen Tang remember that she had forgotten to ask Gu Huaian about what he initially wanted to tell her."]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: You should never come here Again.","paragraphs":["The next day when Shen Tang woke up, the sky was already bright. Shen Tang went downstairs and as expected, Gu Huaian had already gone to the company.","Was this guy made of iron? Did he not need to sleep at all? He had slept so late last night yet woke up so early this morning.","Tao Sister laughed so hard her eyes disappeared. \"Mistress, you're awake! Do you feel uncomfortable anywhere?\"","Shen Tang smiled and hugged Tao Sister's arm. \"I'm good, I haven't thanked you yet for helping me change and taking off my make-up last night. Oh yes, where are Anran and Wuyun?\"","\"They were taken back to the old house.\"","\"Are they coming back?\"","\"Probably not...\"","Tao Sister was also unsure, but she understood the reason. It was because the two little ones were too clingy. Eldest young miss (Gu Qing'an) felt they were distracting master and mistress from developing their relationship.","Shen Tang's brows furrowed. Why so sudden? Once they were back at the old house, they wouldn't get to meet as often. What was more upsetting was that she had gone out yesterday and didn't even get to send them off.","Shen Tang opened WeChat and found Gu Huaian. Her fingers lightly tapped the keyboard but she felt nervous when it was time to send the message.","The events from last night were still fresh in her mind. It was so awkward.","Shen Tang steeled herself and hit send with eyes closed.","Gu Huaian did not reply for a long time, probably busy with work.","Shen Tang thought for a bit. \"Tao Sister, can you cook more food for lunch later? I want to deliver some.\"","\"To deliver lunch for Master? Sure, I'll prepare more of what Master likes to eat.\"","Tao Sister hummed happily as she prepared the dishes. Every change in her tune revealed how delighted her mistress was.","Not long later, He Uncle came in. Tao Sister eagerly shared the news with him.","The two whispered to each other, stealing glances at Shen Tang occasionally. The gazes warmed Shen Tang's cheeks till they gradually turned red.","As lunch time approached, Shen Tang carried an extraordinarily large lunch box to Gu Group.","This was Shen Tang's first time visiting. All that was on her mind were scenes from novels where the front desk rejected visitors who came without an appointment, eventually leading to conflict between both parties.","She was apprehensive. Surely she wouldn't be denied entry...","It had to be said, Gu Group was indeed a premier enterprise, situated right in the heart of the city with an entire building to itself.","After Shen Tang alighted from her car, she could not help but be shocked for a moment.","Previously, she had only read in novels about how rich the Gu family was. Yet she did not expect them to be this wealthy.","Carrying the huge thermal container, she went to the front desk on the first floor.","\"Excuse me, how do I get to Gu Huaian's office?\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, Shen Tang felt like there was something wrong with what she said.","The front desk staff looked up and the two made eye contact, both stunned for a moment.","Shen Tang was amazed by how gorgeous the front desk staff was. She was so beautiful Shen Tang almost went wild.","The front desk staff on her part was probably shocked by Shen Tang's identity. After a brief stunned moment, she resumed her smile and asked, \"Do you have an appointment?\"","\"Um, no.\"","Damn, she forgot about needing an appointment.","Shen Tang inwardly whined. She was an uncultured swine for not having visited such large enterprises before. Please forgive her!","\"May I have your name?\"","\"Shen Tang.\"","The front desk staff did not say anything more. Instead, she picked up the phone to inquire before pointing to a resting area at the side, \"Miss Shen, please kindly wait over here for a while. Someone will come down to get you.\"","\"Alright, thanks!\"","Shen Tang sat at the resting area to wait. She casually picked up a magazine which contained interviews with Gu Huaian.","Tsk, what an annoying man. Even his pictures were so handsome. No wonder he was the most sought after fifth young master in the country.","Though he had an aloof look with that poker face of his.","\"Miss Shen.\"","Hearing the voice, Shen Tang turned around. It was actually Cen Assistant!","\"Cen Assistant, long time no see!\"","\"You're here to... deliver lunch for Chairman Gu?\" Cen Assistant took over the lunch box as the two spoke while walking.","Shen Tang grinned. \"Yup! I'm not disturbing you guys, am I?\"","\"No disturbance at all. But Chairman Gu is still busy. Please wait for a while longer in the lounge.\"","\"No problem. You guys go about your work first.\"","Upon entering Gu Huaian's lounge, Shen Tang clicked her tongue. The minimalist cool-toned interior resembled the man himself.","But goodness, the place was so huge! There was even a gym area. No wonder he had such great physique despite the endless work and lack of rest.","Were all CEOs so hardworking that they even squeezed time out of work to exercise?","Shen Tang pinched the soft flesh on her arm. She had not exercised for a long time.","After a brief moment of guilt, she quickly justified it to herself.","She had just recovered physically and still could not engage in strenuous activities. She would think about this matter again in the future. Ahem.","She had no idea how long she waited but the room door was suddenly pushed open.","\"Gu—\" Shen Tang turned around, taken aback for a moment.","Because the person who entered was not Gu Huaian, but rather the Lotus Sis from Gu Huaian's mouth.","Didn't Gu Huaian say they were not close? What was she doing here? And she was even holding onto a lunch box!","The other party was also clearly stunned before nodding her head with a faint smile. \"Hello.\"","\"Hi.\"","The two women sat far apart from each other without exchanging any words. An eerie silence hung in the room.","Shen Tang wondered if the other party felt as awkward as she did. In any case, she herself felt rather awkward.","She discreetly sized up the lady opposite. Dressed simply in a white dress, hair flowing freely behind her back, light makeup for an au naturel look, the lady resembled a pure white lotus.","Please do not get the wrong idea. Shen Tang was merely speaking literally and had no intention of degrading the lady.","Shen Tang lowered her head to take a look at her own leisure wear and slippers, wriggling her toes slightly in discomfort.","Every minute and second that ticked by felt like agony. Just as Shen Tang could barely sit still any longer, the room door opened again.","This time, the person who entered was Gu Huaian. Clad in a well-fitted suit with every button meticulously buttoned all the way to the top, faint hints of fatigue showed between his brows.","\"Gu Huaian!\" Shen Tang immediately stood up.","\"Huaian.\" The other woman also affectionately called out.","\"What are you doing here?\"","\"I—\"","Before Shen Tang could complete her sentence, the lady called Lotus hurriedly said, \"I came to deliver lunch for you. Uncle said that you often skip meals irregularly. It's bad for your stomach.\"","Shen Tang's ears perked up to listen.","Uncle? Gu Huaian's father?","Damn, so he asked another lady to personally deliver lunch. His intentions were clear!","Their previous meeting was unpleasant. But it seemed normal for Gu Huaian to not be interested in her.","Gu Huaian cast a sideways glance at Shen Tang and rejected outright, \"Thanks but no need. My wife has already delivered lunch for me.\"","\"Wife?\" The girl looked extremely shocked as if she were unaware of this matter.","Shen Tang was also very surprised. She did not expect Gu Huaian to put it so blatantly.","\"Yes, this is my wife. Miss Zhou, we should refrain from overstepping the boundaries between men and women. Please do not come again in future.\"","With this, Zhou Qinglian nearly could not maintain the poise. \"Huaian...\"","But Gu Huaian paid her no heed as he looked towards Shen Tang. \"Why are you standing there as a punishment?\"","\"No...\"","His tone contained faint hints of threat that Shen Tang immediately decided not to say anything more.","She was sincere by nature and quickly swallowed the words that were about to spill out.","\"Come over then if not.\"","Shen Tang hurriedly went over, lunch box in hand, stealing looks around her. \"Shall we... eat together?\"","The lady pursed her lips as her eyes reddened. On the verge of tears, she looked absolutely pitiful.","She trembled and after taking a look at Shen Tang, lowered her eyes, \"I'll take my leave since I have matters to attend to.\"","As she stumbled out in hastened steps, her retreating figure seemed devastated.","Even Shen Tang felt bad looking at her. Then looking back at Gu Huaian's expressionless face without the slightest ripple.","\"You—\" Didn't he feel anything at all?","\"Hmm?\"","For some reason, the low hum from Gu Huaian carried vague threats.","As Shen Tang was sincere by nature, she hurriedly swallowed back the words she was about to utter.","\"Uh... Are you hungry? Let's eat first ba.\"","\"Mm.\"","Gu Huaian took off his suit jacket, leaving just the white shirt inside which faintly outlined his well-built chest.","Shen Tang stared with sparkling eyes. Wow so firm. She was so tempted to touch it.","It had to be said, even an action as simple as Gu Huaian rolling up his sleeves was a visual feast.","And those hands of his—bony joints yet long slender fingers. As someone with a hand fetish, Shen Tang could not help but ogle persistently as her thoughts stray uncontrollably.","Gu Huaian's actions paused for a moment as he sighed helplessly. \"What are you looking at? Time to eat.\"","\"Oh...\"","Shen Tang stole another peek before withdrawing her gaze.","Damn! Gu Huaian must be heaven's favorite. Not only were doors open for him, it seemed like all windows were open too!","The disparity between humans..."]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: If it's not an outsider, it's my wife.","paragraphs":["There was a lot of food, but Gu Huaian only ate a few bites before Cen Assistant came over with some files.","Shen Tang stopped eating along with him.","Gu Huaian said, \"You go ahead and eat, don't mind me.\"","Shen Tang didn't listen to him, mainly because she wasn't that hungry yet and could wait a while.","As a result, Cen Assistant came and went, back and forth several times.","This also meant that Gu Huaian was busy the whole time, and only finally got a real break once the food had gone cold.","Shen Tang had a complex expression. \"Are you this busy every day?\"","\"It's alright, I'm used to it.\"","Shen Tang suddenly felt a little heartache.","Not seeing it day-to-day, she didn't have an intuitive sense of it, but seeing it today, she finally understood why he had stomach problems.","In fact, Gu Huaian didn't really feel tired at all, he was already used to this kind of lifestyle.","From birth, he had been cultivated as the heir, without much of a happy childhood. He never went to amusement parks, ate snacks, or had many friends.","All these years, other than school and work, it was only socializing and entertaining, with almost no personal time.","Gu Huaian was about to continue eating, but Shen Tang stopped him: \"The food's gone cold, don't eat any more. Is there a microwave? Let me heat it up.\"","Gu Huaian looked at his watch, \"Why don't we just go to the company cafeteria?\"","Shen Tang's eyes lit up, \"That works! I've heard the cafeteria at Gu Group is especially delicious.\"","\"Let's go then.\"","Gu Huaian got up and put his suit jacket back on, covering up his well-built figure.","Shen Tang regretfully withdrew her gaze.","The two of them walked out side by side, attracting quite a bit of attention.","Shen Tang suddenly regretted not wearing a mask today. Would her reputation bring negative impact to Gu Huaian?","She worried endlessly, unconsciously falling a few steps back, wanting to keep some distance from Gu Huaian.","But Gu Huaian also slowed his pace. \"What's wrong?\"","Shen Tang felt a little awkward. \"Is it not good for us to walk together?\"","\"Are you afraid that I'll influence you?\"","\"No, no no, I was afraid of influencing you!\"","Gu Huaian laughed softly. \"Don't worry, it's fine.\"","Shen Tang smiled, her steps becoming cheerful.","The Gu Group cafeteria was very big, taking up a whole floor.","There were all kinds of regional cuisines, snacks, desserts and drinks.","Most importantly, it was all free. As long as you didn't waste, you could eat as you pleased.","At this time there weren't many people in the cafeteria, as most had already eaten and left.","Shen Tang picked out some of her favorites and sat down at an empty table.","Gu Huaian was still getting food.","Since he had gotten in line behind her, the speed at which people in front of him got their food increased noticeably.","Shen Tang almost laughed out loud.","Soon Gu Huaian came back with his food, and the two of them sat facing each other.","Shen Tang took a bite of sweet and sour pork ribs and closed her eyes happily.","\"So delicious.\" Shen Tang added, \"But still not as good as Aunt Peach.\"","\"If Aunt Peach knew how much you liked her cooking, she'd probably be very happy.\"","The two of them ate and chatted happily, unaware that the company employees were extremely shocked at the moment.","In the company group chat, someone had sneakily taken a photo of the two whispering to each other and posted it to the group, sparking heated discussion.","[Extra extra! The perpetually aloof Boss Gu has finally opened up!]","[This girl is so pretty, suits Boss Gu well, and...she looks kind of familiar...]","[Rolls eyes. Of course she's familiar, with how often she trends online. But I really can't believe Boss Gu would be with Shen Tang, it's a bit of a letdown...]","[Just eating together means they're together? With all of Shen Tang's scandals, Boss Gu would never be interested in her...]","[Are you a tapeworm in Boss Gu's stomach? Those online scandals might not even be real, I trust Boss Gu's judgement.]","[I trust him too, Boss Gu isn't that kind of lustful person.]","[Stop arguing. Anyone want to eat melon up close? Let's gather at the cafeteria entrance.]","[I'll go!]","[Me too!]","And so, a strange phenomenon occurred in the cafeteria.","Logically at this time there shouldn't be many people coming to eat, since those who needed to eat already ate.","But Shen Tang sensitively noticed that ever since they came to eat, more and more people had come into the cafeteria.","Most only got a small dessert or fruit, sitting not too close or far, and would sneak peeks at them from time to time.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Do they really think they're being discreet...","Shen Tang moved closer to Gu Huaian and whispered, \"Are your employees always this gossipy?\"","Unbeknownst to her, this action made the onlookers' eyes go wide, some even gasping.","Shen Tang really wanted to ask, was it necessary?","Gu Huaian laughed softly again. \"Looks like they're too free.\"","The nearby people instantly changed expression upon hearing this.","Oh heavens, they were busy to death every day, where was this free time coming from?","\"Let's just eat quickly.\" Shen Tang was starting to regret coming here.","With so many people watching them, she felt like a monkey in a zoo.","Gu Huaian swept his eyes around, and people hurriedly lowered their heads.","Shen Tang gave a thumbs up and whispered, \"Impressive.\"","As expected of a tyrannical CEO, able to \"kill\" the onlookers with a single look.","Soon, Cen Assistant also came.","Now when Shen Tang saw him she got nervous, afraid he had brought another pile of work.","Before Cen Assistant could speak, Shen Tang quickly asked, \"Cen Assistant, have you eaten?\"","Cen Assistant was stunned. \"Yes, I've eaten.\"","\"Then you're here to...\"","Cen Assistant looked to Gu Huaian. Gu Huaian nodded, \"Go ahead, she's not an outsider.\"","Shen Tang's eyes lit up.","Not an outsider, so an insider!"]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: If You Marry, You can Leave.","paragraphs":["Cen Assistant had a difficult expression on his face, but since Old President Gu had spoken, he went ahead and said it directly.","\"It was Old President Gu. He just arranged for Miss Zhou to be your assistant.\"","The smile on Shen Tang's face instantly disappeared.","The assistant position was somewhat sensitive, [she] would probably be in contact all day...","Shen Tang looked towards Gu Huaian, wanting to know how he would respond - would he refuse?","He probably wouldn't right, that was his dad after all.","In that moment, thousands of thoughts flashed through Shen Tang's mind, eventually settling on \"Congratulations to the happy couple on their 100 years together.\"","Gu Huaian was vaguely irritated. He didn't like Zhou Qinglian, yet his dad had looked favorably on her since she was young.","He had rejected her unambiguously more than once.","Furthermore, with the Gu Family's current status, they didn't need a marriage alliance to move up another level.","Moreover... Shen Tang had finally taken a small step forward, only to now retreat back into her shell.","She talked boldly but lacked courage. She was very cowardly.","Gu Huaian's face darkened. \"I don't agree. If he has a problem, tell him to come find me.\"","\"Okay.\"","Cen Assistant turned and left. Not long after, Gu Huaian's phone rang.","Shen Tang had a feeling the person calling was his dad.","Sure enough —","\"Gu Huaian, have your wings hardened so you don't even listen to your own father anymore!\"","The phone volume was too loud, so Shen Tang heard it clearly, feeling very awkward.","She picked up her plate, about to leave, but Gu Huaian grabbed her hand.","She shook it off but failed.","Shen Tang didn't use too much strength, she wasn't there to fight after all.","How could Gu Huaian's strength be so great?","A warm feeling spread from her wrist, unlike Gu Jin'an grabbing her. She wasn't as against it.","Gu Jin'an?","When did that happen?","After hearing Shen Tang's thoughts, Gu Huaian grew suspicious. He temporarily kept this incident in mind, and coldly said:","\"Dad, I don't like Zhou Qinglian. You should stop trying to set us up. Don't forget, I'm already married.\"","\"What is that Shen Tang worth — \"","Gu Huaian coldly said. \"Dad! She is my wife, you may not like her but please give her due respect.\"","The phone went silent. After a long pause: \"Unfilial son.\"","Gu Huaian didn't respond further, directly hanging up the phone.","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly. \"Uh we're just contractually —\"","Gu Huaian firmly said: \"Shen Tang, I don't like her.\"","\"Oh...\"","Right, if he liked Zhou Qinglian he would have been with her already, rather than remain single for so many years.","Thinking this, Shen Tang began free associating again. Could it be this guy's first time? Does he not have sexual needs?","Wait... could he have some kind of hidden illness...","Her gaze started to drift downwards but her wrist was suddenly yanked powerfully.","\"Let's go after eating.\"","This time when Shen Tang tried pulling back her hand, there was no resistance. Only that piece of skin still retained the warm feeling, vaguely burning.","The two put their plates away properly before leaving.","Only then did the people around them relax.","\"Wow, President Gu got married!\"","That's right, Gu Huaian didn't speak too loudly earlier, but was very clear in the quiet environment.","\"My crush is over, wah wah wah...\"","\"Don't be sad, you never had a crush to begin with.\"","\"You sure know how to comfort people, wah wah wah...\"","Soon Cen Assistant walked in and instructed them to keep this incident to themselves and forbid external spread.","That's right, it was what Shen Tang asked for.","Gu Huaian was vaguely unhappy. \"Why?\"","\"I don't want to trend on social media again.\"","Shen Tang was truly afraid, with everything that happened to her trending online; her constitution was too frightening.","While others wished to trend, she had enough of always trending. Being too frequent easily produced fatigue amongst the public.","Moreover, they were only contracted married. If they divorced in the future and she found another partner, it would not bode well if netizens compared the two.","Hearing Shen Tang think so far ahead while he, her current partner, was still around and she was already considering a new partner, Gu Huaian's face darkened like the bottom of a pot.","Should he say she was heartless?","Shen Tang felt the temperature next to her drop. Not understanding why.","Noticing Gu Huaian's tightly pursed lips, Shen Tang was somewhat confused. Why did this guy suddenly become unhappy?","After thinking about it, she attributed the cause to the earlier phone call. That must be why.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","It's just as well, at least she won't wear herself down internally.","\"Hmph.\" Thinking this, he gave a cold laugh.","Seems even more upset now.","Two flowers blooming, each exquisite.","Gu Family Ancestral Home.","Old Master was angrily huffing and puffing, furiously throwing the phone to the side. \"Unfilial son! That unfilial son!\"","Old Madam Gu impatiently glanced at him. \"Do you have nothing better to do all day than meddle for no reason?\"","\"How is this meddling?\"","\"The blessings of descendants come from the descendants themselves. Huaian is not a child anymore. Surely he still has the right to choose someone he likes? I think that Shen girl is quite good, looks pretty too. A child from her and Huaian would probably look even better.\"","Gu Huaian was around the age where those his age had mostly married and had children.","Every time Madam mingled with those ladies and heard them boast about their children, Old Madam Gu was envious.","Old Master Gu fell silent.","To be honest, there were no complaints about Shen Tang's looks. She surpassed Zhou Qinglian. But...","\"I promised Old Brother Zhou that I would take care of Lian girl.\"","Their friendship went back decades.","The Zhou Family was chaotic. Zhou Qinglian's father had at least dozens of illegitimate children. Before Old Master Zhou passed away, the most worried was this granddaughter.","Old Master Gu had promised him that he would take good care of Zhou Qinglian.","\"There are many ways to take care of someone. Do you have to sacrifice Huaian's entire life?\"","\"Qinglian is so good. Other than plain looks, is she not better than Shen Tang in every other aspect? Shen Tang just returned after studying abroad, while Zhou Qinglian went into entertainment to earn money without even graduating college.\"","The more he talked, the straighter he stood.","That's right! He was doing this for his son's sake.","\"So? Huaian has already gotten married.\"","\"Married couples can divorce.\"","\"Gu Mingde! Are you planning to divorce me too?\"","Old Master Gu's expression drastically changed. \"Wife, I did not...\"","\"I won't listen, I won't listen! You sleep in the study tonight.\" Old Madam Gu directly turned and left.","Old Master Gu looked at He Uncle. \"Uncle He, did I say anything wrong?\"","He Uncle faintly smiled. \"I feel the Lady is right.\"","Old Master Gu: \"...\"","He helplessly shook his head. \"You all don't understand me.\"","He Uncle's face remained expressionless, while roasting endlessly in his mind: We truly don't understand your logic.","Old Master Gu picked up his phone to call Zhou Qinglian.","\"Don't cry Lian girl, that rotten brat is wrong. I will teach him a lesson for you.\"","\"You directly go to work tomorrow, I'll see who dares to say anything.\"","\"Rest assured, I have approved only you as my daughter-in-law.\"","Just as the words left his mouth, Old Master Gu suddenly felt a chill down his back.","Glancing back, Old Madam Gu was staring at him.","He was so frightened his heart skipped a beat. \"Uh, let's not talk for now. Come by the house if you're free.\"","\"Wife why did you come back down again?\"","Old Madam Gu gently flicked her sleeve where no dust existed. \"Let me make this clear. If you interfere with Huaian again, we will get a divorce.\"","\"Talking nonsense. We're old, what good does a divorce do? How embarrassing?\"","\"Weren't you the one saying married couples can divorce? If you insist on using marriage to provide care, then you marry her yourself.\"","He Uncle's mouth twitched, nearly laughing out loud.","Well played!"]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Ordinary People Can Shine.","paragraphs":["Back in the office, away from those prying eyes, Shen Tang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Oh right, you mentioned earlier that you had something to discuss, what was it?\"","\"It's nothing much. There's a banquet coming up in a couple days and I was wondering if you'd like to be my female companion. Are you free?\"","\"Sure, but you know what kind of reputation I have. I-\"","Before she could finish, Gu Huaian interjected, \"I think you're great.\"","Shen Tang was taken aback for a moment.","Gu Huaian's expression was serious as he repeated, \"I think you're great.\"","Shen Tang couldn't quite describe how she felt in that moment. In all her years, there had rarely been anyone who complimented her with such certainty.","\"What's so great about me?\" Shen Tang was a little bashful. She wanted to hear exactly what Gu Huaian liked about her.","She even had the sudden urge to record this so she could listen to it over and over later.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","Just as the words were on the tip of his tongue, he changed his mind and said, \"You're lazy, greedy, lustful...\"","The more Shen Tang listened, the more wrong it sounded. \"Hey wait a minute! You're supposed to be complimenting me right? Why are you only listing my flaws?\"","\"But those little flaws don't really matter. You're kindhearted, optimistic, helpful, strong, and sincere to others. There's no need to always doubt yourself and lack confidence.\"","Shen Tang's eyes reddened but she laughed somewhat ridiculously. \"Aren't you exaggerating? I'm just an ordinary person.\"","\"Even ordinary people have their own shining moments. Who isn't ordinary?\"","Shen Tang could feel her face flushing. It was hard for any girl not to blush while being sincerely praised face-to-face by a good looking guy.","She had to admit, everything he said sounded like a confession. As expected, handsome guys always speak nicely too.","\"Ahem, you're not bad yourself,\" Shen Tang mumbled quietly.","Gu Huaian nodded. \"I know.\"","Shen Tang faltered. The compliments she was about to give him instantly died on her lips.","Since when was this guy so full of himself?","Even so, their conversation definitely brought the two of them much closer. As the saying goes, sincerity helps build good relationships.","Shen Tang did not stay at the company for long since Gu Huaian quickly became busy again. With nothing to do by herself, she left.","Luo Chen happened to ask her out to discuss some matters regarding their farming variety show. Shen Tang went to meet up with him.","Arriving at the cafe, Luo Chen hadn't shown up yet so she randomly picked an inconspicuous corner to sit and wait.","Next door, she could vaguely hear voices speaking, probably due to thin walls. Shen Tang could vaguely make out that little white flower's voice.","\"Have you made up your mind?\"","\"Why should I believe you?\"","\"You like Gu Huaian. I want Shen Tang. What are you still hesitating about?\"","Hearing this, Shen Tang immediately became alert. My my, eavesdropping about herself?","She quickly plastered herself against the wall to eavesdrop.","In the next booth over...","Zhou Qinglian lowered her eyes and softly asked, \"Do you like Shen Tang too?\"","Gu Jinan chuckled. \"Like her? Hm, I guess you could say I do like her. To be honest, I quite like her figure and looks. And don't you think her personality is pretty amusing too?\"","\"I don't think so.\" Zhou Qinglian's expression twisted for a brief moment.","How could they both like Shen Tang? She was nothing but a promiscuous actress. What was there to like about her?","\"You women are so...\"","Gu Jinan shook his head with seeming helplessness. \"Think it over. If you disagree then forget it. I'm not dead set on her or anything.\"","Gu Jinan calmly took a sip of coffee. \"I have other matters to attend to so I'll get going first.\"","Hearing this, Zhou Qinglian panicked a little. \"Wait!\"","\"I, I agree but you have to promise me something too.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"You can't tell anyone else about this. And afterwards, you have to take Shen Tang far away. Don't ever let her appear by Huaian's side again.\"","Gu Jinan's eyes flashed briefly with disdain. \"Fine, it's a deal then. I look forward to working with you.\"","\"Likewise.\"","Shen Tang had only grasped the general idea. As for what exactly they were planning to cooperate on, she completely missed that part.","She couldn't help feeling a little anxious. Somehow she had ended up stretched full length against the wall.","\"Miss Shen, what are you...\"","Shen Tang looked back to see Luo Chen standing at the door with eyes full of questions.","She quickly stood properly and gave a little cough. \"It's nothing. More importantly, have a seat. We have business to discuss.\"","The underlying meaning was to not question why she was in that position just now.","Because she hadn't come up with an excuse yet.","\"Right, why did you ask to meet with me? What's going on with the show?\"","Shen Tang only provided the funds and occasionally gave some opinions which Luo Chen could freely adopt or ignore. She had given Luo Chen great autonomy to take charge.","Given that, there really shouldn't be any issues cropping up.","As if a dark horse, their farming variety show had broken new ground and consistently topped viewship charts since airing.","The cast had gone from bumbling around cluelessly to looking like experts now, attracting many fans in the process.","Shen Tang was definitely happiest out of everyone, after all she was earning boatloads.","Luo Chen had no reason to be frowning right now.","\"What exactly is going on with you?\" Shen Tang pressed.","Luo Chen heaved a long sigh. \"The show took off and caught unwanted attention. Someone is pressuring me to reshuffle the regular cast lineup. To be honest, I really don't want to.\"","Shen Tang frowned. \"Who is it? How unreasonable, trying to reap the rewards now that it's succeeded.\"","\"He said he was from the Gu Family.\"","\"Which Gu Family?\"","\"The one and only Gu Family of course.\"","Luo Chen sighed again.","He couldn't afford to offend the Gu Family but he also didn't want to replace anyone. He was under immense pressure and had no idea what to do.","Shen Tang was utterly confused. The Gu Family that Luo Chen spoke of should be referring to Gu Huaian's family. But given his personality, there was no way he would do something like this!","\"Have you met him before?\"","Luo Chen shook his head. \"No I haven't actually. We've only contacted by phone.\"","Shen Tang pondered for a bit. \"How about this? Try arranging a meeting and I'll come talk to him.\"","\"Huh?\" Luo Chen swallowed nervously. \"Are you sure? He's from the Gu Family.\"","\"Don't worry, I know people from the Gu Family too.\"","Shen Tang said confidently. The Gu Family member she knew was definitely more powerful than that other one.","Plus she had an inkling of who it could be..."]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: She Fainted. She Faked It.","paragraphs":["Regarding that guess, Shen Tang did not say it out, after all it was just a guess.","Luo Chen took the initiative to ask the other party for a face-to-face talk, however the other party directly and indirectly expressed that they did not want to meet, which made Luo Chen very suspicious.","He covered the receiver and said, \"Could it be that he is an imposter?\"","\"Maybe, in any case, don't look a gift horse in the mouth, take him out for a walk and you'll know.\"","\"You have a point.\"","Finally, Luo Chen used discussing the guest matter as an excuse and successfully got the person to come out.","The time was set for the evening two days later.","This time...","Shen Tang frowned, it wouldn't happen to coincide with Gu Huaian's time right...","She wanted Luo Chen to change the time, however the other party said they were only free that night.","Shen Tang had no choice, she could only hope that the banquet Gu Huaian mentioned was not on that day.","As a public figure, after Shen Tang finished her coffee, she did not go out with Luo Chen, instead she deliberately waited a few minutes.","As soon as she went out, she felt someone was secretly taking photos of her, Shen Tang looked towards the camera and made a \"yeah\" gesture.","She didn't know what the paparazzi were thinking, but she didn't want to be photographed looking bad.","Just then, a girl wearing a duckbill cap suddenly came over and quietly asked, \"Excuse me, are you Shen Tang?\"","\"Yes, what's the matter?\"","The girl excitedly covered her mouth, \"Ahhh I'm your fan, can I get your autograph?\"","\"No no, can you give me your autograph?\"","\"Sure, where do you want me to sign?\"","\"Sign it on the photo.\" The girl reached into her pocket for a pen, her expression changed, \"Ah! I think my wallet just dropped on the road, can you come help me find it?\"","\"Of course I can.\" Shen Tang looked back at the paparazzi, then followed the girl.","The girl kept her head lowered looking for the wallet, \"Huh? Where did it drop?\"","Until they reached the alley entrance, Shen Tang stopped walking.","\"Alright, if I keep pretending with you, my food is going to get cold.\"","The girl instantly dropped her smile, \"You knew? How was I exposed?\"","\"Hmm, your eyes were too exaggerated and superficial. You weren't looking at me with any fondness.\"","\"Then why did you still follow me over?\"","\"I just wanted to see what you were trying to do.\"","The girl sighed, \"You're pretty smart, what a pity, you're too arrogant. I'm sorry, I was forced.\"","Just as Shen Tang was about to speak, a bunch of powder was suddenly thrown at her from the other side. Even though she swiftly held her breath, she still breathed some in.","Her last thought before passing out was: Damn sneak attack! I didn't even finish talking!","She pretended to faint, hehehe.","She could hear soft footsteps and conversation.","\"I helped trick her out for you, now you can delete those photos right,\" the girl said.","\"Delete them? Such good looking photos, it would be such a waste to delete them. I look at them every night before going to bed...\" the man let out a vulgar laugh, it made Shen Tang really want to get up and punch him.","\"Sun Zheng! You promised me!\"","\"What did I promise you? Do you have any proof?\" The one called Sun Zheng laughed sinisterly.","Shen Tang had been lying on the ground so long she was getting tired. These two still hadn't made a move.","It could probably be said her acting skills were quite good, after all no one had noticed she was pretending until now.","Shen Tang felt that if she didn't get an Oscar statuette next year, she wouldn't be convinced.","\"Sun Zheng! You shameless jerk!\" The girl's voice even carried a sob.","\"How am I shameless? Did I force you? Weren't all these your own voluntary actions?\"","The girl let out low sobs.","Shen Tang realized something, no matter when, even if you have a good relationship, you shouldn't agree to unreasonable demands.","She opened her eyes and got up, dusting herself off, \"Are you guys done tying me up or what?\"","The two were frightened.","\"You didn't pass out?!\"","Sun Zheng swallowed, steeled his heart, and gritted his teeth, \"Don't blame me, blame your bad luck!\"","As Sun Zheng spoke, he reached to grab something from his pocket, Shen Tang noticed a bulge there, possibly concealing some sharp object.","But before she could make a move, Sun Zheng was suddenly kicked flying by a powerful force from the side, and that girl was also knocked to the ground.","Shen Tang looked towards Xiao Yu who had retracted her leg, revealing a smile, \"So cool.\"","Xiao Yu expressionlessly mumbled an \"Mm\", but her ear tips flushed red.","\"What should we do with them?\"","\"Of course call the police!\"","As a law-abiding good citizen, taking justice into your own hands was unacceptable.","As she thought this, Shen Tang stepped down forcefully on Sun Zheng's hand and ground down hard.","She then spoke in an exaggerated tone: \"Ah, sorry, didn't see that.\"","Sun Zheng's eyes were bloodshot from rage and pain, he wanted to curse but forcefully held it back.","This woman was clearly trained in martial arts, he was no match for her.","The girl at the side also knew better than to provoke them, she shrank back to the corner trying to minimize her presence, afraid her hand would get stepped on too.","Soon after, the police arrived, it was an officer Shen Tang recognized. He had handled the case last time when she beat up human traffickers on the street.","\"Miss Shen?\"","\"That's right, it's me again.\" Shen Tang pointed to Sun Zheng's pocket and said, \"Be careful, I think he has a knife in there.\"","Hearing this, the officer took the item out of Sun Zheng's pocket — it really was a knife, and there were even blood stains on it!","\"Did he kill someone?!\" Shen Tang backed away in fright.","Sun Zheng was furious to the point his eyes were bloodshot. He gnashed his teeth, \"That's my blood!\"","Turns out when Xiao Yu had kicked Sun Zheng flying just now, the knife in his pocket cut him.","Xiao Yu didn't react much, as if they weren't talking about her.","Shen Tang stroked her nose, \"That was also your own fault.\"","They would have to go to the station to give statements about this kind of situation. The few people got in the police car and left.","Shen Tang kept feeling she had forgotten something important but just couldn’t recall what it was.","The efficient police soon got to the bottom of things.","Sun Zheng was unemployed without skills. He spent his days addicted to gaming.","The girl was his girlfriend. Unable to tolerate Sun Zheng any longer, she wanted to break up.","But because they had taken risqué photos together when they were dating, Sun Zheng used those to threaten her not to break up.","Until recently, Sun Zheng saw a post on a forum. The original poster offered 5,000 RMB to buy private photos of Shen Tang.","Sun Zheng was bewitched by the 5,000 RMB. Just as he was racking his brains thinking about how to get those photos, he happened to see Shen Tang this morning. So he threatened his girlfriend to help trick her.","When Shen Tang learned the reason, she was quite speechless. Was 5,000 RMB worth all that?","The police found that forum. It turned out almost all the posts were similarly asking for private photos of female celebrities.","Shen Tang took a look around, the corners of her lips drooped, very unhappy.","\"No way, on what basis?\"","\"On what basis am I so cheap in there, only 5,000 RMB. Why does everyone else start from tens of thousands to over a hundred thousand?\"","Everyone around was a bit surprised, that's the thing you're hung up on?","Not until Shen Tang left the police station and received Pei Kesong's call did she recall that she had forgotten about the paparazzi.","She embarrassingly asked, \"What did the paparazzi say?\"","\"They said you oppressed men tyrannically.\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Kidding, go take a look yourself. And use your alt account.\"","After hanging up, Shen Tang sighed, \"Xiao Yu, thanks for your hard work today.\"","If not for Xiao Yu being there, Shen Tang wouldn't have dared to boldly follow like that either.","\"It wasn't difficult, it was fated.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","This girl actually learned to talk back, she couldn't have been negatively influenced from being close could she!","Shen Tang started reflecting.","After one second of reflection, Shen Tang convinced herself:","Oh well, why should she blame herself?","Things were good as they were now. Compared to before, Xiao Yu was much more popular now, and that was all thanks to her efforts.","Shen Tang unabashedly thought."]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: I Need a Little Favor from You.","paragraphs":["On her way home, Shen Tang opened Weibo. She had made headlines for the photo of her making a victory sign.","Most of the comments were quite mild, while a small portion were from the black fans who kept verbally attacking her, repeating those same old criticisms.","She didn't know if they were tired of this, but she was certainly sick of reading them.","If they weren't insulting her, they were spreading some unfounded rumors about her, pretending to inform passersby.","Earlier, someone had even posted alleged photos of her deceased relatives and ended up being sued by the Gu Group's legal department.","Shen Tang scrolled down and saw another photo.","In the photo, Shen Tang had her hands crossed against a wall with a blank expression. Xiao Yu stood expressionlessly nearby while Sun Zheng lay on the ground and his girlfriend crouched in the corner.","At first glance, it did seem like Shen Tang was an overbearing bully.","And indeed, she was actually bullying them.","The comments claimed all sorts of things and some even started arguing due to differing opinions.","[Asking for a friend, is this from a TV show?]","[It's confirmed Shen Tang bullied them. Look at those two on the ground, scared stiff!]","[One photo to start speculation based purely on imagination? Were you at the scene? Did you see Shen Tang hit anyone?]","[Well were you at the scene? How do you know Shen Tang didn't hit anyone? Didn't you see the photo of Shen Tang being taken away by the police?]","This comment was accompanied by a photo of Shen Tang entering a police car.","[I can testify that what he said is true. I'm that tree over there and I saw everything.]","[Is it possible because of relationship issues?]","[How dare you spread rumors? Have you forgotten those previous examples? If you have the guts, don't delete this. I'm screenshotting this to send to Shen Tang later.]","Seeing these comments, Shen Tang understood why her agent didn't allow her onto her main Weibo account.","She rubbed her hands eagerly, indeed feeling the urge to do something.","Just as she was about to take action, Xiao Yu popped her head over. \"What are you doing?\"","Not waiting for Shen Tang's reply, Xiao Yu nodded knowingly. \"I see, you want to scold people.\"","\"I don't.\"","\"You do.\"","Xiao Yu sounded extremely certain, making Shen Tang suspect she was the tapeworm in her own stomach.","\"Fine, I do intend to scold them. Don't you think they went overboard?\"","After Xiao Yu read the content, she nodded. \"Overboard.\"","\"Since they've insulted me, shouldn't I scold them back?\"","\"Yes.\" Xiao Yu felt something was off but couldn't figure out what.","\"That settles it. They threw the first blow and I'm just retaliating.\"","This time, Shen Tang deliberately used her alt account to blast those leaving especially nasty comments.","The intense exchange lifted her mood.","By the time she was done, they had reached home.","Upon entering the living room, Shen Tang discovered an extra person — Gu Jinan.","Recalling the earlier conversation she overheard, she quirked her brow in interest. So he was finally making his move?","\"Sister-in-law, you look well.\"","Gu Jinan blinked his peach blossom eyes and revealed a faint smile. He had only taken two steps forward when Tao Sister, who happened to be mopping, blocked his way. \"Please excuse me.\"","Gu Jinan had no choice but to retreat two steps.","Yet Tao Sister mopped to the left whenever he tried going left, and mopped to the right whenever he shifted right, obstructing his path constantly.","Even someone slow on the uptake could tell Tao Sister was deliberately antagonizing him.","Gu Jinan was furious but had to restrain his anger.","Shen Tang was highly amused and nearly laughed out loud, having to recall every sad moment in her life to suppress it.","\"Ahem. You're here to see Gu Huai'an? He hasn't returned.\"","\"I came to see you.\"","\"For what purpose? We're barely acquainted.\"","Gu Jinan gazed deeply into Shen Tang's eyes, extremely complex emotions swirling in his eyes.","Shen Tang instantly broke out in goosebumps.","\"What's the issue then?\"","Gu Jinan heaved a long sigh. \"Sister-in-law seems to have misunderstood me. I came today to tell you one thing. My brother's childhood sweetheart has returned and plans to target you.\"","This rendered Shen Tang thoroughly stunned. Gu Jinan had actually revealed this to her.","\"Target me?\"","\"That's right. He asked me to help seduce you so they could have an affair together. I pretended to agree then came to discuss countermeasures with you.\"","\"I see. Sorry for misunderstanding you earlier...\"","Outwardly, Shen Tang looked grateful but she was criticizing him nonstop inwardly. If not for overhearing their conversation earlier, she might have believed him.","Clearly he was the one who proposed this plan but now he had shoved the blame onto that scheming woman. Some man he was.","Tao Sister seemed about to say something when Shen Tang secretly poked her, signaling her to change her words. \"Young Master, would you like something to drink?\"","Gu Jinan glanced at Tao Sister. He had been here this long yet she only thought to offer him a drink now. The servants would never behave this way without someone ordering them to.","Thinking this, Gu Jinan's gaze turned frosty.","\"What do you plan to do next?\" Shen Tang asked.","Snapping out of his thoughts, Gu Jinan replied, \"I intend to gain her trust first and gather intel from her. So I'll need a small favor from you...\"","\"What kind of favor?\" A smile teased Shen Tang's lips.","\"I need you to cooperate with me to convince her I succeeded.\"","Shen Tang's smile deepened. \"What kind of cooperation? Could you elaborate?\"","\"It's simple. Just pretend to be my girlfriend and act out a scene together in front of her...\"","\"Hmm...let me think about it...\"","\"Alright, I won't disturb sister-in-law's rest any longer.\" As Gu Jinan strode forward, his foot slipped and he face-planted in an awkward split.","Shen Tang heard a \"rip\" sound followed by Gu Jinan's suppressed cry of pain. She sucked in a breath, feeling a chill in her own crotch as phantom pain shot through.","\"Are you okay? Do you need me to call a doctor?\"","Through gritted teeth, Gu Jinan squeezed out, \"I need...clothes...\"","It seemed his pants had torn. He absolutely could not let anyone see him in such an embarrassing state.","Reacting swiftly, Tao Sister stripped off her apron and threw it over. \"Here!\"","Clenching his fists tightly, Gu Jinan endured the pain and covered his waist with the apron.","After a bout of chaos, Gu Jinan was taken away. Shen Tang eyed the detergent spill on the floor and helplessly pinched her brow.","\"Tao Sister, you...\"","Tao Sister guiltily avoided her gaze. \"Would you believe me if I said I accidentally spilled too much detergent?\"","\"Whether I believe you or not is irrelevant. It matters if Gu Jinan believes you or not.\"","The foam was clearly deliberately poured. Gu Jinan wasn't blind. How could he not notice?","Shen Tang worried what consequences Tao Sister might face since Gu Jinan was from the Gu family after all..."]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: You're So Careless.","paragraphs":["The sound of a car came from outside the door. Shen Tang thought it was He Uncle coming back and hurried out to greet him eagerly.","Unexpectedly, it was Gu Huaian who had returned.","\"You're back.\"","\"Mm.\"","For some reason, Gu Huaian seemed to be in rather high spirits. Even Tao Sister noticed it and secretly glanced at the two of them a few times with the corners of her mouth curling up wildly.","Shen Tang tilted her head to look outside the door again, feeling anxious inside.","[Why hasn't He Uncle come back yet? Could Gu Jinan's eggs really be broken!]","Gu Huaian's footsteps halted and he asked casually, \"Tao Sister, where is He Uncle?\"","\"Ah, um...well...\" Tao Sister looked very guilty. Gu Huaian was certain that something he didn't know about must have happened.","Of course, his purpose in asking was not to listen to Tao Sister's reply, but to get a certain chatty person to expose herself.","\"He Uncle went out and hasn't come back yet...\" Shen Tang explained.","[He's been gone for so long, why hasn't he come back? Is Gu Jinan badly injured? Tsk--what if his eggs really did get smashed and he comes to make trouble...]","[We’ll just get Tao Sister to insist it was an accident if that happens. He has no proof.]","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","What kind of trouble have these two caused again?","Shen Tang changed the subject and asked, \"By the way, when exactly is that banquet you mentioned before?\"","\"It's in two days. Do you have time?\"","How could it be at this time? It clashes with the one that Luo Chen said was hosted by someone surnamed Gu.","Shen Tang felt somewhat conflicted, but made a decision after thinking for just a moment and laughed to herself--of course she had to prioritize her sugar daddy!","She could reschedule with that Mr. Gu some other time.","\"I'm free! What should I wear?\"","While Gu Huaian considered who this Mr. Gu that Shen Tang was thinking of could be, he said, \"Someone will come to deliver you some dresses tomorrow, you can pick one.\"","Shen Tang thought he meant someone would bring her a few dresses to choose one that she liked.","She didn't expect that the next day, a whole group of people came to her house--stylists, makeup artists, and even a fitting model with a similar figure to hers that she could use if she wanted.","Many celebrities desperately try but fail to even borrow some of the dresses available for Shen Tang to casually select as she pleased, as plentiful as cabbage.","Shen Tang admitted she was rather shocked by such extravagance.","But she soon happily started picking out clothes with great relish--money is just so nice to have!","She liked all of these dresses so much that she was unable to decide for some.","Tao Sister helped advise on the side, and eventually they settled on a figure-hugging fishtail gown, paired with some jewelry and high heels.","Shen Tang stroked the slender high heels, barely stopping herself from letting the delight spill out of her eyes.","She was quite tall, and with high heels she would be even taller than some male celebrities. So opportunities for her to wear really high heels had been few and far between in the past.","She didn't expect to finally get the chance to now.","Glancing at the time and seeing it was nearing noon, Shen Tang pondered and said, \"Tao Sister, could you pack up some food for me?\"","\"Are you going to see the young master?\"","\"No, I'm going to see how Gu Jinan is doing.\"","They hadn't carried out last night's plan yet when he suddenly got hospitalized. Not visiting him would make her seem rather indifferent.","Plus she also wanted to find out if Gu Jinan's eggs really did get smashed. She had fallen asleep already by the time He Uncle returned last night.","Upon hearing it was to visit Gu Jinan, Tao Sister's face instantly drooped. \"Oh, then let me go pack it up.\"","Soon she came out holding an insulated food container.","Shen Tang took it from her. \"Thanks, Tao Sister. I'm heading out now.\"","\"Have a safe trip, Madam.\"","Gu Jinan was receiving treatment at Gu Hospital, so Shen Tang was quite familiar with the place. As she entered, she smiled and chatted with a few of the young nurses.","After signing in, she arrived at Gu Jinan's ward and could hear pained groans even before going in.","Shen Tang gently knocked on the door. The sounds inside instantly vanished. \"Please come in.\"","Shen Tang adjusted her expression into one of worry and went in. \"How...how are you feeling?\"","When Gu Jinan saw Shen Tang, he recalled how disgraceful things had gotten for him last night--it was utterly humiliating to the point of absurdity.","However, he would not let that Tao Sister off the hook.","If Shen Tang knew what he was thinking, she would surely comfort him: don't overthink things, there will still be many more shameful days for you ahead.","\"I'm alright. The doctor said I pulled a muscle and need to recuperate for a few days.\"","Shen Tang didn't believe his story one bit, but she didn't show it. Instead, she waved the food container in her hand, \"I see. I brought you some food, you should eat something.\"","\"Then I thank...my sister-in-law.\"","Normally, this kind of private visit between a little uncle and his sister-in-law would be somewhat intimate.","But Shen Tang was here to watch a comedy show, hahahahaha!","Opening the container, she was taken aback for a moment. \"Oh, it looks like I brought the wrong one. Or I can bring you some another time...\"","\"It's no problem, I'll eat whatever my sister-in-law brings me.\"","And so, Shen Tang successively took out the egg drop soup, tomato scrambled eggs, cucumber scrambled eggs, and egg fried rice.","Gu Jinan's face was dark, the corner of his mouth was twitching, and his teeth were nearly clenched into dust.","He couldn't help but suspect Shen Tang knew something and had deliberately done this.","Yet Shen Tang's current expression held some bewilderment as she mumbled, \"How did I grab the food packed for Xiao Yu...\"","Only then did Gu Jinan manage to keep his expression under control.","This should really just be a mistake after all.","It's just that right now he reeeeally didn't want to see any eggs, whether whole or broken.","\"By the way, when will you be discharged?\"","\"Why do you ask?\"","\"What about that matter with Miss Zhou you mentioned before? You're hospitalized now, so will it still continue?\"","Upon hearing this, Gu Jinan gloomily lowered his eyes in self-reproach. \"It's all because I messed up and got injured last night...If only I had been more careful and didn't fall...\"","Huh~ Why's he being all wishy-washy, Shen Tang felt extremely disgusted inside.","She nodded. \"Yes, you really were careless.\"","Hearing this, Gu Jinan nearly couldn't maintain his facial expression.","Shouldn't a normal person feel regretful?","Why was Shen Tang's attitude like this? He was momentarily at a loss over how to respond.","\"Don't worry, sister-in-law, I'll be discharged as soon as possible and do my best not to delay your matter.\"","\"Then do your best.\"","Gu Jinan choked a little on her reply. \"Alright.\"","Shen Tang didn't stay long before leaving the ward. Turning her head, she found Gu Jinan's attending physician. \"Doctor, I'm one of Gu Jinan's relatives. How are his injuries?\"","\"What relation are you to him?\"","\"I'm his sister-in-law.\"","The doctor hesitated, unsure whether or not he should say.","But from his reaction, Shen Tang had already deduced that Gu Jinan's eggs really did get smashed. Hahahahaha!","The humor level was 100%!","\"How many?\" Shen Tang asked.","The doctor held up one finger.","Shen Tang forcefully held in her laughter. \"Thank you, doctor. Please take good care of him and don't tell him I came. I'm afraid it would embarrass him.\"","Returning home, Shen Tang asked Tao Sister about what had happened last night.","She was surprised to learn that Gu Jinan had often bullied and framed Gu Huaian when they were young.","\"There's even this kind of history!\" Shen Tang was furious.","\"Yes, the young master has a good temper and usually doesn't hold it against him.\"","Tao Sister added inside her heart--it was just tit-for-tat covert retaliation.","Shen Tang's heart ached badly and she imagined a young Gu Huaian being bullied then silently bearing it with extreme grievance.","She suddenly changed her mind--Tao Sister's methods last night had still been too light.","His both eggs should have been smashed!"]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: What's in it for You and Me","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian finally found out what had happened.","Looking at the home surveillance, his face gradually turned cold.","Gu Jinan still didn't learn his lesson ah, he didn't know that his things could not be touched.","What's more, it was his person.","Reaching out so long, he probably didn't want it anymore.","Thinking this way, Gu Huaian called Cen Assistant.","\"Don't sign the contract with Chenghua Technology yet, hold it back.\"","Chenghua Technology was the company Gu Jinan relied on the Gu Group to create.","He said on the surface that he didn't rely on the Gu family, but his hands took full advantage of all the resources that could be utilized.","This was just to give him a little lesson, and if there was a next time, it wouldn't be like this.","After hanging up the phone, Gu Huaian got up and went out, accidentally seeing Zhou Qinglian being surrounded by stars.","\"Is the secretary's office so free?\"","Hearing the voice, everyone immediately ran back to their seats and shrank back.","Gu Huaian looked at Zhou Qinglian, \"What are you doing here?\"","He still remembered the surveillance he had just watched. Gu Jinan said she wanted to deal with Shen Tang.","Although he didn't know how much of it was true or false, he must not make random fabrications out of thin air.","Zhou Qinglian swept the stray hair to her ear and smiled shyly, \"It was Uncle Gu who let me come...\"","\"What are you doing here? If I remember correctly, you majored in fashion design, right?\"","Noticing the faint gazes around him, Zhou Qinglian's eyes instantly turned red. She reached out to grab Gu Huaian's clothes, but was dodged.","\"Huaian, let's go out and talk.\"","\"I have nothing to talk to you about. Your major is simply unable to handle the work here. Don't come tomorrow.\"","Zhou Qinglian really wanted to cry now. He actually made her lose face in front of so many people. How would everyone look at her in the future?!","She suddenly felt a little resentment towards Gu Huaian in her heart.","\"Why do you have to treat me like this? Do you really not care about the past?\"","Gu Huaian frowned coldly, \"What past do I have with you? You can eat randomly, but you can't speak randomly. Let my wife misunderstand, that's not good.\"","The people who were secretly watching covered their mouths to restrain the screams that were about to come out of their throats.","He really is, I'm crying to death!","Ah ah ah! He really loves her so much!","Please, where can I find such a man before I die?","I must have one like him before I die!","Zhou Qinglian's eyes were red, and her body trembled as if she had suffered a huge blow.","Finally, in the exclamations of others, she fainted.","Gu Huaian hurriedly took a step back and let Zhou Qinglian fall to the ground.","With a \"bang\" that even sounded painful.","However, Zhou Qinglian didn't even wake up with this, I don't know if it was real or fake.","If it was fake, she was really enduring.","A few people felt that Gu Huaian was less humane, no matter what, he shouldn't have watched her fall, it was just a matter of lending a hand.","The majority were very satisfied. The CEO really adhered to male morality.","A good man must engrave these four words in his bones. They suddenly felt a little envious of the CEO's wife.","Zhou Qinglian was sent to the hospital. Gu Huaian thoughtfully instructed the hospital to arrange for her to live next to Gu Jinan.","The two of them were going to plot against Shen Tang, so having them live next door made it more convenient.","Shen Tang didn't know about this.","After learning about the bad things Gu Jinan had done as a child, such as deliberately falling down and falsely accusing Gu Huaian of pushing him, such as breaking things and falsely accusing Gu Huaian of breaking them, and so on, when Shen Tang heard his name now her blood rushed up and she felt an urge to hit someone.","So Shen Tang never went to visit Gu Jinan in the hospital again, even if it was just for appearances, she didn't want to maintain it.","Of course, what she didn't know was that every time after Gu Jinan framed someone, he would be secretly retaliated by Gu Huaian.","Knowing that it was his doing but having no evidence, he could only endure silently.","However, even if Shen Tang knew, she wouldn't say anything. After all, the one who started it was cheap.","As for the little white lotus preparing to take measures against Gu Huaian, Shen Tang felt that no matter how much she did, it was useless. For this kind of thing, it still depended on him.","If Gu Huaian liked her, she would definitely succeed.","If Gu Huaian didn't like her, she wouldn't possibly succeed no matter what.","In fact, men are not as stupid as you think. They can still see if they really like someone or not.","Many people pretend not to know, just to enjoy the ambiguity and feeling of being liked.","The time soon came to the night of the banquet.","Shen Tang had told Luo Chen beforehand that she couldn't go, so Luo Chen went alone to chat face-to-face with the one surnamed Gu.","Coincidentally, the place the other party had chosen happened to be right under the banquet Shen Tang was attending tonight.","\"Wait, since it's like this, I think I can probably still make it.\"","Taking the elevator wouldn't take much effort.","\"Then I'll wait for you downstairs.\"","After hanging up the phone, Shen Tang continued with her styling.","With everything ready, she pushed the door open. Gu Huaian was already waiting.","He wore a black suit, with a tie and cufflinks in the same color scheme as her skirt.","Shen Tang noticed it at a glance.","What a coincidence, the two were dressed like a couple.","She walked over happily in high heels, secretly comparing their height difference.","Gu Huaian was really tall.","\"Sorry to keep you waiting, let's go.\"","\"Let's go.\"","On the other hand, Gu's Hospital.","Zhou Qinglian looked at the brawny bodyguard blocking the door, breathing deeply in anger.","\"Let me pass, I want to go out.\"","The man stood there like a telegraph pole, neither refuting nor agreeing.","However, whenever Zhou Qinglian walked outwards, he would come over and stop her.","\"This is illegal!\"","Zhou Qinglian was so angry she wanted to die. She had tried every method, begging him didn't work, threatening him didn't work either.","It looked like she couldn't get out of this door today. She shouldn't have pretended to be sick. Now she was trapped in the hospital and couldn't get out.","As time passed by one second after another, Zhou Qinglian gave up. \"Can you at least grunt?\"","\"Grunt.\"","Zhou Qinglian gave a cold laugh. \"So you're not mute.\"","\"Who sent you? Gu Huaian? Or Shen Tang?\"","\"Not saying? Heh heh, okay, you really can hold it in.\"","\"No, how many years will it get you sentenced for not talking?\"","At this point Zhou Qinglian had no intention of maintaining her image at all. She was really annoyed.","Tickets for this banquet were extremely difficult to obtain. People without status and background simply couldn't get in.","Uncle Gu originally told her to enter with Gu Huaian, but now it looked like she wouldn't have the chance to go at all.","It must have been Gu Huain who ordered someone to trap her here.","As a girl being treated like this, she felt bad.","She liked Gu Huaian, but more than that, she liked his status and position.","Why on earth did Shen Tang have to appear?","The more Zhou Qinglian thought about it, the angrier she got. If Shen Tang didn't exist, Gu Huaian wouldn't treat her like this. Even if there was no love, he would still marry her under Uncle Gu's suggestion.","Shen Tang, Shen Tang, why don't you go die?"]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: I Want to spend time with my Wife.","paragraphs":["This banquet was more formal than the last one Shen Tang had attended. The people here had more status and would not behave as vulgarly. Everyone was here to seek cooperation, not conflicts.","Shen Tang walked in arm in arm with Gu Huaian, attracting quite some attention.","Gu Huaian first brought Shen Tang to greet two kindly elders, \"Uncle, Auntie, this is my wife Shen Tang.\"","\"Tangtang, this is Uncle Shen and Aunt Shen.\"","\"Nice to meet you, Uncle and Auntie.\"","\"Oh, what a nice girl,\" said Aunt Shen, taking off her jade bracelet and putting it on Shen Tang's wrist.","\"I can't accept this, it's too valuable,\" Shen Tang really wanted to pull her hand back but didn't dare to use force.","\"Good child, don't reject it. Huaian is like my own child, having watched him grow up.\" Gu Huaian also signaled Shen Tang to accept the gift.","Then, Aunt Shen pretended to complain, \"When did you get married? How come I wasn't informed?\"","\"We haven't held the wedding yet. You'll definitely be invited when we do,\" Gu Huaian replied.","\"Alright, alright.\"","After some small talk, Gu Huaian brought Shen Tang away.","He explained in a low voice, \"Uncle and Auntie's child is my childhood friend. He met with an accident years ago and his whereabouts are still unknown. I visit his parents when I have time to accompany them.\"","There wasn't much he could do except be there for his friend's parents.","Shen Tang didn't expect there to be this story behind it. She immediately said, \"I'll visit them more in the future too.\"","As soon as she said it, she felt something was off. Seeing the smile in Gu Huaian's eyes, Shen Tang felt like she had been tricked.","Next, many people actively came over to greet them. Shen Tang put on her professional business smile.","After meeting another group of people, Shen Tang's calves were aching from standing so she unconsciously adjusted her stance into a more comfortable one.","Noticing her small actions, Gu Huaian told her to go sit and rest at the side.","Shen Tang didn't stand on ceremony and nodded, \"I'll go wait for you there.\"","Shen Tang took some food and sat in a corner, preparing to enjoy the delicacies.","Soon, a few women with elegant makeup walked over too.","\"Hello there. Do you mind if we sit here?\"","\"Not at all.\"","What followed next was these women turning on their flattery mode.","Shen Tang was praised so much she almost forgot who she was. Of course, she understood they weren't sincere but only being nice because of Gu Huaian.","Until one woman said, \"Mrs. Gu looks a bit familiar.\"","Only then did Shen Tang calm down and gave a faint smile. \"Perhaps we've seen each other somewhere before.\"","She didn't think these women would pay attention to stuff online, they might not even know who she was.","A strange expression flashed across that woman's face before she resumed her composure.","The women continued chatting, talking about clothes, jewelry, skincare, weight loss, men, children and gossip - typical topics between females.","But since they weren't familiar with one another yet, they only discussed the first two topics.","Shen Tang didn't understand those brands so she quickly lost interest.","However, she didn't show it.","From time to time, she looked towards Gu Huaian who stood out clearly amongst the crowds.","She then saw him frowning at a female server who kept bowing non-stop in front of him.","Shen Tang's first thought was - could this be like in the novels where the poor hardworking girl accidentally spills wine on the CEO's clothes, garnering his attention?","Shen Tang pricked up her ears, wanting to hear what was happening over there. But they were too far away and the music drowned out the voices.","Seeing Shen Tang staring in that direction, the woman understandingly suggested, \"Sitting so long must be tiring. Why don't we take a walk?\"","\"Good idea.\"","Shen Tang looked at the leftover mini cakes in her hand. She opened her mouth wide and gobbled them down in one go.","Waste not, want not!","As they approached, before Shen Tang could speak, Gu Huaian looked over pitifully, \"Wife~\"","Shen Tang was stunned by this term of address. Oh my god, Gu Huaian was actually acting cute!","How much did he drink? His face was all red too.","Shen Tang's ears involuntarily twitched. They felt hot and her heart skipped a beat.","Keeping calm on the surface despite the teasing looks from the others, she asked, \"What happened?\"","\"My clothes...\" They were wearing couple outfits.","Indeed, Shen Tang saw his clothes were stained by red wine.","The female server kept bowing and apologizing nonstop, \"I'm so sorry, I didn't mean to...\"","\"I can help clean it...\"","Gu Huaian looked quite intimidating when he was stern. Seeing the girl on the verge of tears, Shen Tang said, \"It's fine, just change out of it.\"","Gu Huaian pressed his lips together without answering.","But his meaning was clear - he didn't want to change.","\"Do you want me to accompany you to change?\" Shen Tang tried asking.","After all, it wasn't ideal to keep wearing wet clothes.","\"Okay.\" Only then did Gu Huaian relent.","The others jokingly teased, \"Chairman Gu and his wife are so loving.\"","\"That's right, a perfect match made in heaven...\"","\"Excuse us for a moment,\" Shen Tang showed an awkward but still polite smile.","Only when they reached the resting lounge did Shen Tang heave a sigh of relief. She drank some water and asked, \"What happened to you just now?\"","When she turned her head however, she was greeted by the sight of a half-naked Gu Huaian.","Those pecs, that six pack, that figure... *drools*","The impact was too great that Shen Tang almost forgot what she wanted to ask.","\"Why...why aren't you wearing clothes?\"","Gu Huaian pouted sadly, mumbling in a small voice, \"It's so hot...\"","This was completely different from his usual demeanor. Shen Tang's instincts told her something was off about him.","\"Let me turn on the air conditioner for you.\"","When Shen Tang went to find the remote control, she was pulled into an embrace from behind.","Her petite figure fit perfectly against him. She could clearly hear his vital, powerful heartbeats.","Thump thump thump!","Shen Tang's voice unconsciously became strained, \"What are you doing?\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, she really wanted to slap herself.","Why did she have to sound so pretentious!","\"Wife~\" Shen Tang's ears twitched uncontrollably once more. There was no need to stand so close when talking right?","Gu Huaian chuckled softly.","\"How much did you drink? Let me go!\" Shen Tang was shy yet perturbed at the same time. This was the closest she had ever been physically with a man in two lifetimes.","What was up with Gu Huaian? Was he really drunk? How could he have two sides to him like this?","Although the gap moe was pretty cute... She wondered if he would still remember this when sober and feel awkward about it later.","Gu Huaian nudged his head against Shen Tang's, \"Wife, you smell so nice...\"","If it was anyone else, it would be considered sexual harassment.","But this was Gu Huaian...","Shen Tang only felt extremely embarrassed. \"I'm wearing perfume.\"","\"It's not the perfume...\" Gu Huaian sniffed around her like a puppy, \"It's your own scent.\"","Shen Tang couldn't handle such a huge shock. She slowly pried his hands off her, \"Alright alright, so hurry up and put on your clothes, okay?\"","Gu Huaian looked sad like a big puppy being abandoned, \"I want to cuddle with my wife...\"","Shen Tang didn't understand why he was being so clingy when drunk. But they were still in public. It wouldn't be good for them to be away for so long.","\"Put on your clothes first. We'll cuddle more when we get home,\" Shen Tang brushed him off.","\"Okay!\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: He Kissed Her","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian was in no shape to go back downstairs, so Shen Tang decided to return home.","Not until getting into the car did she realize that she seemed to have forgotten something.","Oh well, never mind, it probably wasn't important.","Gu Huaian was very quiet in his sleep in the car.","Taking advantage of the light coming in through the car window, Shen Tang carefully studied this exquisitely sculpted face.","Tsk, he really is so good-looking.","His lips look so kissable.","Thinking this, Shen Tang inexplicably lowered her head.","Gu Huaian's eyelashes fluttered lightly, and he finally pursed his lips slightly.","Shen Tang quickly drew back, only to see Gu Huaian open his eyes and plaintively ask, \"Wife doesn't want to kiss me?\"","Shen Tang felt as if her tail had been stepped on, \"What nonsense are you talking about? How could I possibly kiss you! I certainly don't have any intention of kissing you.\"","Perhaps Shen Tang overreacted too much, even the driver couldn't help taking a glance back.","Gu Huaian seemed a little puzzled between his brows, \"But I heard my wife say she wanted to kiss me...\"","\"You heard wrong, I don't have any intention of kissing you.\"","Gu Huaian was a bit confused. He clearly heard his wife say she wanted to kiss him, didn't he?","He blinked his eyes, \"Then can I kiss my wife?\"","Shen Tang was just about to say \"no\" when Gu Huaian suddenly raised his head and leaned in.","Their lips met, soft and tender, and Shen Tang felt her spine tingle with numb pleasure, her heart thumping loudly.","Had she been kissed?","Kissed?","Kissed?","At this moment, Shen Tang still had time for her thoughts to wander. So this was what kissing on the lips was like. It wasn't the same as described in novels.","Gu Huaian didn't really know what he was doing. His lips parted slightly as he murmured, \"Wife tastes so sweet...\"","Sweet? Where?!","Shen Tang gave a startled jerk backwards, hurriedly looking away with flushed cheeks. Only then did she notice the privacy screen in the car had been lowered without her realizing it.","How embarrassing.","Did he see just now?","Shen Tang fidgeted uncomfortably.","Hadn't they said Gu Huaian was asexual? Why did this seem different?","On further reflection of everything that had happened between them recently, Shen Tang found it hard not to suspect that he might, perhaps, possibly have a tiny bit of liking for her.","Licking her lips, Shen Tang felt somewhat parched.","\"Does wife want to kiss some more?\"","\"No!\" Shen Tang slapped Gu Huaian's face aside with her palm.","She really didn't want to see his face in the short term.","Soon, the car arrived home. Shen Tang didn't wait for Gu Huaian before eagerly getting out and returning to her room.","Tao Sister had already prepared the bathtub with water. Shen Tang soaked in it, washing herself thoroughly, and carefully applied skincare products before finally calming down completely.","It was just a little kiss, laughable, nothing to fear.","Strictly speaking, Gu Huaian was the one taken advantage of, since according to his character setting, this was likely the only kiss he would get his whole life.","Thinking this, Shen Tang giggled aloud.","Coming out wearing a spaghetti strap nightdress and getting into bed, a hand suddenly reached over, frightening Shen Tang so much that she immediately kicked out.","With a thud, Gu Huaian and the quilt fell together onto the floor. He also looked somewhat stunned.","Gu Huaian shook his head, seemingly more clear-headed.","He stood up and pinched his brow, \"How did I get here?\"","Speaking made him instantly revert to his usual self.","Shen Tang couldn't say if she felt disappointed or something else. She pursed her lips, \"Do you know where this is?\"","Gu Huaian looked left and right to see that this was Shen Tang's bedroom.","His brows knitted for an instant before relaxing, \"Sorry, I didn't do anything, did I?\"","\"Nothing much.\" Shen Tang twisted her mouth.","【Jerk!】","【Big jerk!】","【Argh he has no right to not remember anything!】","Hearing her inner voice, Gu Huaian was even more confused. Just what exactly had he done?","Trying hard to recall, he vaguely seemed to remember that he had kissed her...","Wait, he kissed her?","Gu Huaian feigned calm, though his red earlobes gave him away completely. Luckily Shen Tang didn't look over. Gu Huaian wanted to explain but Shen Tang grabbed his arm and pushed him out the door, \"This is my room, please leave.\"","With that, she slammed the door shut with a bang.","Gu Huaian stood at the door, pinching his temple. His head still hurt badly. His alcohol tolerance was usually quite good and some red wine wouldn't affect him this way. Something must have gone wrong.","He would have people look into this matter.","Just after turning around, he discovered Tao Sister and He Uncle peering from the top of the stairs to see what was happening here.","He pretended to remain calm and returned to his room without a sideways glance.","From behind, their muted discussion could still be faintly heard.","\"The young master was kicked out by the missus...\"","\"Sigh, the young master is so useless...\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","·","Gu Hospital","Zhou Qinglian glanced at the time. The banquet was about to end. She pouted her lips, suddenly bursting into tears.","Unlike her usual silent weeping, this time she wailed at the top of her lungs, snot and tears streaming down her face without a care for appearances. The bodyguard was given a shock, quickly looking left and right to see no one was paying attention before passing her some tissue.","\"Stop crying now.\"","\"Crying is useless. I can't let you go out either.\" Zhou Qinglian's voice caught as she cried even harder.","How pitiful she was. Was it wrong to love someone?","Having grown up in an unhealthy family, she understood one principle from a young age. To get what you want, you must use any means to obtain it. Otherwise, don't even think about it.","She was skilled at playing the victim, never expecting to meet someone like Gu Huaian who didn't follow the usual playbook.","The more she thought about it, the sadder she felt. Suddenly, the wall was heavily pounded a few times.","\"Boohoo boohoo! Enough!\"","The voice sounded somewhat familiar, but Zhou Qinglian was in no state of mind to contemplate it now. She wiped away a tear, \"I won't leave the hospital, it's fine if I go next door right?\"","After speaking she headed out without waiting for the bodyguard's response.","Going next door, she hammered loudly on the door. Then pushed her way in, \"You were shouting—\"","Seeing the person lying in the hospital bed, Zhou Qinglian's voice took a sudden turn, nearly failing to come out altogether. \"Chairman Gu, what are you doing here?\"","Gu Jinan also hadn't expected Zhou Qinglian to show up. She looked nothing like her usual self, extremely disheveled.","\"What about you, why are you here again?\" Gu Jinan raised a brow.","\"Was that wailing and shrieking earlier made by you?\"","Zhou Qinglian felt rather awkward. \"No...not me.\"","\"Your tears haven't even dried yet.\"","Zhou Qinglian hurriedly reached up to feel her face. Then she heard Gu Jinan give a derisive snort.","She pursed her lips, smoothing back her hair, \"What are you doing in the hospital? Didn't you say you were going to seduce Shen Tang? Could it be you failed?\"","Men can't stand hearing the word \"failure\".","And Gu Jinan, now impotent, could stand it even less.","His expression instantly changed, as if he had become someone else altogether, grabbing the fruit basket from the bedside table and hurling it at her.","\"Get out! Get out!\"","\"You dare to hit me!\"","Zhou Qinglian had never suffered such grievance before. Picking up several apples from the floor she pelted them right back at Gu Jinan with a rat-tat-tat.","One apple struck true. Gu Jinan's eyes rolled back under the renewed assault to his sensitive area and he promptly fainted.","Zhou Qinglian disdainfully tutted, \"So weak.\""]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: The Orphanage Drama","paragraphs":["Zhou Qinglian tidied herself up unhurriedly before helping Gu Jinan ring the bell.","Without waiting for the doctor to come over, she returned to her own hospital room.","The bodyguard brother was slightly puzzled. \"Why did you come back?\"","Zhou Qinglian had completely let herself go, rolling her eyes without any image: \"Oh, are you willing to talk now?\"","\"Not only did I come back, I'm not leaving anymore either. I'm staying here.\"","\"Oh, you can stay, I'm leaving.\" His task had already been completed, he only had to stop her from attending the banquet.","Zhou Qinglian was a little dumbfounded. \"What, you're leaving just like that?\"","\"Yep, bye.\" The bodyguard brother said before turning around to leave.","You were pretty polite.","Zhou Qinglian sulked to herself as she looked at the empty hospital room, pursing her lips.","What's the difference between staying in the hospital and staying at home? In any case, it was still being alone.","She suddenly felt that it was quite good to stay here, at least until she received the expensive payment bill later on.","Zhou Qinglian was so angry she wanted to swear. So the hospital relies on extortion to make money!","Of course, that was a story for later, so let's not get into that for now.","Let's talk about how Shen Tang was sleeping soundly in the middle of the night when she was suddenly jolted awake and abruptly sat up.","Oh no! She had forgotten about Luo Chen!","She opened her phone to see countless complaining messages from Luo Chen on WeChat.","He was usually so quiet, it seemed he had suffered quite a bit this time.","[Can you believe it, that Mr. Gu is still a minor?]","[Humph, he not only made me wait for over an hour, he looked at me through his nostrils.]","[Are the side branches of the Gu family really that arrogant? Using the Gu family name to directly threaten me to change actors?]","[Wuwuwu, I'm really going crazy......he wouldn't let me leave.]","[Nevermind, I'm not leaving.]","[...]","[I found out, he wants to switch me out for the actress his girlfriend likes, to curry favor with her.]","[Fuck, the actress his girlfriend likes turned out to be you!]","[This guy ordered a bunch of stuff and made me foot the bill in the end, my wallet instantly deflated.]","[No way, he can't have intentionally come to freeload food and drink!]","Shen Tang: \"???\"","After going round and about, it circled back to her in the end.","She really wanted to ask what was going on, but saw that it was 3am. Luo Chen should be sleeping ba.","Shen Tang deleted the text she was typing letter by letter. Then a message from Luo Chen came over.","[Luo Chen: What should I do now?]","[Hopeless Romantic Big Aunt: You haven't slept yet?]","Luo Chen sent over a photo of his dark eye circles, saying: I can't sleep. That young Mr. Gu threatened me that if I don't switch you in, he won't let me continue filming.","Shen Tang directly called him.","\"Did he say what his name was?\"","\"He said his name is Gu Wuyang.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","Her CPU nearly fried from overheating.","\"That's impossible. He must be impersonating someone. Don't bother with him.\"","\"You know him?\"","\"I know Wuyang. He would never do something like this.\"","Luo Chen heaved a sigh of relief. \"Since he's fake, I can rest assured.\"","The Gu family's influence was massive after all. It really was unwise to offend them.","But that guy can't really have come to freeload food right...","Thinking about the meal that cost four digits, Luo Chen felt a stab of pain.","After hanging up the call, Shen Tang thought about it and decided to tell Gu Huaian about this incident.","Who knows if there were others using the Gu family's name to show off.","And he actually used Gu Wuyang's name. Should I say he's stupid or smart?","Gu Wuyang often stays overseas. The people he interacts with after returning to the country are not many, so it would be easy to find out.","Shen Tang suspected this person was his friend or classmate.","What thick skin.","While she was thinking, Shen Tang unknowingly fell asleep. When she woke up, she felt refreshed.","Gu Huaian had already gone to work, which made Shen Tang heave a sigh of relief. She really didn't know how to face him.","No, he was the one related by blood to her. He should be the flustered one, not her!","Thinking this way, Shen Tang touched her lips. The feeling from last night seemed to still remain. Her face instantly turned red.","She splashed cold water on her face before the heat finally faded away.","Shen Tang ah Shen Tang, you really have no integrity.","After going downstairs, Tao Sister immediately brought the dishes over, joking, \"The Master said for you to deliver food to him today.\"","\"I'm not going. No time.\"","One, she didn't want to face him. Two, she really didn't have any time.","She was going to the orphanage to visit the children today.","In fact, Shen Tang had wanted to go see the orphanage earlier.","But that was the place the original body grew up in since young. She was very afraid her disguise would be seen through.","Yet she couldn't keep avoiding it either. Other than sending money on time every month, the original would return once a month.","After changing into casual wear, Shen Tang went to the shopping mall and bought clothes, snacks, learning materials, toys and more.","In the end, there was so much stuff that she could only arrange for truck delivery.","Carrying a truck full of things, Shen Tang swaggeringly arrived at the orphanage, only to discover many people gathered outside the gates.","She alighted from the vehicle and squeezed into the crowd. There, she saw Dean Mum hugging a child while sitting on the floor bawling.","\"You guys can give up on that thought! I will never agree.\"","\"Dean Mum, what's going on?\"","Hearing Shen Tang's voice, Dean Mum wiped away her tears. Her tone was extremely agitated.","\"Tang Tang, you're finally here. They want me to close down the orphanage! If this place shuts, what will the children do? They... they will get bullied in other places.\"","That's right. There weren't many children left in the orphanage.","Those who could be adopted had long been adopted. The ones remaining mostly had disabled bodies. Out of the dozen plus children, not a single one had an able body.","The little girl Dean Mum currently held in her arms had lost both legs from an accident.","Seeing Shen Tang, the little girl's eyes shone brightly. \"Sister Tang Tang, I missed you lots.\"","Shen Tang stroked her head. \"I missed you too.\"","She looked to the person-in-charge on the other side. \"Excuse me, why must this place close down? Who ordered it?\"","The person-in-charge wore an immaculate suit, looking very official.","He patiently explained, \"We can only do as informed from above. It's not that we insist on opposing you all, but your orphanage is too small. If you could merge into the bigger orphanage next door, the children could also receive better care. Can you bear to let them continue living in destitution here?\"","The onlookers around whispered among themselves. A portion felt that he made sense.","\"Yeah, this place is too shabby....\"","\"This orphanage doesn't even have helpers. I say merging is the way to go.\"","\"Right...\"","In actual fact, a few decades ago, this was the only private orphanage around the area. Donations then were also more plentiful.","That was when Shen Tang had first arrived.","Up until ten years prior, a bigger orphanage was set up nearby. The environment and facilities were far better. The children were also more obedient and adorable. Thus, this place had declined since.","To be honest, the facilities truly couldn't compare to those other orphanages. But Shen Tang could vouch that Dean Mum was far more dedicated than all of them combined.","Children with disabilities tended to get abandoned. Thus, psychologically, it was inevitable for them to have some issues. Some had bad tempers and even hit others.","But Dean Mum never discriminated against any child. She patiently soothed them until the children slowly normalized.","Shen Tang asked, \"Which authorities above? Is there a written notice? How do you guarantee the children will receive better care, and won't be bullied instead?\"","Contrary to popular imagination, relations in orphanages weren't actually all that harmonious. Where there were people, there would be conflicts. Resource allocation biases were unavoidable problems.","The person-in-charge shrugged. \"What use is it asking me? Can you trust my guarantee? All I can say is, the environment, medical resources and facilities are far better at that place. These children are mostly disabled. Don't you want them to get better treatment?\"","Upon hearing the term \"disabled\", the little girl in Dean Mum's arms self-consciously glanced at her legs.","As if to comfort her, Shen Tang stroked the girl's head.","The man's words had hit at the softest spots of many. Even Dean Mum was somewhat shaken.","The children indeed had varying degrees of illnesses. If they could receive proper treatment, it would be worth it.","\"If you can guarantee they get better treatment, I'm willing to close this place.\"","The person-in-charge took out a purchasing contract. \"Rest assured. As long as you sign here, I guarantee these children will be appropriately taken care of.\"","Upon receiving and skimming through the contract, Dean Mum's pupils constricted violently. \"You want to buy over this place?\"","Closing down versus getting bought over were extremely different matters.","One still belonged to themselves; one would become someone else's.","The orphanage was the place Dean Mum grew up in since she was small. After her husband's death, she had no children, so she converted this place into an orphanage.","You could say this place contained all of her fondest memories.","Now, they actually want to buy this place!","\"I do not agree!\" Dean Mum said.","Shen Tang took the contract and read through it, but she was not a professional and could not make out any issues.","She took out her phone, intending to take photos and send it to professionals to take a look, but the person in charge stretched out his hand to stop her, \"Sorry, the contract cannot be leaked.\"","Shen Tang raised her eyebrows: \"I won't leak it, I just want my friend to take a look.\"","The person in charge smiled: \"That's not allowed either.\"","The two held onto opposite corners of the contract, at an impasse, the scene becoming tense."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: It's gone. It's definitely gone.","paragraphs":["Cen Assistant was somewhat at a loss. This was already the umpteenth time Gu Huaian had spaced out today.","\"Mr. Gu?\"","Gu Huaian snapped back to reality and gave a light cough. \"What were you saying just now?\"","\"What do you think of this project proposal?\"","Gu Huaian glanced down at the proposal, but soon spaced out again. All he could think about was Shen Tang's lips, soft and sweet like jelly.","He suddenly felt parched, and lightly licked his own lips.","\"Mr. Gu?\" Cen Assistant reminded.","Gu Huaian hurriedly signed off, writing the words \"jelly\" down.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Please redo this document.\"","Cen Assistant contemplated for a moment before asking with concern, \"Are you not feeling well?\"","How could he make such a low-level mistake?","Gu Huaian felt rather embarrassed. \"I'm fine. By the way, Madam will come by later to deliver food. Remember to receive her.\"","Cen Assistant's eyes flashed with understanding.","He looked conflicted, wanting to point out that Mr. Gu seemed to have forgotten this was a contractual marriage?","It didn't seem this situation boded well.","\"Check the surveillance footage from last night's banquet too.\"","He wanted to see what exactly happened for ordinary alcohol to have such a strong effect.","Gu Huaian couldn't figure out his current state of mind either. It was a complete mess, with the sole exception of any feelings of dislike.","And it seemed like he had called her his wife...","Thinking this, Gu Huaian's earlobes started turning red.","When he saw Cen Assistant was still there, he instantly schooled his expression. \"Why are you still here?\"","\"Leaving now.\"","After Cen Assistant left, thinking of Gu Huaian's earlier expression, he sorrowfully shook his head.","Yup, he was definitely done for.","Knowing even someone like Gu Huaian could fall, Cen Assistant revealed an amused smile at the comedy.","Mr. Gu, even you would have a day like this!","Despite their good relations, Cen Assistant looked forward to seeing him suffer this setback. He could hardly wait.","Shen Tang and the two people were still at a standstill outside the orphanage entrance, while curious onlookers lost interest and gradually dispersed, leaving only members of both sides.","The person-in-charge was also getting impatient. \"Young lady, I think we've been at this stalemate long enough. I won't trick you all, just sign this document and we'll let the matter rest. What do you say?\"","Shen Tang stood with both hands on her hips. \"I've also got a suggestion for you. Take your contract and people, and swiftly leave this place. Then I'll also pretend this never happened.\"","The person scoffed. \"You think we'll just leave you all alone if we go?\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Nevermind. I poured the drink but you didn't take it, now you must drink the forfeit. Don't regret this later.\"","Dean Mum hugged the child tightly, extremely nervous in her heart.","\"Tang Tang, why don't we just...\"","\"Dean Mum!\" Shen Tang said seriously. \"I won't let anything happen to you!\"","Dean Mum's lips moved, but she didn't say anything in the end.","What she wanted to say was, Shen Tang shouldn't get bothered by these people because of her. They were clearly not good people at first glance.","If push came to shove, she could sign the contract. Houses were but lifeless objects, not comparable to living people.","Shen Tang grasped her hand tightly. \"Mum, trust me.\"","\"Alright.\"","Dean Mum looked towards the person-in-charge, took a deep breath and said, \"I won't be signing this contract.\"","\"Fine, as you wish.\"","The group turned to leave, but Shen Tang and Dean Mum's hearts remained suspended, unable to settle down.","\"Tang Tang, what should we do now?\"","\"Wait here for a bit, Mum. I need to make a call to someone. Oh yes, help the kids distribute these things first.\"","\"OK.\"","When Dean Mum opened the car door, she then realized Shen Tang had actually brought so many things over.","She was spending too much.","Dean Mum was about to tell Shen Tang this couldn't continue in future when she turned and saw her foster daughter making a phone call, suddenly feeling a strange emotion.","Though she was the one who raised this girl, she strangely felt like Shen Tang was a stranger all of a sudden.","Then she smiled wryly to herself, she must be tired silly.","Dean Mum went in to call the children out to queue and collect presents.","For the orphanage kids, this was the moment they anticipated most.","When Shen Tang ended her call and turned around, she saw a bunch of physically handicapped children happily hugging their gifts, smiling widely.","She only had one thought—to protect these smiles no matter what.","As Shen Tang walked back, the kids excitedly surrounded her.","\"Sis Tang Tang!\"","\"Sis Tang Tang!\"","The chirpy sounds were beautiful to her ears.","Shen Tang was also an orphanage child in her past life. Coming back now felt like coming home.","\"Have you kids been obedient and listening to Dean Mum recently?\"","\"Yes!\"","\"We're very obedient!\"","Shen Tang played with them, gradually losing track of time.","She didn't plan to head home tonight. She worried those people would come back to stir trouble later on.","As dusk approached, a group of men dressed in black suits appeared at the orphanage gates.","Dean Mum got a huge shock. Why were they back so soon?","Shen Tang was also astonished. \"Why are there so many people?\"","Xiao Yu tilted her head. \"Didn't you ask me to bring more men?\"","Shen Tang thought 'more' meant around ten people. She didn't expect a few dozen burly expressionless men.","Just them standing there gave off an imposing aura.","\"Thanks for helping out tonight, everyone.\"","\"It's no trouble.\"","As the night grew darker, the children played to their heart's content before eventually tuckering out and falling asleep.","Shen Tang's group sat quietly in the first floor hall without turning on the lights, quietly waiting for something.","At midnight, soft rustling sounds could be heard coming from outside.","They exchanged looks with each other—here they come!"]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Don't be afraid, I'm coming.","paragraphs":["The night enshrouded the earth, with boundless skies and twinkling stars.","The residential building was all dark, with only the streetlights emitting dots of light.","Over a dozen loafers held baseball bats in their hands, standing at the door of the orphanage.","A man with yellow hair spat on the ground and asked, \"Shall we go in together?\"","The crew cut man pondered for a moment, \"Let's go in together. There's not many people in the orphanage, just a group of disabled children and an old lady. Let's make it quick.\"","\"Sounds good!\"","They were all street gangsters, so jumping over the wall took no effort at all.","There was nothing good to smash in the yard, only some recreational facilities.","They came to the window, the yellow-haired man took out a baseball bat and smashed it hard, shattering the glass instantly.","\"I suddenly remembered a line.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Punching Tsinghua University Nursing Home, kicking Peking University Kindergarten.\"","\"Haha, this orphanage is worse than a kindergarten. I'll punch a kid each later.\"","Their voices were loud, completely looking down on the people at the orphanage, not afraid of being discovered at all.","The group jumped in through the window one by one. One of them found the light switch and turned on the lights with a click -","only to see dozens of people dressed in black standing expressionlessly in the middle of the room looking at them.","They wondered for a moment if they had come to the wrong place.","But looking around, this was definitely it.","\"Sorry for the intrusion.\"","The group looked at each other, swallowing saliva.","The yellow-haired man said with difficulty, \"Um...we came to the wrong place, apologies...\"","Before he could finish speaking, he turned to run.","Though that was just a thought.","He was grabbed by Xiao Yu and pulled down by the collar, falling butt-first onto the ground.","\"Ow...\"","The crew cut man took a step back in fright, \"You can't hit me after hitting him!\"","In the end, the dozen or so were beaten up, each with a swollen face. They now squatted against the wall.","Xiao Yu was very dissatisfied, \"Just this? Too weak.\"","She had thought they were some tough opponents, but they were just some petty street punks.","She didn't get a thrill from beating them up at all.","Shen Tang held Xiao Yu's hand and shook it lightly, \"Our Xiao Yu is the strongest, but without you guys, we couldn't have handled these dozen people either.\"","\"What should we do next?\"","\"Hand them to the police, of course.\"","Upon hearing this, dozens of gazes looked over in unison, everyone feeling surprised except Xiao Yu.","\"Why are you all looking at me like that? Is there something on my face?\"","The yellow-haired man rolled his eyes, \"Please call the police quickly...\"","Before long, the police arrived. The leading man first glanced at the people squatting by the wall, before asking:","\"Who called the police?\"","\"It was me.\" Shen Tang recounted what happened today, \"I suspect they were sent by the group this morning.\"","\"Suspect? Are you the police or am I the police?\"","Shen Tang pursed her lips. She had a bad feeling about this.","Glancing slightly to the side, she saw the yellow-haired man flipping her the finger.","Seeing this, Xiao Yu immediately went up and kicked him.","\"Hey! You dare to hit someone right in front of the police? Take them away.\"","Shen Tang was flustered, \"It was because he had just scolded me, so Xiao Yu just...\"","\"What did he scold you? I didn't hear it.\"","The policeman glanced at the bodyguards and said, \"This bunch looks a bit like gangsters, take them all away.\"","The dean mum became anxious, \"No, they're bodyguards we hired, they're good people. Officer, please don't arrest them!\"","The policeman snorted coldly, \"Whether they are good people or not, your word doesn't count, and neither does mine. We have to take them back for interrogation before we know.\"","Shen Tang finally understood. These two groups were likely in it together.","No wonder the yellow-haired man was so arrogant, turns out he had backing.","Shen Tang took out her phone, about to contact someone, when her phone was snatched away.","She wanted to resist but was afraid of being wrongly accused of assaulting a police officer.","\"Officer, why are you taking my phone?\"","\"The case is not resolved yet, phones need to be confiscated.\"","Shen Tang secretly glanced at the camera hidden in the corner. She had made the right move in installing them.","She had intended to record these hooligans' actions as evidence, but now there was an unexpected gain.","\"Ok, then confiscate all of theirs too.\" Shen Tang said, pointing at the gangsters.","\"Are you teaching me how to do my job?\"","Shen Tang curled her lips. It seemed she couldn't see certain professions through rose-tinted glasses after all, there were good and bad people everywhere.","In the end, everyone was taken to the police station.","Funnily enough, Shen Tang's side were clearly the victims, yet they were kept up all night for interrogation, which was obviously not by the book.","Luckily Xiao Yu and the rest were proper bodyguards, with clean records, so nothing could be found against them no matter how they were checked.","Shen Tang was exhausted, yet was forcibly kept awake. Her temples were now throbbing with pain.","She didn't know when the door opened and someone said, \"You can leave now.\"","Shen Tang jerked her head up to see Gu Huaian standing at the door.","She rubbed her eyes. He was still standing there, his tall figure bringing a great sense of security.","For some reason, upon seeing him, her grievances from before all welled up, and Shen Tang's eyes instantly turned red.","She rushed forward, stopping just before him, \"You...\"","Before she could finish speaking, Gu Huaian pressed her back and pulled her into his embrace.","\"Don't be afraid, I'm here.\"","His words made Shen Tang completely unable to hold back her emotions, tears flowing unstoppably.","She forcefully held in her sobs, but her body couldn't stop trembling.","Heaven knows how scared she had felt just now.","She seemed strong, but was just an ordinary person after all. Compared to those in power, she was nothing.","Gu Huaian's embrace was broad and warm. Shen Tang felt treasured by him.","After crying into his chest for a while, she reluctantly pulled back, embarrassed. \"Sorry, I got your clothes wet...\"","\"It's fine. Let's go home first.\"","That word 'home' brought some warmth. Shen Tang only now realized that at some point, she had started seeing that place as home.","Would she be reluctant to leave when the time came?","Gu Huaian's footsteps faltered. She wanted to leave?","His face instantly darkened. Shen Tang was about to say something when she saw his expression and promptly shut her mouth.","Until they got in the car, Gu Huaian didn't say another word.","Shen Tang secretly glanced at him several times. He was angry, was it because of what happened earlier?","She carefully tugged at Gu Huaian's sleeve, \"Are you angry?\"","Gu Huaian impatiently loosened his tie, \"Is it not obvious?\"","Shen Tang nodded.","It was very obvious. His face was as black as Judge Bao's, if not for the car lighting she wouldn't even be able to see clearly.","Gu Huaian pulled at the corners of his mouth.","Good, having the leisure to think random thoughts, it seems she's not scared anymore.","\"Yes, I'm angry, so reflect on it, and write me a 1000-word self-criticism tomorrow.\"","Shen Tang slowly gaped. Did she hear that right? A self-criticism?","\"Can I not write it?\"","\"No.\" Gu Huaian rejected mercilessly.","\"Can I write less then?\"","\"2000 words.\"","\"Ok ok, 1000 it is.\" Shen Tang quickly said.","Heavens! The last time she wrote a self-criticism was probably in middle school, what was it for again?","Oh right, it was because the boy behind her pulled her bra strap and she nearly broke his fingers.","She had long forgotten how to write a self-criticism.","Shen Tang pondered, she would go online later to copy one back.","Just then, Gu Huaian beside her slowly said, \"Right, I'll check online for plagiarism. If there are similarities, the punishment will be doubled.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","This jerk! Such a jerk!!!"]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: You can try to lean on me","paragraphs":["“Tang, come out and play!”","Shen Tang bit her pen in anguish, lying face down on the table: “Woo woo woo, I can’t go out, I still have things to do today...”","On the video chat, Qi Yue put on makeup while asking: “What’s the matter? My brother’s company was founded. Don't you want to take a look?”","Shen Tang really wanted to see what the biggest entertainment company in the domestic industry would look like in the future.","But she still had a self-reflection essay to write.","She sighed, “Forget it, let’s go next time. I—”","Before Shen Tang could finish speaking, the door was suddenly pushed open. She quickly put down her phone and pretended to be lost in thought.","“How much have you written for your self-reflection?”","Gu Huaian peeked in, and the paper had only a few ugly words like “I'm sorry, I was wrong.”","He raised his eyebrows: “You wrote so long and only got six words down?”","Shen Tang put her palms together, “Teacher Gu, I know I did wrong. Can I stop writing it?”","“Then tell me what exactly you did wrong?”","Shen Tang was rendered speechless.","In fact, she really didn't know what she had done wrong. She felt that she had done the right thing.","Gu Huaian scoffed, “It seems you don't really know your mistakes.”","His thin lips were pressed into a straight line, somewhat angry and somewhat helpless.","Why couldn't she learn not to take risks?","That's right, she always had her own ideas, and didn't care about him at all, after all, she was ready to leave.","Thinking of this, Gu Huaian felt even more irritated.","He glanced at the phone, “Keep writing. You can go out and play after you finish the self-reflection.”","Shen Tang complained inwardly.","This guy didn't even go to class today, just to stay home and watch her write a self-reflection, how freaky.","Hearing her thoughts, Gu Huaian said he could be even more freaky.","After the man left, Shen Tang picked up her phone and realized the video call was still on.","Qi Yue smiled gloatingly, “Well, well, you two really know how to play.”","“No, it’s not what you think.”","“Alright, alright, I get it. Don’t wanna hear about this stuff, it’s nauseating. I’m hanging up.”","After speaking, Qi Yue immediately hung up the phone.","Shen Tang was exasperated, hey, at least let me explain!","Her innocence!!!","As the sun set in the west, Shen Tang racked her brains and wrote a thousand words for her self-reflection.","She ran to Gu Huaian's study and knocked twice before pushing the door open, “Teacher Gu, I'm done with my self-reflection!”","Gu Huaian was in an online meeting. When he heard Shen Tang's words, everyone on screen had subtle expressions.","“Wait a moment.” He muted the microphone, “Let me check it first.”","“You’re really checking it?” Shen Tang handed over the notebook in her hand, “Here, I wrote every word carefully, not that I just made it up.”","Gu Huaian took the notebook and looked at the crooked handwriting. He hooked the corners of his lips.","Shen Tang noticed and frowned, “I haven't written in a long time. Don't make fun of me!”","Although her writing wasn't very good before, it was still a little better than now.","“I'm not.” Gu Huaian denied.","“I saw you laugh!”","“You saw wrong.”","Shen Tang: “......”","She's silly, not blind okay?!","After checking word by word, Shen Tang anxiously asked, “So how is it? Does it pass?”","Hearing the two words “barely acceptable”, the corners of Shen Tang's mouth curved up crazily, “Then Teacher Gu, I can go out now, right?”","Gu Huaian immediately changed his face, “Where are you going?”","“Wasn't it... the orphanage thing is still not solved?”","“It seems you still don't really understand your mistakes.”","“Huh?”","Gu Huaian sighed, and simply said, “I'm right here. You can try relying on me a little.”","Shen Tang was stunned for a moment. Tao Sister and Xiao Yu were also Gu Huaian's people, but she could ask them for help without any misgivings, yet she couldn't do the same with Gu Huaian so casually.","It still seemed like something was missing.","She didn't expect Gu Huaian to take the initiative to say such words, which was practically telling her—“Go ahead and use me.”","Shen Tang carefully chose her words, “I see you’re quite busy with work usually. I don't want to bother you with these little things.”","“You call this a little thing?”","Shen Tang smiled awkwardly.","Um, how is it not?","Compared to a tycoon making millions per minute, hers were just little things.","The more Gu Huaian thought about it, the angrier he got. He didn't even have lunch yesterday afternoon. He just kept waiting for a certain heartless person to bring him food.","He even told Assistant Qian, but that person didn't come at all.","Thinking of this, he flicked her forehead.","Shen Tang covered her head and yelped, “Ow!”","“Giving you a lesson. From now on, no matter big or small, you can contact me if you need anything.”","“Okay.” Shen Tang nodded obediently.","“So now?”","Shen Tang cleared her throat and said in an exaggerated manner: “Sugar daddy, please, help me resolve the orphanage matter! I beg you, please.”","Gu Huaian: “......”","Well, he means, you can't ask for too much. At least there's some improvement.","But her tone was still lacking. It made people want to hit her when they heard it.","“I'll handle this matter. You don't need to worry about it.”","“Thank you, sugar daddy!”","Gu Huaian pinched between his brows, “Change how you address me.”","“You like me calling you Teacher Gu?”","Shen Tang looked a little surprised, as if saying, so this is the real you, Gu Huaian?","Teacher-student play, why not?","“What are you thinking? Just call me by name.”","“Then... Gu Huaian?”","“Yes.”","The two looked at each other.","Shen Tang noticed Gu Huaian's lips, and inevitably recalled the light kiss from before.","Hearing her thoughts, Gu Huaian let out a soft laugh.","To be honest, he wasn't fully sober when he kissed her either. It felt fuzzy, like there was a layer of gauze in between.","He lowered his head and slowly moved closer...","The door was suddenly pushed open with a “bang”, and Tao Sister covered her face, saying, “Oh my, sorry, please continue, I didn't see anything.”","Shen Tang noticed Tao Sister's huge cracked fingers and bulging eyes. She felt a little speechless.","Just as she was about to speak, she noticed from the corner of her eye that Gu Huaian's laptop was still on video call.","Although the mic was muted, her face was very clear on the video.","Wait, does that mean everything just now was seen?!","Shen Tang's face instantly turned red. She complained, “Why didn't you say you were on video?”","“It's okay, they won't talk.” And they didn't really do anything just now.","He glared warningly at the screen. The few people on the other end instantly looked away, very much like trying to cover up.","Shen Tang looked extremely resentful. Is this something that will or won't be talked about?","She really had no face to see anyone now!"]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: She's Not That High","paragraphs":["Shen Tang returned to her room, her mind full of the scene just now. Ah!!!","Did he just try to kiss her?","She was actually looking forward to it for a moment before they got interrupted. She didn't know whether to feel regretful or what.","Shen Tang forced herself not to think about this.","Think about the orphanage instead. With Gu Huaian's help, things would definitely work out.","She wondered if the matron was scared.","She called the matron, who picked up right away.","\"Tang Tang, something wrong?\"","\"Are you alright?\" Shen Tang asked.","\"I'm fine, I'm fine. Tang Tang, is that man your boyfriend? He sent a lot of supplies over and had people fix some worn down places. The acquisition has also been resolved thanks to him. He is truly a good man. Tang Tang, you have to treat him well.\"","\"Huh? It's been resolved already?\" Shen Tang was surprised. Gu Huaian was just...","That jerk must have done it on purpose!","The matron's voice was full of smiles. \"Yes, yes. Those who owed apologies apologized, those who deserved punishment got punished. Turns out they heard this place was going to be demolished so they wanted to snatch it for themselves. Your boyfriend said the demolition plans do exist but not for a long time.\"","Shen Tang understood. The orphanage did occupy a large piece of land after all. Money moves people's hearts!","\"How are the children?\"","\"They are fine. You just take care of yourself, no need to worry about us. In the future when you visit, don't bring too many things... don't overspend...\"","The two chatted for a while before hanging up.","Shen Tang clutched her chest. She didn't know why, but talking with the matron gave her a sense of familiarity.","\"What's going on...\"","She couldn't figure it out.","After resting for a bit, it was time for Shen Tang to get back to work.","When Pei Kesong called, Shen Tang almost forgot who she was.","Of course that was impossible.","But the days off were truly happy and hard to part with.","Arriving at the company, Pei Kesong walked around Shen Tang twice with knitted brows. \"Did you gain weight?\"","Shen Tang said guiltily, \"No, just drank more water so looks a bit bloated.\"","\"Is that so? Then let's weigh you.\"","Shen Tang didn't expect she had to get on the scale. She stripped down to her undergarments and stepped onto it.","One look at the number and she knew she was screwed.","Sure enough––","Pei Kesong gave her death glare. \"Very good, you gained 22 lbs. Remember you are a female celebrity? You forgot even basic body management.\"","Shen Tang mumbled, \"I just got out of the hospital not long ago...\"","Pei Kesong shook her finger. \"Excuses won't work. Lose weight. I'll send you a weight loss schedule later and you have to strictly follow it.\"","Shen Tang drooped her head dispiritedly. \"Fine... By the way, what's the job you mentioned?\"","\"A supporting female role No.3 in a big IP production. Not much screen time but excellent character design. Take a look.\"","Shen Tang read it. The No.3 female lead came from a prominent military family and was skilled in martial arts. She was doted on by her family.","Her father and brothers died in battle one day. Her mother died from depression after, leaving her an orphan girl.","Her betrothed looked down on her unladylike behavior and broke off the engagement to marry someone else instead, making her the laughing stock of the capital.","Later when enemy troops invaded, several generals of the dynasty suffered crushing defeats.","She took off her makeup, put on armor, and volunteered to join the fight. No one looked favorably on her but having no other choices, she was allowed on the battlefield.","Unexpectedly she performed valiantly and thoroughly routed the enemies, earning everyone's praises.","But a big tree attracts the wind. On the way back from the triumph, she was ambushed and fell off a cliff.","It was an open ending whether she died or survived.","Not being the female lead, there were no detailed accounts of her.","After reading, Shen Tang instantly fell in love with this character. Women striving for achievement was difficult in patriarchal societies.","\"I'll take the role!\"","Pei Kesong rolled her eyes. \"You can't just say you want the role and get it. Hurry up and lose weight. Go audition next week.\"","Right, a female general must have a good figure and not soft flab like hers.","\"Don't worry, I will lose weight properly!\"","Come night time, Shen Tang started regretting a little. Was doing this role a must?","Tiring and hungry, Pei Kesong even had Yuan Yuan keep an eye on her so she couldn't slack a bit.","Wah... she committed too early.","Yuan Yuan cheered at the side, \"Sis Tang Tang, jiayou! Just a bit more!\"","Shen Tang had no energy to even speak. \"How...how long more...a bit?\"","Yuan Yuan grinned. \"Not long, just the last 30 minutes! Jiayou!\"","Fine, just 30 minutes. She already promised so no quitting halfway.","Besides, everyone meant well for her.","Shen Tang endured the tears and continued exercising. She didn't know how much time passed until she heard Yuan Yuan said \"Done!\". She promptly laid down with eyes staring straight at the ceiling, looking as if refusing to blink even in death.","\"Sis Tang Tang, you alright?\" Yuan Yuan asked worriedly.","\"Still...still breathing...\" Shen Tang panted heavily.","If just pursuing thinness, dieting would do. But to have good body lines required exercise too.","Of course she was crash dieting because of the urgent audition. She had professional nutritionists plan her meals and supplements too. Don't try this at home.","In a blink of an eye, a few days passed. Shen Tang went from a dead dog tired initially, to a masochist by the end. Her figure now looked much better than before.","Indeed, expert guidance brought obvious results.","Faint abdominal lines could be seen. Just a bit more and abs would show!","That day, Shen Tang brought Yuan Yuan along to the audition. Right after getting out of the car, they met the intimidating Qi Yue.","Shen Tang was surprised. \"You came to audition too? Didn't you retire from the industry?\"","Qi Yue took off her shades and smiled charmingly. \"I did, but not completely. I'm here in another capacity today.\"","\"Huh? What capacity? Don't tell me you're the interviewer? \"","\"That's right.\"","Shen Tang was only joking but correctly guessed it anyway. She was shocked. \"Damn girl, so you joined them after not being able to beat them. Became capitalist now huh.\"","Qi Yue fluttered her lashes flirtatiously. \"That's right. Want me to give you some backdoor help?\"","Shen Tang was a little tempted.","Before she could answer, Qi Yue continued on her own. \"Forget it, I know you won't want it. It's an insult to your personality.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"No wait, I didn't say I don't––\"","\"You don't have to say it, I understand you. Rest assured I'll be fair to everyone.\" Qi Yue said and left gracefully, leaving Shen Tang frozen there.","\"No no, I want it! I do!\"","Who would reject backdoor opportunities?","Insults to personality, as if! She's not that narcissistic.","Yuan Yuan covered her mouth and giggled at the side. When Shen Tang looked over, she instantly shut up. \"Erm, Sis Tang Tang, don't worry. You'll definitely get selected.\"","Shen Tang pouted. \"Hopefully...\"","While she said that, knowing Qi Yue was one of the interviewers did boost her confidence quite a bit.","Even if no favoritism, at least no unfair treatment would happen to her.","She really didn't expect Qi Yue to become an interviewer though. Looks like the Qi family invested heavily in this production to have such influence.","Then might she run into the female lead...","Sometimes thinking too much of something summoned its arrival. Shortly after entering, Shen Tang saw a familiar face walking over smilingly.","\"Sis Tang Tang, what a coincidence~\"","\"Mian Mian, you came to audition too?\"","Female lead Lin Mian Mian smiled shyly. Seeing no one was paying attention, she whispered, \"Nope, I've already been confirmed internally. It's a show the company invested in for me.\"","Shen Tang was unsurprised.","Indeed Qi Jue moved quickly. Just after starting his company, he already got resources for his girlfriend.","Shen Tang almost shed tears of envy from the corners of her eyes.","Damn unfair heaven!","She transmigrated here so why didn't she land in the body of the female lead?"]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Forced to Eat Melons","paragraphs":["\"By the way, Sister Tangtang, do you want to come to our company? I remember your previous company was quite...\"","The incident with previous agent Wang Brother made waves inside and outside the industry. Lin Mianmian naturally heard about this incident too.","The olive branch extended by the female lead was something Shen Tang quite wanted to take, but interacting too much with the female lead was not a good thing either.","Shen Tang painfully declined, \"Forget it, I'm quite good now. My new agent treats me very well. It was her who allowed me to come for the audition this time.\"","Lin Mianmian's expression was somewhat subtle.","\"Then alright... If you change your mind in the future, you can contact me anytime.\"","\"Sure.\"","After Lin Mianmian left, Shen Tang found a corner to rest and clear her emotions, so as not to affect her audition later.","Afraid of others disturbing her, she specially took a magazine to cover her face.","Perhaps because places like these have more accidents, not long after, a clamor rose not far from Shen Tang.","\"Hey, who's this? How did you come for the audition, could it be... you climbed into someone's bed?\" A female voice sounded mocking.","\"How can you say that!\"","\"Heh, whether you climbed into someone's bed or not, you know clearly in your heart, yet you're afraid of others talking about it?\"","\"I climbed into someone's bed? Who did I climb into bed with? On what basis are you speaking so vulgarly?\"","\"A relationship? You got into a relationship with someone else's boyfriend? Huh, your mouth really does not choose, huh.\"","\"Someone else's boyfriend?\"","\"You can't possibly want to say you didn't know right?\"","\"I... I really didn't know. He said his ex-girlfriend died, and had been single all this while...\"","The girl was silent for a moment, gnashing her teeth, \"I'm still alive and kicking, don't curse me dead. Moreover, how could a 30 something year old single man possibly be believed.\"","\"I...\" The other girl stammered, seemingly not knowing how to explain.","Shen Tang was already very embarrassed to be forced to listen in on gossip, what was more embarrassing was these two did not leave, and she somewhat needed the bathroom.","Regarding this matter, she as an outsider did not know right from wrong, whether the girl was innocent or not she did not know, but the man must definitely be a scumbag.","Seeing the two still confronting each other there, Shen Tang could not hold it in any longer.","She removed the magazine from her face, and had not even opened her mouth to speak, when a male voice sounded from beside, \"Then what happened?\"","The three looked over simultaneously, the chubby looking man gave an honest smile, \"Sorry, I was sleeping here just now, accidentally overheard your conversation.\"","Shen Tang raised her hand saying weakly, \"Me too...\"","The two girls were somewhat unhappy, but since it was not intentional by the others, there was nothing that could be said.","\"It's fine.\"","The other girl suspected of being a mistress explained red-faced, \"You... don't misunderstand, I really am not a mistress that destroyed someone else's relationship...\"","Shen Tang actually did not care about all this. They were strangers after all, she was not interested in other people's love lives.","However, the man stroked his chin, \"According to what you said, this man should be a scumbag, putting on a single image out there, who knows how many people he has tricked!\"","Come to speak of it, that was indeed a possibility.","\"Who is that man? I might even recognize him.\" The man said.","The two girls looked at each other, neither seeming to want to say.","Seeing the atmosphere turn rather awkward, the man casually waved his hand, \"Harm, I don't mean to pry into your privacy, it's just that if he is someone from the industry, I might recognize him.\"","The two girls hesitated for a moment, before finally saying—","\"Chen Mingyu.\"","\"Chen Junjie.\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","\"Two people?\"","The initial provoking girl was also somewhat panicked, what if she had gotten the wrong person...","\"That can't be. I've seen your photo in his phone before, it must be right...\"","The last part was spoken softer, seemingly to convince the other person, or perhaps to convince herself instead.","The other girl firmly said, \"I'm certain his name is Chen Junjie. I've seen his IC before.\"","\"Oh dear, I haven't heard of these two names before. What does he do?\" The man scratched his head.","\"Photographer.\"","\"Photographer.\"","Since their occupations were the same, then in all likelihood, it was the same person.","Shen Tang suggested, \"Why not get him out to meet up? However you look at it, he has a part to play in this matter.\"","If the other girl really was cheated on, then that would truly be miserable.","Both girls agreed to this method. After all, there were no other good solutions.","For guys like these, even if caught red-handed in bed, they would never admit it either.","The girl suspected of being the mistress asked, \"You... are Shen Tang right?\"","Shen Tang nodded, \"You know me?\"","\"Hello, I'm He Xue. You saved my older sister previously... Now she's your hardcore fan, always asking us to vote for you everyday in our family chat group.\"","He Xue did not explain in detail, but Shen Tang guessed what had happened. It was likely the previous incident.","She had jokingly talked about them becoming her fan, yet she did not expect someone to take it so seriously.","Shen Tang felt somewhat moved, \"Thank your sister for liking me. By the way, what's your sister's Weibo username?\"","He Xue opened and closed her mouth, before finally saying softly, \"I am Steamed Bun ^_^.\"","\"Pfft!\" The other girl immediately burst out laughing, \"Your sister's Weibo username is really interesting. By the way, I'm Li Menglong.\"","With the barrier broken, the two no longer continued provoking each other. The rights and wrongs would soon be uncovered.","Shen Tang felt this Weibo username was extremely familiar, yet she could not recall it for a moment.","\"Are you here for the audition too?\"","He Xue nodded, \"I'm here to audition for the female lead's maid.\"","Li Menglong stroked her hair, \"What a coincidence. I'm also auditioning for this role. Looks like we'll be competing again.\"","Shen Tang and the man were somewhat nervous, fearing conflict might erupt between the two girls again.","The man hastily spoke, \"I feel you're more suitable for the role of the petty princess.\"","Li Menglong nearly burst out laughing, \"I clearly know my own limits. That's at least the fifth female lead right? I can't get that role.\"","The man thumped his chest, \"What I say goes.\"","\"You are...\"","The man gave an honest smile, \"I'm the director.\"","The three women: \"...\"","It was truly awkward, giving awkwardness the key to open the door. Reaching peak awkward levels.","Too amusing, not a single one had recognized the director."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Motherfucker","paragraphs":["\"What, you're really the director?\"","The man smiled, \"What, don't I look like one?\"","\"Not really.\"","Shen Tang still remembered the gossip Pei Kesong had told her earlier, saying that this director had a terrible temper and really enjoyed yelling at people, making many actors cry.","But the man in front of her looked gentle and good-tempered.","Shen Tang relaxed, thinking that maybe Pei Kesong was just trying to scare her.","The man blinked, \"Alright, I have to get back to work now. You all remember to do well later, add oil!\"","\"Thank you, director!\"","\"We will, we will.\"","After hearing this, Shen Tang was even more convinced Pei Kesong was just trying to scare her.","Look at how nice this person is, even going out of his way to encourage them.","The scumbag matter would have to wait until after the audition. Li Menglong got some advice from the director and prepared to try again for the princess role.","As for Shen Tang, she looked over the script again. It would be her turn to audition soon.","Upon entering, Shen Tang immediately saw Qi Yue and Qi Jue sitting to the side, the brother and sister looked quite similar.","\"Hello everyone, I'm Shen Tang. I'm auditioning for the role of the female general today.\"","Qi Yue tossed a flirtatious glance her way, but Shen Tang ignored it completely.","The deputy director sitting in the middle leaned back in his chair and said, \"Go ahead and perform the scene where you request to lead the troops into battle.\"","\"Alright.\"","Shen Tang closed her eyes, and when she opened them again her entire demeanor had changed.","Despite there being no props, she seemed to be fully immersed in the scene.","Even kneeling on the ground, Shen Tang's back remained straight, her gaze exceptionally determined. \"Your Majesty, I have been trained in swords and spears since I was young, studying Sun Tzu's Art of War. Now that the enemy has invaded, I request to lead the troops into battle.\"","She paused, as if listening to someone else speak.","Shen Tang's expression instantly cooled, and she turned her head sharply, a flash of killing intent in her eyes. \"What of it that I'm a woman? My grandmother fought alongside Your Majesty to establish this kingdom, one of its founding heroes. I was taught by her, do you doubt my grandmother's achievements? Are you questioning me, or questioning Your Majesty?\"","\"Not to mention my family has guarded the borders for three generations, dying on the battlefield. On what basis can you useless corpses who do nothing but eat and sleep say they are useless?\"","\"Oh? Then why don't you lead the troops?\" Shen Tang raised a brow, disdainful.","She looked forward again, lowering her head in a bow, tone as firm as a boulder. \"Your Majesty, I ask again to lead the troops.\"","\"Thank you, Your Majesty!\"","Shen Tang stood up. The room fell silent. Qi Yue was the first to applaud and loudly exclaim, \"Great!\"","Shen Tang almost laughed at her exaggerated acting.","The deputy director's eyes blinked and he shook his head. \"I don't think she's suitable.\"","Qi Yue retorted, \"What's not suitable? I thought it was pretty good.\"","\"This... her performance was a bit superficial. I don't think she's suitable.\"","\"How was it superficial? I thought it was very authentic. You're not deliberately finding fault, are you?\" Qi Yue didn't give the deputy director any face.","Shen Tang noticed the deputy director's face had darkened.","No matter how she thought about it, she couldn't figure out how she had offended him.","After thinking it over, there was only one possibility - she had blocked someone else's way.","\"Thank you, director.\"","The director smiled and winked. \"Go back and prepare well.\"","\"Alright.\"","Shen Tang left. Yuan Yuan anxiously came up to her, \"Sis Tang, how did it go?\"","Shen Tang frowned and shook her head.","Yuan Yuan quickly said, \"It's fine, we can try again next time. I believe in you!\"","Shen Tang couldn't help laughing out loud. She ruffled Yuan Yuan's hair, \"Just kidding, I got it.\"","Normally they would have to wait for notification, but she had been chosen on the spot this time.","Shen Tang couldn't help but wonder if the director had pulled some strings for her.","When Pei Kesong heard the news, she was silent for a few seconds.","\"You think the director is running a charity? He wants this drama to succeed more than anyone.\"","Shen Tang awkwardly laughed.","She then said, \"Speaking of which, the director isn't as scary as you made him sound.\"","Remembering the deputy director's expression, Shen Tang asked, \"Did you get the people mixed up? It's the deputy director, not the director right?\"","Pei Kesong had a complex expression. \"I hope you'll still think that after you start filming.\"","Shen Tang had a bad feeling about this.","Pei Kesong patted her shoulder, \"Do your best. Don't cry when the time comes.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Why did she feel more and more afraid the more she heard?","Speaking of which, she had added the director, He Xue and Li Menglong on WeChat earlier, making a group to follow up on the scumbag matter.","He Xue met up with the scumbag. Li Menglong sat at the next table eavesdropping.","It turned out to be the same man after all.","He Xue deliberately probed him, proving her own innocence.","Hearing her boyfriend being so warm and caring toward someone else, Li Menglong was so angry she could hardly stand it.","Oh wait, ex-boyfriend that is.","When confronting him face to face, the scumbag actually still tried to argue.","But the facts spoke louder than words. It was clear he had two-timed and deceived these girls.","The two girls simultaneously broke up with him, each throwing a cup of coffee in his face.","The director applauded in the chat: Well done!","When Shen Tang heard about this aftermath, she was very satisfied as well.","Because of this incident, the two girls got to know each other despite not being acquainted before.","Of course they didn't let the scumbag off so easily. They directly exposed him online, and unexpectedly there was more to follow.","Many other victims came forward to share their stories of being deceived by him.","As a photographer, he met many girls. He used free photo shoots as bait to trick ignorant young girls into taking private photos.","He would share these photos in a group with other photographers like him, everyone exchanging resources.","Even worse, he also seduced quite a few underage girls into physical relationships, with the youngest only 14 years old.","Learning of this, the netizens were furious.","Some directly doxxed the scumbag. Word was he didn't even dare leave his house now, and all his social media accounts had been bombed.","[F*cking scumbag!]","[Guys like this spoil the bunch. I'm a photographer too and now my friends are asking me if I've done anything bad.]","[Just 14 years old! How could he do that? He's in his 30s himself, about the same age as the girl's father...]","[As a father of daughters myself I can't even read this stuff.]","[Can the rest of the people in that group get doxxed too?]","[The above poster, calm down! Doxxing is illegal!]"]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Party at the Old House","paragraphs":["Shen Tang didn't expect the aftermath to be like this. Thinking that such a young child was deceived, and might be left with lifelong psychological shadows, she felt extremely upset.","Opening her main Weibo account, she directly reposted and commented: I suggest physical castration.","In the entertainment industry, she was the first to be so brave.","Now Shen Tang also had some loyal fans who rushed over as soon as they saw her Weibo post.","The most powerful one was a girl whose ID was \"I am steamed stuffed bun\".","Shen Tang finally understood why it looked familiar. This person was really the king of being tough-mouthed, and could take on almost a hundred others alone, leaving her with an indelible impression.","She gave the girl a like.","This matter came to a temporary conclusion for the time being, but Shen Tang kept an eye on it all along.","Tonight she would go to the old house. Shen Tang tried on a dress she hadn't worn before, and found that it was already too loose, about a section too wide.","Tao Sister's face was full of distress: \"Madam has lost weight again...\"","Shen Tang was extremely happy about it. She took off her clothes and looked left and right, \"Hahaha, my abs are finally going to come out...\"","\"Madam has such a good figure.\"","\"Hehe...\"","Before Shen Tang could worry about what to wear tonight, the styling team arrived at her house, and they brought top designer dresses too.","Shen Tang had thought the dresses were rented, and only later found out that Gu Huaian had bought them all.","As someone who had always been thrifty, this was the first time she felt what a rich person's life was like.","Looking at it this way, her previous life was just like child's play in comparison.","Although she still felt some discomfort, it was already much better than before.","Shen Tang was like a wooden mannequin the whole time, letting the team dress her up and change her clothes.","\"Tao Sister...\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"Why do we have to dress up for going to the old house?\" She felt it was no less stressful than attending a banquet last time, having to wear formal dresses.","\"Didn't Sir tell you?\"","\"What?\"","Tao Sister's expression was somewhat complicated: \"This time going to the old house is not an ordinary family dinner. The whole Gu family clan will come, including the side branches of the Gu family.\"","Shen Tang didn't know about this at all. \"So wouldn't there be a lot of people?\"","\"Yes, but Madam you don't need to worry. Sir is now the head of the Gu family. It's up to the others to fawn on you. If you don't want to talk, just ignore them.\"","Shen Tang felt somewhat hesitant: \"Wouldn't it... bring undesirable effects for my husband?\"","\"Rest assured, in the face of absolute power, these are not problems. You don't need to consider these things, just do whatever you want.\"","Shen Tang breathed a sigh of relief. She feared scenes like this the most.","The scene from attending the previous banquet was still vivid in her mind. She had no idea what to say to those women at all.","It was as if they were separated by the Somali Trench – they liked high-end stuff, while she liked down-to-earth things.","It is said that man depends on clothes while a horse relies on the saddle. Shen Tang wore a jade-colored cheongsam today, gentle and sexy at the same time, giving off an intellectual feeling.","The pearl earrings adorning her ears matched her fair complexion even more.","Tao Sister circled around Shen Tang twice, and was so excited that she took out her phone and started taking pictures.","\"This outfit looks too good, I have to take it down and post it on Weibo.\"","\"Ah?\" Shen Tang was stunned for a moment, \"Post it on Weibo for what?\"","Tao Sister didn't even lift her head to speak. \"Of course it's for your fans to see. You don't know, because you don't post on Weibo often, they clamor for it every day in the group.\"","\"No, how do you know what they are like?\"","Tao Sister smiled mysteriously, \"I'll be honest, I'm your hardcore fan.\"","In Shen Tang's stunned expression, Tao Sister went on, \"Actually, so is Uncle He. He still checks in at your super topic every day.\"","Shen Tang was truly shocked. What virtue or ability did she have...","She was so moved that her nose turned sour, and she reached out to hug Tao Sister, but was pushed away, \"Don't, don't mess up the styling.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","The brewing emotions dissipated instantly.","\"When did you guys start? Why didn't you tell me?\"","Tao Sister and Uncle He were not young. She didn't know where they had learned these things.","Also, there were some nasty comments in her comments section. She didn't know if they had seen those.","Shen Tang was a little worried that they would be scolded by the black fans.","She tentatively asked with care: \"You guys haven't encountered anything bad, right?\"","Tao Sister waved her hand dismissively, and scoffed, \"They're all trivial matters. Don't worry, my combat ability is fierce. Those people can't beat me in an argument.\"","As she spoke, she opened Weibo, \"Your Uncle He's son is a programmer at a company. He specially wrote a small program to automatically scold them back for us.\"","Shen Tang slowly widened her eyes, \"There's even such an operation...\"","She was shocked stiff. My good buddy.","\"Is this thing so useful that I could buy it from you?\"","\"Buy what, just take it and use it directly. I'll add him to the group and let him give it to you.\"","This was the first time Shen Tang learned that Uncle He had a son too.","But it was also normal, she just didn't know what Uncle He's son looked like, and whether he was as refined as Uncle He.","His job was a programmer. Could it be that he was already bald at such a young age...","Shen Tang was added to a group of four. Apart from her, the other three were Tao Sister, Uncle He, and Uncle He's son Little He.","To Shen Tang's disappointment, Little He's WeChat avatar was just his work photo. It could be seen that he had exceptionally thick hair, which made people envious and jealous.","Shen Tang couldn't help but ask in the group: Any tips for hair growth?","【Little He: ???】","【Uncle He: Madam is joking. Ours is natural.】","Shen Tang looked even more envious. Her hair was softer, so she looked like she had less hair. Many black fans attacked her hair.","Tao Sister consoled, \"Madam don't be upset. Your amount of hair is already enough. To be honest, the hair on Uncle He's head is a wig.\"","Shen Tang instantly stared with wide eyes: \"A wig?\"","\"Yes, although his hair is thick, it's curly like wool. He felt it didn't match his temperament, so he shaved his head bald and wore a wig.\"","Shen Tang imagined it in her mind - curly-haired Uncle He actually looked cuter.","There was a knock on the door, and Uncle He walked in, \"Madam, Sir is waiting for you downstairs.\"","Shen Tang's gaze uncontrollably floated to Uncle He's head. The hair quality looked quite real, if Tao Sister hadn't said so, she wouldn't have noticed it was fake.","Uncle He inexplicably felt a chill on his head, \"Madam?\"","Shen Tang came back to her senses, \"Oh oh, I'll go down now.\"","Taking her pearl clutch, Shen Tang only went downstairs then.","Downstairs, Gu Huaian had his legs crossed while sitting on the sofa.","Hearing footsteps, he slightly raised his head to see Shen Tang in cheongsam, a hint of awe flashing in his eyes.","He got up and walked to the stairs, holding out his hand to help Shen Tang down.","\"This outfit suits you very well.\"","Shen Tang smiled, \"Thank you, you too.\"","Only after speaking did she notice that Gu Huaian was in a suit again today.","She couldn't help but start to suspect that Gu Huaian had bought dozens of the same suits and wore them on rotation.","Gu Huaian's expression stiffened. He clearly wore different clothes every day...","It was getting cold, time to buy new clothes..."]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Just ate cephalosporin","paragraphs":["Arriving at the old residence, Shen Tang had just gotten out of the car when countless eyes looked over. There were kind, curious eyes, and also unkind ones.","Shen Tang maintained a smile as she walked in linking arms with Gu Huaian. Seeing Old Madam Gu and Old Master Gu, Shen Tang was somewhat hesitant about what to call them. Calling them uncle would be inappropriate, but calling them dad was afraid he would not give her face.","Finally, she tentatively called out, \"Dad, mom.\"","Old Master Gu had a cold face, seeming as if he wanted to say something. Shen Tang's eyes were quick to notice Old Madam Gu pinching him fiercely.","\"Ow!\" Old Master Gu's mouth kept twitching in pain.","Laughter spilled from Shen Tang's eyes. As expected, there is always a higher mountain. It looks like currying favor with Old Madam Gu is the way to go in the future.","Old Madam Gu laughingly held her hand. \"You look even more beautiful after not seeing you for a while...\"","Shen Tang happily touched her face. \"Really?\"","Old Madam Gu smiled, \"Of course it's true.\"","Gu Huaian felt somewhat ashamed to look at her.","There were many people who came today. Old Madam Gu and Old Master Gu's attitude towards Shen Tang decided the attitude of the other Gu family members towards her.","Old Madam Gu was so intimate, and many people in their hearts also took note of Shen Tang.","Old Madam Gu introduced her to several important elders before letting the young people go off on their own.","Shen Tang followed Gu Huaian away from the crowd and had just breathed a sigh of relief when she heard a voice she did not want to hear from behind.","\"Sister-in-law...\"","Shen Tang looked back to find that Gu Jinan had also come.","\"You're better?\" Her gaze uncontrollably lowered. Gu Huaian grabbed her chin.","Why did she want to look at everything?","Gu Jinan's expression twisted for a moment, apparently recalling some bad memories.","\"I'm fine, thanks for sister-in-law's concern,\" Gu Jinan said, even blinking his eyes.","Shen Tang was a little nervous. Gu Huaian wouldn't misunderstand, would he...","Just then, two little ones ran over. \"Sis!\"","\"Sis, you came!\"","Shen Tang was hugged by Gu Anran and Gu Wuyang at the same time. She had missed them after not seeing them for a while.","Gu Wuyang was wearing a little suit today, with a bow tie at the collar. Gu Anran was dressed like a little princess, even wearing a diamond crown on her head.","Shen Tang couldn't help but guess, were those diamonds on it real...","Gu Huaian's lips curved up slightly. Tang Tang is so cute.","He moved next to Shen Tang's ear and asked in a low voice, \"Do you like it? If you like it, I'll buy you one.\"","Shen Tang's sensitive ears twitched. \"Hehe, I like it.\"","【The one Gu Huaian gives must be real. It can definitely sell for a lot of money in the future.】","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He was a little helpless. This little money-grubber had money in her eyes.","\"You play here first. I still have some things to deal with.\"","Shen Tang waved her hand. \"Go, go.\"","Gu Jinan was about to talk to Shen Tang when Gu Huaian gave him a cold look. \"Come with me.\"","\"Big brother, what's the matter?\"","\"I do have something. Come with me.\"","Gu Jinan was a little unhappy, but he couldn't refute and could only leave reluctantly, looking back every three steps.","However, Shen Tang didn't even glance at him.","Exchanging pleasantries with adults was not as fun as chatting with little friends. Shen Tang decided to just stay with Anran and Wuyang for the rest of the time.","However, she didn't have to look for trouble as trouble came looking for her.","Shen Tang even wondered if she was actually the female lead of this book. Why else would she never get any peace?","\"Miss Shen, do you mind going to the side to talk?\"","Shen Tang looked at Zhou Qinglian with a smile as she politely declined, \"I'm sorry, it's not very convenient at the moment. Do you have something to say? You can just tell me directly.\"","Zhou Qinglian frowned, revealing a trace of fragility.","Not far away, a girl saw this and hurriedly came over to uphold justice.","\"Sis Lian...\"","She looked at Shen Tang. \"Don't bully my sister Lian. If you have anything, come at me!\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","If she hadn't accidentally discovered it last time, she really wouldn't have imagined that Meow Meow was actually such a silly fool in real life.","She still had some past feelings, so Shen Tang endured it.","Shen Tang took a deep breath. \"Which eye of yours saw me bullying her?\"","Meow Meow hemmed and hawed, unable to say anything.","When she was little, Sis Lian was often bullied by her father's illegitimate children. She couldn't bear to watch, so she helped speak up.","Over the years, it had become a habit. As soon as she saw Sis Lian frowning, her first thought was that she was being bullied.","Gu Anran and Gu Wuyang also explained at the side, \"Sis didn't bully anyone!\"","\"That's right. Auntie, how could you be like this? Sis didn't bully anyone at all. This auntie suddenly came over talking to herself, and you just charged over.\"","Zhou Qinglian's brow jumped. \"Auntie? You call her sis and call me auntie?\"","Wuyang nodded. \"Yes, because you look older than sis.\"","Zhou Qinglian felt like she had been shot through the heart.","Clutching her chest, she staggered back a step.","Meow Meow was a little confused. \"Is that how it is?\"","Seeing this, Zhou Qinglian gently shook her head. \"Yes, you misunderstood. Miss Shen didn't bully me...\"","However, her expression was completely unconvincing. It was as if saying she did bully me, but I don't dare say it.","Meow Meow, also known as Zhou Yun'an, glared angrily at Shen Tang. You're still saying you didn't bully her!","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She also clutched her chest and made a grief-stricken expression like Xizi Holding Her Heart. \"Miss Zhou, I'm sorry. I didn't know not agreeing to your request was bullying you...\"","\"You...\" Zhou Yun'an was stunned for a moment, looking left and right, temporarily at a loss for words.","Shen Tang thought it was too funny. She seemed to have found a way to deal with Meow Meow.","Gu Anran hurriedly patted Shen Tang's back. \"Sis, don't be sad...\"","Gu Wuyang frowned. \"You bullied sis! I'm telling uncle!\"","The plot instantly reversed. It was as if Zhou Qinglian was the bully instead.","Zhou Qinglian also didn't expect Shen Tang to be so good at acting, having learned her tricks. She inevitably felt a little stifled.","She forced a smile. \"Yun'an, don't misunderstand. Miss Shen really didn't bully me. It's just that I have something I wanted to privately discuss with her, and Miss Shen was not very convenient...\"","Zhou Yun'an felt a little uncomfortable inside. If she wasn't bullied, then why did sister make that expression?","However, she never liked thinking too much.","\"What is it about?\" Zhou Yun'an asked curiously.","\"I'll say it now then.\"","Shen Tang almost laughed out loud. It seemed Meow Meow wasn't only aimed at her, but at everyone.","Zhou Qinglian's expression almost cracked. She had said a private chat. How could she say it here?","Yun'an, how can you still be so stupid!","\"It's nothing much...\"","\"If it's nothing much, let's go then.\"","Zhou Qinglian was rendered speechless. \"But I...\"","Zhou Yun'an tilted her head. \"Sis Lian, do you have anything else?\"","\"No, no... let's go.\"","And so, a storm dissipated just like that. Shen Tang thought it was too funny.","She stroked the little ones' heads. \"Thanks for just now, you two.\"","\"You're wel—\"","Gu Anran's words were cut off as Gu Wuyang elbowed her. \"So how are you going to thank us?\"","Shen Tang made a \"hm\" sound. \"I'll take you to gain some ranks later, how about that?\"","Gu Wuyang gave her a very reasonable look.","Since returning to the old residence, the two hadn't played games together at all. Gu Anran missed it terribly.","He almost wished they could play now, but the occasion wasn't right.","\"Oh, when will this end...\"","Shen Tang also wanted to ask this question.","Not long after, a few elegantly dressed women walked over with unkind expressions.","One fiery red-lipped woman looked Shen Tang up and down and handed her a wine glass. \"Have a drink?\"","Shen Tang politely smiled. \"I'm sorry, I just took cephalosporin.\"","The few women: \"......\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: Gu Huaian's Rotten Peach Blossom","paragraphs":["Shen Tang's answer was beyond all of their guesses.","If it was any other excuse, they could have pressed her to drink, but since Shen Tang said she took cephalosporins, they really couldn't force her to drink alcohol.","Wouldn't that be like attempting murder?","Besides, they didn't even know if Shen Tang had really taken them.","A few people looked towards the woman with flaming red lips. Shen Tang thought to herself, it seems she's the center of attention.","\"May I ask who you all are...\"","Shen Tang had originally assumed it was only Gu Family people, but it looks to be more than that now.","The woman smiled and said, \"I'm Huaian's good friend. We often get together, but don't overthink it, there's nothing between us.\"","Shen Tang: \"Oh.\"","Hilarious, those words were quite interesting, implying something between them in both overt and covert ways.","The woman pursed her lips. Shen Tang's reaction made her very unhappy. So nonchalant, seems very assured huh.","In fact, Shen Tang just didn't care.","Let alone nothing between them, even if they wanted something, she couldn't control it.","Gu Wuyang had disappeared. Shen Tang looked left and right, then asked Gu Anran: \"Where is Wuyang?\"","Gu Anran blinked her big eyes and shook her head, \"Don't know.\"","Hearing the name, the flaming red lips' eyes lit up. She half squatted down and said, \"Turns out it's Anran! You've grown so big. I even held you when you were little!\"","Gu Anran tilted her head in puzzlement. \"But I was born overseas...\"","Shen Tang nearly laughed out loud. She discovered her ability to hold in her laughter was getting stronger and stronger.","\"Then I must have remembered wrong...\"","Gu Anran tilted her head and pulled at Shen Tang's clothes. \"My mom said that people who try to cozy up like this usually have ill intentions. Big sister, let's go.\"","The flaming red lips nearly couldn't maintain her expression. Shen Tang noticed her take a few deep breaths to forcibly restrain her emotions.","\"Anran, you misunderstood. I'm your uncle's friend. I don't have any other intentions.\"","\"Oh~\" Gu Anran suddenly realized, \"So your target is my uncle...\"","Muffled \"pfft\" sounds of suppressed laughter came from the surroundings. No way of knowing who it was laughing on the sly. Shen Tang really envied them, since she had to force her face to remain motionless.","The flaming red lips' face fluctuated between green and white as she forced down her emotions. \"Since you're busy, I won't disturb you.\"","After speaking, she left with the others, rather hurriedly.","Shen Tang also breathed a sigh of relief.","Gu Huaian really does have a lot of rotten peach blossoms. Didn't expect the Mrs. Gu position to be coveted by so many.","Would there be anyone else? Shen Tang thought to herself. She quickly spat three times to avoid jinxing it.","But the more you fear something, the more it comes.","Another woman walked over. Shen Tang's heart thumped.","The woman had short stylish hair that gave off a heroic air.","She extended her hand, \"Miss Shen, pleased to meet you, I'm Xu Yan.\"","\"Pleased to meet you too.\"","Shen Tang shook her hand but couldn't pull back.","Xu Yan maintained her grip at just the right force - not hard enough to hurt but not loose enough for Shen Tang to pull free.","\"Um...\"","Xu Yan blinked. \"Miss Shen, do you have time recently? I have a variety show that I'd like to invite you on.\"","\"Huh?\"","This was a completely unexpected development for Shen Tang.","\"What variety show? I have a drama to film soon, so I may not have time.\"","She didn't know how to turn down people with good intentions.","\"Our show is quite popular, it's called Cute Baby Forward. It's a parenting variety show, currently third in terms of total online views. We've had top actors and actresses on. If you came on it would definitely boost your career.\"","\"I understand all that you just said. What I don't understand is why you want me? And I don't have any children.\"","Shen Tang felt her popularity was still lacking, especially compared to the A-list guests that had been on recently.","Bluntly put, Shen Tang felt she wasn't worthy.","Xu Yan smiled. \"Don't underestimate yourself, your fame is no less than those actors and actresses. As for a child...\" She looked at Gu Anran. \"There's one right here.\"","As soon as Shen Tang heard this, her earlier hesitation instantly vanished.","She knew what kind of family the Gu Family was. How could they allow their child to be exposed like that?","It wasn't that it was bad to gain fame, but it was dangerous and likely to attract ill-intentioned people.","Also, every little fault would be magnified endlessly once famous, easily incurring internet rage.","Shen Tang didn't want to see that kind of situation.","\"Sorry, I don't plan on participating for the time being.\"","Xu Yan was undeterred and handed Shen Tang and Gu Anran each a business card. \"No need to refuse outright, please consider it.\"","After speaking, she smiled and left.","Gu Anran was a bit puzzled. \"Sis, why didn't you want to do it?\"","Shen Tang patted her head. \"You wouldn't understand.\"","Gu Anran: \"...\"","\"Sis, I would if you explained it...\"","Shen Tang proceeded to clearly explain her misgivings one by one. \"So I don't want to bring you there.\"","Gu Anran nodded. \"I get it now. Sis, wait for me a bit!\" She then scampered off as soon as she finished speaking.","Shen Tang wanted to go after her but Gu Anran ran too fast, instantly disappearing into the crowd.","Shen Tang helplessly shook her head.","On the other side, Gu Wuyang was like a little tail, following Gu Huaian everywhere. Every so often he would nod, as if he truly understood the adults' conversation.","When people dispersed, Gu Huaian asked: \"Why are you following me?\"","Gu Wuyang shook his head. \"No reason.\"","\"Tell the truth.\"","\"I'm helping my big sister keep an eye on you.\"","Gu Huaian raised an eyebrow. \"Keep an eye?\"","Gu Wuyang nodded. \"That's right. Big sister was pestered by several women that like you. I'm here to guard you and not let you get seduced away by a bad woman.\"","Gu Huaian was speechless. \"You're so little. Do you even understand what it means to like someone?\"","\"Of course I do! Just because I'm little doesn't mean stupid!\" Gu Wuyang retorted.","Gu Huaian pondered briefly. \"Sorry for taking you as a fool.\"","Gu Wuyang: \"...\"","Very annoyed."]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Childhood plum is no match for Heaven.","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian was somewhat surprised to ask, \"Is it really your aunt who asked you to come over?\"","How could he feel that Shen Tang didn't seem like the kind of person who would do this.","Moreover, if it was really her order, it would be even better.","Gu Wuyang waved his hand, \"Oh, who cares who ordered it? Anyway, I don't want anyone else to be my aunt.\"","\"You're not calling me sister this time?\"","Gu Wuyang rubbed his nose, \"Isn't the situation different? Anyway, let's talk about each of us, it doesn't matter.\"","After a while, Gu Anran ran over with a clatter, grabbed Gu Wuyang's hand and prepared to leave, \"Brother, let me tell you something...\"","Gu Wuyang didn't intend to leave, pulling Gu Anran back, \"What's the matter? Didn't you see that I'm busy right now.\"","\"It's a big deal!\"","\"What's the big deal?\" Gu Huaian asked.","He glanced at Shen Tang, she was alone, it didn't look like anything was going on.","Gu Anran didn't know if she should say it or not, Gu Huaian urged, \"Hmm?\"","\"It's just that someone wants to invite my sister to participate in the variety show, that 'Cute Baby Charge Forward', it's so good to watch, but my sister is afraid it will bring us bad influence and refused directly...\"","Gu Anran said in a low voice, \"I really want to go...\"","In fact, she didn't particularly want to go, but she heard the woman say that if her sister went, it could take her career to the next level.","She sometimes goes on Weibo and sees many people scolding her sister.","She doesn't want to see her sister like this. She wants to make her sister better. Everyone will definitely like her when they see her sister!","Gu Anran was confident about it.","Gu Huaian didn't make a decision on his own, he had to consult the person involved about this matter.","But he still told the two little ones about the possible consequences of going to participate in the variety show.","\"That's it, do you still want to go?\"","Gu Anran and Gu Wuyang looked at each other, \"Go!\"","\"Uncle, can you persuade my sister? I want to go with her.\"","Gu Anran said with confidence.","Gu Huaian stroked Gu Anran's head, \"I'll try to persuade her, but whether she agrees or not, I'm not sure.\"","Gu Anran rubbed against him happily several times, \"With Uncle taking action, one against two, you must be able to do it!\"","Gu Wuyang also nodded beside him.","Gu Huaian smiled helplessly, \"Don't give me a tall hat, whether this matter can be done or not depends entirely on her. Even if you can't go, you can't blame her.\"","Gu Wuyang frowned, \"Oh, you are so nagging.\"","Gu Anran also dug her ears, \"We will never blame my sister!\"","Shen Tang waited for a while before the two little ones came back. She pretended to be angry, \"Where did you two run off to?\"","The two looked at each other and grinned.","\"Sister, I found some delicious desserts over there, let's go eat them.\"","When Shen Tang heard about delicious food, she instantly forgot the previous question, drooling.","In order to look good in her skirt today, she hadn't eaten much and had been here for so long, she was already hungry.","\"Let's go, where is it?\"","The three of them came to the food court and started eating.","The food was all in small portions with a wide variety, Shen Tang ate them one by one, very satisfied.","\"Ah, this is so delicious!\"","\"This is also delicious, sister, try it.\"","Gu Anran fed Shen Tang a piece of cake.","Shen Tang swallowed it in one bite and said unclearly, \"It's really good!\"","Not far away, someone looked over in disgust, \"Haven't eaten anything delicious in hundreds of lifetimes? Eating like a pig.\"","Gu Yun'an heard it and frowned, \"Who are you talking about! You are the pig!\"","The woman who had just spoken was a little embarrassed. She glanced at Zhou Qinglian, \"Yun'an, aren't you at odds with her?\"","Gu Yun'an snorted coldly, \"What does it matter to you whether I get along with her or not? No matter how she is now, she is still a member of the Gu family. Who are you to say that about her?\"","Zhou Qinglian's eyes darkened, somewhat uncomfortable.","Now Gu Yun'an was like this, wouldn't she defect to Shen Tang's side in the future?","No, she had to do something about it.","Over there, Shen Tang discovered a particularly delicious drink and couldn't help drinking several glasses in a row.","When drinking the sixth cup, the cup was grabbed by a hand stretching over, \"This is wine, don't drink it anymore.\"","Shen Tang smacked her lips, \"Sweet, not wine.\"","\"This is wine, and it has a very strong aftertaste, don't drink it anymore.\"","Shen Tang turned her head and blinked, \"Huh? Gu Huaian? Why do you have two heads?\"","As she spoke, she swayed, \"Why am I a little dizzy? Could it really be wine?\"","Gu Huaian chuckled, \"You're drunk, I'll take you back to rest.\"","\"I'm, I'm not drunk!\"","\"You are drunk.\"","\"I'm not drunk!\"","\"You—\"","Gu Huaian didn't finish speaking when Gu Wuyang mercilessly interrupted him, \"Uncle!\"","Gu Wuyang really couldn't stand to listen anymore. Looking at Gu Huaian was like looking at an immature little kid, \"Can't you just take my sister away? A drunk person, what's the point of reasoning with her?\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"You don't understand.\"","He thought this Shen Tang was very interesting.","Although their conversation just now did sound a little childish.","Gu Wuyang curled his lips, \"Yes, yes, I don't understand, you understand the most.\"","Gu Huaian knocked him on the head, \"No respect.\"","\"I'll take her upstairs, you two don't eat too much either.\"","After saying that, Gu Huaian rolled up his sleeves and carried Shen Tang in his arms directly.","The bulging veins on his forearms looked very sexy, unfortunately Shen Tang didn't see it.","Gu Anran's mouth was full, she nodded when she heard this.","It wasn't that they were gluttonous, it was just that since they came to the old house, they had been under too much control in all aspects.","Sweets like this, they could only eat a little bit each time, on the grounds that eating too much would rot their teeth, and teeth were a person's image.","Gu Anran was already drooling.","Gu Wuyang picked up a few more, \"Little sister, eat slowly.\"","\"Okay! Brother, you eat too!\"","Not far away, Zhou Qinglian looked at Gu Huaian carrying Shen Tang away with resentment, almost biting her silver teeth.","Gu Yun'an even thought she was seeing things wrong and rubbed her eyes, \"Sister Qinglian...\"","Zhou Qinglian quickly adjusted her expression, \"I'm sorry, I lost my composure. I just...\"","As she spoke, she was choked with sobs.","Gu Yun'an immediately threw the scene from just now to the back of her mind and hurried forward to comfort her, \"Sister Qinglian, don't be sad...\"","However, she couldn't say the next words.","Previously, she had a very bad attitude towards Shen Tang because she felt that Shen Tang had taken Sister Qinglian's place.","Now seeing Big Brother's attitude towards Shen Tang, she could be sure, sure that Big Brother cared a lot about Shen Tang, or that he liked Shen Tang very much.","Gu Yun'an could no longer do what she did before.","Zhou Qinglian was waiting for the following, when she saw Gu Yun'an suddenly freeze up.","The two looked at each other, both stunned for a moment.","The tears were still hanging on Zhou Qinglian's face, looking a bit funny.","\"Sister Qinglian, I think...\"","Gu Yun'an's halting manner gave Zhou Qinglian a bad premonition.","She lowered her eyes in disappointment and said sadly, \"You don't have to say any more, I understand. In the end, a childhood sweetheart can't compare to a fairy descending from heaven. I'll just treat these decades of feelings as an illusion...\"","As soon as her voice fell, a tear slid down her cheek.","Gu Yun'an felt extremely distressed.","\"Sister Qinglian, I, I will help you!\"","Zhou Qinglian secretly hooked the corners of her lips. She really hadn't made any progress over the years, still so easy to fool."]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Ha ha ha Ha","paragraphs":["“Hot...”","Shen Tang tugged at her collar, but couldn’t get it off no matter what.","She opened her eyes hazily, “Mmm, help me take off my clothes...”","Gu Huaian's movements paused for a moment as he was helping to pour water, and said in a low voice, “Bear with it for a bit, I’ll go call someone.”","Shen Tang couldn’t wait any longer. She pouted disappointedly, “The clothes are too tight...”","Gu Huaian’s gaze lowered, landing on the peaks, and quickly looked away, finally settling on Shen Tang’s slightly protruding belly.","The cheongsam was a fitted style, very figure-flattering, so Shen Tang’s belly was very noticeable.","Gu Huaian was a little helpless. How much did she eat?","“Let me loosen it for you.”","However, after fumbling around for a bit, he couldn't find where the zipper was.","He was sweating bullets, and Shen Tang was also anxiously waiting.","“Hurry up...” she urged.","“I can't find where it is.”","“Oh, it's right down there...” Shen Tang desperately wanted to do it herself, but the dress's zipper was hidden. It was normal that he couldn't find it.","However, her whole body felt weak and powerless, her waist was still uncomfortably constricted, and she felt a bit nauseous.","Outside the door, Old Madam Gu, who had come to check on Shen Tang, had an awkward expression on her face as she retracted her hand that was about to knock on the door.","She looked at Gu Qingan beside her, “Let’s go, it doesn’t seem to be a good time for us to come.”","Gu Qingan tutted twice. He didn't expect his younger brother to be so stupid. He really wanted to spread this story and have everyone join in mocking him.","“Young people are so impatient these days...”","They can’t even wait until they get home. Such youthful vigor!","The two went downstairs. Old Master Gu snorted coldly, “I knew this would happen.”","Old Madam Gu glared at him, “If you have nothing nice to say, keep quiet.”","Old Master Gu moved his lips, but didn’t talk back. Instead, he glared at Gu Qingan, “What are you laughing at? Anran even threw up, and you as her mother didn’t stop her!”","Gu Qingan didn't expect to become collateral damage.","But wait, Anran threw up?","\"Mom, let me go take a look.\"","\"I'm going with you. Seeing your dad just irritates me.\"","Old Master Gu: \"...\"","Life was truly unbearable.","He surreptitiously looked left and right. Seeing no one was looking, he finally let out a sigh of relief.","How they acted in private was one thing, but he absolutely could not lose face in public.","Upstairs in the room, Gu Huaian finally helped Shen Tang unzip her dress. A glimpse of white flashed before his eyes and he quickly averted his gaze.","“Is this okay?”","As soon as the words left his mouth, he realized his throat felt a little dry.","He grabbed the glass of water next to him and took a big gulp, then remembered this was the water Shen Tang had just drank from.","His ears turned even redder, and his face was also flushed.","Gu Huaian felt a bit nervous and clumsy, emotions he hadn’t experienced in years.","He turned his back to Shen Tang. Rustling sounds came from behind him.","Glancing back, he saw Shen Tang had taken off her cheongsam, left only in a set of cute lace lingerie.","Gu Huaian’s eyes shook. He abruptly stood up and turned around, throwing the blanket over Shen Tang with one hand behind his back.","\"Hot...\" Shen Tang struggled.","\"Don't move! I'll turn the air conditioning down.\"","Gu Huaian picked up the remote control and directly set the temperature to 16 degrees Celsius.","Soon, the cold air hit them. Shen Tang finally stopped fidgeting.","Gu Huaian was originally soaked in sweat, but the blast of cold air made him shiver.","He pulled his sleeves down and put his jacket back on, once again taking on the appearance of the aloof, abstinent Gu Huaian.","That is, ignoring his wandering gaze and flushed earlobes.","In the middle of the night, Shen Tang woke up needing to pee badly. Reaching out to turn on the light, she discovered her body felt cool and breezy.","She instantly sobered up and threw off the covers to take a look. She was only wearing her underwear.","What was going on here?","“Awake?”","Hearing the voice, Shen Tang looked over to see Gu Huaian sitting on the sofa.","He had a laptop in front of him, the screen’s light illuminating his face, making his expression unclear.","Shen Tang felt a little guilty, although she didn't know why she felt guilty.","“Um... how did I get here?”","What she really wanted to ask was who helped take off her clothes, but she didn’t dare to ask outright.","“You forgot?”","Shen Tang felt Gu Huaian's tone was a little strange.","Her radar instantly went off. Shen Tang rubbed her head, “I’m still a little dizzy...”","“Drink this sobering soup first.”","Seeing Shen Tang unmoving, Gu Huaian then remembered she wasn't wearing much inside, and threw over a brand new set of pajamas before turning his back.","Shen Tang knew Gu Huaian wouldn’t peep, but the process of changing still felt a bit awkward. She couldn’t help glancing over occasionally.","There’s a saying that goes, appreciate a beauty under lamplight, observe a gentleman under moonlight.","At this hazy moment under the lamp and moonlight, Gu Huaian’s silhouette was particularly attractive.","However, Shen Tang didn’t have time to look more. She couldn’t hold it in any longer!","Hastily putting on the pajamas, she rushed to the bathroom.","The pitter patter of water rang out. Shen Tang felt much more comfortable.","After washing her face and removing her makeup, she was fully awake.","But she also felt too embarrassed to come out now.","Because Shen Tang had remembered everything that happened before.","It was so awkward, really super awkward.","She had asked him to help take off her clothes, it was like she was deliberately trying to seduce him.","Heaven knows, she really didn't have that intention. Gu Huaian wouldn't misunderstand, right...","Last time it was Gu Huaian who got drunk and embarrassed himself. She didn't expect it to be her turn so soon. How quickly the wheel of karma turns!","Shen Tang was lost in thought the whole time, dawdling and not coming out.","The bathroom door was suddenly knocked on.","\"What's wrong?\" she called out.","\"I have something to tell you.\"","After Shen Tang came out, she didn't even lift her head and burrowed back under the covers, mumbling, \"What is it? I'm sleepy.\"","\"Since you're sleepy, I’ll tell you next time. It's not urgent anyway.\"","Hearing Gu Huaian say this, Shen Tang instead became curious.","She poked her head out from the blankets, \"I'm not sleepy anymore. What is it?\"","Gu Huaian's lips curled up slightly. \"It's nothing much, you sleep first and I'll tell you tomorrow.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She sat up in bed. \"Tell me, tell me. Leaving me hanging like this, I won't be able to sleep.\"","The sudden coquettishness startled Gu Huaian. He responded half a beat slower, \"It's just...Gu Jinan, he...\"","\"What happened to him?\" Shen Tang eagerly asked, eyes shining with gossip.","Gu Huaian's mood was a bit complicated. He had deliberately spoken vaguely to pique her interest, but now seeing how concerned Shen Tang was about Gu Jinan's matters, he felt a little uncomfortable.","He said lightly, \"He walked into the wrong room drunk...a one night stand warning.\"","\"Yes. Well, no.\"","Shen Tang sat cross-legged on the bed. She felt like she was missing a bag of melon seeds to munch on.","\"So what exactly happened?\" She was truly anxious to know. Gu Huaian's way of speaking was too taxing. She didn't know how his assistant Chen put up with it.","Upon hearing her thoughts, Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He blurted out in one breath: \"Gu Jinan walked into the wrong room drunk. There was a girl already lying in the bed. He got into bed to sleep and the girl kicked him out of bed, beating him up and accusing him of being a pervert.","Gu Huaian paused, then continued, \"He suffered three injuries and went to the hospital.\"","\"Hahahahaha!\"","Shen Tang didn't expect the incident to be so hilarious. How were Gu Jinan's parts now?","Hahahahaha!"]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Can You Cook","paragraphs":["Shen Tang was laughing so hard that her jaw dislocated. As the saying goes, excessive joy begets sorrow.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Luckily, the family doctor lived downstairs and Gu Huaian quickly invited him over.","This was not difficult to treat. With a click, her jaw was back in place. However, the look in the doctor's eyes towards the two was rather meaningful.","Shen Tang really did not want to understand the implication. She blamed her extensive knowledge.","Gu Huaian was also somewhat uncomfortable. \"Don't get the wrong idea, it's not what you think...\"","The doctor nodded understandingly. \"I see. Don't worry, I won't say anything.\"","Shen Tang and Gu Huaian: \"...\"","It had to be said, this was really easy to misunderstand, especially since it was the middle of the night.","After seeing the doctor out, the two seemed even more embarrassed.","Shen Tang lay back down, intending to sleep.","Despite being very awake, she was not tired at all.","Gu Huaian often stayed up late working. At that moment, he still had some unfinished work.","\"You sleep, I'll finish up some work.\"","Shen Tang peeked out from under the covers, secretly looking at Gu Huaian. It's often said that a man diligently working is most charming. This scene was quite pleasing to the eyes.","Why didn't he have any dark circles? He was simply inhuman!","Ahhhhh, he put on his glasses. A gentleman villain, a beast in sheep's clothing!","Gu Huaian's actions paused as he looked towards Shen Tang. \"If you're not sleepy, come help me.\"","Shen Tang pulled the covers over her head. \"Who said I'm not sleepy.\"","Gu Huaian sighed. \"Then sleep quickly and stop thinking random thoughts.\"","He couldn't concentrate on his work.","Shen Tang mumbled softly. How did he know what she was thinking?","The next day, Shen Tang was woken up by knocking on her door.","Still groggy from sleep, she realized it was already past 10 am.","She bolted up in panic. Oh no! It was so late after staying over at someone else's home. What would they think of her!","After hurriedly washing up and going downstairs, she unexpectedly saw a whole family sitting on the sofa.","Including Old Master Gu, Old Madam Gu, Gu Huaian, Gu Qingan, Gu Anran, and Gu Wuyang.","They were all core members of the Gu family.","Shen Tang's steps faltered. She squeezed out an embarrassed yet polite smile. \"Morning.\"","Old Master Gu harrumphed. \"It's almost lunch time. What morning!\"","Old Madam Gu glared at him. \"If you've got nothing nice to say, keep your mouth shut!\"","Then she beckoned to Shen Tang affectionately, \"Come down quick. You must be hungry. Have a little something first. Lunch will be ready soon.\"","\"Thanks, Mom. I'm not very hungry.\" Shen Tang sat down awkwardly and looked at Gu Huaian in surprise. She really wanted to ask why he wasn't at work.","It was as if Gu Huaian could read her mind and explained, \"I took the day off today.\"","Gu Huaian thought to himself: I'm not a tapeworm, I can hear your thoughts.","This ability was truly bizarre. He didn't know how it came about or when it would disappear.","Although it was somewhat impolite, it also eliminated his misunderstanding about Shen Tang. At least he knew she was not her past self.","If there were no thoughts, sooner or later he would have realized she had changed. But it might have wasted more time.","\"Sis, you woke up so late!\" Gu Anran wrinkled her nose. She had been waiting all morning.","Noticing the subtle expressions on Old Madam Gu and Gu Qingan's faces, Shen Tang smiled awkwardly.","\"Sorry, I overslept.\"","\"Have you decided if you'll participate in Cute Baby Charge?\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Tang was confused.","Gu Anran looked at Gu Huaian angrily. \"Uncle, you lied!\"","Gu Huaian rubbed his nose. Could he say he forgot?","\"Sorry, Uncle forgot. Ask your aunt yourself now.\"","Gu Anran went over and started shaking Shen Tang's clothes. \"Sis, sis, sis, sis...\"","The only thing on Shen Tang's mind were the words \"sis sis\".","\"Stop shouting, you need to ask your mom if she agrees...\"","Shen Tang passed the question back to Gu Qingan.","After all, it was her child.","She thought Gu Qingan would refuse. Unexpectedly, she nodded indifferently, \"Sure, go play.\"","Shen Tang was stunned.","Gu Qingan explained with a smile, \"What you're worried about, they've told me. I don't think it'll be an issue. Since they've made the decision, they have to bear the consequences. Even if it does reach that point, consider it a trial. Of course, the Gu family doesn't eat grass.\"","Gu Qingan was indeed a powerful woman, she had great breadth of mind.","\"If none of you have any objections, then I'll agree.\"","\"Agree, agree, agree...\" The little recorder started up again.","Shen Tang was getting a headache from the noise.","Although Gu Wuyang didn't say anything, the delight in her eyes couldn't be concealed. She was obviously very happy too.","Shen Tang remembered watching children's shows when she was little in her past life. She seemed to have envied those kids too. She understood instantly.","She looked at Gu Wuyang affectionately. She would help fulfill this child's wish then.","\"Alright, alright, go on.\"","Gu Anran jumped excitedly. \"Woohoo!\"","She would perform well on the show and let everyone understand her real sister!","Everyone would surely like her!","After that, it quieted down again. Other than the two little ones, none of the adults spoke.","Shen Tang didn't know how the others felt, but she certainly felt awkward.","Very, extremely awkward in fact.","She sat between Old Madam Gu and Gu Huaian, nervously clenching and releasing her fists repeatedly.","【I'm gonna die, gonna die, gonna die】","【Should I say something?】","【Is this aristocratic family life? As expected, it's dangerous like deep waters and scorching fires.】","【No wait, do the Gu family usually talk so little? Isn't this too quiet...】","Gu Huaian glanced at her. \"Hungry?\"","\"Huh?\"","\"I'll take you to eat.\"","\"Um, I'm not very hungry...\"","She was a little hungry since she drank a lot last night and had digested it all by now.","But lunch was currently being prepared in the kitchen. It didn't seem right for her to eat.","\"Let's go.\"","Gu Huaian stood up. Seeing Shen Tang unmoving, he reached out to pull her along directly.","Shen Tang had an embarrassed expression but Old Madam Gu smiled kindly. \"Go on.\"","Gu Anran ran over. \"I wanna go too!\"","Gu Qingan grabbed her. \"You're not going.\"","\"I'm hungry!\"","\"You're not.\"","Gu Anran wanted to say more but Gu Wuyang pulled her aside and whispered to her for a bit. Then she understood and nodded.","\"Sis, you go. I'm not hungry anymore.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She strangely felt like they were discussing her.","Gu Huaian brought her to the kitchen. Shen Tang discovered the kitchen in the old mansion was truly enormous, practically the size of an average person's entire home.","Of course, not that many people were cooking inside, only a few.","They didn't react at all to their entry and remained completely focused on preparing the ingredients.","The ingredients here were all extremely fresh and top-grade. They had to be carefully handled to not affect the taste.","Thinking of the casual meals she used to make, Shen Tang instantly felt her cooking didn't deserve to be called food.","\"What do you want to eat?\"","Gu Huaian's action of rolling up his sleeves made Shen Tang gape.","She asked in astonishment, \"You can cook?\""]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Shall we Go to the Movies","paragraphs":["Gu Huaian tilted his head, \"What, don't I look like it?\"","Shen Tang shook her head, \"You really don't look like it. I thought you were someone who would never touch the opposite sex inappropriately.\"","【After all, he is supposed to be an overbearing president. He should not work diligently at all times and be unable to distinguish between the five grains. Instead, he should occasionally have red eyes, pinch waists, howl, and do other cool things.】","Gu Huaian sighed. He really didn't know where Shen Tang got all these strange ideas from.","\"The Gu family rules dictate that girls should be raised in luxury while boys should be raised in poverty. Since high school, I have been studying abroad, and my family has given me the same amount of money as an average student, which is barely enough to get by. To be honest, I even had a part-time job at a Chinese restaurant back then, and that's where I learnt how to cook.\"","\"Ha?\" Shen Tang was very shocked. She had thought that an rich second generation like Gu Huaian must have lived an extravagant life since he was young.","\"Don't get your hopes up, I'm not necessarily a good cook.\"","Shen Tang quickly shook her head, \"No no, it must be more delicious than my cooking.\"","Since lunch would be in two hours, Gu Huaian was just letting Shen Tang fill her stomach. He didn't plan on making anything too complicated.","Using chicken broth as the base, he cooked a bowl of fresh shrimp and vegetable noodles. Considering that Shen Tang had to maintain her figure, there were only a few strands of noodles, and the rest of the bowl was filled with greens and shrimp.","Garnished with green onions and cilantro, Shen Tang was practically drooling when the piping hot bowl was placed in front of her.","\"It smells so good...\"","【I didn't expect Gu Huaian to be such a good cook. Is there anything he can't do? How are ordinary people supposed to live? 】","【Oh right, I heard that the technology for males to give birth is almost fully researched in foreign countries?】","Gu Huaian couldn't bear to listen any further, and pushed the bowl and chopsticks towards her. \"Eat up.\"","After taking a mouthful of noodles, Shen Tang was instantly amazed.","\"It's sho good!\"","To be honest, it was more delicious than her own cooking.","As expected, an exceptional person excels in every aspect.","Having finished all the food and soup, her empty stomach from the morning was finally satisfied. Shen Tang let out a comfortable sigh.","\"That hit the spot.\"","\"What are your plans next?\"","Shen Tang blinked. \"Waiting for lunch?\"","Gu Huaian chuckled softly. \"Other than eating.\"","Shen Tang thought for a while. \"Nothing much. I'll be starting filming in a couple days, so I plan to focus on acting. Oh right, there's also that parenting variety show I have to go discuss the contract for.\"","Gu Huaian nodded. \"What about this afternoon? Any plans?\"","\"Nothing in the afternoon.\"","\"How about going to watch a movie then?\" Gu Huaian coughed lightly into his fist. \"My friend gave them to me. It'd be a waste not to use them.\"","\"What movie is it?\" Shen Tang didn't think too deeply about it.","She was more inclined to believe that Gu Huaian was reluctant to waste the tickets rather than him deliberately asking her out to the movies. He probably had deeper motives, like wanting to check out how the movie turned out.","Gu Huaian, who could hear her inner thoughts: \"...\"","Why couldn't he simply want to watch a movie with her?","\"You'll know when we get there this afternoon. Oh right, what kind of movies do you usually like to watch?\"","\"I'm pretty easygoing. I like watching all genres except for arthouse films.\"","It wasn't that she didn't like arthouse films. She just couldn't understand them. She didn't have the insight or deeper thoughts to comprehend what the directors were trying to convey. She preferred exciting blockbusters that sent adrenaline levels surging.","Gu Huaian tensed his palms slightly after hearing her inner thoughts.","\"Ahem. I need to go to the restroom for a bit.\"","Once inside the restroom, Gu Huaian quickly texted his assistant Qian to rebook two movie tickets.","Luckily he had asked. Showing her the wrong movie would have the opposite effect.","A while later, Gu Huaian walked out with the corners of his lips slightly upturned.","Shen Tang was puzzled. \"That happy just from using the restroom?\"","\"Yup.\"","Shen Tang: \"Hmmmmm...\"","She didn't expect Gu Huaian to be so happy just from using the toilet. But to each their own, she should respect and understand his preferences.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He wasn't, he didn't have any weird preferences.","But in this situation, it seemed he couldn't voluntarily explain himself just yet...","He fabricated: \"I just received some good news earlier and got happy over it.\"","Shen Tang realized she had misunderstood. Thankfully she didn't voice her assumptions out loud.","\"I see... you didn't need to explain yourself to me...\"","Gu Huaian didn't say anything more.","After lunch at the old residence, Gu Qingan called Shen Tang over.","Shen Tang grew nervous.","While she was used to interacting with Anran, she rarely talked to this elder sister.","From her brief interaction last time, she seemed like a nice person.","But Shen Tang still couldn't figure out why she was looking for her.","Countless thoughts flashed through her mind just walking those few steps over.","Only after confirming no one else could overhear them did Gu Qingan speak. \"Sorry, did I scare you?\"","\"Ah no, not at all~!\" While Shen Tang was very nervous, she wasn't scared.","\"I asked you here because I have a favor to request your help with.\"","\"What is it?\" Shen Tang couldn't think of anything she could do to help her. After all, it seemed she didn't have much ability to offer.","\"It's like this. You know just how hard Huaian works. If this keeps up, his body won't be able to take it. I want you to advise him not to work so hard.\"","\"I probably can't do that...\"","\"You can! Huaian will listen to you.\"","Shen Tang didn't understand why Gu Qingan sounded so certain. She scratched her head. \"I'll try my best then.\"","\"Oh right, this is for you.\"","What Gu Qingan handed to her was an invitation card to an auction house.","There was a QR code printed on it that showed the items up for auction after scanning.","Shen Tang asked in bewilderment, \"Why are you giving this to me?\"","She didn't have money! Her savings were for her retirement fund, she couldn't touch that!","Also, with what little savings she had, she probably couldn't afford anything there since even the cheapest items were in the seven digits.","\"I think you can just go take a look. The invitation allows you to bring a friend along too. You can invite someone to go have fun with you.\"","\"Thank you, sister.\" Since it came from the kindness of her heart, there was no harm in going to take a look.","Shen Tang felt she was too uncultured. It would be good to broaden her horizons. She just wasn't sure who to invite along.","Wait. Come to think of it, all her good friends came from wealthy families...","Shen Tang's face fell as she realized that out of everyone, she was the only poor one.","Seeing Shen Tang's ever-changing expression, Gu Qingan found her very amusing. Young people were so lively and vibrant!","Unable to resist, she pinched Shen Tang's cheeks. \"Alright, I'm leaving Huaian in your hands. I've got other things to do.\"","Just don't let me down after all the effort I've put into this!","Shen Tang nodded with flushed cheeks. \"Okay, bye sister~\"","When hanging out with friends, she was always the one doing the face-pinching rather than the other way around. Getting her face pinched for once felt pretty nice actually!"]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Who Claims Who Proves","paragraphs":["Shen Tang was seeing a movie with a male for the first time.","She didn't expect the tickets Gu Huaian's friend had given them to be for a horror film.","After the two entered the theater, they discovered there were hardly any people inside, only a dozen or so couples.","Their seats were in a prime central location.","Shen Tang settled into her seat with popcorn and Coke in hand, and glanced over at Gu Huaian beside her.","[Oh my god, I'm not going to get scared later am I!]","Hearing her thoughts, stone-faced Gu Huaian clenched his fists tightly. He would definitely keep an eye on Shen Tang, and leave early if it got too frightening.","The movie soon started, and Shen Tang watched with gusto as she snacked.","Gu Huaian beside her was looking rather pale.","Shen Tang reached over and grasped his hand, leaning in to softly ask: \"Are you scared?\"","Scared? How could a man admit to being scared? Let alone with Shen Tang next to him.","Gu Huaian shook his head. \"Not one bit.\"","\"Oh,\" Shen Tang responded. \"But you look so pale.\"","\"I was born this way.\"","Shen Tang sighed and shook her head. Keep pretending then.","The most stubborn part of his entire body was his mouth. Even the sky could collapse and his mouth would be there to prop it up.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","He wanted to say...nevermind, it sounded dirty, best leave it unsaid.","Men really did share many similarities, being stubborn for instance.","Shen Tang withdrew her hand, but he gripped it tightly.","Oh well, hand holding it was then. It wasn't costing her anything.","Gu Huaian didn't pay attention to the movie plot at all, completely focused on the feeling of her soft hand in his own. He couldn't help but grow nervous:","Was he holding too tightly? Were his palms getting sweaty...?","Who would have thought he'd have such worries one day.","Gu Huaian pressed his lips together and sneakily glanced at the other couples in the theatre. Most had the girl looking fearful and the guy comforting her, and one couple was even boldly making out.","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","This was a public place, the security cameras could see everything clearly, yet they didn't care at all?","Noticing Gu Huaian's gaze, Shen Tang gave a knowing look. She pulled his head down onto her shoulder and put her arm around him.","\"Don't be scared, it's all fake.\"","Gu Huaian: \"......\"","After hesitating a moment, he maintained this position.","Though somewhat embarrassing, this was considered intimate contact, especially since Shen Tang had initiated it.","When the movie finished and Gu Huaian stood up, he suddenly realized his neck was sore.","He casually massaged his neck and asked: \"Was the movie good?\"","\"It was great! So thrilling, when can we come watch again?\"","Gu Huaian laughed softly. \"Anytime you want.\"","Shen Tang's ears abruptly turned red.","Damn him and that alluring smile.","Shen Tang shamelessly thought to herself.","\"Shall we go for a stroll?\" Gu Huaian checked his watch, it was still early.","\"Sure.\"","It'd be nice to walk around after sitting for so long.","Along the way, Gu Huaian spotted an acquaintance and told Shen Tang: \"Wait here, I'm going to say hi.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Tang sat down on a bench and looked around while she waited.","She suddenly noticed a store with some pretty nice looking clothes and went inside to browse.","Just as she was about to touch one, a voice sounded from behind her: \"What are you touching? What if you damage it?\"","Shen Tang paused briefly before continuing to reach out, but was forcefully yanked back, the clothes were tugged as well.","The shop attendant hurried over, wanting to see what had transpired.","\"What are you doing?\" Shen Tang's brows furrowed.","She took a look at the person who had pulled her. A plump figure covered in gems and gold jewelry.","The face was unfamiliar, Shen Tang was certain she didn't recognize her.","\"Why did you grab me?\"","Shen Tang glanced down at the clothes in her hand, the threads had come loose.","She held them out. \"You should pay for this, you pulled it.\"","The woman was unhappy. She pointed at Shen Tang saying: \"It was clearly you who pulled it. Trying to put the blame on me? If you can't afford it then don't come poking around.\"","Shen Tang had the sudden urge to throw the clothes at the woman's head.","Noticing the looks floating their way, she suppressed her anger and explained: \"Would it have torn if you didn't yank me? \"","It wasn't that she couldn't afford to compensate, but it wasn't her fault, why should she have to foot the bill?","The woman raised her brow and loudly declared: \"I only gave you a tiny tug, though it's no wonder with how you look like the mistress my husband keeps outside......you little homewrecker!\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Tang clearly sensed the shift in how the onlookers were gazing at her.","If earlier they were merely curious for some drama, now their expressions held contempt, condemnation and disgust.","She could tolerate no more, there was no need.","Shen Tang coldly laughed. \"Spouting nonsense? Did your mother not teach you not to randomly spread rumors? Do you know spreading falsehoods is against the law?\"","The woman shrank back a little, but seeing the crowd around her spoke up again stubbornly: \"Whether or not you're a mistress, you know clearly in your heart. If you aren't, then prove it!\"","Shen Tang crossed her arms over her chest. \"Hilarious. The burden of proof lies with the one who alleges. Do you understand? You're alleging I'm a mistress. I might as well allege you're a mistress, and a spare on the side too.\"","\"I was trying to give you some face, but since you refuse to back down, you want proof right? Take a look then.\"","The woman took out her phone and opened to a picture.","It was a bed photo containing a woman who resembled her and a man lying together.","Shen Tang was shocked, eyes bulging wide.","The two bore an astonishing seven parts likeness! They could pass as biological sisters.","\"Holy crap! The resemblance!\"","\"See the similarity!\"","After speaking both felt something was off.","The woman was stunned a moment. \"Why are you pretending? This is obviously you right?\"","Shen Tang frowned. \"We do really look alike, but this clearly isn't me. Ask the people around if you don't believe me.\"","Shen Tang didn't know if she had a sister, but this woman definitely wasn't her. The cosmetic surgery traces were still distinct.","The woman first showed the photo to the shop attendant. The attendant smiled and shook her head, \"There is a strong resemblance, but it's not the same person. The one in the picture has a pointier chin, it looks like she got some work done.\"","It had to be said, shop attendants really did have a discerning eye.","Shen Tang gave her a thumbs up.","\"That's right, her nose is smaller than mine too.\"","Shen Tang suspected the woman in the picture also had a nose job.","She'd read before that those surgeries were terribly painful, this girl sure had endurance.","Still unconvinced, the woman passed her phone around to some passersby.","Most said it wasn't the same person, though a few felt it could be an issue of angles and makeup.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","\"Wait seriously, shouldn't you all go get your eyes examined?\" Shen Tang earnestly suggested.","\"My eyes are perfectly fine!\"","\"Hold on, isn't she that actress? Called something or other Tang?\"","\"Now that you mention it...seems like she is...\"","Shen Tang desperately wanted to cover her face and flee, that would only affirm she actually was Shen Tang though.","She deliberately touched her own face, asking in delight: \"Really? People have told me before I resemble a famous actress!\"","Hearing her say this, the crowd then felt she wasn't the celebrity after all.","\"I must have seen incorrectly...\"","Shen Tang disagreed. \"No no, you didn't see wrong ma'am. I do look a lot like Shen Tang. We're equally good looking.\"","Passerby: \"Eh yo~!\""]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Sex Girl, Love Girl","paragraphs":["In the time it took to speak, the plump woman who had previously claimed Shen Tang was the mistress thought she could slip away unnoticed in the chaos, but she was alerted by a passerby who wanted to watch the drama unfold or perhaps had good intentions.","\"Famous star, she's getting away!\"","Shen Tang turned her head just in time to see the woman sneaking off furtively.","\"Where are you going? Feeling guilty?\"","The woman acted tough, \"What do I have to feel guilty about? Hehe, whoever did something wrong knows it in their heart.\"","Shen Tang nodded, \"You're right, then you should be clear about the consequences of spreading rumors, no?\"","As she spoke, she took out her phone and started tapping on it.","The woman nervously asked, \"What are you doing?\"","\"Calling the police. I can't bear this mistress reputation.\"","The woman gulped, \"Is calling the police necessary?\"","By this point, most onlookers had figured out what was going on.","Some supported Shen Tang calling the police, while others thought she was making a mountain out of a molehill.","But Shen Tang didn't care what others thought. She was going to use legal means to uphold her rights.","Just then, Gu Huaian came back surrounded by a group of people.","\"What's going on?\" Gu Huaian coldly glanced around. \"Someone bullied you?\"","The color drained from the woman's face. She would recognize that face even if it turned to ash.","What was his relationship to this woman?","The woman now deeply regretted recklessly defaming someone without getting the facts straight. She was stuck in a dilemma.","She looked pleadingly at Shen Tang, appearing extremely pathetic.","\"I...\"","Shen Tang waved her hand, \"It's nothing, just a misunderstanding.\"","The woman was pathetically grateful, \"Yes yes, just a misunderstanding...\"","She called the salesperson over, \"Get this young lady's purchases today on my tab...uh, I have to go, bye now...\"","\"No need to go overboard, just paying for this skirt is fine.\"","\"Yes yes, I'll pay right away.\"","The woman paid and hurried off.","This time, Shen Tang didn't try to stop her.","However, she had no intention of taking the woman's money.","It wasn't like she couldn't afford it herself.","Alright, she could afford it, but after buying it she'd be broke.","The onlookers hadn't left yet. Most were sneakily peering over, seemingly wanting to figure out her relationship with Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang looked puzzledly at the group of people trailing behind Gu Huaian. \"They are...\"","\"It's nothing.\" Gu Huaian told those people, \"You guys can go first.\"","The people looked at each other, and the leader respectfully said, \"Then we won't disturb you...\"","Gu Huaian swept his gaze around again. The surrounding people quickly avoided his eyes.","At this point, Shen Tang had lost her enthusiasm for shopping anyway.","Plus, she seemed to have noticed someone secretly taking photos. She didn't know if they would end up online or if she might be recognized.","\"A friend of mine opened a shop nearby with great privacy. Want to go try it? The taste is pretty good.\"","Shen Tang nodded, \"Sounds good, let's go. Is it far?\"","\"Not far, let's go.\"","Gu Huaian proactively blocked the prying eyes of those around them.","It really wasn't far, just down an alley next to the mall.","It was a small villa. From the outside, it looked nothing like a restaurant and more like a private residence.","You could see a Chinese-style interior through the fence, with flowing jugs and winding waters, exotic flowers and plants, carved railings and painted buildings. It was a visual feast.","Gu Huaian entered a password skillfully and they walked right in. A beauty in a cheongsam walked out in high heels. \"Oh, a rare guest...\"","Shen Tang was stunned by the woman before her eyes.","She was truly gorgeous, with delicate features, a seductive figure, innate charm, seemingly exuding a bewitching aura from her bones.","The woman walked not far from Shen Tang and lazily leaned against a table, twirling a strand of hair around her finger.","Just a casual glance from her felt profoundly affectionate.","\"First time here, little sister? Any dietary restrictions?\"","A hint of fragrance drifted over. Shen Tang felt a little dizzy.","[Such a nice scent...]","\"No...no restrictions...\"","Shen Tang couldn't resist as a woman either. Her face suddenly flushed red.","She secretly stole a few more glances. *sigh* How could someone be so good looking?","\"Hehe, go ahead and look all you want, don't be shy.\"","Shen Tang's face grew even redder, she even felt a little hot.","[Sister is so beautiful...]","[I want to snuggle with sister so much...]","Gu Huaian's brows furrowed. He pulled Shen Tang behind him in one motion. \"What are you doing getting so close? Just say what you need to say.\"","The woman chuckled lightly. \"Oh? What are you afraid of? We can't even talk now?\"","Shen Tang peeked out from behind Gu Huaian and shyly asked, \"Sister, what's your name? I'm Shen Tang.\"","\"You can call me Sister Lan.\"","\"Sister Lan! You're so gorgeous!\"","The woman glanced smugly at Gu Huaian. \"Thanks for the compliment. You're very cute too. Have a seat, I'll go make you something to eat.\"","\"Thank you, Sister Lan!\"","After the woman left, Shen Tang couldn't hold back anymore and excitedly stomped her feet, whispering loudly, \"Ahhh, did you hear that? Sister Lan called me cute!\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He didn't really understand. \"Is it that big of a deal?\"","\"Of course it's a big deal! Getting complimented by a girl, it's totally cheating!\"","Thinking of that woman's character, Gu Huaian suddenly regretted coming here. He had the feeling he personally led his lamb to the big bad wolf.","Oh right, forgot to mention, although the woman is biologically female, she likes other females.","This was also one of the reasons Gu Huaian was able to maintain a long friendship with her.","After all, back then he had no interest in women, while she had no interest in men.","After waiting a while, Sister Lan came out carrying a tray. She placed the items in front of Shen Tang one by one.","\"These are my homemade candied fruits and pastries. Try them first to see if you like them.\"","Shen Tang looked at the pretty desserts, reluctant to ruin them.","\"So beautiful...\"","\"Go on, try them. See if you like the taste.\"","Shen Tang's eyes lit up. She finally picked a peach blossom-shaped pastry. It was soft and sticky, mildly sweet, with a hint of peach aroma.","\"So yummy! Sister Lan, your skills are just too good!\"","Sister Lan smiled. \"If you like it, have more. I'll pack some for you later too.\"","\"That's...probably not appropriate...\"","It didn't seem right to eat it now and take it to go.","\"It's no problem. Someone's paying anyway.\"","Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian and blinked, as if asking: Is it okay?","Gu Huaian pinched the bridge of his nose. \"It's fine, take as much as you want.\"","Sister Lan waved a finger. \"Not too much, but if little sister likes it, I can give them all to you.\"","Shen Tang blushed and nodded.","Ever since coming here, the heat hadn't left her cheeks.","Girls really were the most wonderful creatures in the world!"]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Painful Experience","paragraphs":["Lan Sister was not only beautiful, but also a good cook. Shen Tang felt extremely regretful that she didn't have four stomachs like cows, otherwise she could have eaten up all the delicious food.","Gu Huaian said: No need to feel so regretful!","\"If you like to eat, I can bring you here again next time.\"","Lan Sister came over and asked, \"Little sister, why not give me your contact info? If you want to come here again, you can let me know in advance on WeChat.\"","\"Sure, sure!\"","Shen Tang ignored Gu Huaian's words completely. She took out her phone and added Lan Sister on WeChat.","Haha, wouldn't it be more convenient if she came by herself?","Moreover, that was a beautiful lady's WeChat contact. Only a fool would reject it!","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Watch your boundaries.\"","Lan Sister smiled ambiguously, \"Look at what you said, do I look like someone without boundaries?\"","\"Yes.\"","Lan Sister was not bothered at all. She held Shen Tang's hand and said, \"Come, I'll show you my stock. Pick whatever you like, I'll give them all to you.\"","\"Great...\"","Shen Tang's attention was all on her hand. Lan Sister's hand was soft and smooth as tofu.","Gu Huaian pursed his lips, emanating an unpleasant aura.","Shen Tang hesitated a little. Lan Sister forcefully pulled her and said, \"Ignore him, the cold-faced block of ice.\"","Shen Tang chuckled at that.","After the two went inside, Gu Huaian sat there alone, sulking.","Now he regretted it. He shouldn't have brought Shen Tang here in the first place, knowing the type of person Lan Sister was.","Although he knew Lan Sister wouldn't do anything outrageous, Shen Tang was too lustful. He really wondered if she would be seduced away.","After waiting for a while without the two coming out, Gu Huaian was about to go in and find them. Finally he heard footsteps.","He saw the two of them come out chatting and laughing. Shen Tang was holding a bunch of stuff, with a big happy smile on her face that he could see from afar.","Humph.","Perhaps noticing Gu Huaian's resentment, Shen Tang looked over excitedly, \"Gu Huaian! Lan Sister gave me so many things!\"","Other than food, there were also some antique-looking accessories and clothes.","Gu Huaian said gloomily, \"I thought you weren't going to leave.\"","\"If Lan Sister doesn't mind, I can stay!\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","Lan Sister covered her mouth, laughing and shaking. There were even tears coming out from laughter.","Gu Huaian pursed his lips, \"Alright, time to go.\"","Shen Tang was a bit reluctant.","Some people just clicked so well at first sight. It was a feeling of reunion after a long separation.","Lan Sister pinched Shen Tang's cheek, \"Remember to message me when you get back.\"","\"Okay!\"","On the way back, Gu Huaian didn't say a word, emanating chilly air.","Even a dummy like Shen Tang could tell he was angry.","She blinked her eyes, \"Sorry.\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"Don't be mad.\"","\"I'm not mad.\"","\"Yes, yes, you're not mad, just unhappy.\"","Gu Huaian sighed, \"Stay away from her, she's not a good person.\"","Shen Tang frowned, \"But I feel like Lan Sister is pretty nice...\"","\"She... Her ex-girlfriend had an accident, and she hasn't been normal ever since...\"","Shen Tang was stunned for a moment.","\"Wait, did you say ex-girlfriend?\"","\"Yes.\"","From Gu Huaian, Shen Tang heard a tragic story.","Lan Sister's original name was Shen Lan. She came from a scholarly family with strict, old-fashioned rules.","Shen Lan wasn't born attracted to girls either. Of course, she had never liked anyone before.","In college, she was popular for her good looks and personality.","That was when she met her girlfriend, who started pursuing her.","At first Shen Lan was repulsed, but didn't know when she had gotten used to the other's presence.","They were happy together for a while, until the Shen family found out about them.","The Shen family couldn't accept a homosexual relationship, and forced them to break up. Neither of them agreed.","So the Shen family imprisoned Shen Lan at home.","Shen Tang was shocked.","\"Imprisoned?\"","Was that something a decent family would do?","\"Yes. They thought that would make the girls break up. But Shen Lan's girlfriend secretly ran over, intending to elope with her.\"","Shen Tang could guess without asking that it didn't succeed.","Sure enough:","\"They were discovered. Shen Lan's father ordered someone to bring over the man he had chosen to be Shen Lan's husband, and made him do it with Shen Lan in front of her girlfriend...\"","Shen Tang: \"!!!\"","\"What the heck, he's insane!\"","\"That's his daughter!\"","Shen Tang was so angry hearing this. This f*cker was not human! Simply inferior to beasts!","No, saying that would be insulting beasts!","Lan Sister looked quite cheerful. Didn't expect she had such painful experiences.","Gu Huaian sighed, \"I also think he's seriously ill. Shen Lan couldn't believe her own father would order this. Her girlfriend desperately tried to save her and struggled. She fell and hit the broken teacup shards that Shen Lan's father had smashed earlier. She became vegetative.\"","Shen Tang opened and closed her mouth, not knowing what to say.","Lan Sister was just too pitiful, and so was her girlfriend...","She had heard that vegetative people could move and smile, looking just like normal people, except without consciousness.","It was truly cruel.","\"Shen Lan cut ties with the Shen family after that. She started hating the Shen surname and loathed her own lineage. She rarely told people her surname externally, and broke off contacts with the Shen family.","Over the years, Shen Lan has been taking care of her girlfriend and her girlfriend's grandma. The grandma didn't blame her, which made her feel even more guilty. This small villa was the happy future home she and her girlfriend had looked forward to. She made it happen, just that the other person didn't get to see it...\"","Back then Lan Sister probably didn't have the ability yet. Shen Tang suddenly realized Gu Huaian must have helped out!","Otherwise how would he know so clearly?","Shen Tang then thought of another question: \"So why did you tell me to stay away from her?\"","Gu Huaian paused for a bit. \"She...started sleeping around to numb her pain after the trauma. She seduced quite a few people, but took no responsibility. She would leave after seducing them. Many girls wanted to live and die for her.\"","Shen Tang raised her brow, \"You're afraid she would seduce me away?\"","Gu Huaian didn't reply, but silence was the best answer.","Shen Tang chuckled, \"Don't worry, I won't.\"","She only appreciated the beauty. She just wanted to be friends with the beautiful lady sister, someone to admire from afar but not defile.","Gu Huaian's intention telling her all this was to get Shen Tang to keep a distance from Shen Lan. But it had the opposite effect, making her feel more sympathetic.","When Shen Tang thought about how oppressive Lan Sister's family origins were, she felt heartache.","Perhaps sleeping around was her way of masking the sadness.","The more cheerfully she laughed, the sadder she was inside.","She had heard there was still a chance for vegetative people to wake up. Hopefully Lan Sister's girlfriend could wake up soon.","*Sigh*...","\"I didn't expect I share the same surname Shen with Lan Sister. She shouldn't have any issues with the Shen surname, right?\"","\"If she has issues, you'll stay away from her?\"","Shen Tang's eyes were determined, \"No way. I can just not use the Shen surname too.\"","Come to think of it, why did she have the Shen surname in the first place?","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","He knew it!"]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Suspected Black Powder","paragraphs":["Shen Tang thought for a long time before finally remembering that Dean Mum seemed to have said when she picked her up, she had a bag embroidered with the Shen character with her at that time. Therefore, she was named Shen. It is also unknown whether she was deliberately abandoned at that time or lost. Anyway, no one has come looking for her in so many years, nor have there been any missing person notices seen.","Of course, Shen Tang did not care anyway. She was past the age of needing parents, and after hearing about Lan Sister's matter, Shen Tang even began to panic. Her parents would not be this kind of person too! If there were parents like this, it would be better to not have any.","\"Don't think randomly.\"","Her hair was suddenly messed up. Shen Tang took Gu Huaian's hand away, \"My hairstyle!\"","\"It looks good like this too.\"","Shen Tang looked in the rearview mirror, \"I was fooled by you!\"","To put it in a high EQ way, it has a kind of messy beauty.","Low EQ is: bird's nest.","She didn't notice that after being distracted like this, she had already forgotten what she was thinking about earlier.","Returning to the villa, Tao Sister was curled up on the sofa playing with her phone, completely engrossed, and didn't even hear them come back.","Shen Tang quietly walked over and took a peek. Good stuff, Tao Sister was arguing with her anti-fans.","\"Why don't you use that app?\"","Tao Sister was so frightened by this sudden voice that she shuddered, \"Oh my god, Madam you are back.\"","Shen Tang nodded, pointing at the phone screen and asked: “Why are you still going down there yourself? Don't get angry.\"","\"Don't worry, they can't scold me. The server for that app is being upgraded and can only be used tomorrow.\"","Shen Tang took a look at Tao Sister's comments. Hmm, how to put it, not a single dirty word, can be called the ancestor master of sarcasm.","\"Amazing!\"","\"Of course, don't underestimate me.\"","Shen Tang also noticed that Tao Sister added a WeChat fan group, which seemed to be newly created by her big fan.","\"What's this group?\"","Tao Sister hemmed and hawed, and did not answer directly.","Shen Tang was even more curious. \"Add me in.\"","Tao Sister was somewhat hesitant, \"I can't decide this. I have to ask the admin...\"","\"Then ask now.\"","Shen Tang watched as Tao Sister finished asking, and the reply from the other side was: No.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Is this really her fan?","\"Why can't I join the group?\"","The other party replied: Idols, please stay away from fans' lives.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Tao Sister: \"......\"","Seeing this scene, Gu Huaian almost laughed out loud. Seeing Shen Tang deflated, he felt inexplicably happy for some reason.","Shen Tang frowned, \"Tao Sister, give me her WeChat, I want to talk to her.\"","\"You...don't be impulsive...\" Tao Sister was a little afraid that the two would argue.","She wouldn't know who to help at that time.","After all, this admin was a true fan who was preparing Shen Tang's birthday present. They had chatted a bit before, and Tao Sister felt very surprised.","Speaking of which, there didn't seem to be many days until Shen Tang's birthday either.","\"Don't worry, I'm a rational person.\"","Tao Sister believed it.","Tao Sister handed over her WeChat.","When Shen Tang added her as a friend, she remarked \"I am Shen Tang\" in big letters.","As a result, she was rejected without even a reason for rejection.","Shen Tang couldn't accept it and applied again, and was rejected again.","She continued to apply, continued to be rejected.","Apply... Reject...","It was as if the two were at odds.","Shen Tang felt they were a bit childish.","Annoyed and tired.","Shen Tang was going to apply one last time. She changed the application content: If you don't accept me, I'll cry for you to see!","Then she was rejected again.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","This must be a black fan! How could her fans possibly treat her like this?","Before long, the other party actually sent a friend request with a message: Should I cry now? Or wait a while?","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Do you think I'm the kind of woman who gets whatever she wants?","Do you think that just because you applied, I would accept?","Shen Tang sneered and firmly tapped Agree.","She wanted to see what was going on with this fan, whether she was an undercover agent.","So she specifically changed a remark—Suspected Black Fan.","Gu Huaian, who had heard her inner thoughts loud and clear, couldn't help grinning.","It was just too silly to watch, Shen Tang where's your backbone?","Shen Tang said, what is backbone? Can you eat it?","After agreeing, the other party asked: Cry now?","Shen Tang didn't reply. She first carefully examined some of her WeChat data, including avatar, nickname, signature, moments. All were lovely pink series, and what she shared were all kinds of delicacies, seemingly a girl.","Wait, was this a selfie—","Shen Tang clicked in and saw a great beauty. Her skin was as white as snow, her lips as red as blood, her hair as black as ebony.","She was right, she cosplayed Snow White.","Shen Tang felt her heart strings being tugged instantly. What could be wrong with a beauty? It must be her who was wrong.","Seeing Shen Tang not replying, the other party chased to ask:","[Suspected Black Fan: Where did you go? Ran away?]","[Suspected Black Fan: You can't be fake Shen Tang, can you?]","[Suspected Black Fan: Even if you're fake, you still have to cry for me to see!]","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She found a screenshot of herself crying from one of her crying scenes and sent it over.","[Infatuated Macaque: Here's the crying photo you wanted, no need to thank me]","[Suspected Black Fan: Liar! Great crying .jpg]","Shen Tang strangely felt a little guilty. She looked closely and indeed did not say live shot earlier. It didn't seem to count as deception either.","The other party sent an audio. Shen Tang clicked to play it and a coarse voice echoed in the living room—","\"Shen Tang! You big liar!\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She blinked blankly, \"No.\"","\"What no?\"","\"Gender is wrong.\"","Everything was pink, how could it be a boy, and so coarse too?","Tao Sister scratched her head, \"He was always a boy, and also, burly men and pink, simply a perfect match!\"","Shen Tang nodded slowly after a pause, \"You're right...\"","It was her who had preconceptions. Who said boys can't like pink?","She slowly turned her head and looked at Gu Huaian.","Gu Huaian suddenly felt a chill down his back, \"I still have things to do, I'll just— \"","\"Wait!\"","Before Shen Tang finished speaking, Gu Huaian was already leaving as if he hadn't heard anything.","Hateful!","However, since this fan wasn't a girl, Shen Tang had no need to forgive him. So she reopened what she had let go just earlier.","[Infatuated Macaque: Why didn't you agree to be my friend earlier?]","[Infatuated Macaque: You're not my black fan, are you?]","[Suspected Black Fan: How do you know!]","The message was sent out then quickly withdrawn, unfortunately Shen Tang saw it already. It was confirmed, a black fan after all.","[Suspected Black Fan: You can insult my taste, but cannot insult my personality!]","Shen Tang: Hehe ^_^"]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: Took a Bite of a Fake Melon","paragraphs":["Shen Tang closed her phone and asked Tao Sister, \"This person is a hater. What did you say he was organizing in the group chat?\"","Tao Sister looked completely confused: \"Huh?\"","\"No, Little Rui is not a hater.\"","Shen Tang stroked her chin. Since even Little Rui was brought up, it looked like they must have chatted for a while.","She took the opportunity to ask, \"So tell me, what was the purpose of him creating that group?\"","Tao Sister started mumbling again, unable to give a clear answer.","Shen Tang was a little worried that Tao Sister was being deceived. After all, even if he was a hater, he wouldn't be able to make too many waves since there were laws to restrict them.","\"Forget it, if you don't want to say, then don't say anymore.\"","Just after she finished speaking, Tao Sister immediately smiled. \"Then I won't say.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Just don't let yourself get deceived. Nowadays there are all kinds of crazy scam methods online. Who knows, there might be scammers pretending to be my fans, pulling you into groups and asking you for money.\"","\"That won't happen. Little Rui isn't that kind of person. He even sends us money!\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"There's even something that good happening?\" Hearing that made her want to join the group even more.","\"Yeah, he's your fan. When we go fight the haters, he gives us red packets!\"","Shen Tang was a little shocked. \"Ha? He really is my fan?\"","\"Yeah, I already said he's your fan. How could I trick you?\" Tao Sister rolled her eyes, but still looked cute doing it.","Shen Tang laughed embarrassedly a couple times.","\"Okay, I misunderstood...\"","But she couldn't fully blame herself either. That fan was just too strange, first sending that kind of message earlier, it was hard not to misunderstand.","Wait a minute, could he be a converted hater? After all, there were quite a lot of fans like that too.","\"Do you know his Weibo ID?\"","\"I know,\" Tao Sister said warningly, \"But it's useless if you ask me, I won't tell you for now.\"","Shen Tang sighed. Tao Sister was too vigilant.","\"Alright alright, I won't ask anymore. Oh right, this is food that Lan Sister gave me. Try some.\"","\"That Lan girl? It's been a while since she came around.\"","\"Tao Sister, you know Lan Sister too?\" Shen Tang tilted her head to ask.","Come to think of it, it was normal they knew each other. After all, Gu Huai'an and Lan Sister were friends, although it seemed they didn't really like each other.","\"I know her. That girl has a bitter fate.\" Tao Sister didn't say any more, but picked up a small cake to take a bite.","\"Hmm, looks like that girl's skills have gotten even better.\"","Shen Tang also took a big bite. \"So yummy, so yummy~\"","She had originally wanted to give some to her friends to try too, but looking down, it seemed she didn't have too many left herself. Then maybe...she wouldn't share.","Wait until next time, hehe.","In just a moment, Shen Tang had already convinced herself.","She also wondered if Lan Sister needed introductions to any high-end clients. She could help introduce some.","Oh right, she almost forgot to let Lan Sister know she was doing well.","She sent a WeChat message over, but Lan Sister didn't reply.","Looking at the time, Shen Tang guessed that she was probably with her girlfriend.","Since the miraculous event of her entering this book world happened, then that meant miracles existed. She prayed in her heart for Lan Sister's girlfriend to get better soon!","Time passed quickly. Shen Tang had to get to the filming location again.","Because of the distance, Shen Tang didn't have Yuan Yuan come pick her up. Instead the two would meet directly at the filming location.","Just as she arrived at the entrance to the filming location, she saw the Director smiling while holding a thermal flask and sitting at the entrance.","Shen Tang greeted him, and the Director nodded with a smile. He looked left and right, and seeing no one was paying attention, quickly pulled Shen Tang aside. \"Have you heard?\"","\"Heard what?\" Shen Tang was extremely excited. Was there gossip again??","\"I heard the fifth male lead started seeing the investor!\"","\"They're dating?\"","\"That's right!\" The Director's small eyes blinked nonstop. \"That man has prospects. He knows to cozy up to a rich and beautiful woman to cling to her coattails to swiftly advance his career!\"","Shen Tang supplemented, \"Then give her a kick!\"","The Director stroked his head. \"Uh... maybe not. The Qi family business is huge. Unless he wants to die, he wouldn't do that.\"","\"The Qi family?\" Wait a minute, wasn't the investor from the Qi family? Then wasn't this woman with the golden thighs Qi Yue?","Wow, she had accidentally gotten gossip about her own sister.","Wait a minute, what sister doesn't say anything when she starts dating?","She unilaterally declared their friendship over.","Remembering Qi Yue had said she was also coming today, Shen Tang had Yuan Yuan help bring her luggage in, while she herself stood guard at the entrance.","Humph, she was going to get an explanation.","Not long after, Qi Yue's car arrived as well.","Just as Shen Tang went to greet her, she saw a man get out of the car.","He was rather handsome, also tall, but Shen Tang strangely disliked him for some reason, feeling he seemed rather greasy and pretentious.","Seeing the man carefully helping Qi Yue out of the car, Shen Tang said sarcastically, \"Oh, if you didn't know better, you'd think some old rich guy was coming. What, after not seeing each other for a while, now you can't even get out of a car yourself?\"","Qi Yue felt this was inexplicable.","\"Eating gunpowder so early in the morning? That's a strong smell of explosives.\"","\"I just discovered--\"","\"Discovered what?\" Qi Yue took the man's arm. \"Let me introduce you. This is my nephew, Tang Shuqing.\"","\"Not the fif--nephew? He's your nephew?\"","Shen Tang blinked in shock, looking at Tang Shuqing, then at Qi Yue. Looking closely, it did seem they resembled each other a little.","She quickly turned to look at the Director, only to see him looking everywhere except at her, clearly looking very guilty.","Wow, she had taken a bite of fake gossip first thing in the morning!","Shen Tang was a little embarrassed. \"Uh...pleased to meet you, big nephew...\"","Now looking again, where was any greasiness or pretentiousness?","*Cough* He was clearly an elegant talent.","Tang Shuqing gave a faint smile. \"Hello, big sister Shen Tang.\"","\"Hello, big nephew, hello. Um...I didn't prepare any greeting gift, so have this lollipop.\"","Shen Tang took out a lollipop from her pocket and handed it over.","Tang Shuqing didn't disdain it and smiled as he accepted it.","Qi Yue raised her eyebrows. \"Why aren't you making sarcastic comments anymore?\"","Shen Tang embarrassedly grabbed her arm. \"Misunderstanding, all misunderstandings, it's all his fault!\"","Shen Tang mercilessly sold out the Director.","As an investor, Qi Yue was quite familiar with the Director and knew what kind of person he was.","\"Just listen to what he says and take it with a grain of salt. Eight out of ten things he says are fake.\"","Shen Tang nodded. Fake gossip was harmful!","She looked at the Director. \"Hurry up and honestly explain, where exactly did you hear this news from?\"","No smoke without fire. Someone must have said it first for the rumor to have spread. She just didn't know who had such a loose tongue.","Qi Yue was also extremely curious. \"Yes, who was the one speaking nonsense? How will I be able to find a boyfriend like this?\"","The Director laughed drily. \"Uh...I don't know who said it either. I just saw a line online...\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"And you actually believed it?\"","There wasn't even any evidence. Wasn't this just random slander?","The Director smiled awkwardly and didn't offer any explanations.","Qi Yue's eyes narrowed. \"Not right.\"","\"What's not right?\"","\"You wouldn't have believed it just from a random line online. Hurry and honestly explain, exactly where did you hear it from!\""]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Are you trying to embarrass me in public","paragraphs":["When Director saw that he couldn't get away with it, he sighed and said, \"Fine, I'll tell you. I actually saw it in a group chat, and I also saw photos of you two there. As for what group and who said it, don't ask, I can't say.\"","Qi Yue pouted her lips. \"Even if you don't tell me, I can find out. It must be someone from the crew.\"","The director neither confirmed nor denied it, he just rubbed his nose and said, \"I still have things to do, so I'll get going first.\"","\"Hey, wait a minute!\" Hearing Qi Yue's voice, the director started jogging away directly. His speed was quite fast, with all the fat on his body jiggling.","Qi Yue: \"...\"","\"I just wanted to remind him that his pants were ripped...\"","Shen Tang also noticed it. There was a hole ripped open on the butt. She coughed and said, \"Don't worry, others will remind him if they see it too.\"","In the end, the director was still wearing those tight pants at the crew dinner that night.","Had he fixed it?","Shen Tang was taken aback for a moment. She deliberately circled around to the back of the director to take a look. Hmm, his pants were still ripped.","The director looked back. \"What are you suddenly coming over here for?\"","Shen Tang didn't know whether to speak up about it or not. After an entire day, those who should see it would have already seen it.","She covered her mouth and softly reminded him: \"Your pants are ruined.\"","\"What?\"","\"I said your pants are ruined!\"","At that moment, the music abruptly stopped, making Shen Tang's words very conspicuous. Everyone around looked over at once, checking out the director's butt.","Director: \"...\"","Shen Tang took a step back with an innocent look on her face. It wasn't her fault, how could she have known the music would suddenly stop like that?","After all, the director had seen his fair share of things in the industry. He waved his hand unconcernedly, \"It's fine, let's continue eating.\"","In any case, it had been seen by everyone over the course of the day already, so what was a few more minutes?","This truly illustrated the saying, being open-minded is a virtue. He never agonizes over himself internally.","Just like now, the director was not embarrassed, yet everyone else felt embarrassed instead.","Sure enough, what that saying pointed out was right - as long as I'm not embarrassed, the embarrassment lies with others.","Shen Tang went back to her seat. Qi Yue peeled a shrimp and passed it to her. \"Not bad.\"","Shen Tang exaggerated the tone of her voice. \"Oh my, this is a shrimp personally peeled by the young miss. This slave will take it back and worship it as an offering.\"","Qi Yue rolled her eyes. \"Tone down your exaggerated acting. Otherwise, I'm afraid others may say you got in through the back door.\"","\"Pfft!\"","No one knew who laughed first, but everyone burst out laughing together.","Only one person did not blend in with the others - Hou Jingjing, who played the second female lead. She had a mocking smile on her face, even brazenly rolling her eyes.","Her actions were so conspicuous that Shen Tang couldn't help looking over.","Hou Jingjing raised her head and glanced over with a sneer.","Shen Tang blinked blankly, wondering if she had offended her somehow?","\"May I ask if you...\"","Hou Jingjing put down her utensils and dabbed her mouth with a napkin. \"Didn't anyone teach you the custom of no talking while eating?\"","Although she didn't address anyone specifically, everyone knew she was referring to Shen Tang.","However, everyone felt they were being scolded too.","Shen Tang made a sound of surprise. \"You're asking me this right in front of everyone. Are you trying to deliberately embarrass me publicly?\"","Qi Yue pretended to cover her mouth unintentionally, recounting all of life's sad stories in her mind to stop herself from laughing out loud.","The cowardly group takes a big loss.","It seemed like Hou Jingjing had never encountered anyone like Shen Tang before. She was at a temporary loss for words.","Stuttering, she said, \"I, I...\"","She did intend to embarrass her, but who would ask so directly?","\"Have I offended you somehow?\" Shen Tang asked earnestly. She really wanted to know the answer.","Hou Jingjing's eyes instantly turned red. \"Don't you know clearly yourself what you've done?!\"","After saying that, she ran off.","Shen Tang was even more confused now. What had she done to her?","Hou Jingjing's behavior did dampen the mood quite a bit. Everyone else didn't know whether they should continue joking around or leave early. They all looked towards the director.","\"Everyone keep going. I'll go take a look at little Hou.\" It would be a good chance to change into another pair of pants, the director thought.","Shen Tang felt a little awkward and quietly asked Qi Yue: \"Should I not have said that line?\"","Qi Yue gave a cold laugh. \"The one who flirts first is cheap. She was the one who criticized you first. Your counterattack was not wrong. She got embarrassed because she couldn't retort back, that's why she ran back to her room.\"","Although Shen Tang knew this rationale, she still couldn't help but wonder if she had gone a little overboard.","After all, it looked like the other party had cried.","Although Hou Jingjing was only playing the second female lead, she wasn't well-known. Come to think of it, this may have been her first time acting as the second female lead.","Of course, Shen Tang didn't mean anything else by that. After all, she also hadn't played many second female lead roles herself. It's said that every set inevitably has its own share of tears and laughter.","\"Forget it, I won't think about it anymore. Let's eat!\"","Today was considered the opening feast. It was the last relaxed and happy meal before the hard work started tomorrow.","According to what Pei Kesong said, this director had strict requirements. He would keep making people reshoot scenes again and again if he was not satisfied, and his scoldings spared no one, until he was pleased with the result.","Of course, Shen Tang had not yet witnessed any of that from the director so far.","She sidled up to Qi Yue and asked softly: \"How come your brother and Lin Mianmian aren't here today?\"","Qi Yue's expression was somewhat complicated. \"Don't mention that guy to me. He's nothing but a kiss-up.\"","Shen Tang did not give any opinions regarding this statement.","\"What a kiss-up. In the end, he didn't get anything at all from it,\" Qi Yue sighed.","\"Well, you never know...\"","Maybe the female lead would fall into Qi Jue's hands in the end?","Hmm, somehow it felt like there was some innuendo in that sentence?","Time passed quickly. After official shooting started, Shen Tang finally understood why Pei Kesong would say what she did.","She watched with her own eyes as Hou Jingjing was scolded to tears by the director, then ran off.","This time, the director did not chase after her. He only said, \"If you can act then act, if you can't then get lost.\"","Not long after, Hou Jingjing was led back by an assistant, her eyes red from crying, to continue filming.","Shen Tang was shocked. She quietly complained: \"How can one person have such vastly different sides to them?\"","Yuan Yuan thought she was afraid, and comforted her, \"Don't be scared Sister Tangtang, your acting is very good, you won't get scolded too many times.\"","Shen Tang's lips moved. \"I appreciate your words, but can I just not get scolded at all?\"","Yuan Yuan had a forced smile on her face.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Forget it, stop talking.\"","No point in humiliating herself further. After all, she had heard that even top actors have been scolded by the director before.","Lin Mianmian's acting was quite remarkable, befitting of the female lead in the book.","This also resulted in standout performances from Shen Tang in their shared scenes. Usually they could nail scenes in one take.","They finished several scenes in one go each time. The director praised, \"Not bad.\"","To be frank, Shen Tang didn't feel those two words held any significance. Yet some people didn't see it that way.","Hou Jingjing looked over with puffed up anger, like an enraged blowfish.","Shen Tang gave her a smile.","Hou Jingjing was outraged. She said to her assistant, \"Did you see that? She was actually mocking me!\"","The little assistant hesitated. \"It looked like she just smiled normally...\"","\"Are you my assistant or hers? Why are you even speaking up for her?!\"","\"Of course I'm yours.\" The little assistant revealed a bitter smile. What a temper on this master..."]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: If you stay, I'll be distracted.","paragraphs":["Hou Jingjing was like a spoiled child, who got angry very easily.","Shen Tang felt that those who openly showed their emotions were not as scary as those who schemed behind one's back.","Still, Shen Tang wanted to know why Hou Jingjing disliked her so much.","That day, after Shen Tang finished shooting her scenes early, she happened to see Hou Jingjing sitting on a flower bed with red-rimmed eyes.","\"What's wrong?\"","\"None of your business!\"","Shen Tang didn't want to bother with someone who clearly didn't like her. She simply said \"Oh\" and walked away.","Seeing that, Hou Jingjing got even angrier. \"Hey! You're just going to leave like that?\"","Shen Tang shrugged. \"What else?\"","\"Aren't you even worried that something might happen to me?\" Hou Jingjing challenged.","Shen Tang replied earnestly: \"No, I'm not worried. After all, good people don't live long, while troublemakers plague the world for thousands of years.\"","Hou Jingjing: \"...\"","She shouldn't have asked! Ever since joining this crew, she had never won an argument against Shen Tang. This woman was vicious!","Hou Jingjing sniffed. \"Don't you even want to know why I dislike you so much?\"","To be honest, Shen Tang had been very curious about this in the beginning, but could never find the reason no matter how hard she tried.","Now, she didn't really care anymore.","So Shen Tang shook her head.","This angered Hou Jingjing even more. She shot up from the flower bed. \"I don't care if you want to know or not, I'm going to tell you anyway!\"","\"The reason why I oppose you is because you--Ah!\" Noticing the curiosity flashing in Shen Tang's eyes, Hou Jingjing hurriedly shut her mouth. \"Damn, you almost tricked me!\"","Shen Tang sighed, making a tiny gap between her thumb and index finger. \"What a pity, just missed it by this much...\"","\"Humph! You sly, crafty woman. Fortunately I'm smart.\" Hou Jingjing looked pleased with herself.","Shen Tang exclaimed, \"Wrongfully accused! This is a huge misunderstanding! I'm a perfectly law-abiding citizen!\"","Just then, there was a loud \"bang\" next to them.","Hou Jingjing turned to look, but Shen Tang covered her eyes. \"Don't look.\"","\"I want to see! What happened?\" Hou Jingjing struggled to remove Shen Tang's hand, but Shen Tang was too strong.","Shen Tang's voice trembled slightly. \"Someone died...\"","Hou Jingjing instantly fell silent.","She guessed someone must have fallen to their death right in front of them. Her mind involuntarily began to imagine all kinds of gruesome scenes. Hou Jingjing swallowed hard and asked, \"Who is it?\"","\"Don't know them.\"","The body had landed face down. The impact was so brutal that even if Shen Tang had recognized the person, they would be unidentifiable now.","Shen Tang shakily dialed 120 [Chinese emergency number] and the police. But it seemed the person was already dead, as there was no response at all.","To be honest, Shen Tang was terrified. A living, breathing person had just crashed down right next to them. Some of the...stuff...had even sprayed onto their clothes.","Unable to hold it in, Shen Tang dry heaved.","Feeling somewhat worried, Hou Jingjing tugged at the corner of Shen Tang's clothes. \"Are...are you okay...?\"","\"Ugh, I'm fine...\" Shen Tang gagged.","The area was too remote. It wasn't until the police cars arrived that people from the crew realized something had happened here.","When Hou Jingjing's assistant rushed over, she was so frightened she almost burst into tears. Still, she bravely came to bring Hou Jingjing back.","\"Jingjing, let's go back first...\"","But Hou Jingjing shook her head. \"I'm not leaving...\"","The assistant frowned helplessly. \"But your clothes are dirty...\"","Dirty clothes...?","Realizing what that meant, Hou Jingjing let out a blood-curdling shriek.","Shen Tang instantly grabbed her mouth, cutting off the scream.","\"Be good, go back and change your clothes, take a shower, don't think about anything, just get some good rest.\"","Hou Jingjing tugged anxiously at Shen Tang's sleeve, her voice unconsciously clinging. \"What about you?\"","\"I'll stay here a bit longer. You go first...\"","Hou Jingjing had obediently avoided looking at the area marked by the yellow police line, although with so many people around, there wasn't much to see anyway.","She kept looking back worriedly as she left. Her assistant couldn't help wondering if she was possessed, since Hou Jingjing normally did nothing but grumble about Shen Tang behind her back.","Before long, more and more onlookers gathered, including passersby and those who came specifically to gawk at the spectacle. They would take a peek and then recoil in fear, gossiping about the deceased.","Unable to stand their stares, Shen Tang withdrew to sit on a nearby flower bed after answering the routine police questioning.","She was still struggling to process what had happened. She had seen dead bodies before, but never one so horrifically mangled. Her legs felt weak.","\"How could it be her?!\" The speaker sounded shocked.","\"Who was she?\"","Hearing the voices, the person jumped in fright before turning to see it was Shen Tang. He quickly explained, \"She was a makeup stylist, always so cheerful. How could she have jumped to her death...?\"","Shen Tang nodded. \"Who said it was suicide?\"","The police hadn't even announced anything. How could people make assumptions like that?","The girl suddenly looked nervous. \"I...I guessed. If it wasn't suicide, then she must have been murdered, right?\"","\"You sure know how to guess...\" Shen Tang closed in and said softly, \"Take another guess - why did she commit suicide then?\"","The girl stammered, \"I...I don't know...\"","\"It's too early to draw conclusions now. What if she really was murdered?!\"","The girl took a frightened step back.","Shen Tang's expression returned to normal. \"Of course, I'm just making wild guesses too.\"","The girl smiled awkwardly. \"I don't know what you're talking about. I need to get back to work.\" And she hurried off.","\"Wait, what's your name?\" Shen Tang asked.","The girl hesitated briefly before answering. \"I'm Li Xiumei.\"","Shen Tang watched Li Xiumei walk away with an intense stare.","It was obvious at first listen that Li Xiumei was a fake name. Shen Tang didn't even need to guess.","She admitted that she had deliberately intimidated the girl.","She didn't know why, but she had a sixth sense that something was off about her.","Shen Tang hoped it was just her overthinking things.","Because of the incident, everyone went back early to rest that day.","The weather had also turned gloomy, and it began pouring heavily before long.","Shen Tang and Yuan Yuan shared a small suite. The two curled up on the sofa, too disturbed to do anything.","The rain dripped steadily outside. As night deepened, neither felt like sleeping yet.","\"Sister Tang, how do you think she...\" Yuan Yuan began.","Shen Tang's ears twitched and she quickly shushed the girl. She leaned sideways, straining to listen. There seemed to be faint rustling sounds coming from outside.","With a death having just occurred right downstairs, Yuan Yuan was petrified with fear. Clutching a pillow tightly, she didn't dare utter another word.","Shen Tang tiptoed on bare feet to the door and pressed her ear against it. Indeed, there were sounds outside - footsteps, pacing by, then coming back, finally stopping right outside their door.","Shortly after, they could hear the lock being tampered with.","Having heard this too, Yuan Yuan was dumbstruck with shock. Recalling the jumper from before, her mind leapt to the worst possibilities.","Could it be the murderer coming for them? Would they meet the same cruel end?","Tears instantly pooled in Yuan Yuan's eyes. \"Sister Tang...\" she whimpered.","Shen Tang had already swiftly sent a distress message to the police. She shot Yuan Yuan a look and mouthed, \"Yuan Yuan, do you trust me?\"","Remembering Sister Tang's previous mystical encounters, Yuan Yuan nodded. \"I trust you!\"","\"Good. Quietly go lock yourself in the bedroom now.\"","But Yuan Yuan shook her head adamantly. \"No, what about you then?\"","Shen Tang said solemnly, \"If you stay, I'll be distracted worrying about you.\"","Still, Yuan Yuan couldn't bring herself to abandon Sister Tang alone against an intruder, even knowing she would be a liability.","By now the person outside was clearly growing impatient, working at the lock with louder sounds, seemingly unconcerned about the noise they were making, emboldened by the rain and late hour.","Shen Tang urged again, \"Have you forgotten how strong I am? Go, quickly!\""]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Against the Sky Against the Air","paragraphs":["Yuan Yuan ended up crying as she hid in the bedroom.","Shen Tang sighed, she wasn't great enough to sacrifice herself to save others, but this was the best method for now.","Shen Tang's brain spun rapidly, the people outside didn't seem random, but more like they were here for her.","Shen Tang held a fruit knife and stood at the door.","The movement outside soon quieted down, and Shen Tang waited for a while without any sound.","Suddenly, a scream came from outside.","That voice--","It was Hou Jingjing's!","Shen Tang swiftly opened the door and went out, only to see Hou Jingjing lying on the ground unconscious, the hallway empty of people.","She ran over, and just as she was about to squat down, she suddenly noticed an extra shadow on the ground.","Shen Tang rolled to dodge, and saw a figure wrapped up in black clothes stab towards her with a knife.","Shen Tang used all her strength to kick, and the person slammed into the wall, letting out a muffled groan of pain.","The person still wanted to continue, but the police siren sounded from downstairs, and he turned to run away.","Shen Tang chased him for two steps, worried about the fainted Hou Jingjing on the ground, and retreated back.","Hou Jingjing's abdomen was a bloody mess, having bled a lot. Shen Tang didn't dare move her, and hurriedly called 120.","Noisy footsteps sounded, and the surrounding guests only opened their doors now.","\"Oh my god, the wound is so serious...\"","\"Quick, call 120!\"","\"Why is she still unconscious, could she be-- \"","\"Don't speak nonsense!\"","The surrounding people's whispers made Shen Tang's head hurt.","\"Shut up!\"","The surroundings instantly turned silent.","Shen Tang didn't care what others thought of her, she just stared at the pool of red, knowing that her head was about to explode.","Soon the police and doctors arrived, and the surroundings descended into chaos. It was as if Shen Tang was drifting outside of the crowds, even when Qi Yue called her it was like she couldn't hear any sounds.","A bout of dizziness overcame her, and she completely lost consciousness.","When she next woke up, she was in the hospital.","Shen Tang discovered that recently she had been hospitalized so many times. She had just gotten out not long ago and now she was admitted again.","Practice makes perfect, now when she went to the hospital, it was like going home, very comfortable.","Shen Tang tilted her head to look, Gu Huaian was currently sitting on the sofa handling work.","She suddenly felt a little guilty.","\"Awake?\"","Shen Tang stared wide-eyed in surprise, he didn't even lift his head how did he know she was awake?","Shen Tang closed her eyes, pretending to still be asleep.","\"If you're awake let's go, the doctor said you're fine, just shocked.\"","Shen Tang still didn't respond.","As a result, Gu Huaian directly came over and flipped her blanket open.","Shen Tang frowned, \"How can you flip a girl's blanket open!\"","Right after she finished speaking, the blanket was covered back up.","\"Sorry, I've covered you back up.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","She looked at the clothes she was wearing, still the pajamas from last night. It looks like she could directly leave without needing to change.","\"How did I end up at the hospital?\"","\"Miss Qi sent you here.\"","\"How is Yuan Yuan?\"","Gu Huaian was stunned for a moment, \"Is that the girl with the round face? She saw you faint and cried so hard she couldn't breathe, I had someone send her back.\"","\"Then...how is Hou Jingjing?\"","\"Not too serious, just some external stitches. \"","\"I want to go see her...\"","After all, Hou Jingjing getting injured was more or less related to her. Although Shen Tang still didn't know who she had offended again.","Gu Huaian's expression was a bit strange, but Shen Tang didn't think much of it.","\"Oh right, did they catch the assailant from last night?\"","\"No, he ran very quickly. But heaven's net is wide, though its meshes are coarse. He can't hide for long.\" A flash of coldness appeared in Gu Huaian's eyes.","Those who dare to hurt his people have to be prepared to face retaliation.","He wasn't a good guy, or he would have been viciously disposed of long ago.","Shen Tang suddenly felt a chill. She pulled her clothes tighter.","Hou Jingjing was staying downstairs. Shen Tang was originally surprised why she was staying so far. As soon as she went downstairs she understood why.","She could hear Hou Jingjing's screaming cries from a long distance away.","\"Wah...it hurts so much...I want painkillers! Painkillers!\"","\"Where is the doctor? Why aren't they here yet!\"","\"Ahhhhh I'm going to die from pain!\"","\"Mom...wah...I want to go home...\"","How to put it, it sounded miserable, and creepy too.","Luckily this was a high-end private hospital without too many patients, or else she would have disturbed others.","Shen Tang noticed the expressionless yet hardworking nurses, and gave them a silent thumbs up in her heart. So professional, not affected by external influences.","When Shen Tang arrived at the door of the hospital room, she gently knocked.","The cries in the room stopped for a moment before continuing.","Shen Tang picked at her ears. The door wasn't closed so of course the sound was so loud.","She directly pushed the door open and entered.","Hou Jingjing currently had her eyes closed as she wailed at the top of her lungs. Not a single teardrop could be seen, but her face was ghastly pale.","\"Feeling better?\"","Upon hearing Shen Tang's voice, the wailing immediately ceased.","Hou Jingjing smoothed her hair, awkwardly saying: \"You, why did you come?\"","\"Came to see you. Does your wound still hurt?\"","Upon hearing this, Hou Jingjing immediately pouted. \"It hurts so bad...\"","\"I'm sorry, because of me you got dragged into this...\"","Hou Jingjing stared with wide eyes in shock, \"What nonsense are you saying? What does this have to do with you?\"","\"The person who came was probably looking for me...\" Although just conjecture, Shen Tang felt the probability was very big.","Now when she thought about it, perhaps it had to do with her loose lips that afternoon.","Was the person looking for her the murderer who killed that girl?","\"Shen Tang you seem a bit different like this.\"","Shen Tang smiled wryly, \"What should I be like then?\"","\"Shouldn't you be sassing heaven, earth, and air?\" I got dissed by you so many times before.\"","\"It's different this time...\"","\"There's no difference at all. I chose to go out myself, just unlucky to run into bad people. What does it have to do with you? Ow, don't think anymore. You're making an injured person comfort you instead, really...\" At the start Hou Jingjing was still a little awkward, but upon seeing Shen Tang like this she completely discarded those feelings.","In just one day, the relationship between the two improved visibly.","The little assistant went from initial disbelief, to now \"whatever\", \"do what you want\", \"I don't care\".","Shen Tang also recalled the previous incident, and hurriedly asked: \"Can you tell me now why you were targeting me before?\"","Hou Jingjing: \".....\"","\"What, you still remember that thing?\"","\"Of course. If you don't explain I won't be able to eat or sleep properly. I'll--\"","\"Get fat!\" Hou Jingjing supplemented.","Shen Tang: \".....\"","She hadn't gotten fat!","She had just become more solid!"]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: I Only Like You","paragraphs":["The two seemed to have made a habit of bickering with each other, as they started quarreling after exchanging just a few pleasant words.","Hou Jingjing pouted, \"Is this how you treat a patient?\"","Shen Tang immediately stood up straight and bowed 90 degrees, \"I'm sorry, I was wrong! Can you forgive me, Miss Hou?\"","Hou Jingjing gave a cold snort, \"I don't forgive you. I'm in a bad mood today and have decided not to tell you the reason why I was targeting you earlier. I'll save it for next time.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Oh, don't be like that...\"","\"No matter what you say, I'm not telling you today.\"","Shen Tang clutched his chest and took a step back, feigning agony.","Don't ask her what kind of mood she was in. She was regretting it now, extremely regretting it.","As they continued chatting, Hou Jingjing couldn't help but think of Shen Tang's former reputation.","She exclaimed, \"You're completely different from the rumors now...\"","\"Rumors can be good or bad. I used to be a rogue before, now I'm a pervert.\"","Hou Jingjing nodded in agreement, \"I didn't expect you to be quite self-aware.\"","\"Birds of a feather flock together. I just can't find any normal people around me.\"","Hou Jingjing quickly leaned back, trying to keep some distance, but ended up straining her wound and sucked in a breath of cold air.","\"Ow!\"","\"Hey, be careful...\"","\"I'm fine, I can endure it...\"","Shen Tang frowned and rang the bell, \"It would be more convincing if you wiped away some tears while saying that.\"","Hou Jingjing wiped the corners of her eyes, but there were no tears.","She had been tricked again.","Soon, a nurse came to check on the wound. There was no major issue.","After chatting for a while longer, Shen Tang stepped out and found that Gu Huaian was missing.","After asking the nurse, he traced Gu Huaian's steps and found him hugging an elegantly dressed woman at the stairwell.","Shen Tang quickly hid himself, not wanting to see any more.","He couldn't clearly describe what he was thinking in that moment.","It was as if thinking: Oh, so he has such a close relationship with another person too!","So he would be like this with others too!","I'm not special after all.","Shen Tang told himself in his mind that Gu Huaian was only his sponsor father and contract husband. Everything was fake. His previously messy heart instantly calmed down.","On the other side, the woman was being pushed away, but she didn't seem embarrassed.","\"Huaian, is this how you treat an old friend after not seeing each other for so long?\"","Gu Huaian pulled up the corners of his lips, \"Let's just talk. Don't get handsy.\"","The woman's lips curled up. \"What, are you afraid your little girlfriend will misunderstand? She can't be that petty, can she?\"","\"Don't talk nonsense.\"","\"Yes yes, she's not petty. My mistake.\"","\"She's not my girlfriend...\"","The woman raised her brows, \"Huh? Didn't they all say you've been doting on a female celebrity recently? Could she only be a mistress?\"","\"Not a mistress. She's my wife.\"","The woman's expression twisted for a moment before she forced herself to resume normal.","\"How could you get married without telling me? I might get upset now.\"","\"The wedding hasn't happened yet. I'll invite you when it does. I have things to do, so I'll get going first.\"","Gu Huaian didn't want to hear anything more from her and strode away with large steps.","He had heard Shen Tang's inner voice just now. He needed to explain things now. Since humans have mouths, they should be used for speaking.","After searching around for a while, Gu Huaian finally found Shen Tang downstairs.","He was being held onto by an old lady with silver hair. \"Xiu Xiu, Xiu Xiu...\"","Shen Tang patiently explained, \"Grandma, I'm not Xiu Xiu...\"","\"Xiu Xiu, you've come back! Don't blame your mother. He wasn't a good man...\"","Shen Tang looked helplessly at the young nurse, and she seemed just as helpless.","\"I'm sorry. She has Alzheimer's disease and sometimes fails to recognize people. Xiu Xiu was her daughter who passed away over 20 years ago.\"","Shen Tang sighed and squatted down to hold the old lady's hand. \"Xiu Xiu doesn't blame you...\"","Although she didn't know what had happened, the fact that it still tormented her after over 20 years must have been very distressing.","Upon hearing Shen Tang's words, clarity instantly returned to the old lady's eyes.","\"You're not Xiu Xiu...\"","\"She would never forgive me...\"","\"Grandma...\"","The old lady wiped the tear stains from the corners of her eyes. \"Young lady, what's your name? You look so much like my daughter.\"","\"Grandma, my name is Shen Tang.\"","\"Shen Tang... Shen Tang... What a nice name, such a nice name!\"","Shen Tang lowered her eyes. Her name actually had a simple origin. She was so well-behaved and sweet-talking as a child that the dean's wife felt the character \"Tang\" looked and sounded nicer, otherwise she would have been called Shen Tang (Shen Sugar).","Still, she also found it pleasant to hear. At least she wasn't named Shen Chunhua or Shen Dog Egg.","Soon after, the old lady failed to recognize Shen Tang again and clung onto her while calling out for Xiu Xiu.","Strong emotions of grief were bad for the elderly's health. Shen Tang took the chance to slip away when the young nurse managed to pacify the old lady.","She took this incident as just a minor interlude and didn't dwell on it.","While walking, she raised her head and found Gu Huaian standing there. He seemed to have been watching for quite some time and looked rather happy.","Shen Tang couldn't help but feel sour. So happy chatting up a beauty?","Gu Huaian lightly coughed into his fist. \"Why did you come down here?\"","\"Wasn't I afraid of disturbing your conversation with the beautiful lady?\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, Shen Tang felt she was done for. Just as she was about to explain herself, she saw Gu Huaian sniffing the air.","\"Can you smell that?\"","\"Smell what?\" Shen Tang also sniffed.","\"The sourness.\"","\"There's no... sour...\" Shen Tang instantly caught on that he was mocking her.","\"I don't smell anything. Is your nose spoiled?\"","\"Such a strong smell of vinegar. Maybe someone tipped over a vat of vinegar somewhere.\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Jerk!","Annoying!","\"She was my classmate overseas. We weren't very close.\"","\"Who wants to hear you say this!\"","\"She received Western education from young and tends to be more affectionate. Just now when she hugged me, I pushed her away immediately.\"","Shen Tang added, \"And told her that would cost extra?\"","Gu Huaian looked blank for a moment.","Shen Tang instantly realized that this was the book's world, different from reality. That joke didn't exist here.","She suddenly felt dejected.","She still hadn't decided whether to stay here or leave. Although there was money and friends here, the other world was where she grew up.","Gu Huaian's eyes darkened for a moment.","\"I don't like her.\"","【Why would I care who you like? You don't like me anyway.】","\"I like you.\"","Shen Tang froze for a second.","Gu Huaian repeated, \"I like you, Shen Tang. In the past, present, and future, I only like you.\"","Now wasn't the best time for confessions, but he was afraid that if he didn't say it now, he would lose his wife.","\"How... How could you like me?\" Shen Tang stuttered out.","【Ahhhhhhh! How could Gu Huaian like me?】","【Is this real? Or is he just teasing me?】","【This is a bit too sudden. I need time to process this...】","\"I thought I was being quite obvious about it. I said something similar last time too. Why haven't you realized yet?\"","Shen Tang gave an embarrassed laugh. \"Well, it's a little hard to believe...\"","She had her doubts before, but that was Gu Huaian! She was very afraid of wishful thinking.","Shen Tang couldn't stop herself from recollecting the various interactions between them, including how he rushed over from thousands of miles away to save her, the drunken kiss, leaning against each other in the cinema, his initial praises for her, and eventually settling on his last line.","— \"I like you, Shen Tang. In the past, present and future, I only like you.\"","Shen Tang's face flushed red all of a sudden.","\"It feels a little unreal...\"","Gu Huaian slowly lowered his head and lightly landed on Shen Tang's lips.","Shen Tang didn't dodge, filling Gu Huaian's heart with a trace of secret delight.","This was the first light kiss between the two while fully sober. Shen Tang stared wide-eyed until Gu Huaian covered them with his hand.","He slowly rubbed and pressed against her lips, not deepening the kiss.","He kissed her almost reverently—gentle, restrained, lingering.","The touch of their four lips made their souls quiver.","In the darkness, Shen Tang only felt a rush of numbness from her tailbone that softened her entire body, forcing her to cling onto Gu Huaian for support.","After some time, Gu Huaian lifted his head.","He removed his hand and looked at Shen Tang, whose eyes were moist, lips slightly swollen, seeming willing to let him have his way. His eyes darkened.","Shen Tang couldn't comprehend it but instinctively felt a sense of danger.","Gu Huaian's Adam's apple rolled as his hoarse voice asked, \"Does it feel real now?\"","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Ahhhhhhh!","What does he expect her to say?","\"Tang Tang, be with me, okay? Stay by my side.\"","Don't leave, alright?"]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: Next time I'll wait for your consent.","paragraphs":["\"I, I'll think about it...\"","Shen Tang had an urge to flee, but Gu Huaian held her hand tightly, not letting her leave.","\"I'm not in a hurry, you can consider it slowly.\"","Shen Tang's heart thumped like a drum. She suspected Gu Huaian could even hear the intense beating of her heart.","As soon as the two of them turned around, they discovered several children standing near some bushes not far away.","They lined up in a row, covering their eyes with their hands, but there were big gaps between their fingers, and their eyes were also opened wide, the curiosity in them almost overflowing.","Shen Tang was so embarrassed she didn't even know how to walk.","One young girl loosened her hands and asked, \"Brother, why don't you kiss sister?\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She awkwardly curled her toes, almost clawing out a three bedroom apartment on the spot.","Gu Huaian laughed softly.","\"Have you finished your homework?\"","\"No...\"","\"Huh? The teacher is here!\"","The few children simultaneously looked back. Gu Huaian pulled Shen Tang to run away.","After running for a few minutes, only until an secluded corner, did the two finally stop.","Shen Tang's breathing was slightly rushed: \"Why did we run?\"","\"Afraid they'll ask me to kiss you.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"That would indeed be quite scary.\"","Now it was Gu Huaian's turn to feel dejected. He dropped his eyes, \"Is my kissing technique that bad?\"","What kind of weird question is this!","Are you serious?","Shen Tang carefully examined Gu Huaian's expression. He seemed to be serious indeed.","The key issue was, how could she know if his technique was good or not? She had never kissed anyone else before.","But judging from her abundant theoretical knowledge, it did seem to be not that great.","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","\"Well...don't feel too bad. No one is perfect. Having shortcomings is very normal. You—\"","Before she finished speaking, she was pinned against the wall, the back of her head held in a big hand.","A scent unique to Gu Huaian assaulted her. Scattered kisses immediately fell.","Different from the earlier superficial tasting, his smooth tongue rolled into her mouth. The gentle kisses gradually turned into an entanglement between lips and teeth.","Shen Tang's mind went blank from his kiss, temporarily unable to think. She pushed with her hand, but was tightly clasped by his ten fingers.","\"Mnn...\"","Soft, dense ambiguous sounds rang out from the hidden corner.","After quite a while, Gu Huaian finally raised his head. His ears were bright red, and his breathing somewhat rushed, looking as if he was the one being kissed.","Shen Tang was also equally disheveled. She couldn't even stand steadily, only able to lean against the wall panting heavily.","\"You, why did you suddenly kiss me!\"","Gu Huaian held Shen Tang's face and earnestly apologized, \"Sorry, I kissed you without your consent.\"","Shen Tang retorted inwardly: When did you ever ask for my consent?","\"Was there any improvement?\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Kissing technique.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Did it feel com—\"","Before he finished speaking, Shen Tang hurriedly covered his mouth, \"Don't say it!\"","She knew what he wanted to say from hearing that word!","She was still a young lady, okay? Of course she would feel shy!","Moreover, who asks such a question?","Could it be that if she said it didn't feel comfortable, he would go and learn more?","Or, go find someone to practice with?","Shen Tang's brain ran wild again uncontrollably.","Gu Huaian pecked her lips again, \"Have you considered it?\"","\"Huh?\"","\"Dating me with marriage as the premise.\"","Although the two were currently married, that was fake, an agreement marriage.","He wanted to find an opportunity to annul the agreement and start over with her properly.","Shen Tang blinked blankly: \"Wait, didn't you just say earlier you weren't in a hurry and would give me time to consider slowly?\"","\"Yeah, it's been so long, have you considered it?\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","How long has it been?","This is called not being in a hurry? Letting her think slowly?","Shen Tang discovered the number of times she was rendered speechless today seemed to be a bit much.","She said indifferently: \"No.\"","\"Oh...\"","Gu Huaian disappointedly hung his head down, resembling a big dog.","Seeing him like this, Shen Tang almost softened, and hastily turned her face away.","\"You, from now on you can't suddenly kiss me again. I haven't agreed to you yet.\"","\"Okay, next time I will definitely wait until you consent before kissing you.\"","Shen Tang: Wait, is that what she meant?","On the way back, Shen Tang didn't quite dare look at Gu Huaian. Fortunately, Gu Huaian also didn't get close to her, causing Shen Tang to relax considerably.","She admitted that she did quite like Gu Huaian.","But she didn't know if staying here for him would be a decision she ends up regretting.","Although she also didn't know if that dream she had last time was real, or just imagined by her, and didn't know if she still had a chance to leave.","Shen Tang sighed.","Gu Huaian rubbed her head, \"Don't feel pressured, just follow your heart. No matter what, I won't blame you.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Kidding.\"","Shen Tang pouted, this guy was becoming naughtier and naughtier.","Because the culprit who previously hurt Hou Jingjing still hadn't been caught, the crew was forced to temporarily halt filming. Shen Tang thus didn't return to the crew, but rather went back to the villa.","Back in her room, Shen Tang tossed and turned, occasionally sighing.","Since she couldn't make a decision, she might as well ask someone else.","So she edited the matter and sent it to Qi Yue.","[Qi Yue: Is that friend you mentioned yourself?]","Shen Tang: Does this person understand the concept of \"see through but not expose\"?","[Hopeless Romantic Monkey: No, what do you think, should they be together or not?]","[Qi Yue: Don't let your guard down! This kind of top tier man, if you miss him you'll regret it your whole life!]"]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Do you... Want to touch your Abs","paragraphs":["Monkey in Deep Love: What if she can't go back home?","Qi Yue: The key is she doesn't really have any family members. If she leaves, can we still see each other often?","Qi Yue: Although I don't know where she wants to go, I don't want her to leave anyway.","Shen Tang was leaning towards staying in her heart. Qi Yue's words were like a reassurance pill for her.","Qi Yue: Besides, it's Gu Huaian! Don't you know he's the man most girls in the country want to marry?","Monkey in Deep Love: Wait, how did you know I was talking about Gu Huaian?","Qi Yue: I figured it out with my brain, Tang Tang. Don't worry about anything else for now. Just sleep with him first!","Shen Tang's little face flushed red.","Qi Yue was too uninhibited. What was that about sleeping or not sleeping?","But Gu Huaian did have a good figure. She wondered how he was in that aspect...","Shen Tang hurriedly shook her head. What was she thinking about? It must be Qi Yue's fault!","There was a knock on the door. Shen Tang put on her slippers and went over. As soon as she opened the door, she was shocked by the scene before her eyes.","\"Want some fruit?\"","\"Such white cherries, ah no, so red!\"","She suspected Gu Huaian was trying to seduce her, but she had no evidence.","The man who was usually wrapped up was wearing a deep V-neck robe today. Goodness, the neckline was open all the way to his waist!","His pectoral and abdominal muscles peeked out tantalizingly. The dark robe made his skin look even paler.","Shen Tang almost cried, forcibly tearing her eyes away.","\"Thank you.\"","Shen Tang took the cherries and was about to close the door, but met resistance.","She looked up and saw Gu Huaian propping the door open with his hand.","\"Anything else?\"","\"Do you...want to touch my abs?\" Gu Huaian's ears turned red after saying this.","Shen Tang's eyes widened. Did she just hallucinate?","Seeing Gu Huaian's shy look, good lord, he really did come to seduce her!","Ahem, she shouldn't pass up free abs.","Shen Tang lightly coughed. \"Touch!\"","Her sinful hand reached for his robe, but didn't dare go in.","Good heavens, she was always one to talk big, but was inevitably nervous when it came to the real thing.","Gu Huaian also seemed very nervous. Shen Tang heard his breathing become much quicker.","Just as Shen Tang's hand was about to land on the abs, a voice of confusion came from the side: \"What are you two doing?\"","Shen Tang quickly retracted her hand.","\"Tao Sister, you haven't slept yet?\"","Tao Sister shook her head. \"I heard about what happened yesterday. I was going to bring you some milk. What are you two doing?\"","Her gaze fell on the two of them. When she saw Gu Huaian's exposed outfit, her eyes couldn't help but widen.","Was she seeing things?","Gu Huaian hurriedly fixed his clothes. \"I...I still have work to do. I'll head back first...\"","Shen Tang eagerly nodded. \"Go take care of your work.\"","What a pity she didn't get to touch the abs. His pecs looked so big too. She really wanted to bury her face in them...","Tao Sister suddenly realized. \"Did I interrupt you two?\"","\"I'll leave now.\"","She shoved the milk into Shen Tang's hands and teased, \"Rest well. I'll make breakfast later tomorrow.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Gu Huaian: \"...\"","After Tao Sister left, Gu Huaian softly asked, \"Still want to touch?\"","Shen Tang shook her head. \"Next time. I'm going to sleep now.\"","She wasn't in the mood to continue. She had a feeling Tao Sister wouldn't have left so quickly.","Thinking this, she went to the stairs and as expected, came face-to-face with Tao Sister squatting there.","Tao Sister awkwardly explained, \"Oh, I was just tying my shoelaces, hahaha...\"","\"You're wearing slippers.\"","\"Oh...\"","Tao Sister peeked at Gu Huaian and asked regretfully, \"You're not continuing?\"","She didn't understand why the married couple still slept in separate rooms.","She was a night owl and had never noticed either of them going to the other's room in the middle of the night.","That meant they always slept separately. That was clearly abnormal!","They were both young people. Didn't they have any passion at all?","Tao Sister suddenly thought of a possibility. Could it be the husband really had problems down there!?","Before it was joking, but now she suspected it was true.","No, no, no. She had to think of a way.","Seeing Tao Sister's ugly expression as she walked away, Shen Tang was confused. What did she think of again?","It was late. The two returned to their rooms to rest.","In her dream, Shen Tang dreamed of a vast whiteness. Gu Huaian's abs filled the bed, a full forty-eight blocks.","Were these personified rice cakes?","Shen Tang woke up with a start.","The sky was already bright. Looking at her phone, it was just past seven.","Except for when she was on set, she didn't think she had woken up this early before.","She had just gone downstairs when she saw Tao Sister with dark circles under her eyes, saying something to He Uncle.","She quietly walked over, wanting to listen. But she was discovered by Tao Sister's sharp eyes.","Tao Sister weakly said, \"Mistress, you're up so early today? Let me bring you breakfast.\"","\"No, I'm not hungry yet. Tao Sister, are you sick?\"","Tao Sister shook her head, then nodded. \"Yes.\"","\"What illness? Have you seen a doctor?\"","Tao Sister murmured, \"Heart disease. Incurable.\"","Shen Tang: \"...\"","She looked at He Uncle and saw him sigh heavily as well, his expression somber.","\"What's going on?\"","Shen Tang also started feeling anxious.","\"Don't tell me the family went bankrupt!\"","Tao Sister choked. \"No, not that.\"","Shen Tang breathed a sigh of relief. \"As long as we didn't go bankrupt.\"","Otherwise her money and luxury villa experience card would be gone prematurely.","Tao Sister sighed again. \"Mistress, why did you marry the husband in the first place?\"","Shen Tang became nervous. Did Tao Sister discover something?","She looked at He Uncle, but he didn't give any hints despite knowing the inside story. So did she find out or not?","\"Because he's handsome and rich?\"","\"That's true.\" Tao Sister nodded. \"Nothing else? Like love or something?\"","Shen Tang felt awkward. She was purely in it for the money. Saying it was for love would tarnish the word love.","\"Why are you asking this?\"","Tao Sister slowly put a hand on her chest. \"Because I discovered a secret...\"","Shen Tang became curious. \"What secret?\"","\"I discovered the husband seems to not—”","\"Not what?\" Shen Tang asked.","Please forgive her illiteracy, but the first words that came to mind were impotent and dysfunctional.","But she was so wrong.","Before Tao Sister could finish speaking, they heard Gu Huaian slowly coming down the stairs. She immediately got up and grabbed a napkin from the table, wiping left and right.","Shen Tang also heard the footsteps and quickly shut up.","\"You're up so early today?\"","Shen Tang touched her nose. \"Slept well, woke up early.\"","\"Had breakfast yet?\"","\"Not yet.\"","Tao Sister put down the napkin and rushed towards the kitchen. \"Breakfast is ready. I'll bring it out now.\"","In a bit, Tao Sister brought out a table full of food.","Aside from the normal breakfast foods, there was also chives fried eggs, garlic glass noodles with fresh oysters, lingzhi five finger hairtail fish congee, satay lamb, lotus root stir-fried squid, dogwood chicken soup with ginseng and Chinese angelica.","Shen Tang gaped in shock. \"So lavish this early in the morning!\"","Wait, something seemed off about these dishes.","Gu Huaian's face was black. \"Take these away.\"","\"Huh?\"","Gu Huaian lightly coughed. \"It's a bit too fortifying to eat these in the morning.\"","Tao Sister's lips moved, but she still took everything away in the end.","Not listening to elders means suffering losses right before your eyes. Hmph! Go on being impotent then!"]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: I Am His Wife","paragraphs":["In order to maintain her figure, Shen Tang did not eat much, only tasting a little before putting down her chopsticks.","Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian who was still eating and said, \"Do you want to try this soup dumpling? The skin is thin and the filling is big, it's very delicious.\"","\"Okay.\"","Gu Huaian did not move, and neither did Shen Tang. Tao Sister felt a little exasperated and reminded, \"Sir, can you not reach it?\"","Shen Tang reacted instantly, \"Let me do it, let me.\"","After picking up the dumpling, Shen Tang went on to ask, \"Do you want to try this crispy pork bun? The meat is tender and juicy without any grease.\"","\"Okay.\"","This time, Shen Tang took the initiative to pick the bun for Gu Huaian.","\"Do you want to try this pan-fried dumpling? Crispy outer layer and tender filling...\"","\"Do you want to try...\"","\"Do you want...\"","At first, Tao Sister had an approving smile.","Seeing that Gu Huaian was eating more and more, Tao Sister became somewhat worried, \"Um... I think the gentleman should be full now!\"","Shen Tang looked at the brown sugar cake on her chopsticks, \"Are you full?\"","Gu Huaian was completely stuffed, but seeing Shen Tang's regretful expression, he still gritted his teeth and said, \"Not full.\"","Shen Tang happily picked up the brown sugar cake and put it in Gu Huaian's bowl, \"Try it, this is so delicious!\"","The consequence of eating too much and too haphazardly was Gu Huaian being hospitalized for gastritis.","Shen Tang felt very guilty. If it wasn't for her wanting to watch him eat because she couldn't, and kept picking dishes for Gu Huaian, he wouldn't have ended up in the hospital.","\"I'm sorry, it's all my fault...\"","Gu Huaian's complexion was ghastly pale. \"It's not your fault, I wanted to eat.\"","Although he said that, Shen Tang understood what was on his mind. It was all because she wanted to watch him eat.","In the past, it was always Shen Tang who got sick. This time it was Gu Huaian's turn, so Shen Tang decided to take good care of him.","Whether it was pouring tea, feeding medicine, peeling fruit, or calling the doctor, she did it all very seriously.","Even for going to the toilet...","Gu Huaian looked back, \"Are you sure you want to come in?\"","Shen Tang blushed and took a step back, \"Can you do it yourself?\"","\"I can.\"","How could he let Shen Tang know that he only had gastritis and was not disabled?","Although being taken care of by her felt nice and gave him the feeling that her eyes and heart were only on him,","Gu Huaian actually wanted to pretend to be sick but was afraid Shen Tang would find him too weak.","Moreover, the company had reached a critical moment recently. The person who caused his death in his previous life was about to show his cards.","Thinking of this, after finishing the IV drip, Gu Huaian still chose to be discharged from the hospital.","Shen Tang was worried, and since she was free anyway, she simply followed him to work.","In the afternoon when the company employees were all busy, there were few people on the road. The two went straight to the floor of Gu Huaian's office building.","Just as they got out of the elevator, they saw a somewhat familiar woman.","Oh right, wasn't this the woman who hugged Gu Huaian last time?","Shen Tang looked at Gu Huaian with a smile that was not a smile.","The latter had a cold face. \"What are you doing here?\"","The woman smiled as she came over, \"Huaian, I was passing by here and came to see you. I even specially brought your favorite pastries.\"","\"Since you just happened to pass by here, you specially brought food?\" After Shen Tang finished speaking, she covered her mouth, \"Sorry, should I not have said that...?\"","Hehehe~","Gu Huaian laughed lightly. \"You're right.\"","The woman's face twisted for a moment. \"Huaian...\"","\"We used to be old classmates. I don't want my words to sound too offensive. Apart from business matters, don't come to me for personal matters in the future.\"","\"Huaian, you...\"","\"Cen Assistant, see the guest out.\"","The woman seemed to want to say something else. She opened her mouth but didn't say anything in the end, and left following Cen Assistant.","Shen Tang felt that she would not give up so easily.","Unexpectedly, she sent a WeChat message to Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang was sitting right opposite Gu Huaian. The screen lit up and she happened to catch sight of it.","\"Oh, a message from the beauty.\"","Gu Huaian didn't even lift his head. \"The password is 8264.\"","Shen Tang shook the phone. \"Should I really read it?\"","\"Go ahead, there's nothing that can't be seen.\"","After unlocking, Shen Tang found Gu Huaian's home screen very simple, all work software.","There was also a Weibo. Does he use Weibo too?","Just as she was about to open it, WeChat received another message. Shen Tang then opened WeChat. Someone named \"Song Classmate\" sent a few continuous messages.","[Song Classmate: Huaian, you are different from before. Is it because of her?]","[Song Classmate: She doesn't seem to match you very well, but it's fine if you like her.]","[Song Classmate: I didn't expect you to become a completely different person after getting married. I really dare not imagine that an arrogant genius like you would become a henpecked husband one day. If our classmates knew about this, they would definitely be shocked.]","[Song Classmate: If it were me, I would not restrict you from interacting with other women. There is more to life than just love.]","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Wow, quite imaginative huh. How many TV shows has she watched to imagine such a scenario?","Moreover, what did she say just now? She just pointed out the lie, right? That's why she's resentful?","If she remembered correctly, the one who retorted should be Gu Huaian, right? What has it got to do with her?","Song Classmate sent another message: Huaian, are you busy?","Looking at Gu Huaian who did not lift his head, the evil part of Shen Tang was itching to stir up trouble, but her righteous conscience prevailed in the end.","She handed over the phone, \"Do you want to reply?\"","\"You can help me reply.\"","\"Reply what?\"","\"Anything is fine, block her if you don't know how to reply.\"","Shen Tang was somewhat surprised. \"Aren't you very close?\"","\"Not very. Do you still remember the friend I mentioned before? He was very close to her, so I got to know her through him. After my friend had an accident, we never contacted each other again. I don't know why she suddenly came back and tried to get close to me this time. I feel something is fishy.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Tang immediately said, \"Then you definitely can't block her! Let me get to know her!\"","Thus, Shen Tang contributed her own corny pick-up lines—","[There was once a little pig who planted a strawberry and a mango. The strawberry grew so slowly, and the little pig said to the strawberry, berry you suck, berry you suck, did you hear that, idiot?]","[There is a gentle word in mathematics: There exists one and only one you that is vivid and concrete tomorrow.]","[You are the East Australian Current, I am the North Atlantic Current, you should be embraced, I'll take the wind for you.]","She didn't know if the other party noticed the change of person. Anyway, after Shen Tang sent the messages, the other party did not reply for a long time.","Finally, she sent a message: Are you Gu Huaian?","Shen Tang almost spit out a mouthful of water.","Goodness, she was suspected of not being the real person!","But it was normal too. There's no way Gu Huaian would say something like that.","Shen Tang did not intend to pretend to be Gu Huaian at all. She immediately replied:","[No, I'm his wife, smiling emoji]"]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: Monogamy","paragraphs":["Shen Tang pursed her lips, feeling bored. It seemed the formal battle had just begun before it ended.","Gu Huaian looked up, \"If you find it boring, you can go out for a walk.\"","Shen Tang really couldn't sit still. \"Then I'll go out! I won't disturb your work.\"","After saying that, she couldn't wait to go out, instantly forgetting about Gu Huaian.","Speaking of which, Gu Huaian had many assistants, including some pretty girls. Shen Tang looked at them until her eyes hurt. Tsk tsk tsk, Gu Huaian was really fortunate.","She admitted she was jealous and envious to death.","Zan, the senior assistant, was Gu Huaian's only personal assistant.","He really had \"maintaining masculinity\" ingrained in his bones.","Okay, maybe he just simply didn't like close contact with the opposite sex.","Shen Tang walked around. At first, no one spoke to her. Everyone just peeked at her and communicated through glances.","Until a girl came over with a red face, \"Tan...Tang Tang, I I I am your fan. Can you can you can...\"","The girl was so nervous she couldn't even speak clearly. Shen Tang took the initiative to ask, \"An autograph? Where do you want it?\"","\"Here...here!\"","\"Do you want to take a photo?\"","The girl's eyes lit up, \"Yes...yes!\"","After a round of operations, the girl's face turned frighteningly red.","Shen Tang curiously asked, \"Why are you my fan?\"","\"Lear...learn...\"","Shen Tang looked at her expectantly, \"Learn what?\"","Learn her perseverance?","Learn her aloofness from the mundane world?","Or learn her...","\"Learn how you scold people!\" The girl said excitedly while clenching her fist. \"You scold people so well! I really admire you!\"","Now you don't stutter anymore.","Shen Tang never imagined it was for this reason. Did she have no other virtues besides scolding people?","Well, it's not necessarily bad. It's still somewhat useful. At least she can fight back when being bullied.","But it's fine...","Seeing Shen Tang's easygoing personality, another young lady came over.","\"Shen...Gu...\" The young lady struggled with how to address her. Shen Tang didn't care. \"Just call me Shen Tang.\"","The young lady asked curiously, \"Shen Tang, how did you get our boss?\"","As soon as she said this, everyone around pricked up their ears. Even the sounds of typing and talking became much softer.","Shen Tang stroked her chin. \"It was him who took the initiative...\"","He had initiated that agreement. No problem with that.","Hearing this, everyone looked at each other. So the boss had this side to him!","\"Shen Tang, is the boss also so cold at home?\"","\"Shen Tang, how did you two meet?\"","\"When are you planning to have a child? How many?\"","\"When's the wedding?\"","\"Shen Tang, do you two sleep together at night? Do you get woken up by the cold in the middle of the night?\"","Shen Tang: \"???\"","Not even my seven aunts and eight sisters nagged me like you guys.","A girl came over and asked in a low voice, \"Shen Tang, how is the boss in that aspect? Does he have good stamina?\"","Wait, did some weird questions get mixed in?","As soon as this question came out, everyone else stopped working and looked over expectantly.","To be honest, the last time she got this much attention was when she was reading a self-criticism on stage in her previous life for fighting at school.","No, are you guys really this gossipy?","Seeing Shen Tang not answering, everyone urged her.","\"Come on, just tell us. We won't spread it around!\"","Yeah, it'll just be known by the whole company.","\"Is it seven times a night? I remember novels all write like this.\" A very young girl asked.","\"Wouldn't that kill someone...\"","\"To be honest, my boyfriend gets exhausted after just once...\"","\"I see, he runs when he sees me at night...\"","Shen Tang wished she could grab a handful of seeds to eat. Wow, was the topic that explosive?","She liked hee hee hee~.","\"Hurry and give us details.\"","\"Wait! I have seeds!\" Someone took out a bag of seeds and distributed some to everyone.","Shen Tang gave a big thumbs up. How thoughtful!","So, no one was in the mood to work anymore. They started listening to gossip.","When Gu Huaian came out, this was the scene he saw. With just herself, Shen Tang had led the entire office astray.","\"Hey, don't you think I went overboard?\" A woman complained bitterly.","Shen Tang quickly comforted her, \"No no, it's clearly your husband who has a problem.\"","\"That's right, being tired from work is no excuse.\"","\"I see, he's eaten his fill outside.\"","Shen Tang nodded in agreement. That's what she thought too.","\"Sister, you're so pretty. There's no need to hang yourself on a single tree.\"","\"That's right!\"","Hearing this, another girl sighed, \"Stop it. My boyfriend found himself a boyfriend again and said he wants to implement a one husband and one wife system.\"","Shen Tang's eyes widened. Was it the one husband one wife system she was thinking of?","Gu Huaian: \"???\"","\"What's a one husband one wife system?\"","He wondered if he had misheard.","Do people play like this nowadays?","Everyone scattered like birds, not knowing how many times they had practiced this. Anyway, they ran very quickly.","In a blink of an eye, only Shen Tang was left beside Gu Huaian.","Shen Tang looked at them. Wow, each and every one of them was so good at pretending, as if they had been working hard all along.","If not for the pile of snacks she was holding that they had fed her, she would have thought everything just now was an illusion.","Shen Tang blinked. \"Are you done with work?\"","\"Mm, what does a one husband one wife system mean?\"","\"It's... it's what you think. Some people find a boyfriend while also finding a girlfriend...\"","\"You think so too?\"","She wants to find another girlfriend???","Shen Tang quickly shook her head. \"No no, I won't find one.\"","She just liked being intimate with girls. She didn't want to go further!","Gu Huaian's expression finally relaxed.","Having just him was enough.","In the next few days, Shen Tang followed Gu Huaian around like a little tail.","Mainly because Gu Huaian didn't let her go out alone since the attacker still hadn't been caught.","Shen Tang thought he had a point.","Until today, when they received a call from the police station that the person had been caught.","Shen Tang and Gu Huaian hurried over. She wanted to see who she had offended.","At the police station, the police informed them of some unexpected yet unsurprising results.","The girl who had fallen from the building before was indeed murdered. The murderer was her boyfriend, who was also Li Xiumei's boyfriend.","It was a premeditated murder due to a love triangle between the three.","As for Shen Tang, Li Xiumei thought she knew something from her words, so her boyfriend decided to kill two birds with one stone and silence them.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","Sorry, it was her big mouth.","To be honest, she regretted it a little because Hou Jingjing got hurt.","If she hadn't said those words, maybe Hou Jingjing wouldn't have gotten injured.","But she should or should not have spoken. Her sixth sense was quite accurate."]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: Have You Broken the Law","paragraphs":["When Shen Tang came out of the police station, Gu Huaian's face looked a little unhappy.","Shen Tang secretly glanced at him a few times. \"Are you angry?\"","Gu Huaian squeezed his eyebrows and was very helpless. \"Now you're clever, but when you were talking earlier, how come you didn't think there might be danger?\"","Shen Tang opened her mouth. \"I didn't think of it at the time...\"","\"A 5,000 character self-criticism.\"","Shen Tang's eyes shook:!!!","\"Can it be a little less?\"","\"If you try to bargain again, the number of words will double.\"","\"Okay, 5,000 it is.\" Shen Tang's eyes were full of tears. It hadn't been long since she last wrote a self-criticism, how did she end up having to write so many more words this time?","She really wanted to complain - didn't he say he liked her? Was this how he liked her? She doubted that everything he said was fake.","Gu Huaian knocked Shen Tang on the head, wondering if it was full of water instead of a brain.","\"Don't think randomly.\"","\"Oh...\"","With this matter settled, the crew resumed work.","Shen Tang had no choice but to start the life of working hard to shoot the drama during the day and racking her brains to write self-criticisms at night.","She had just written a few words when Shen Tang started to get a headache. She looked to Yuan Yuan for help pleadingly, \"Yuan Yuan, good Yuan Yuan, help me...\"","Yuan Yuan shook her head helplessly. \"Sister Tang Tang, I can't. And the handwriting would be different...\"","Shen Tang's hopes were dashed as she withdrew her gaze.","After barely cobbling together eight hundred words, Shen Tang threw down her pen and gave up. \"I'm not writing anymore, whoever wants to write can write!\"","\"Really?\" Yuan Yuan's expression clearly didn't believe her.","Shen Tang: \"......\"","Shen Tang picked up her pen in humiliation and collapsed on the table crying bitterly: \"Wuwuwu, why is my life so bitter...!\"","\"Can you search online for help?\"","\"That guy will check for plagiarism!\"","Yuan Yuan slowly opened her mouth wide. He was that strict?","\"Oh right, online there are shops that help write papers, they should also be able to help write self-criticisms.\" She seemed to have heard someone mention it.","Shen Tang's eyes lit up. \"Let me search for some!\"","Sure enough, there were many such shops on Taobao. Shen Tang picked one with a lot of good reviews and high scores, then directly placed an order.","【Customer Service Qingqing: Dear, may I ask how many words does the self-criticism need to be?】","【Lin Daiyu Uprooting the Weeping Willow: 50,000 words, must be written by yourself, the other party will check for plagiarism, needs to be rewritten if it exceeds 1%】","【Customer Service Qingqing: Dear customer, have you violated heavenly laws?】","When Shen Tang looked, she realized she had accidentally added an extra 0.","【Lin Daiyu Uprooting the Weeping Willow: I'm so sorry, it's 5,000 words. When do you think you can get it done?】","【Customer Service Qingqing: Dear, it will require about five days, will that work for you?】","【Lin Daiyu Uprooting the Weeping Willow: That can work, remember it needs to be original writing.】","【Customer Service Qingqing: No problem dear ^3^】","Gu Huaian had given her half a month's time. Now it was already several days later, minus five days, there would still be enough time to hand copy it.","So Shen Tang put the matter out of her mind for the moment and started to concentrate seriously on shooting the drama.","The stricter a director was, the faster or slower the shooting efficiency tended to become.","That's right, there were two extremes.","For those with good acting skills, with the director's guidance, they could get the scene approved in one or two takes.","For those with poor acting skills and thin skin, being scolded by the director was enough to have them on the verge of a breakdown, to the point they almost forgot how to act.","Just now, two supporting characters had cried from being scolded for not taking things seriously.","Shen Tang rather wanted to go comfort them, she couldn't bear seeing others cry, but the director's words made sense -","\"No one will coddle any of you in this industry. Without seriously working on your acting skills and fawning over people in a servile manner, sooner or later you'll be eliminated.\"","Shen Tang sighed. Who wasn't scolded heavily when they first entered the industry?","In her last life when she first entered the industry, because she lacked connections, resources, and acting skills, she had played cannon fodder roles, corpses, and all kinds of extras without end while enduring endless scoldings.","Her acting skills did admittedly greatly improve because of it, but it wasn't as inspiring as a protagonist in novels, because she remained a no-name 18-line actress right up until her death.","Thinking of this, Shen Tang felt so aggrieved she almost cried.","Wuwuwu, her life was so miserable...!","So this life she might as well just take it easy; things could just happen however they did.","Calculating the days, it would soon be time for her contract dissolution. It was just right for her to quit then.","Thinking of her carefree rich life after having money but no job, Shen Tang was so happy she almost laughed out loud.","\"Sister Tang Tang, Sister Tang Tang!\"","Hearing Yuan Yuan's voice, Shen Tang came back to her senses. \"What's up?\"","\"The director is calling you.\"","Only then did Shen Tang realize that everyone was actually looking at her. What was going on? Did something happen?","She felt nervous inside but didn't show it externally. She got up and walked over.","\"Director, were you calling me?\"","The director had two completely different personalities when filming versus in private. No matter how good the relationship was privately, when working he would be all business without showing any personal favoritism.","The director didn't look to be in a good mood. \"You're trending.\"","\"Huh?\"","Taking the phone over, she discovered a photo of her standing crying in front of the police station entrance. Gu Huaian who had been standing next to her was cropped out, and in his place was a middle-aged bald man who happened to be passing by on the street instead.","The angle this photo was shot from was also very clever, making it look as if Shen Tang was crying while looking at the middle-aged man.","The person who released this photo was also quite smart, not writing any captions with it, which resulted in the comment section getting extremely lively.","Relying solely on this one picture, netizens began letting their imaginations run wild making up stories.","【This makes me want to cry too after imagining an entire sadly unrequited love story...】","【Are you serious, person above?】","【What's Shen Tang crying about? Am I the only one who thinks she looks quite beautiful crying?】","【It should be a close relative being imprisoned, Shen Tang is too grieved over it】","【Then might that be Shen Tang's boyfriend? emmm he's probably quite rich...】","Many people refuted this comment, but without proof they could only say Shen Tang wasn't married yet.","Suddenly, a female celebrity outside of the top 18-lines liked this Weibo post and sent an ambiguous Weibo post: Congratulations on getting married @Shen Tang","A woman's thoughts were simple. Shen Tang being married was something she could confirm to be true, after all she had heard Shen Tang discuss it with Wang Ge when chatting that time.","Moreover, she hadn't said anything else or lied about it either. Even if Shen Tang wasn't happy there was nothing that could be done.","Netizens completely lost it and soon dug up that the two belonged to the same company, so this news had a 80-90% chance of being true.","Shen Tang was actually married?","It couldn't be to that middle-aged bald man right!?","Some comments were quite nasty, with extremely rude words being said.","【Hahahaha, this gold-digger Shen Tang has finally gotten married. I really don't know how she could bring herself to marry down like that.】","【Makes no difference with the lights off】","【It actually does make quite a big difference hahaha】","Fans came out to do PR control since Shen Tang and the studio hadn't released any statements yet. They didn't believe this was real.","Tao Sister and some diehard fans even used the app developed by Uncle He's Son that allowed them to scold others without curses at an extremely fast speed.","Often by the time the other side finished typing their words, they already had ten messages sent back.","Among them, the fan named \"My Awesome Buddha\" was the most amazing. She could be called the ace among the fans, adeptly switching between over a dozen small accounts to fight one against a hundred.","The black fans began questioning their lives after being countered to such an extent.","Why do all you fans seem to have eight hands? How can you all type so fast?"]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Open","paragraphs":["Shen Tang was somewhat surprised after seeing the whole story clearly: \"So, that's it?\"","She thought the director was looking for her because of the filming, but didn't expect it was her private matter.","The director frowned, \"Isn't this a big deal yet? Weibo has now become a carnival for anti-fans.\"","Shen Tang was silent for a moment and asked, \"Director, do you still browse Weibo during working hours?\"","Director: \"...\"","\"Is this the point?\"","Of course it is, didn't you tell us not to play with our phones? Yet you don't practice what you preach yourself?","However, Shen Tang didn't dare say this out loud.","After thinking for a moment, she confessed frankly, \"I did get married.\"","Hearing Shen Tang's words, there was a sound of gasping around.","\"Sister Tang Tang, you really are with that person—\"","Before this person could finish speaking, someone next to him pulled him.","Shen Tang scratched her head, \"I did get married, but not to this person. To be honest, I don't even know him.\"","\"Ah, I knew it wasn't true...\"","\"Right, the two people are completely incompatible. Sister Tang Tang wouldn't be so confused...\"","Although everyone said so, no one knew whether they really believed it or not.","There were still some people with strange expressions, feeling that she said that because she was afraid of embarrassment.","The director didn't quite believe it either. He pulled Shen Tang aside and asked in a low voice, \"Did you really get married?\"","\"Yes, no need to lie to you.\"","\"Who is it?\"","Seeing the gossip-loving eyes of the director, Shen Tang made a zipper motion at her mouth.","\"Alright, if you don't want to say it, don't say it, hehe, I don't really want to know either.\"","After a while, he pleaded, \"Just say it, I won't tell anyone else.\"","Shen Tang shook her head, indicating nothing to say.","As a melon-craving weasel, the director's words had no credibility at all.","In fact, almost everyone in the Gu Group knew about her relationship with Gu Huaian, but this matter didn't spread online at all, which also showed something.","Shen Tang didn't want her private life to be discussed by everyone.","Logging on Weibo, she posted an emoji: black guy question mark face.jpg","As for the female artist from the same company, Shen Tang didn't pay any attention to her at all.","【I knew it was fake news, it was simply too absurd】","【Sister Tang Tang is out!】","【Laughing to death, next time can the anti-fans make up something more realistic?】","Shen Tang reassured her fans again in the Weibo fan group.","Opening WeChat, her friends didn't think this was true at all, on the contrary, they thought it was ridiculously fake.","It was worth mentioning that the fan who was suspected of being an anti-fan sent a lot of messages to comfort her.","At the same time, she also posted on Moments that whoever went to attack would get 2 yuan per comment.","Shen Tang couldn't help staring with wide eyes.","Wow! She wanted to earn this money too!","The two returned to the crew, and everyone around looked at them curiously.","Because he didn't get to eat melon, the director was in a very bad mood and scolded with a cold face, \"What are you looking at? Isn't anyone working anymore?\"","The crowd dared to be angry but didn't dare to speak, you were the one who took the lead in slacking first.","\"Get to work, get to work!\"","After another busy afternoon until midnight before they finished work.","Shen Tang was exhausted with a sore waist and back. This role still needed to wield weapons, Shen Tang didn't use stunt doubles, it was all her personal effort, which also led to being extremely tired every day.","Just after taking a bath, she heard the WeChat ringtone. Shen Tang instinctively tapped to answer.","Not until seeing Gu Huaian's handsome face did she realize it was a video call, and she was still wearing a strappy nightgown inside, with nothing underneath.","Shen Tang hurriedly disconnected the video.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","How could he make a video call to her!","After changing into modest home clothes, Shen Tang called him back. She had just been seen, she also wanted to see in return, that was only fair, right!","Gu Huaian answered in one second. Shen Tang didn't get a good look earlier, only to find out now that Gu Huaian was still wearing a suit and glasses. Looking at the background, he was still in the company.","Shen Tang couldn't help feeling distressed, \"Why are you still in the company?\"","\"Some things I didn't finish, have to work overtime tonight.\"","\"Can't it be done tomorrow?\"","\"Some are too urgent and must be handled tonight.\"","Shen Tang nodded in understanding. Too bad, so she wouldn't have a chance to see fresh meat.","\"So what did you want from me earlier?\" Shen Tang tried her best to ignore the embarrassing incident just now and asked seriously.","\"Nothing much either, I originally wanted to ask about the Weibo incident, whether you need my help to handle it.\"","After a pause, Gu Huaian went on to say, \"Sorry, I just saw it.\"","Shen Tang didn't expect it to be about this matter. She scratched her head and curiously asked, \"How do you plan to handle it?\"","\"Go public.\"","Gu Huaian pursed his lips, seemingly a little nervous.","Shen Tang was a little suspicious, his real purpose was simply to go public.","Shen Tang deliberately hesitated for a moment, then slowly rejected under Gu Huaian's expectant gaze.","As expected, he looked disappointed with the result.","Gu Huaian was indeed somewhat disappointed to hear this result, but he still wanted to try again, \"Are you sure you don't need my help? This can solve it once and for all.\"","Shen Tang shook her head, \"Thank you, but I don't need it for now.\"","\"Alright...\"","The two chatted briefly for a few more sentences before hanging up the video.","The next few days, Shen Tang worked hard filming during the day, and video chatted with Gu Huaian at night. It was a bit awkward at first, but later she could calmly remove makeup and skincare while chatting.","She always felt like she had forgotten something, but couldn't think of it for a while.","It wasn't until Gu Huaian reminded her that Shen Tang remembered she hadn't written her self-criticism yet.","Looking at the date, there were still two days, enough time.","Logging in to Taobao after not going on for days, Shen Tang found the shop, but discovered the store had closed down, and the money had also been refunded.","Shen Tang: \"???\"","The store closed down!!!","What the hell!","Was she lacking that money? She was lacking the self-criticism!","Because they were still on video, Gu Huaian saw Shen Tang's sudden change of expression and was very worried, \"What happened?\"","Shen Tang forced a smile and said, \"Nothing.\"","\"Does this look like nothing happened?\"","\"If something happened you can tell me.\"","Shen Tang sighed, could she say this?","Should she say, the mercenary she paid to write it ran away?","Gu Huaian would definitely laugh at her!","\"Um...can the self-criticism not be written?\"","Gu Huaian raised his eyebrows: \"Did something happen with the self-criticism? Haven't started writing yet?\"","Afraid of saying more and letting him guess, Shen Tang quickly waved her hand: \"No no, it's almost done, just saw a lot of work tomorrow, may not have time to finish it off, hahaha...\"","Whether Gu Huaian believed her or not, Shen Tang didn't know. Anyway she had no mood to continue chatting.","Finding another mercenary was too late now, she had to work overtime to write it herself now.","\"Then you can—\"","\"Not write it?\"","\"Give it to me two days late.\"","Shen Tang sighed, fine, at least two more days.","Damn it, this cold-hearted jerk Gu Huaian!","Sooner or later she'd get him in her hands!"]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Don't Be such a Fool","paragraphs":["It's no wonder people say human potential is limitless. When pushed, even Shen Tang didn't struggle to write like she did before, directly writing four thousand words overnight, just lacking a wrap up to finish it.","But after being drained, people feel somewhat dizzy.","Yuan Yuan looked at the two huge dark circles under her eyes and felt a little distressed, \"Tang Tang sister, are you alright? Rest a bit.\"","\"I'm fine, I just feel like my soul has been sublimated.\"","She hadn't struggled this hard even when she was in school. Shen Tang now felt like she could succeed at anything.","It wasn't until she came to the dressing room that the makeup artist asked in shock, \"Were you out stealing pigs all night?\"","\"Don't mention it, it was all tears.\"","Because she didn't rest after staying up all night, and the high-intensity shooting at the set, Shen Tang was tottering.","Yuan Yuan was very worried, \"Tang Tang sister, do you need to rest?\"","\"No need.\"","Shen Tang looked at Yuan Yuan earnestly and said, \"Acting is the profession with the least right to get sick. When you get sick and take leave, it will delay the crew's progress. Everyone will understand, but whether they can accept it or not is another matter. The whole crew can't serve you, everyone's time is precious. So, as much as possible will be persevered. Of course, accidental injuries are different.\"","Not only Yuan Yuan heard these words, but many others did too, and were quite moved, almost struck in the heart.","Who among them hadn't persevered when sick or injured?","Outsiders only saw their bright and dazzling side, but didn't see the hardship behind them.","But Shen Tang felt this was what an actor should do. This bit of hardship was nothing, after all the pay for one day might be a normal person's annual salary.","Earning more, hardship should be expected.","Of course, Shen Tang didn't say this part out loud. She was afraid of getting beaten.","She still persevered through this day, it was just that after returning to the room, she washed up and rested early, and didn't video chat with Gu Huaian as usual.","On the other end, Gu Huaian waited and waited, but she didn't arrive.","He couldn't help but send a message to ask, but didn't receive a reply.","Given Shen Tang's history, Gu Huaian was very worried, and couldn't help suspecting something had happened to her again.","He hurriedly got up and went out, instructing Assistant Qian, \"I'm going out for a bit, help keep an eye on things here, call me if anything comes up.\"","Although Assistant Qian didn't understand why he had to go out at this time, he had always been obedient and helped Chairman Gu handle everything properly, which was his job.","\"Alright, drive safely.\"","The driver was off work, so Gu Huaian drove himself. After driving for two hours he arrived at the crew location.","At this time, the crew was brightly lit, clearly still shooting night scenes.","Gu Huaian asked around and found out Shen Tang was fine, and had returned to the hotel to rest, only then letting out a breath.","Arriving at the hotel and finding Shen Tang's room, Gu Huaian hesitated without knocking on the door.","Looking at the time, it was late, maybe Shen Tang had fallen asleep and that's why she didn't reply to his message. He was making a fuss over nothing.","Just as Gu Huaian was about to leave, the door was suddenly opened from inside.","Yuan Yuan was surprised to see Gu Huaian. \"Chairman Gu?\"","The two had met before at the hospital last time. At the time, Yuan Yuan had marveled at Sister Tang Tang's good fortune, to be able to pluck this aloof flower.","\"Are you here looking for Tang Tang sister? Please come in.\" Saying so, she opened the door wider, looking left and right to see no one was paying attention before feeling relieved.","Yuan Yuan was completely unaware of how dangerous it was to let an adult man into a room late at night.","Of course, Gu Huaian was not that kind of person.","The words \"I was just about to leave\" that were on Gu Huaian's lips were swallowed back down as he entered the room.","It was a small suite, with two bedrooms and a living room. Yuan Yuan and Shen Tang each had a room.","Gu Huaian had intended to just sit for a bit before leaving, but for some reason, after sitting on the sofa for not long he fell deeply asleep.","Seeing this, Yuan Yuan hurried to Shen Tang's room to wake her up. She couldn't handle this situation.","This was Sister Tang Tang's man, she had to take care of him herself.","Shen Tang was having a beautiful dream, when she suddenly felt shaking. \"Ear...earthquake?\"","She hazily opened her eyes, only to discover Yuan Yuan shaking her awake.","Shen Tang: \"...\"","\"Is it morning?\"","\"Not yet. Tang Tang sister, Chairman Gu is here.\"","\"Chairman Gu? Which Chairman Gu?\"","\"Your man!\" Yuan Yuan said with a face full of teasing.","Shen Tang suddenly became spirited, her first reaction was that this guy better not have come to discuss punishment, they'd agreed to postpone it two days.","Then she realized she was thinking wrongly, he wasn't that kind of person.","\"Did he say why he came?\"","Yuan Yuan shook her head, \"He came in and I went back to my room. I just came out to use the bathroom and found he was asleep.\"","Shen Tang whacked her on the head. \"Why did you let him in?\"","Putting on clothes and getting up, she went to the living room and found Gu Huaian sound asleep.","It had to be said, even his sleeping posture was so handsome.","The long lashes covered his eyelids, casting fan-shaped shadows beneath. Going further down was the straight bridge of his nose, and pursed thin lips.","None of those bad habits like grinding teeth or snoring were present, he was very quiet in sleep.","Shen Tang suddenly didn't have the heart to wake him.","Just then, the phone rang and Gu Huaian jerked awake.","\"Tang Tang, did I disturb you?\"","\"No, your phone rang.\"","After Gu Huaian answered the call, his expression grew uglier and uglier. \"Alright, I'll head over now.\"","\"Tang Tang, I...\"","\"You should hurry and go, work is important.\"","Gu Huaian did indeed have urgent business to attend to. He pinched between his brows. \"Alright, I'll get going first then.\"","Until he left, Shen Tang still didn't know why he had come. It wasn't until she saw the WeChat messages.","[Gu Huaian: Why aren't you answering the phone? Did you rest?]","[Gu Huaian: I'm very worried about you]","[Gu Huaian: Tang Tang......]","The three messages had long intervals between them. Shen Tang suddenly thought that perhaps he had come because he was worried about her.","Her heart suddenly felt somewhat sour. At this moment her mind only had one thought, she wanted to know the answer.","Less than two minutes after Gu Huaian left, Shen Tang hurriedly ran downstairs, but saw Gu Huaian standing below smoking.","\"Why did you come down?\" He quickly put out the cigarette.","He was smoking to give himself a boost before driving later, for his and others' safety he had to be responsible and avoid driving while fatigued.","Shen Tang wrapped her clothes tighter, autumn nights were still very cold.","\"You...why did you come?\"","Gu Huaian didn't speak.","Shen Tang took a deep breath and asked, \"Did you come because you were worried about me?\"","\"Yes.\"","Gu Huaian wanted to say something more, but Shen Tang suddenly flew over and hugged him. He only felt like he'd been hit by a cannonball, somewhat winded.","But that wasn't the point. The point was Tang Tang had taken the initiative to hug him.","Gu Huaian couldn't control the corners of his mouth turning up, extremely delighted inside.","\"Gu Huaian.\"","\"Mm, I'm here.\"","\"Don't be so silly in the future.\"","\"Not silly.\"","\"Yes, yes, you're not silly. Just coming all this way in the middle of the night, saying one thing and leaving.\" As Shen Tang spoke, she laughed.","She released her hold. \"Didn't you still have things to deal with? Hurry and go.\"","Gu Huaian was somewhat reluctant to leave. He pursed his lips. \"Why don't I just not go?\"","Shen Tang pushed him. \"What are you dreaming about, there's nowhere here for you to stay.\"","\"I can sleep on the floor.\"","Shen Tang took a careful look, realizing Gu Huaian was serious.","Although she didn't know what he had been busy with recently, she did know it was quite important.","\"No, you should go back.\" Shen Tang hesitated a bit then said, \"My scenes will finish shooting soon, I'll come find you then.\"","Gu Huaian hugged Shen Tang tightly against him.","\"I believe you, you definitely have to come.\"","\"Mm, wait for me.\""]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Can you Give me a Title","paragraphs":["After seeing Gu Huaian off, Shen Tang went upstairs.","She suddenly felt that her behavior earlier was a bit impulsive, but she did not regret it, because she really wanted to know the answer.","To put it bluntly, she had already accepted Gu Huaian in her heart, she was just being stubborn and would not say it.","Hmm, her whole body's most stubborn part was her mouth. Even if the sky fell down, her mouth would still be there propping it up.","Just after getting out of the elevator, she saw a girl coming out of the room of the actor who played the male lead next door. Shen Tang and the other party were both startled for a moment.","There seemed to be tear stains on the girl's face. She hurriedly covered her face and left in a rush.","Shen Tang also had no intention of minding other people's business, pretending not to have seen anything.","Returning to the hotel room, Shen Tang was a little unable to fall asleep.","She carefully contemplated the plot of the original book, trying to figure out what Gu Huaian was busy with recently, but found that she had almost completely forgotten about the plot of the book.","Shen Tang's heart skipped a beat. No matter how she tried to think about it, she couldn't recall the specific details. She only remembered the name of the protagonist and remembered that she was the vicious cannon fodder in the book.","Shen Tang was a little scared. What was going on? Were they trying to erase her memory?","What if she gradually forgot about her previous life from then on, forgot that she had crossed into the book, and was later forced to follow the plot of the book?","A huge panic came over her. The more Shen Tang thought about it, the more afraid she became.","She wanted to call Gu Huaian but suddenly remembered that he was driving, so Shen Tang quickly put down her phone.","Lying in bed, she felt her hands and feet turn ice cold and couldn't warm up no matter what.","Sleepless all night.","Shen Tang was waiting for Gu Huaian to come before resting for a while. Having not slept the second half of the night, her condition today was even worse than yesterday’s.","The makeup artist had no choice but to apply thick concealer to cover the dark circles.","Yuan Yuan was very worried, \"Sister Tang, do you want to take a break and let others film first?”","\"I'm fine, don't say that again in the future.\"","It was another day of high-intensity work. Today, the crew finished early, which even moved Shen Tang herself.","She was working so hard!","Wait, didn't she say she wanted to live a lazy life as a salted fish?","But seeing how hard everyone else worked, Shen Tang couldn't bear to drag them down.","Not long after returning to the room, there was a knock at the door.","Yuan Yuan opened the door and found that the visitor was the popular actor who played the male lead.","Speaking of which, Shen Tang had only interacted with him in the scenes they filmed together. They hadn't contacted each other in private.","\"Is Shen Tang here?”","\"Yes.” Yuan Yuan nodded blankly afterwards, \"Sister Tang!”","Shen Tang walked over and asked in surprise, \"Do you need me for something?”","Instead of answering directly, the actor looked at Yuan Yuan. Understanding his intention, Yuan Yuan entered the room.","The actor glanced at the corridor again, \"Would it be convenient to come in and talk?\"","\"Uh, sure.\"","After they entered, the two looked at each other in silence.","Shen Tang felt a little awkward. \"You were looking for me because...\"","The actor also looked a little awkward. \"It's like this. Last night, you should have seen...\"","\"I didn't see anything, I didn't see anything at all!\"","Hilarious. She hated trouble the most. She really didn't want to get involved in other people's disputes.","Whether it was a girlfriend or a special occupation, it had nothing to do with her.","The actor carefully observed Shen Tang's expression and saw that she was telling the truth, so he also relaxed a little.","He sighed, \"I won't hide it from you either. She's my girlfriend, but she's still in college. We don't want to announce it publicly yet. I'm afraid she'll be affected by rumors.\"","Shen Tang really wanted to say that she wasn't interested in their love story at all.","She nodded. \"I see, I see.\"","She remembered the actor was in his thirties, tsk tsk tsk, to actually date such a young girlfriend.","Although she didn't see the girl clearly last night, with just a quick glance she could tell that the girl was very beautiful.","She only hoped that the actor was genuinely getting along with her, otherwise there would be another heartbroken person in this world.","But being able to make a girl leave crying in the middle of the night didn't seem like something a good person would do.","Shen Tang sneered internally but didn't show it externally.","She smiled and saw the actor off, then immediately started gossiping about it with Yuan Yuan after turning around.","The two unanimously agreed that the actor was a big scumbag.","After searching online, they found out that he was also frequently rumored with actresses in the past. It was unknown how much of it was true or false.","Wait, there were even gay rumors with male actors!","Tsk tsk tsk. Shen Tang and Yuan Yuan read it with great interest until Shen Tang received Gu Huaian's call, and she suddenly realized that she had forgotten the time while gossiping.","Yuan Yuan laughed teasingly and gave the space to the couple.","Shen Tang cleared her throat before answering the call.","\"Hello?\"","As soon as she spoke, Shen Tang was shocked by her own voice. She sounded like she had swallowed a harmonica.","\"What were you busy with?\"","\"Let me tell you what happened last night...\"","Shen Tang complained about the actor and his girlfriend to Gu Huaian again, focusing on how the girl left crying alone late at night, which was a bit too much.","No matter what the reason was, there was no justification for doing that.","Gu Huaian occasionally responded softly. The current state of interaction between the two was somewhat similar to the life pattern of an old married couple.","In addition, Shen Tang talked about some gossips from the crew. She didn't know if Gu Huaian loved listening or not, but she spoke with great interest.","\"Do you think I'm annoying?\"","\"No.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Really.\"","\"By the way, have you finished with your work?\"","\"Almost. When this matter is over, I can also take time off to accompany you.\"","\"Who wants you to accompany me!\"","\"Then who do you want to accompany you?\"","Shen Tang was choked by Gu Huaian's serious tone for a moment. She was obviously just teasing him playfully earlier! She didn't really mean that she didn't want him to accompany her!","Unfortunately, Gu Huaian was too far away to read her mind.","Because Shen Tang had not given him a clear response, had not given him a title, the business tycoon who was usually adept on the commercial battlefield was still a little insecure.","\"Tang...\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"Can you give me a title?\"","It had to be said that Gu Huaian's slightly pathetic tone made Shen Tang feel distressed.","\"Okay.\"","She heard herself say."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Boyfriend Obligations","paragraphs":["The change in identity made both of them feel a bit shy.","Gu Huaian's voice was filled with unrestrained joy: \"I really want to come see you right now.\"","\"No rush, we have plenty of days ahead of us.\"","Shen Tang gave a perverted smile, \"So, boyfriend, shouldn't you be fulfilling your boyfriend duties now?\"","Gu Huaian was stunned for a moment, \"What duties?\"","\"Show me your abs?\"","Gu Huaian's ears turned red, he said in a low voice, \"That...that's not very proper, is it...\"","\"Nothing improper about it, I'm not a stranger.\"","Shen Tang suddenly felt like she was an old lecher harassing a decent man.","She was just joking around, she didn't expect Gu Huaian to actually lower the camera and start unbuttoning with one hand.","His slender, dexterous fingers slowly undid the suit button, then the shirt button.","Shen Tang's eyes widened uncontrollably, she thought she could hear herself swallowing saliva.","Damn, confirmed old lecher.","Just then, there was a knock at the door. Shen Tang thought it was her room, but it turned out to be Gu Huaian's side.","Then, Zhen the assistant's voice rang out, \"President Gu, Chairman Chen is here to visit.\"","Gu Huaian's hands stopped moving, he chuckled, \"Looks like you won't get to see after all.\"","Shen Tang was extremely disappointed, why did this Chairman Chen have to come at this time of all times.","\"You go take care of things, I have something to do on my end too.\"","After ending the video call, Shen Tang muttered under her breath, \"Hmph, it's just abs, not like I really wanted to see that much.\"","\"There's so many little fresh meat showing off abs online, got tired of looking long ago.\"","If you ignore Shen Tang's disappointed expression, her words sound quite credible.","She opened Weibo, logged into her side account, and saw quite a few little sisters and little brothers in her feed.","However, content she used to really enjoy, now somehow looked unappealing today.","What the heck, every time she tries to look at or touch abs, there's always some force majeure interfering?","Shen Tang was quite upset, like an angry pufferfish.","Knock knock knock!","There was a knock at the door, Shen Tang impatiently said, \"Who is it?\"","\"Tangtang, it's me, open up quick!\"","Shen Tang had just opened the door when Qi Yue squeezed in like lightning.","\"Hurry, shut the door!\"","After Shen Tang closed the door, she looked at Qi Yue's thief-like manner, completely puzzled, \"What's going on?\"","Qi Yue shamelessly helped himself to half a bottle of water from the fridge before sitting down on the sofa.","\"A little accident happened.\"","\"What accident?\"","\"I just saw my brother come out of Lin Mianmian's room.\"","\"Ah? They have a supervisor-subordinate relationship, it's probably just work they needed to discuss, should be nothing, right?\"","Qi Yue slapped the table, sucking in a breath from the pain.","\"Ow! Huge problem! The key is my brother looked disheveled, lipstick marks still on his face!\"","Seeing Shen Tang's mouth open wider and wider, Qi Yue asked, \"Shocking right? Didn't expect my brother the sycophant to actually have his day of success one day, a sycophant gets what he deserves in the end!\"","Shen Tang was quite surprised indeed, Lin Mianmian was the female lead of this book, yet she was conquered by Qi Jue?","Although she didn't remember the specifics, she knew Qi Jue was one of female lead Lin Mianmian's admirers, not the one and only.","\"It's...not necessarily that they're together, maybe some accident happened between two adults...\"","Shen Tang wasn't entirely certain, she didn't know if she was trying to convince Qi Yue or herself with those words.","In fact, even if Lin Mianmian and Qi Jue really were together, it didn't impact Shen Tang at all.","The story in the book had already diverged, it was no longer cold lifeless words, but a real living world.","They were not vague side characters described in a few brush strokes, but real people of flesh and blood, with their own thoughts. Every action they take could send the story in a different direction.","Thinking this way, Shen Tang's earlier worries dissipated bit by bit.","Even the female lead changed, so she as a mere cannon fodder should be fine, right?","Looking at it this way, even forgetting those plot details didn't matter, Shen Tang comforted herself internally.","\"Tangtang?\"","\"Snapping back!\"","Qi Yue waved her hand in front of Shen Tang's face, making her regain focus.","\"What were you thinking about?\"","Shen Tang smiled, \"I actually have good news to share too.\"","\"What good news? Don't tell me you and President Gu did the deed...\" Qi Yue said, bringing both thumbs together and grinning wickedly.","Shen Tang rolled her eyes, \"Is that all you can think about!\"","\"What's wrong with adults in a relationship getting intimate? Not against the law.\"","\"It's not illegal, just that I'm not ready yet...\"","Qi Yue was flabbergasted, \"You two haven't even really kissed yet? A platonic relationship?\"","\"We have kissed before...\"","Saying this, Shen Tang involuntarily recalled that kissing scene.","She had to admit, Gu Huaian was a great kisser, if she didn't know he'd never kissed anyone else before, she'd suspect he practiced somewhere.","Qi Yue clicked her tongue twice, \"Thinking what naughty thoughts, your face is all red.\"","\"Wasn't...thinking anything...\"","Shen Tang awkwardly looked away.","Qi Yue clearly didn't believe her, \"One look and I can tell you were thinking something dirty! Don't you not have scenes next week?\"","\"Yeah.\"","\"Are you going to meet President Gu then?\"","Shen Tang blinked, \"How'd you know?\"","\"Guessed it, could tell with just my toes. Qi Yue stroked her chin, eyes darting around, \"Tell me before you leave tomorrow, I'll give you a present.\"","\"What present?\"","\"It wouldn't be a surprise if I said it early, that's all for now, I'm outta here.\"","True to her words, Qi Yue left as quickly as she came, completely different from her earlier thief-like manner.","Hadn't played games in a while, Shen Tang opened WeChat to see Meow Meow urging her to play. Thinking about how silly she was used by others previously, Shen Tang didn't want to team up.","An idea struck her and she messaged:","[Hopeless Romantic Monkey: Wanna play games?]","[Meow Meow: Coming!]","After easily winning several rounds with her, Shen Tang opened voice chat and asked, \"So how are things going with your brother and his goddess?\"","Meow Meow was silent briefly before responding in a soft voice, \"I discovered...my goddess doesn't seem to be what I imagined...\"","Shen Tang nearly laughed out loud, well now, the two started internal conflict without her interference?","Containing her laughter, she asked, \"Oh? Is it alright for you to share?\"","\"I don't know how to explain it, I originally saw her as pure and unblemished, high above others. But now I see she makes .... expressions sometimes, I even get a bit frightened seeing her now...\"","Whenever she saw Zhou Qinglian, she'd make resentful anguished expressions, or ask Meow Meow to help her do some bad things.","She knew she wasn't a very upright person, but the worst she'd done was curse at someone. Those kinds of shady plots were beyond her...","Now whenever possible, she avoided Zhou Qinglian.","\"Hmm...avoidance is not a permanent solution...\"","\"Do you have any good ideas? Big sister monkey, you have to help me out.\"","\"In my opinion, why are you meddling as a younger sister in this kind of matter? Best to just tell your brother directly and have him handle things.\"","Meow Meow froze briefly, \"But...my brother doesn't like her...\"","\"You clearly know your brother doesn't like her, so why help her out? You can't force relationships.\"","Previously as an outsider, Shen Tang didn't take those girls pining after Gu Huaian seriously, since she had no plans to be with him herself.","But now that she was his girlfriend, she did feel somewhat bothered.","However, Gu Huaian always handled these situations very tactfully, giving her ample sense of security.","What really worried Shen Tang was this silly tender-hearted child Meow Meow being somehow tricked into doing something irreversible.","Plus that Zhou Qinglian disappearing for so long, Shen Tang had an ominous feeling she was plotting something big.","After all, Zhou Qing didn't seem the type to give up so readily."]}]);
